window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":701,"title":"Chapter 701 - Not Vicious Enough","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Although Lin Yuan was not a Creation Master in the traditional sense, he always accomplished what Creation Masters could do using his own abilities. Thus, Lin Yuan was just as curious about unknown beings as any other normal Creation Master, especially when it came to sacred source lifeforms.","“Okay, I’ll go with you to take a look at the Astronomical Parliament.”","Lin Yuan did not ask Wen Yu about the other areas of the Astronomical Parliament that he did not understand.","When they went to the parliamentary meeting, Wen Yu would explain everything to him herself.","Wen Yu stood up and said, “Young Master, a ritual needs to be done before the parliamentary meeting can be held. This ritual requires the use of a large number of spiritual-type spiritual ingredients. We need to prepare these spiritual-type spiritual ingredients first.”","Lin Yuan smiled and replied, “That’s fine. Someone will deliver us spiritual-type spiritual ingredients soon..”","When Lin Yuan had given the 100 evolved Bronze/Epic Angelfish of Bliss to the Sea Bliss Clan, they had generously expressed their thanks to Lin Yuan for evolving the feys so quickly and had given him a set of fish coats as a show of gratitude.","Lin Yuan was not very interested in this set of fish coats. He felt that the fish coats that came from the Angelfish of Bliss that the Sea Bliss Clan nurtured would not be able to match up to those that came from the Angelfish of Bliss he was going to nurture in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","He could guarantee that every Angelfish of Bliss he nurtured in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake would be Epic quality.","But now, it seemed that those fish coats would come to be of use. Otherwise, he did not know where he would go to find the spiritual-type spiritual ingredients needed for the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting.","Just as Wen Yu was curious about why Lin Yuan had said what he said, Lin Yuan’s dedicated courier Ah Neng arrived at the mansion entrance.","This time, she was carrying ten Platinum fey storage boxes.","Lin Yuan received the boxes from Ah Neng and carried the fey storage boxes into the mansion with Wen Yu.","He took 200 completed rainbow fish coats out of one of the fey storage boxes.","Some of the fish coats had come from adult Angelfishes of Bliss.","He could immediately sense the spiritual energy in the fish coats.","Wen Yu could also feel it as she said, “Young Master, the parliamentary meeting only needs about 50 of these fish coats. The ritual will take half an hour. I will go to the training room first to contact the Astronomical Parliament. You can come to the training room after half an hour.”","Lin Yuan nodded and said, “Let me check the fish coats in the other fey storage boxes. If you’re free after this, please look into the Sea Bliss Clan and the Miao family’s Connected Beast Park on top of managing Sky City’s private territory.”","Wen Yu was about to agree when Lin Yuan spoke again. “You can organize the information about the Sun family’s Condense Fairy Orchard as well, then see if any main members of the Sun family have the condition where their muscles have necrotized.”","Wen Yu nodded with a smile and replied, “Young Master, you can leave it to me. Master Mystic Mood has already evolved the Elemental Paper to pinnacle Gold grade. I can organize information much faster than before. I’ll be able to provide you with all the information in three days.”","Wen Yu stored the 50 fish coats into the lotus flower-shaped Diamond fey storage box on her wrist and went to the training room to conduct the ritual.","After Lin Yuan left, Wen Yu poured another cup of Three Treasures Tea out of the teapot.","He drank the Three Treasures Tea and reinvigorated himself before he checked through the 100 Platinum grade fish coats.","The Bronze Angelfish of Bliss were only about as large as half his palm. Even when they grew to Platinum grade, they would only be as large as half his hand.","The Platinum Angelfish of Bliss with awakened dragon-species bloodlines were only a little smaller than the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish.","However, the Platinum Angelfish of Bliss did live up to its name.","When their fins were spread out, they glided through the water like the sparkling Red-Crowned Crane.","When their fins were pulled back, and their tail swished, they looked like rainbow fairies that lived amongst the clouds. They were utterly gorgeous!","But when Lin Yuan saw the color of the scales on the Angelfish of Bliss, he frowned.","Most of the 100 Platinum Angelfish of Bliss glittered with five colors, while the rest glittered with four colors.","After Lin Yuan checked through all the 100 Angelfish of Bliss, he noticed that none of them had seven-colored scales.","This meant that all of these Angelfishes of Bliss were high- and middle-quality adult Platinum Angelfishes of Bliss.","Lin Yuan laughed coldly.","When he had been forming the deal with the Sea Bliss Clan, he did not ask them to give him adult Angelfishes of Bliss, only that they should give as much as they felt expressed their sincerity.","Now, he could see the Sea Bliss Clan’s sincerity.","Lin Yuan finally knew why the Sea Bliss Clan had sent so many fish coats of this grade.","The high-grade fish coats were supposed to shut him up.","Initially, he had felt that it was Gao Feng who wanted to attack the Sea Bliss Clan. Lin Yuan had just been kicked out of the Sea Bliss Clan’s private faction territory.","Is my scheme to completely topple this veteran faction too vicious? But from their shameless manner, I actually don’t think that I’m vicious enough.","Even though these 100 Platinum Angelfish of Bliss were not of supreme quality, Lin Yuan still planned on nurturing them in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","The Submerged Flood Dragon Lake was going to be expanded by a lot, and the Platinum Angelfish of Bliss were so small.","Even if he nurtured all 100 Angelfish of Bliss, it would not require much space.","Moreover, Wen Yu would need to use 50 fish coats every week.","When the Angelfish of Bliss reached adulthood, they would require one month to produce one fish coat, no matter how well they were nurtured.","This meant that Wen Yu’s requirement of 50 fish coats every week would amount to 200 fish coats every month and would need to come from 200 Angelfish of Bliss.","This was a significant burden to the current mansion.","Master Duan Li would only be able to produce 300 Platinum Water Potions in two months, which would be used to evolve the Angelfish of Bliss to Platinum and grow them to adulthood.","Thus, the 200 fish coats that the Sea Bliss Clan had sent to silence Lin Yuan had truly solved his current emergency."]},{"number":702,"title":"Chapter 702 - The Figure Formed from Eight Willpowers","paragraphs":["Even if the Sea Bliss Clan used the fish coats to obscure the low quality of the Angelfish of Bliss they sent over, they essentially used collateral resources to exchange for development resources.","Lin Yuan took a large basin and filled it with water. He placed his hand in the basin and circulated his spiritual power to purify the spiritual power in the soil before pouring it into the water.","He did this for ten minutes before taking out the five-colored Angelfish of Bliss and placing them in the basin.","Although these Angelfish of Bliss had grown into adults, they had been so cooped up in the fey storage box that they started to become sickly after being shipped.","If Lin Yuan had not spent ten minutes pumping pure spirit qi into the water, the Angelfish of Bliss might have just sunk to the bottom instead of swimming.","The listless Angelfish of Bliss came into contact with the spirit qi-infused water and were affected by the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp’s Place of Life. They immediately became more lively.","Lin Yuan used his hand to circulate spiritual power and placed his palm against the Platinum Angelfish of Bliss as he carefully sensed them.","There were both male and female fish, and the first two male fish seemed normal.","But when he checked the third fish, which was female, he was crestfallen.","When the Sea Bliss Clan traded Angelfish of Bliss, they would destroy the female fish’s wombs.","Thus, the Angelfish of Bliss he was holding could not reproduce.","After his stormy expression persisted for a while, he checked the rest of the adult Angelfish of Bliss.","Lin Yuan discovered that 70 female Angelfishes of Bliss had destroyed wombs. He was so angry that he started to laugh.","Since the Sea Bliss Clan wanted to treat him in such a manner and play sneaky tricks, he would have to use a more forceful tactic to attack them. He should add in some other more menacing methods.","Lin Yuan spent about 15 minutes checking the 100 Platinum Angelfish of Bliss.","He could not keep the Angelfish of Bliss stored in the fey storage box as they would likely die from prolonged storage in the fey storage box.","Lin Yuan brought the ten Platinum fey storage box and ran to the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","The Submerged Flood Dragon Lake’s water came from an underground spring, so no matter how large the lake was expanded, there was no worry that there was not going to be enough water or that the rocks would contaminate the spring water in the lake.","Even though Submerged Flood Dragon Lake was being constructed, the water remained extremely clean.","Under the watchful eyes of Hu Quan’s 200 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen, Lin Yuan immediately poured the 100 adult Platinum Angelfish of Bliss into Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","The 100 Angelfishes of Bliss immediately became Blackie’s play buddies.","Blackie nudged one fish, then another fish, and it even used its tail to create waves that pushed the Angelfish of Bliss to the surface.","It was just like a naughty child.","However, Lin Yuan was aware that Blackie knew its limits and did not do anything to stop it.","Due to the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp’s Place of Life, the 100 Angelfish of Bliss would not die like they would have in the fey storage box, albeit the low concentration of spirit qi would result in their production of fish coats slowing.","Hu Quan’s 200 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen watched in shock as Lin Yuan greeted Hu Quan before he ran back into the mansion.","Lin Yuan ran upstairs to the training room.","At that moment, a Class 3 Spirit Craftsman jogged over to Hu Quan and asked respectfully, “Master Hu Quan, was that person the young master? Those are 100 adult Angelfish of Bliss!”","Before the Class 3 Spirit Craftsman could finish speaking, he noticed Hu Quan looking at him with a small smile.","The Class 3 Spirit Craftsman then received a fierce slap from Hu Quan, who roared, “That’s my young master! How dare you address him? Do you really think that you’re the only person here who can recognize those as Angelfish of Bliss? Get back to work and do your best to finish the project in two weeks! Don’t waste Young Master’s effort of gathering all the materials for us in only one day.”","After being slapped by Hu Quan, the Class 3 Spirit Craftsman was not upset. Instead, he was delighted.","When he looked at the other 199 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen, Liu Tong felt that the other Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen were idiots.","The number of Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen in Heavenly Craft Pavilion would only increase. Eventually, even Master Hu Quan would lose track.","If he could be slapped by Master Hu Quan a few times every day, at least it would lead to Master Hu Quan remembering who he was.","It was better than Hu Quan completely forgetting that he existed.","Moreover, his hard work and loyalty were not outshined by anyone else.","Eventually, he would be recognized by Master Hu Quan and even Young Master.","...","Lin Yuan did not have to push open the training room’s door to feel the overwhelming spiritual energy coming from within.","After he opened the door, he saw the 50 rainbow fish coats alight with rainbow flames. They formed a rainbow door that led to an unknown place.","Lin Yuan did not know that the moment the rainbow door lit up, all the stars in the sky shined too.","However, due to the bright sun, the shining starlight was not noticeable.","Lin Yuan asked Wen Yu, “Are we going to step through this door?”","Wen Yu shook her head and replied, “Young Master, this door is the Astronomical Parliament’s goods exchange door. The Astronomical Parliament needs willpower and laws as the medium for exchange. It cannot be used casually. Young Master, we just need to sleep next to this door in order to enter the parliamentary meeting.”","After Wen Yu spoke, Lin Yuan saw that she had placed two chairs next to the rainbow door.","He immediately took a seat on one of them and said, “Good, I’m exhausted after being awake for six days.”","Lin Yuan closed his eyes and quickly fell asleep.","As Wen Yu looked at Lin Yuan, all her nervousness about activating the Astronomical Parliament for the first time dissolved.","When she sat down and entered dreamland, two figures materialized under the backdrop of an expansive starlit sky.","But when she saw the figure standing next to her, she was so astonished that her jaw almost hit the floor. She realized that the figure was comprised of eight willpowers.","This figure also radiated with the subtle power of laws!"]},{"number":703,"title":"Chapter 703 - The 12 Zodiac Constellation Seats","paragraphs":["As the owner of the Astronomical Parliament, no one understood it more than Wen Yu.","Spirit qi professionals that joined the parliamentary meeting through the ritual invitation needed to be able to comprehend Willpower Runes at the very least. Otherwise, they would not be able to force themselves into the parliament even though Wen Yu was the owner.","Seeing that Lin Yuan’s body was formed from eight willpowers, it meant that he had comprehended eight Willpower Runes.","Wen Yu, who had been Lin Yuan’s right-hand person all this time, was overcome by incredulity.","She had always assumed that he had only comprehended around four Willpower Runes. Yet, he had comprehended twice of what she had thought.","If not for this occurrence where Wen Yu was able to make use of the Astronomical Parliament’s rules to discover that Lin Yuan had comprehended eight Willpower Runes, he might never have revealed this to her.","However, she did not understand the power of laws that was radiating from him.","The presence of law powers indicated Myth Breed feys.","After she found out that he had comprehended eight Willpower Runes, Wen Yu would only be shocked that his feys had truly reached Myth Breed.","She would not feel dumbfounded.","Even if he did have Myth Breed feys, he should not possess so many different law powers.","Moreover, these law powers were very strange, and some were clearly stronger than others. They were just like beautiful flowers blooming in a garden, where some were more vibrant than others.","The less noticeable laws were the smaller flowers that helped decorate the scenery.","The more fragmented laws were just some frivolous decorations.","Regardless of how weak the less noticeable laws were, they were still laws that could only be controlled by thearch-class experts or Myth Breed feys.","While Wen Yu was busy being shocked, Lin Yuan took stock of his surroundings.","Lin Yuan saw 12 golden thrones in this vast starlit space.","The 12 enormous golden thrones were carved with intricate etchings.","However, they were all darkened, as though they were waiting for someone to sit on them to undo their seals and release their true forms.","Lin Yuan remembered the information about the Astronomical Parliament that he had seen from True Data. He knew that these 12 golden thrones were the 12 zodiac constellation seats.","There were also 66 bronze seats below the 12 golden thrones, which were also covered with complex carvings.","However, the markings on the 66 seats were far less magnificent than those on the 12 thrones.","Those 66 seats had to be the north-south constellation seats that were mentioned as part of Star Spirit Seat’s ability.","But even if he knew what those seats were, he was still unclear on their abilities.","He needed Wen Yu to explain everything to him.","When Lin Yuan looked at Wen Yu, he noticed that she was not solid. Instead, her body was composed of willpower. He could sense that the willpower was the one that Wen Yu had combined with the Elemental Paper when she had evolved it to Fantasy Breed.","When he looked around again, he could guess the mechanisms of the Astronomical Parliament from what he had read on True Data. It seemed that the ability to enter the Astronomical Parliament was not just about being able to comprehend willpowers. It was definitely also connected to souls.","When sacred source lifeforms formed contracts with spirit qi professionals, the extra step of forming a marrow contract had to be taken.","The spirit qi professional should be imprinted into the depths of the spirit qi professional’s soul, and both beings would fuse together.","Lin Yuan was still able to bring along the laws in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt into the Astronomical Parliament. In other words, other than willpowers, his very soul had entered the Astronomical Parliament.","“Wen Yu, you said that willpowers were the medium that was required to exchange matter in the Astronomical Parliament. What does that mean?” asked Lin Yuan.","He activated the laws that were carved into the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, and the power of over ten laws flowed out of Lin Yuan.","The power of the laws joined together and even formed a desolate world that one could not help but lose themselves in.","After he activated the power of his laws, he said, “If necessary, I have a significant amount of law power that we can use.”","Wen Yu felt that she understood Lin Yuan less and less. It seemed magical that he had been able to activate over ten laws.","Wen Yu recovered from her shock and said anxiously, “Young Master, this is the first time I’m holding the parliamentary meeting as well. We’ve just entered the venue, but the meeting hasn’t officially begun. We only need to use willpower and laws when we use Star Spirit Seat. Energy will require willpower, while physical entities will require laws. I only have one Willpower Rune. If I use it, even I won’t be able to enter the Astronomical Parliament again. Willpower and laws are very important. You must think carefully before deciding to use them.”","Wen Yu spoke with solemness.","The power of the willpower she possessed could not use Star Spirit Seat.","Thankfully, only one participant needed to pay in order to use the ability.","Lin Yuan, who possessed so many laws and willpowers, was able to use Star Spirit Seat with ease.","But it was a serious matter to use willpower and laws for Star Spirit Seat.","Wen Yu still needed to explain the situation to Lin Yuan seriously.","After Lin Yuan heard what Wen Yu said, he still only half-understood.","Only he and Wen Yu were in the Astronomical Parliament, so there was no point in using Star Spirit Seat.","“Young Master, when I finished forming a marrow contract with the Astronomical Parliament, I could only assign one of the 12 zodiac constellation seats. One of the ways to increase the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars is to feed it spiritual-type spiritual ingredients, which means to feed the cat’s eye stone on my forehead. Another method...”"]},{"number":704,"title":"Chapter 704 - Lin Yuan the Leo","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Since Wen Yu had stopped speaking mid-sentence, Lin Yuan was understandably confused.","But he still responded to what she had already said.","“While you were away from the mansion, I decided to expand the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake. Since the Astronomical Parliament will need spiritual-type spiritual ingredients, we’ll be able to cultivate over 1,000 Angelfish of Bliss in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake. Then, the Astronomical Parliament will be able to consume the fish coats.”","Wen Yu hastily changed the subject and said, “Young Master, Master Mystic Moon has evolved the Astronomical Parliament to 1 Star. I can assign another of the 12 zodiac constellation seats.”","She walked over to one of the golden thrones and injected the willpower inside her onto the carvings on the throne.","Shortly after, the throne changed from its original darkened appearance and started to glow slightly.",".","This dim light was like the glow of constellations.","The starlight started to intensify and shoot upwards.","Under the guidance of the starlight, the Libra constellation appeared in the initially empty sky.","When the Libra constellation appeared, the etchings on the Libra throne detached from the throne and transformed into a simple pattern that was printed on Wen Yu’s neck.","Wen Yu turned to Lin Yuan and said, “Young Master, Mystic Realm-type sacred source lifeforms are different from other sacred source lifeforms. Their owners are just the leaders, but they cannot control everything that happens. The 12 zodiac constellation seats separately oversee everything in the meetings. The Libra throne symbolizes balance and allows me to be responsible for the stability of the meeting. I can still designate a contract for one more zodiac constellation seat. Young Master, please choose from one of the 11 zodiacs left and form a contract with it!”","From Wen Yu’s words, Lin Yuan gained a general understanding of how the 12 zodiac constellation seats worked.","If one formed a contract with one of the 12 zodiac constellation seats, they would become one of the keepers of the Astronomical Parliament, even if they were not the owner.","Although it seemed that forming a contract with the 12 zodiac constellation seats was separate from Wen Yu’s rights as the contractor of the Astronomical Parliament, her permission was still required before anyone was allowed to sit on a throne.","Lin Yuan understood that Wen Yu wanted to share the Astronomical Parliament with him.","He looked deeply into her eyes and did not reject her.","“You formed a contract with the Libra throne, which symbolizes balance. But I’m clueless about the other 11 seats. Which do you think I should form a contract with?” asked Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was no stranger to the zodiac.","He once knew many people who were obsessed with it and believed that it could change their fates.","However, Lin Yuan was not familiar with the specifics.","In his previous life, he had been a Virgo and was often bullied because of this. As such, he was not willing to form a contract with the Virgo throne.","Wen Yu quickly explained, “The Aries throne symbolizes new beginnings, the Taurus throne symbolizes strength, the Gemini throne symbolizes wisdom, the Cancer throne symbolizes resilience, the Leo throne symbolizes power, the Virgo throne symbolizes beauty, the Scorpio throne symbolizes secrets, the Sagittarius throne symbolizes candor, the Capricorn throne symbolizes toughness, the Aquarius throne symbolizes rebellion, and the Pisces throne symbolizes complexity.","“I formed a contract with the Libra throne that symbolizes balance. When the parliamentary meeting is ongoing, I have the power to propose kicking out anyone that I feel is disrupting the balance. In such an instance, the other people seated on the 12 zodiac thrones will vote, and my proposition will pass if it receives more than half of the votes in support. Out of the 11 thrones left, I think you can consider forming a contract with the Leo throne. It symbolizes power and will enable you to overturn a vote during the parliamentary meeting.”","A determined smile appeared on Wen Yu’s face.","After forming a marrow contract with the Astronomical Parliament, Wen Yu could communicate with it in the depths of her soul.","The first thing the Astronomical Parliament had said to Wen Yu was that she had to keep the Leo throne empty or claim it for herself because it symbolized power and would essentially be the leader of the parliamentary meeting.","But once Wen Yu learned about the Leo throne’s ability, she decided that she would save that throne for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan walked up to the golden Leo throne and placed his hand on the back of the throne.","When he injected his willpower into the Leo throne, a giant Leo constellation appeared in the sky.","Once this constellation appeared, it immediately called to the etchings on the Leo throne.","Soon, the complex markings formed a simple lion’s tail that printed on Lin Yuan’s wrist.","Now, Lin Yuan was officially a part of the Astronomical Parliament and had the power to influence the meeting.","After he formed a contract with the Leo throne, Lin Yuan did not need Wen Yu’s explanation to understand the connection between the 12 zodiac constellation thrones and the north-south constellation seats.","When Star Spirit Seat was used, those seated on the 12 zodiac constellation thrones could give items or energy to those seated on the north-south constellation seats.","However, this would require willpower and laws.","Additionally, those seated on the north-south constellation seats could not request any transaction with those seated on the 12 zodiac constellation thrones.","But, they could make promises using willpower.","This shocked Lin Yuan, and he felt that the Astronomical Parliament was like an enormous computer server, wherein he and she were part of the system.","It was like an unbeatable gift that the main characters in books possessed.","He could use energy or items to make those seated on the north-south constellation seats promise to do things for him.","Lin Yuan felt that this exchange was unfair."]},{"number":705,"title":"Chapter 705 - Lin Yuan like Feels Part of a System","paragraphs":["Since Lin Yuan had the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, he could absorb willpower from Fantasy Breed feys.","By absorbing the laws from Myth Breed feys’ Law Crystals, he could pay the price of exchanging willpower and laws for matter.","Anyone else would be unwilling to give up the willpower and laws they had undergone great pains to obtain. But Lin Yuan did not know what kind of people would take the seats on the north-south constellation seats.","Lin Yuan asked Wen Yu, “Who will be chosen to sit on the 66 north-south constellation seats?”","Wen Yu felt embarrassed as she answered, “Young Master, the number of zodiac constellation seats that can be filled is decided according to the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars. However, the number of north-south constellation seats filled will be decided according to the strength of my spiritual energy. My current strength of spiritual energy will only be able to fill two north-south constellation seats. This means that when we officially hold a parliamentary meeting, there can be two people joining us.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","Wen Yu continued. “I can’t choose the people who can sit on the north-south constellation seats. But I know the conditions to gain a seat are very stringent, to the point of unreasonable. The people who will be able to sit on the north-south constellation seats have to be willing to give up everything they have in exchange for one thing. This one thing can be strength, health, wealth, or even revenge. They will also have to be hypnotized in order to be called by the north-south constellation seats into the parliamentary meeting.”","Lin Yuan nodded again.","But the more of Wen Yu’s explanation he heard, the more Lin Yuan felt that the people she spoke of who would be willing to give up everything in exchange, for one thing, sounded like the MCs in the books he used to read.","They had a goal, were willing to make sacrifices, and the Astronomical Parliament resembled a system.","Was this not the entire checklist to be the MC of a story?","Lin Yuan had a sense that he was the main character.","After she provided Lin Yuan with an explanation, Wen Yu sighed. “Young Master, Master Mystic Moon said that I don’t have many affiliations to spiritual energy. He also doesn’t know when I’ll be able to unlock more north-south constellation seats.”","Lin Yuan gently knocked on the Leo throne’s armrest and asked, “Wen Yu, how many feys can you contract based on your current level of spiritual energy?”","Wen Yu responded, “The Elemental Paper you gave me and the Earth Rush Golden Lotus from the Moon Empress are both source-type lifeforms. They aren’t real feys. Thus, the only fey I’ve formed a contract with is the Silver Sunlight Egret. I shouldn’t have any problems forming contracts with three more feys. Even if I do contract more feys, I have no idea when I’ll be able to comprehend another Willpower Rune.”","She thought back to the eight Willpower Runes that Lin Yuan had comprehended. She was not upset since it was Lin Yuan, but she knew how difficult it was to comprehend Willpower Runes. Hence, she could not help but be astonished at his talent.","Lin Yuan started to contemplate deeply. He planned on looking out for a suitable spiritual-type fey for Wen Yu to form a contract with.","But she was affiliated with avian feys and egret-species feys.","Although there were many strong egret-species feys, they were not suitable for Wen Yu’s current fey system, which was leaning toward management.","Apparently, Wen Yu’s search for feys would need to come from long-term memory, or she would need to work harder on her source-type lifeforms.","Lin Yuan possessed a significant number of source-type lifeforms.","Previously, when Lin Yuan received source-type items, he would check through them and sort them in different brocade boxes.","But ever since he obtained the Elemental Shellfish, which could continuously produce heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, his store of source-type items had steadily increased. Thus, he did not put much effort into looking through the contraction requirements and abilities of the source-type items he possessed.","Lin Yuan planned on bringing all his source-type items to the Spirit Lock spatial zone after the parliamentary meeting ended. He would instruct Genius to record all the contraction requirements and abilities of the source-type items.","At that time, he would only need to tell Genius what kind of ability the source-type lifeform he was looking for needed to possess, and Genius would be able to find it immediately.","Wen Yu looked at Lin Yuan, who was seated on the Leo throne. His hair was subtly illuminated by gold.","“Young Master, since there’s a lot of variability in who could be called to take a seat on a north-south constellation seat, it could literally be anyone. It could even come from an unknown land or federation that we haven’t heard of. If you don’t think they’re suitable, I’ll immediately invoke the power of the Libra throne and kick them out. If you think they’re passable, we can allow them to form a contract with the north-south constellation seats. Even if they manage to form a contract, we can still vote to kick them out,” said Wen Yu.","Lin Yuan’s posture immediately straightened, and excitement bloomed in his heart, especially when he heard that the person called to a north-south constellation seat could come from anywhere.","This naturally included places outside of the Radiance Federation.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s Space Tunnel had not been connected to Startling Lines Continent and Divine Wood Federation.","Lin Yuan had never been out of the Radiance Federation.","However, he now had a method of meeting people outside the Radiance Federation and potentially influence people from the Divine Wood Federation and Startling Lines Continent.","He immediately started to wonder if he was an actual system. He could provide resources to the people seated on the north-south constellation seats and enable Sky City to expand to other places.","Lin Yuan whispered to Wen Yu, “We’ve been here for some time. Let’s start the parliamentary meeting!”","Wen Yu’s expression became austere as she started to chant. Her voice caused the other constellations other than Libra and Leo to spin and form numerous north-south constellations.","The constellations included Andromeda, Centaurus, Perseus, Delphinus, Ursa Minor, Dorado, and more.","However, since these north-south constellations had not been unlocked, they remained dim in the sky.","Suddenly, Andromeda and Perseus started to light up and drew two willpowers into the parliamentary meeting.","Lin Yuan looked at Wen Yu in confusion.","She quietly explained, “Every north-south constellation represents a characteristic. The two willpowers being called now are applicable to the characteristics that Andromeda and Perseus represent.”","Lin Yuan watched as two mind willpowers formed a silhouette and landed on the Andromeda constellation seat.","A dark and sharp willpower condensed into another figure that landed on the Perseus constellation seat."]},{"number":706,"title":"Chapter 706 - The Barren Grotto Continent","paragraphs":["Bei Xu had been ensconced in the excruciation of the cold and his injuries as he waited for death to claim him.","When he had been struck in the back by the Underground Shadow Leopard, the agonizing pain and blood-curdling sound of his flesh being sliced open alerted Bei Xu that his spine had probably also been cracked.","He had spent all his life digging in the mines and had experienced countless injuries. Thus, he knew that his injuries were fatal.","Any further struggle was just his natural instinct for survival.","But after his instinct died down, Bei Xu suddenly sensed that he had entered a starlit world.","When he was young, he had heard a legend. It was foretold that the Grotto Continent was just an underground world. The true experts and wealthy would head to the surface to live where greenery existed.","The surface of the Grotto Continent did not have those violent gusts of wind that could strip flesh from bone, nor did it experience extreme temperatures.","There was a federation there called the Fertile Federation. Supposedly, people living in the Fertile Federation could look up and see stars at night. However, this was just a legend that he had heard from his mother when he was young.","After going through cruel daily labor in the mines, Bei Xu had no time to linger on the Fertile Federation and the stars that could be seen there.","Yet, he could not only see stars now, but he was also literally amongst them.","Bei Xu could not help but wonder if this was the afterlife.","Immediately after this thought entered his mind, he realized there was someone next to him. The figure that had condensed from willpowers stared dazedly at him. She spoke with a bird-like voice. “I can actually see color!”","After Yin Lin had finished eating a scrumptious dinner with her parents, her maidservant Sisi had pushed her around the garden.","The blind Yin Lin had spent her days in a wheelchair, and going around the garden had become her favorite activity after reading. The garden was filled with the fragrances of fresh flowers, and Sisi would describe the different flowers to her.","This allowed Yin Lin to interact with a better sensory world.","While she was smelling the irises, she could not suppress the desire to see the world and her willingness to sacrifice anything in exchange.","Perhaps she had been in the garden for too long because as the breeze caressed her, she felt tired.","Slowly, Yin Lin fell asleep.","The moment she fell asleep, she found herself amongst the stars.","The world of darkness that she had known for so long was suddenly replaced with the view of brilliant constellations. There were bronze seats around her, and her surroundings were dotted with stars. There were two enormous constellations in the sky, and a willpower morphed into a person next to her.","There was a man and a woman who looked like celestial beings seated on the golden thrones in front of her. She could see all of this extremely clearly.","Yin Lin could dream but could only experience sound, taste, and see strange shapes that she had imagined. However, she could never dream in color or light.","For someone who had never been able to see, Yin Lin had no concept of color.","But now, she knew that she could.","This confirmed to Yin Lin that she was not dreaming. This was real.","Lin Yuan cocked an eyebrow as he looked at Yin Lin and nodded slightly. She managed to confirm that the world of the Astronomical Parliament was different from reality but was still real, the moment she entered.","Maybe it was more impressive due to her blindness, but Lin Yuan could not help but be impressed at her intelligence.","In comparison, Bei Xu seemed rather dull and even guessed that he had entered the afterlife.","The moment that Bei Xu and Yin Lin were called to the parliamentary meeting, Lin Yuan felt that he was truly like a system that was written about in science fiction novels.","He could faintly guess the morphology of Bei Xu and Yin Lin’s willpowers. He knew their names and a portion of their life experiences.","At that moment, Wen Yu narrowed her eyes and said to Lin Yuan, “The man called Bei Xu is about to die in real life. Thus, his willpower is about to disappear from the parliamentary meeting too.”","Although the parliamentary meeting was separate from reality, the figures of those who entered comprised of willpowers and their soul. It was still connected to the soul and willpowers in reality.","If their body died, the willpowers and soul would also disappear from the celestial world.","Lin Yuan frowned.","While Bei Xu and Yin Lin were busy being shocked, Lin Yuan had already seen a part of their life from their willpowers. It was like he was watching two movies concurrently.","Yin Lin had been cared for her entire life and was treated like a princess. Although she could not see, she led a much happier life than most people.","In contrast, Bei Xu had lived a vicious cycle of a life. When he was not so sick to the point of being immobile, he was laboring away in the mine.","He had escaped from the mine because he had given a quarter of his food to a sick companion.","Life in the underground mine dictated that everyone had to use all their strength to dig even more mines.","Since Bei Xu was one of the people with a better physique, he was given more food.","By giving away a portion of his food without permission, he had essentially lowered his productivity for the next day, which lowered the profits of the mine’s owner.","Lin Yuan could tell from Bei Xu’s willpower that he seemed like a god that was silently looking over the Grotto Continent.","The Grotto Continent was even more barren than Lin Yuan could imagine.","Spirit qi professionals from the Grotto Continent were not like the ones in the Radiance Federation who could seek out high-quality Bronze grade feys.","The normal spirit qi professionals in the Grotto Continent considered being able to contract feys a miracle. They did not have the right to be picky about the abilities and quality of the feys.","It was already extremely rare to be able to find feys in the Grotto Continent.","The rare feys that appeared mostly fell under the control of the elites. They would never be granted to people like Bei Xu, who dug mines."]},{"number":707,"title":"Chapter 707 - Lin Yuans Small Present","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan felt sad for Bei Xu, who was about to die. He truly was an empathetic and good person.","Lin Yuan could sense from Bei Xu’s willpower that he had managed to maintain a fragment of warmth despite having lived in such an environment.","Besides power, Sky City valued character.","Bei Xu’s character definitely met Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Since the Astronomical Parliament gave Bei Xu this chance for Lin Yuan to help him, Lin Yuan planned on using this chance well.","According to the plot of fictional stories, the lowliest being could also become invincible when they were granted a gift.","Bei Xu was much more than a lowly being. He had comprehended a Willpower Rune before the age of 22. In the Radiance Federation, he would be considered decently talented.","In the Grotto Continent’s underground world, where feys were rare, Lin Yuan was confident that he would be able to easily nurture someone with Bei Xu’s affinity.","Lin Yuan said to Wen Yu, “Use Star Spirit Seat.”","Wen Yu immediately realized that Lin Yuan wanted to heal Bei Xu, just like how he had rescued her.","The Astronomical Parliament could exchange physical items, but healing required the exchange of energy. Lin Yuan needed to provide willpower in exchange.","Since this was an important matter, Wen Yu reminded Lin Yuan again, “Young Master, the exchange of energy will cost willpower.”","Lin Yuan nodded. Wen Yu did not say anything else and immediately activated Star Spirit Seat.","He released the Bud of Mountain Jade that was in reality’s vitality and directed it toward Bei Xu.","The Leo constellation above Lin Yuan immediately started to absorb the vitality that Lin Yuan released. Then, the Leo constellation moved until it was above Bei Xu’s head and unloaded the vitality onto Bei Xu.","While the vitality was transferring to Bei Xu, Lin Yuan chose to sacrifice the willpower he had obtained from the Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole’s flesh.","However, he realized that a sixth of the Diamond VIII/Fantasy III Dark Spirit Eye Tadpole’s willpower had been depleted.","This cost practically caused Lin Yuan physical pain—the price for resource exchange in the Astronomical Parliament was very high.","However, Lin Yuan was soon stunned.","Lin Yuan was shocked to realize that the willpower he had sacrificed shot toward the cat’s eye stone on Wen Yu’s forehead and fused with it.","This made Lin Yuan understand what Wen Yu had not said when she stopped mid-sentence. Apparently, the Astronomical Parliament could also absorb willpower and the laws that people sacrifice in exchange in order to increase its Stars.","Lin Yuan had felt some heartache at depleting so much willpower. But if this could allow Wen Yu to increase the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars, Lin Yuan felt that it was worth it. After all, Lin Yuan’s own Sacred Sword Wielding Queen also manipulated willpower and laws.","Lin Yuan was able to easily extract willpower and laws from Law Crystals that came from dead Fantasy Breed and Myth Breed feys. He could sacrifice those in exchange for resources.","No one else would be able to handle the cost, yet Lin Yuan could afford it easily.","The transfer of vitality did not affect Bei Xu’s willpower or soul. Thus, the Bei Xu in the parliamentary meeting did not feel any different.","However, this occurrence caused Bei Xu and Yin Lin to recover from their initial shock.","At that moment, Bei Xu and Yin Lin heard a bright female voice say, “Welcome to the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting.”","Bei Xu and Yin Lin followed Wen Yu’s voice, who was sitting on the Libra throne.","But soon, their gazes were drawn to Lin Yuan, who was seated on the Leo throne. It was because Lin Yuan had used Star Spirit Seat’s ability again and continued to direct vitality toward Yin Lin’s body in reality.","Since the Jasmine Lily’s Severed Limbs Growth could use the genetic model of a body to regrow what had been destroyed, as long as the sight portion of Yin Lin’s genetic model was intact, Severed Limbs Growth would be able to commence healing.","The memories that Lin Yuan could access mostly came from her willpower.","For as long as Yin Lin could remember, she had not been able to see. Thus, Lin Yuan could not be sure that the sight portion of Yin Lin’s genetic model was intact. As such, he only injected a small amount of vitality.","If the sight portion of her genetic model was still intact, when she returned to reality, she would be able to see light at the very least and be able to make out some shapes and colors.","If it was effective, when she returned to the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting next time, Lin Yuan would be able to heal her completely.","When the willpower was depleted, Lin Yuan wanted to release the willpower and laws that had been etched into the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","The majestic aura of willpower and laws deeply shocked Bei Xu, who had spent all his life in a barren wasteland, and Yin Lin, who could finally see.","Yin Lin and Bei Xu asked in unison, “What’s happening? Who are you?”","Lin Yuan did not answer them immediately because he noticed that Wen Yu was looking at him, her face as pale as a sheet.","The light from the cat’s eye stone on her forehead had turned dark.","Lin Yuan knew that this was due to Wen Yu’s spiritual energy being pushed to its limits.","The Astronomical Parliament could only hold the parliamentary meeting for a limited amount of time. Moreover, Wen Yu had spent too long explaining the workings of the Astronomical Parliament world to him.","Lin Yuan thought back to what Wen Yu had told him before standing up and saying to Yin Lin and Bei Xu, “Before you entered the parliamentary meeting, you were willing to give up everything in order to achieve your dream.","“If you want to take your words back, you can just treat this experience as a holiday in the celestial realm. Otherwise, you’ll come back after a week. At that time, you can state your request, and in exchange, you’ll need to accomplish a task of equal weightage.","“Of course, if you choose to say no, you’ll still find that I’ve given you a small gift from this trip. I hope you like it.”","Before Bei Xu and Yin Lin could reply, they disappeared from the parliamentary meeting.","A thin layer of sweat had appeared on Wen Yu’s face as she turned to feebly say to Lin Yuan."]},{"number":708,"title":"Chapter 708 - They Will Look Forward to Next Week","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Young Master, with the amount of spiritual energy I have now, I’ll be at my limit after the parliamentary meeting is held for half an hour. Yin Lin and Bei Xu were called here by Andromeda and Perseus. The next time, they’ll be able to direct themselves here when they fall asleep. But will they be able to sleep so soundly again next week?”","A confident smile stretched across Lin Yuan’s face. “They absolutely will. In fact, They will really look forward to next week.”","...","A few gusts of chilling wind shocked Bei Xu awake. He sat up instinctively but soon realized that his sudden movement could aggravate the injury he had sustained from the Underground Shadow Leopard’s claws.","However, he found that his back did not hurt at all.","In the underground world, anywhere without a stone that could light up on its own would be steeped in darkness. Hence, Bei Xu could not see his own body clearly.","But as he felt around his body, he realized that his injury had completely healed.","The change in his body made him remember what the celestial-being-like man and woman, and what the man had said.","Suddenly, he clenched his fists as shock and inspiration flashed across his eyes.","He muttered under his breath, “The Astronomical Parliament.”","He went through his memories again and slowly climbed down from the rock pillar. His recovered body was swept away by the rapid currents, and he only kept his head above the water.","He planned on being carried to a suitable spot where he could climb out.","Although the Grotto Continent was desolate, there were many root-species plants and insects.","Bei Xu decided to find some insects and plants to feed himself for the next few days. He would quietly wait for a week to pass and be recalled to the mysterious and vast starlit realm.","He had also thought of the request he would make.","He wanted a fey that he could form a contract with or be able to avenge his father, mother, and older sister.","It would be challenging for him to survive in this underground world on his own.","...","The sleeping Yin Lin suddenly heard Sisi’s voice say, “Miss, it’s getting windy. If you’re tired, let’s take you back to your bedroom to rest! Although it’s a little early, you can wake up from the nap later, have some snacks, and still have an hour left over to read.”","Yin Lin woke up to the sound of Sisi’s voice and discovered that she could see more than just darkness now. She could even perceive light.","This change made Yin Lin think back to the place called the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting.","The ever-composed Yin Lin started to tremble as she said calmly, “Sisi, take me back to my room!”","After returning to the room and lying on her bed, Yin Lin tentatively stretched out her hand and removed her blindfold.","When she opened her eyes, large beads of tears flowed out.","Although she still could not see clearly, light had finally entered her world.","She could see general shapes and colors.","This was a dream she had never hoped that she would be able to achieve.","Although she usually took naps, she was not tired at all. Instead, she looked around at her surroundings curiously.","She remembered what the man who resembled a celestial being had said and murmured, “Is allowing me to see light the gift that you mentioned?”","Yin Lin hastily rang the bell that was tied to her bed.","The ring alerted Sisi, who was standing outside, to open the door and walk in.","Sisi walked up to Yin Lin and saw that Yin Lin had removed her blindfold. Sisi asked anxiously, “Miss, do your eyes feel uncomfortable?”","But when Sisi looked into Yin Lin’s eyes, she could not help but freeze. Her legs seemed to have lost all strength.","Sisi swore that she had never seen a set of such crystal clear, beautiful green eyes.","One word entered Sisi’s head—fairy!","Yin Lin started to laugh.","Shortly after, Sisi felt Yin Lin touch the knot around Sisi’s neck.","“Sisi, is this blue?” asked Yin Lin curiously.","Sisi immediately replied, “Yes, Miss, this is blue.”","But after she replied to Yin Lin’s question, Sisi froze again. She then burst out in astonishment and delight. “Miss! You can see light and color!?”","Yin Lin chucked and replied, “You were right. Blue is a color that represents a good mood.”","Yin Lin had always been sensitive and could tell that Sisi was very confused. Sisi was so elated that she started to cry.","“Miss, it’s so great that you can see! Master and Mistress will be overjoyed!”","Yin Lin moved her hand up from the knot at Sisi’s neck, and her fingertips came into contact with the hot tears that were cascading down Sisi’s cheeks.","She could only make out Sisi’s general silhouette.","Now, she craved even more strongly to be able to see and muttered the words, “Astronomical Parliament”.","Yin Lin started to think about the request she would make. She wanted to be able to see the world clearly, to see Sisi, her family, and Grandpa Butler’s face.","Her heart was filled with endless gratitude for the man who had given her this gift.","This ‘little gift’ was the most precious present she had ever received.","Shortly after, Yin Lin touched Sisi’s face and said,” Sisi, remind me not to sleep six days later. I need to sleep the entire day on the seventh day. Take me to my parents now. I want to see the color of Mom’s strawberry jam!”","...","Lin Yuan woke up in the training room and said to Wen Yu, who was looking rather weak, “Tell Big Brother Liu to roast some of the Angelfish of Bliss’ fish coats for you. It can help you to replenish your spiritual energy.”","Wen Yu nodded and asked with worry, “Young Master, is it really okay that you used willpower for the Astronomical Parliament?”","Lin Yuan shook his head and replied, “This cost is nothing to me. Will the Astronomical Parliament evolve faster from absorbing willpower or fish coats?”","Wen Yu carefully calculated the two variables before saying, “The two times that you used Star Spirit Seat had better effects than using the 40 fish coats.”","When Wen Yu saw that Lin Yuan’s emotion had not changed, she became certain that Lin Yuan did not mind using these willpowers. Only then could she set her worry to ease.","Lin Yuan decided that he would use more willpowers and laws for Star Spirit Seat so that the Astronomical Parliament could increase its Stars soon."]},{"number":709,"title":"Chapter 709 - Choosing Laws and Willpowers","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Investing willpowers and laws into the Astronomical Parliament not only helped Wen Yu to increase the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars, but it also benefited Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan fed a large amount of willpower and laws to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, there would be issues that arose with regards to the sorting of the willpowers and laws.","The world in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt was formed from representations of the laws and willpowers.","The extremely similar willpowers and laws could not be combined in the skirt. Thus, the images on the skirt often clashed.","It was similar to how the pile of Law Crystal fragments that Duan He had given Lin Yuan was separated into five groups and came from five different Myth Breed feys.","One of them was the Gilt Flames Dragon Lice that had comprehended broiling flame laws.","When Lin Yuan had been trading with Sun Ningxiang, she had displayed her trust in him by sending him the Law Crystal fragments to him first.","Lin Yuan had already given the Law Crystal fragments from Sun Ningxiang to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb. Thus, several Law Crystals with pure laws had been condensed.","Amongst the Law Crystal fragments that Sun Ningxiang had given him, one of the feys it came from was the Roasted Armor Sacred Ladybird that had comprehended roasting flame laws.","The Gilt Flames Dragon Lice and Roasted Armor Sacred Ladybird’s laws were very similar. However, the broiling flames laws were much hotter than the roasting flame laws.","Although the two laws did not seem very different, their images immediately started to fight on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","The broiling flames law was more complete than the roasting flames law. Hence, Lin Yuan would much rather only have one of them on the skirt so as to avoid them fighting on the skirt, which would ruin the picture on the skirt.","By giving laws to the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan was carefully filtering the laws that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would absorb.","This would allow Lin Yuan to prune the laws and leave only the best on the skirt.","Naturally, this logic applied to willpowers as well.","After Lin Yuan obtained enough Law Crystal fragments from Sun Ningxiang, the willpowers from Fantasy Breed feys would not even catch Lin Yuan’s eye.","However, as for now, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would accept any law and willpower.","After Wen Yu’s spiritual energy increased, the Astronomical Parliament would allow more people into the parliamentary meeting.","At that time, a lot of willpower would be needed.","Although heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were physical items, they were still items that contained concentrated pure elemental energy.","Lin Yuan needed to pay willpowers and laws in order to use Star Spirit Seat to exchange resources.","If Lin Yuan really was a system and the people called to the north-south constellation seats were the MCs, Lin Yuan wanted them to set up a Sky City in the continent they originated from.","Every Sky City that was set up would be like the fire inside stars. When the fire inside stars burned to a certain extent, it would burn through the boundary to reach another Sky City.","Finally, all the Sky Cities would be connected.","In order to accomplish this dream, the main task of Lin Yuan as the system was to input resources.","The valuable resource that Lin Yuan had the most of was heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. Thus, he wanted the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb more willpowers just in case.","Hence, he needed to find dead Fantasy Breed feys.","Lin Yuan did not think that this was a difficult task.","If I can even get my hands on the Law Crystal fragments from Myth Breed feys, I shouldn’t have a problem obtaining the bodies of dead Fantasy Breed feys!","Lin Yuan was working with the Sun family’s Condense Fairy Orchard and the Sea Bliss Clan. Even if the Sea Bliss Clan eventually decided to strike back against him, they were still collaborating for now.","Lin Yuan felt that Condense Fairy Orchard and the Sea Bliss Clan would be glad to help him collect the bodies of dead Fantasy Breed feys. After all, he could supply them with Class 4 and even pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master resources.","Since he planned on terrorizing the Sea Bliss Clan, his partnership with them was definitely short-term. As such, he needed to quickly squeeze all the resources he needed from the Sea Bliss Clan as soon as possible.","In this aspect, Lin Yuan was very confident. He was certain that the Sea Bliss Clan would never reject what he was about to offer them.","Meanwhile, Wen Yu had recovered some of her spiritual energy and no longer felt as dizzy as she did before.","She stood up and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, I’m going to take over the work at Sky City’s private faction territory. At night, I’ll return to the Hidden Moon Pavilion and organize the information you asked for.”","Lin Yuan nodded and paused for a moment before saying, “You’ve finished organizing all the information on the Miao family. For now, you can just focus on paying attention to their activities. You don’t have to watch the Sea Bliss Clan as closely either. Just focus on investigating the Sun family’s Condense Fairy Orchard, especially the member of their family that has severely injured muscles that require Legend Muscle Growth Camellia for treatment.”","Since Wen Yu had stayed in the Hidden Moon Pavilion for a week, she was unaware of what had happened on Star Web and at the mansion.","But when she heard Lin Yuan mention the Sun family for the second time, she knew that he needed the information on them more urgently.","She had heard of the Sun family before.","When she had been working at the Radiant Moon Palace as a spirit attendant, she often heard the Eight Trigrams gossiping about the top factions.","Jin Qi had once spent half a year talking about the Sun family daily and with a mocking tone. It seemed that three of the Sun family’s pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters had betrayed them, and the Sun family eventually killed them.","However, Wen Yu never paid much attention to gossip and did not know detailed news about them.","“Young Master, in just two days, I’ll be able to provide you with detailed information about the Sun family.”","Wen Yu headed to her room, logged onto Star Web, and immediately started working.","Lin Yuan left the training room and picked ten of the best fish coats from the remaining 160 and gave them to Liu Jie, who was preparing ingredients in the kitchen."]},{"number":710,"title":"Chapter 710 - The Demanding Lin Yuan","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan instructed Liu Jie to roast the fish coats into crispy crepes that Wen Yu could use to replenish her spiritual energy in the future.","Lin Yuan sat on the water rhinoceros leather sofa and picked up the phone to call Qi Haitao.","He had met Qi Haitao at Sky City’s private faction territory on Star Web.","Lin Yuan had initially rejected Qi Haitao’s offer to meet in real life to discuss the partnership, but after the latter’s repeated offers of hospitality, Lin Yuan eventually exchanged phone numbers with Qi Haitao.","Lin Yuan heard the call ring three times before Qi Haitao picked up.","Qi Haitao said in a friendly tone, “Brother, I didn’t manage to get your name back at Sky City’s private faction territory. May I know how I should address you?”","Lin Yuan chuckled and replied, “You don’t need to call me brother. Considering that I delivered you 100 evolved Angelfish of Bliss in three days, I trust that the Sea Bliss Clan now acknowledges Sky City’s sincerity. However, I can’t say that Sky City has received the same level of sincerity from the Sea Bliss Clan. Do you really think you can call me brother after only giving Sky City mid to high-grade adult Angelfishes of Bliss?”","Qi Haitao’s tone immediately became stern with a touch of annoyance. “What? I instructed my subordinates to give you 80 high-grade and 20 supreme-grade adult Angelfish of Bliss. I can’t believe they got it wrong!”","Qi Haitao’s tone changed to coaxing as he said, “Brother, I’ll compensate you on our next transaction. I’ll tell my men to give you 60 high-grade and 40 supreme-grade Angelfish of Bliss. My apologies about this. Haha, do you like the fish coats I personally picked out for you? They are the best that the Sea Bliss Clan has to offer!”","Lin Yuan’s words were like a violent slap to the smiling Qi Haitao.","If this was any other time, Qi Haitao would never have swallowed his pride no matter how badly he wanted to work with Sky City.","However, Sky City had just delivered 100 Bronze/Epic gestating Angelfish of Bliss to the Sea Bliss Clan.","This allowed his father, who was the leader of the Sea Bliss Clan, to decide to cut off all other fey business dealings and concentrate on nurturing the Angelfish of Bliss.","He had also already sent people to the Spirit Guards with the contract between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park to force Connected Beast Park to pay for the price of the Sea Bliss Clan’s change in business model.","It could be said that the Sea Bliss Clan was in dire need of Sky City’s Creation Master resources. Otherwise, the Sea Bliss Clan would be at the mercy of Connected Beast Park’s future wrath.","Qi Haitao could not help but sigh to himself.? I was too shortsighted previously. Why did I give Sky City adult Angelfish of Bliss like that?","An amused expression appeared on Lin Yuan’s face as he gently knocked the soft leather of the water rhinoceros leather sofa.","Qi Haitao was truly the young leader of the Sea Bliss Clan. The things he said were so interesting.","Lin Yuan was not confused about Qi Haitao’s attitude toward him. After all, Sky City had demonstrated its impressive Creation Master resources to the Sea Bliss Clan.","Although Qi Haitao was seemingly admitting to the mistake, he was actually testing Lin Yuan’s ability.","Qi Haitao had also shown the Sea Bliss Clan’s last trump card by trading 80 adult high-grade and 20 supreme-grade Angelfish of Bliss with every transaction. He also shoved all the blame to his subordinates and wiped himself clean of all the errors from the last transaction.","It could be seen that Qi Haitao had a strong negotiation ability.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan did not plan to argue with Qi Haitao and allow him to continue testing him.","Instead, he told Qi Haitao in a determined and straightforward manner, “Will all of the transactions between the Sea Bliss Clan and Sky City lack sincerity like this? Will the Sea Bliss Clan try to trick Sky City with female Angelfish of Bliss that can’t reproduce again?”","Lin Yuan’s words caused Qi Haitao to break out in cold sweat.","As far as Qi Haitao was aware, the adult Angelfish of Bliss should have been close to death by the time they arrived at Sky City in the fey storage box.","Sky City should be seeking the Sea Bliss Clan out for help now and asking their advice on how to nurture Angelfish of Bliss.","Qi Haitao had already thought of the conditions he would set in exchange for the advice.","Surprisingly, Sky City not only did not care that the Angelfish of Bliss were close to death, but they had also even closely investigated the physical condition of the Angelfish of Bliss.","One had to know that the Angelfish of Bliss were the foundation of the Sea Bliss Clan.","Naturally, if the Sea Bliss Clan wanted to rely on Sky City, which possessed so many Creation Master resources, Qi Haitao would have to prevent Sky City from getting their hands on female Angelfish of Bliss with reproductive abilities at all costs.","Just as Qi Haitao was stuck between a rock and a hard place, he heard Lin Yuan’s clear and strong voice say, “In the next transaction, Sky City can pretend to forget about the Sea Bliss Clan’s trick. But since you want to play dirty, Sky City will have to demand 50 high-grade and 50 supreme-grade Angelfish of Bliss from the Sea Bliss Clan.”","Lin Yuan’s request greatly exceeded Qi Haitao’s initial expectation.","But after he was backed into a corner by Lin Yuan and had his tricks exposed, Qi Haitao breathed a sigh of relief when he heard what Lin Yuan requested.","Just as Qi Haitao was about to agree, Lin Yuan spoke again. “If the Sea Bliss Clan wants to express their sincerity, continue to send us 200 seven-colored fish coats. Additionally, I want the Sea Bliss Clan to provide Sky City with 10 complete Fantasy Breed fey carcasses with every transaction.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Qi Haitao’s jaw drop, and he could not help but curse Lin Yuan internally.? How can he be so demanding!?","Qi Haitao felt that Lin Yuan was even greedier than the Devil.","He immediately pushed what the Sea Bliss Clan could offer to the limit by demanding the continued delivery of 200 seven-colored fish coats. He even asked for 10 complete Fantasy Breed fey carcasses.","These terms would result in the Sea Bliss Clan offering a manifold of the original conditions."]},{"number":711,"title":"Chapter 711 - Giving Them a Taste of Their Own Medicine","paragraphs":["As much as the Sea Bliss Clan needed to rely on Sky City’s Creation Master resources, the Sea Bliss Clan could not afford this price.","“I’m sorry, but the Sea Bliss Clan cannot agree to these conditions. We—”","Before Qi Haitao finished speaking, Lin Yuan cut in and said, “You’re jumping the gun. Don’t be so quick to say no! Sky City will not unreasonably force the Sea Bliss Clan to pay such a price. Sky City will be able to offer the Sea Bliss Clan a guarantee. After every three transactions, which means after Sky City evolves 300 gestating Angelfish of Bliss for the Sea Bliss Clan, we will provide the Sea Bliss Clan with a Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss.”","Lin Yuan’s words calmed Qi Haitao down.","Qi Haitao started to breathe raggedly.","The entire Sea Bliss Clan dreamed of having the Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss.","The Sea Bliss Clan had managed to progress to the level they were at because they owned a potion made from over 200 types of spiritual ingredients.","The potions could help the birthed eggs to hatch.","The Sea Bliss Clan also used this to dominate the market on the Angelfish of Bliss.","However, after the death of Qi Haitao’s grandfather, who was a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master, the Sea Bliss Clan had run out of top Creation Master resources.","Nevertheless, the Sea Bliss Clan had their own trump card as well, which was that when the previous leader had been nurturing the Angelfish of Bliss, he had managed to nurture two Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss.","These two Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss were a symbol of power and luck for Qi Wangyang and were kept in the Sea Bliss Clan’s main mansion.","Unfortunately, both the Bronze/Legend Angelfishes of Bliss were male and could not reproduce.","If Sky City could promise to evolve gestating Angelfish of Bliss to Legend quality, there was no way the Sea Bliss Clan would reject the offer.","One Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss could produce over 1,000 eggs. Even with the power of the Sea Bliss Clan’s special potion, only 1% of the eggs would hatch. Thus, the Sea Bliss Clan would be left with ten supreme-grade fish.","But after a few years, the general quality of the Sea Bliss Clan’s Angelfishes of Bliss would rise.","The offspring birthed by the Bronze/Legend female Angelfish of Bliss could even break through the ceiling that the clan had never been able to accomplish. They could eventually evolve or transform into a new being.","At that time, the offspring produced by the female Bronze/Legend fish would have minimal quality of Bronze/Epic.","The offspring would still have the potential to be Legend quality.","If the female and male Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss were nurtured together in the main mansion, they could produce amazing offspring.","If this deal was successful, it could strengthen the Sea Bliss Clan’s trump card and allow them to have enough standing to clash against elite factions in the future.","When Lin Yuan heard Qi Haitao’s strange breathing, he held the phone away from his ear and only placed it back against his ear after a few seconds.","This man’s breathing was too strange.","Lin Yuan heard Qi Haitao say anxiously, “It’s a deal!”","Lin Yuan did not waste time saying anything else to Qi Haitao. After the deal was done, he hung up immediately.","Although Lin Yuan could use Bronze/Legend to form the transaction with the Sea Bliss Clan, they could still play tricks with the Angelfish of Bliss. If so, Lin Yuan could fight fire with fire.","The Angelfish of Bliss were already very delicate, but they were especially weak during the gestation period. Any trigger could kill them.","Lin Yuan only needed to use spirit qi to evolve the Angelfish of Bliss to Bronze/Legend and inject a large amount of pure spirit qi into the womb of the gestating Angelfish of Bliss.","This would strengthen the eggs, but it would not transform or evolve them.","At that time, the gestating Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss would remain pregnant for a long time.","The female fish would not be strong enough to provide for the strengthened offspring; thus, it would not be able to birth the eggs.","This would cause the Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss to remain pregnant for a long time.","No one faction in the world understood the Angelfish of Bliss better than the Sea Bliss Clan.","After the eggs left the mother’s body, the mother’s body would be split open, leading to a quick death.","At that time, the Sea Bliss Clan would have no choice but to watch the Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss exist in the hell of not being to give birth.","The Angelfish of Bliss that Lin Yuan evolved for the Sea Bliss Clan would only be able to serve ornamental purposes.","Lin Yuan did not believe that when the Sea Bliss Clan eventually faced a shortage of Aurora pollen, they would choose to abandon the pregnant Bronze/Legend Angelfish of Bliss.","The pregnant Angelfish of Bliss would require over a hundred times the amount of Aurora pollen they currently needed in order to sustain the eggs they would not be able to give birth to.","This would increase the amount of Aurora pollen that the Sea Bliss Clan needed.","Lin Yuan wondered when the sheer mountain of Aurora pollen needed by every Angelfish of Bliss would cause the Sea Bliss Clan to collapse.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was increase the Sea Bliss Clan’s Aurora pollen needs during their collaborative period.","After he ended the call with Qi Haitao, Lin Yuan called Listen.","He told Listen to use the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s role to bring back some Muscle Growth Camellia.","Ever since Lin Yuan had gained the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, it became much easier for him to obtain simple spiritual ingredients.","Although Wen Yu had not discovered who within Condense Fairy Orchard was injured and needed Legend quality Muscle Growth Camellia for treatment, Lin Yuan also could not be sure that he wanted to trade the evolved Muscle Growth Camellia with Sun Ning Xiang in exchange for complete Myth III Law Crystals.","However, it did not hurt to evolve the Muscle Growth Camellia first.","Spiritual ingredients like this that could heal specific injuries were a rare and precious resource.","They could be used to exchange for important resources during special occasions, just like what Lin Yuan was planning to do with the Sun family.","After ending the call with Listen, Lin Yuan prepared to return to his room to sleep.","Even if Lin Yuan was made of metal, his body was at its limit after six straight days of hard work.","He planned to sleep for a few hours, then have a meal, before going back to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to work again.","But before it was time to eat, Lin Yuan was awakened to come face to face with Liu Jie’s stern expression."]},{"number":712,"title":"Chapter 712 - Power Conforms to its Target","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After being awakened by Liu Jie, Lin Yuan felt dizzy. It was torture to be woken up when you were sleeping exceptionally soundly.","When he woke up, his eyes felt hot and swollen. He gently rubbed his eyes.","Just as he was about to stretch, he noticed Liu Jie’s solemn expression.","Lin Yuan immediately sat up straight.","Liu Jie saw that Liu Jie had awoken and said in an austere voice, “Lin Yuan, Duan He is back. But he can’t enter the mansion yet.”","Lin Yuan was still slightly dazed when his eyes suddenly flew open.","From what Liu Jie had just said, Lin Yuan knew what had happened.","When Lin Yuan had last spoken with Duan He, he had told Duan He not to bring the bloodied bodies of enemies into the mansion. Since Liu Jie had said that Duan He could not come into the mansion yet, it meant that Duan He had brought back another bloodied body of an enemy.","Liu Jie quickly pulled on a long white robe embroidered with fish patterns and said, “Big Brother Liu, let’s go down together.”","Liu Jie walked up to Lin Yuan and said, “Lin Yuan, I think the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce will be going through a tumultuous period for now. Zhou Luo’s Lava Dragon Lizard was severely injured while it was protecting Listen. If Duan He hadn’t appeared in time to save it, Zhuo Luo would be done for.”","Lin Yuan’s expression darkened.","“How is Zhou Luo’s Lava Dragon Lizard now?”","A look of relief came over Liu Jie’s face as he said, “In order to defend Listen against a lethal blow, half of the Lava Dragon Lizard’s body was split open. If it wasn’t a defense-type fey and had the dragon-species-bloodline with impressive regenerative abilities, it would never have been able to hold out until Master Hong Shen arrived.","“When Master Hong Shen arrived, he immediately started healing its roots. It was only then that Zhou Luo was able to return it to the spiritual spatial zone. The Lava Dragon Lizard is already being well taken care of by Master Hong Shen in the mansion. This level of injury will probably take at least a month to heal.”","When Lin Yuan heard about the Lava Dragon Lizard’s injury, he immediately clenched his fist.","Fighting always broke out in a split second between experts. If Duan He had been even a second later, the Lava Dragon Lizard would have died. To a spirit qi professional like Zhou Luo, the death of the Lava Dragon Lizard would be like him losing his best partner. It would have affected Zhou Luo for the rest of his life.","When Zhou Luo had stood out in the water world dimensional rift to take on the Blade Worms, he had also been willing to sacrifice his life for Lin Yuan and Liu Jie. Hence, Lin Yuan treated Zhou Luo as a member of his family. It was also after that that Zhou Luo’s image was carved onto the feature wall in the living room.","Lin Yuan felt that he had been too careless.","When he had been facing off against the Suzerain/Myth II Night Calamity Crow, the main Zheng family’s Nightmare Squad and third lineage of the Zheng family’s pinnacle Suzerain Jiao Hanzhong, he had won every fight.","Moreover, his journey had been too smooth, which resulted in Lin Yuan losing his cautiousness.","He had almost forgotten how strong the enemy was.","In the fights against the Night Calamity Crow, Nightmare VI, and Jiao Hanzhong, the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer had been the main combatants.","As they were Sky City’s top fighters, they had managed to successfully kill the enemies.","Frankly, Nightmare VI was just the sixth strongest member of the Zheng family’s Nightmare Squad.","The main function of the Nightmare Squad was to serve the young generation of the Zheng family’s direct descendants.","Additionally, the Nightmare Squad was not the Zheng family’s only resource.","Lin Yuan was now fully aware. His Sky City was very much lacking in fighting power.","Although Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath were emperor-class experts, the Mother of Bloodbath was only Suzerain VIII/Myth II, and Endless Summer was Suzerain X/Myth III.","Endless Summer’s power had not yet reached pinnacle Suzerain X/Myth III.","Technically, Endless Summer could not be considered the strongest emperor-class presence.","As for the new emperor-class expert Duan He, he had not joined Sky City for long, while Purple Demon had only recently evolved to Suzerain II.","Duan He could be considered an impressive fighting force given the Seven-Headed Sea Demon Snake’s current power. He was now Sky City’s current top fighting force.","Sky City’s power lay in its fighting abilities. However, the king-class experts’ power was much weaker. It could not even amount to the power of a rising faction.","Zhou Luo, Master Hong Shen, Hu Quan, and Fei Qianqiong were the only four king-class experts in Sky City.","However, Hu Quan was a Spirit Craftsman and did not fight.","Fei Qianqiong was a spy in the Iron Wall Chamber of Commerce and could not use his true strength easily. Thus, the strongest fighting force out of the four of them was Master Hong Shen, who had contracted the Black Bronze Succulent.","Lin Yuan thought,? Sky City’s fighting power must be raised.","But Lin Yuan had no plans to change the current members or their roles.","Although Sky City was a faction, it was also a large family in which the members supported each other.","Character was the most important criterion to become a member of Sky City.","Zhou Luo and Master Hong Shen might not be very strong now, but they had the potential to become stronger.","Ever since Sky City had announced its private faction territory’s role, it had generated enough reputation to gain the loyalty of any king-class expert.","Nonetheless, Sky City had openly opposed the Zheng family and the Miao family.","King-class experts were not enough to solve the insufficiency in fighting power, which was what Sky City truly needed.","The stronger Sky City became, the greater threat they would pose to other factions.","However, he also could not disregard the power of king-class experts because they were always reliable sources of strength.","Lin Yuan had been too busy to develop the white-clothed-followers plan after he used it that one time.","But now, he needed to pick up the slack."]},{"number":713,"title":"Chapter 713 - The Cycle of the Double Tree Cores","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan had been busy working recently, and he needed to go to the Divine Wood Federation soon.","Moreover, he needed to act as the Astronomical Parliament’s system every week and start lighting up the fires in the stars around the world.","Lin Yuan was overloaded with work and did not have the time to pick the strongest king-class experts and develop the white-clothed-followers plan.","It could be said that Lin Yuan was now singlehandedly supplying all of Sky City’s resource needs.","All of Lin Yuan’s hard work went toward increasing Sky City’s resources.","When he was developing the white-clothed-followers plan, he had proceeded alongside Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan initially planned on allowing Liu Jie to take charge of the white-clothed-followers plan, and the time had come.","Liu Jie saw that after explaining the situation with the Lava Dragon Lizard, Lin Yuan’s hand had clenched tightly, and his brow was tightly furrowed as he was deep in thought.","Just as Liu Jie was trying to think of something to say to comfort Lin Yuan, he heard Lin Yuan say, “Big Brother Liu, do you remember the white-clothed-followers plan that I mentioned to you before?”","Liu Jie nodded and replied, “I remember.”","Although Liu Jie appeared to be very honest, he was a spirit qi professional whose fighting method was orchestrating an insect army. It was his second nature to employ strategies.","Even though he was not as good as Wen Yu at collecting information, he was able to see the big picture and had many radiant willpowers after being in the Radiance Hundred Sequence for so many years.","When he heard Lin Yuan mention the white-clothed-followers plan, he had an idea of what Lin Yuan was going to say next.","“Big Brother Liu, let’s proceed as we discussed and have you take over the white-clothed-followers plan. You shall become the leader of Sky City’s white-clothed followers!”","Liu Jie nodded resolutely but did not make any assurances. “Young Master, I will do my best.”","After becoming Night Leaning Moon’s disciple, Liu Jie technically did not need to address Lin Yuan as ‘Young Master’.","They were actually of equal status.","However, Liu Jie’s perspective had not changed. No matter if it was in the present or the future, Lin Yuan would always be Liu Jie’s faith.","Lin Yuan was the person who had saved the rest of Liu Jie’s life.","It could be said that Sky City was created to fulfill Lin Yuan’s dream. Concurrently, Lin Yuan’s dream had also become Liu Jie and Wen Yu’s dream.","Usually, Wen Yu took care of all of Sky City’s affairs while Lin Yuan handled the matters on a larger scale.","Liu Jie had nowhere that he could inject his main effort into.","Lin Yuan had already given Sky City’s shield and sword to Liu Jie. To Liu Jie, this was a duty and a responsibility.","Liu Jie touched the Creation Master retainer crest on his chest. He felt the carvings of the sword and shield on the side of the two stars.","Since I control the white-clothed followers, I will do whatever it takes to turn them into Sky City’s invincible sword and shield. I will definitely live up to the trust that Lin Yuan has in me,? thought Liu Jie.","When he reached the entrance of the mansion, Lin Yuan immediately saw a pool of blood that was even more vibrant of a red than the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus flowers.","The osmanthus flowers scattered all around carried the subtle sweetness and warmth, but the air was stained with the muddled flavor of blood and carnage.","Lin Yuan saw that all the feys and spirit qi professionals lying on the ground were dead.","Purple Demon did not know how to control its power. The bodies lying all around were evidence that Purple Demon’s attacking form had changed.","The dead feys and spirit qi professionals had wounds that still had remnants of the dark-type elemental energy that Purple Demon’s main head and spewed.","At that moment, Lin Yuan noticed that the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer had also appeared.","He was slightly relieved that Chu Ci spent most of her time at the Radiant Moon Palace after New Year’s, where Cold Moon was teaching her.","Chu Ci was still young and should not witness such a bloodied scene or be pulled into the fights between clashes.","As Chu Ci’s brother, Lin Yuan would always want to shelter her from all troubles no matter how old she became. He wanted her to always remain carefree and comfortable.","When the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer saw Lin Yuan, their sour expressions softened.","“Lin Yuan, I was just discussing with Sister Summer. She should stay in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce for now. Given her sensing abilities, she will definitely be sensitive to enemies approaching as long as they are not thearch-class experts,” said the Mother of Bloodbath.","Lin Yuan nodded. He had had the same thought.","Sky City had always remained obscured above the clouds, but the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was open and existent in the physical world.","The animosity between him and the Zheng family would hence start from Listen and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce being targeted.","The Zheng family and Miao family were linked by marriage, while Sky City and Condense Fairy Orchard’s partnership had become a problem for the Miao family.","Judging from the purple-robed man from Connected Beast Park’s reaction, Lin Yuan knew that he had obstructed Connected Beast Park’s plans.","The Zheng family and Miao family could not find a trace of Sky City. Thus, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, which was an open target, became the main battleground while the two families were searching for Sky City.","Endless Summer swung the bracelets formed from Body Weaponization and said, “Lin Yuan, do you remember that you gave me the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire after my tree core was dug out?","“The Lifeform Sacrificial Fire restored my tree core and became my new tree core. But after that stupid bird died, Sister Blood returned my original tree core to me. When I was going through the World Cleansing and receiving World Grace for Suzerain III, the tree core that had been dug out regrew on the branch. Now, the two tree cores are finally not rejecting each other. They form a smooth cycle.”","Lin Yuan’s nostrils flared.","He had always known that the Mother of Bloodbath’s abilities and exclusive skills enabled it to have endless potential.","As long as there was blood-type energy, it could quickly evolve and even strive toward Creation Breed.","Endless Summer was much less spectacular in comparison, but the circumstance it just described was clearly the legendary double tree core situation.","These two tree cores formed a complete cycle that functioned within Endless Summer’s body."]},{"number":714,"title":"Chapter 714 - The Possibility of Becoming Creation Endless Mystical Dream Summer","paragraphs":["For plant-type feys, their tree core was their heart, the source of their strength.","Usually, digging out a plant-type fey’s tree core would result in death.","However, Endless Summer now had two tree cores that nourished each other. One of the tree cores was even formed from the precious Lifeform Sacrificial Fire.","The tree core formed from the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire gave Endless Summer almost too incredible abilities of recovery.","The two tree cores gave Endless Summer two sources of strength and multiplied her power.","Thus, Endless Summer had a higher chance of pursuing the evolution to Creation Breed.","If Endless Summer used to feel that she could never reach Creation Breed, she could now feel that she stood a chance.","After Lin Yuan heard what Endless Summer said, he paused to think. He remembered the Moon Empress telling him about information regarding plant type feys’ tree cores.","Lin Yuan asked Endless Summer, “Endless Summer, is this double tree core situation considered a mutation or an evolution?”","Endless Summer’s demeanor suddenly became serious.","“I started out as a mere hydrangea. When my quality was Elite, I met a Gold Thriving Summer Flower that was trampled to death by a group of monkeys. Luckily, I used my roots to absorb the Thriving Summer Flower’s energy and transformed into the Embroidered Summer Flower. I also comprehended the Enlightenment Willpower and managed to pass the World Cleansing and transformed into Endless Summer.","“Myth Breed feys, including Sister Blood, are the same. We’re all aware of how we can evolve. With double tree cores, the tree cores will be linked, which allows me to faintly sense that if I successfully pass the Trial of World Creation and evolve to Creation Breed, I’ll transform into the Endless Mystical Dream Summer.","“Actually, I want to thank the dead Thriving Summer Flower. If not for it, my bloodline would not have mutated, and I wouldn’t have been able to pursue power like I’m doing now.”","This was the first time that Lin Yuan had heard Endless Summer talk about its experiences.","He did not expect that its journey would be so inspirational or full of coincidences.","Before Endless Summer transformed into the Endless Mystical Dream Summer, Lin Yuan could not use True Data to check what kind of fey it would be.","But from the name, Lin Yuan knew that Endless Summer would definitely be able to manipulate the mind even better than it could now.","At that moment, Duan He asked curiously, “Why aren’t you grateful to the monkeys instead? If the Gold Thriving Summer Flower hadn’t been killed, you wouldn’t have been able to mutate and evolve, right?”","Before Duan He could finish speaking, his mouth was stuffed by Purple Demon’s tail.","Purple Demon said apologetically to Endless Summer, “Sorry, Sister Summer. There’s something wrong with him. I’ll teach him a lesson for you!”","Endless Summer shook its head, and a look of fury came over its face.","“Those monkeys not only trampled the Thriving Summer Flowers, but they also urinated on my roots. After I absorbed the Thriving Summer Flower’s energy, I gagged on the smell for over a month. Why should I thank them? They should thank me instead.","“When an enormous snake was hunting them, I sheltered them. While they were hiding from the snake, they even had the gall to continue their reproductive activities.”","From Endless Summer’s words, Lin Yuan knew that the monkeys annoyed it to a severe extent.","During their time together, Lin Yuan had noticed that Endless Summer was very neurotic about cleanliness.","But even so, Endless Summer had been willing to protect the monkeys with its body. It seemed that despite Endless Summer speaking about the monkeys with scorn, it was still grateful to them for giving it the chance to mutate and evolve.","Lin Yuan suddenly understood why when he had rescued Endless Summer with the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire, Endless Summer had not hesitated about becoming his Protector.","It was because Endless Summer placed a high value on returning favors.","It had protected the monkeys for 100 years over a casual trampling on their part. But in this case, Lin Yuan had saved Endless Summer’s life.","When Endless Summer mentioned the monkeys, it realized that it would need to experience at least three more World Cleansings.","It saw Lin Yuan’s hand shake and gem fragments appeared in his hand.","Endless Summer’s breath hitched before its chest started heaving.","The Mother of Bloodbath and Purple Demon had not reached Myth III and did not need to absorb the pure law power from Law Crystals, but Endless Summer had reached Myth III and craved law power.","Moreover, Lin Yuan possessed pure Law Crystals that could be easily absorbed.","At that moment, Lin Yuan asked seriously, “Endless Summer, how many of these Law Crystals do you think you’ll need to evolve to Creation Breed?”","Creation Breed was an unfamiliar concept to Lin Yuan. As Lin Yuan’s Master, the Moon Empress had only mentioned that such a level existed. She would not give Lin Yuan information about law power and Creation Breed feys while he was still a C-rank spirit qi professional.","Thus, Lin Yuan needed to ask the Suzerain X/Myth III Endless Summer about such information.","The law power from the Law Crystal fragments Lin Yuan was holding mostly came from Duan He, and 20% of the Law Crystal fragments came from the Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s skirt.","When Lin Yuan saw the look of desire appear on Endless Summer’s face, he knew it wanted to look the Law Crystals over carefully. He placed the Law Crystals in its hand.","Endless Summer studied the Law Crystals like it was a trance before saying, “If they are all as pure of these Law Crystals, I would need around 100 to evolve to pinnacle Myth III. From there, I’ll be able to advance toward Creation Breed feys.”","When he heard what Endless Summer said, Lin Yuan started to sketch out a plan.","The Law Crystal fragments Duan He gave me can produce 5 Law Crystals. Along with those from Sun Ningxiang, I should have 20 pieces now. 100 is a lot, but it shouldn’t be impossible."]},{"number":715,"title":"Chapter 715 - Lin Yuans Gift of the Road to Heaven","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan still had not taken out the larger Law Crystals.","In the near future, Lin Yuan would work harder on trading with Sun Ningxiang. He felt that it would not be difficult to garner 100 Law Crystals.","Lin Yuan had never been afraid of hard work. If he could branch out and partner with Sun Ningxiang in other areas, he might be able to obtain more Law Crystal fragments from them. He might even be able to obtain all the Law Crystal fragments that Condense Fairy Orchard had collected over the last century.","The sacred source lifeform that Lin Yuan had contracted could not only extract pure laws from Law Crystals, but it could also extract pure Law Crystals from Class 7 dimensional lifeforms.","Even if the Law Source Crystal was less pure than the Law Crystals from Myth Breed feys, the decade in between each active dimensional rift was too long. Thus, there were many Law Source Crystals in the Radiance Federation.","Law Source Crystals did not have many other uses besides being an ornament.","This suited Lin Yuan just fine.","It was much easier for him to collect Law Source Crystals than Law Crystal fragments.","At first, Lin Yuan had planned on giving the pure Law Crystals produced by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to the Mother of Bloodbath.","But since Endless Summer also had the potential to evolve to Creation Breed and the Mother of Bloodbath still had a while to go before evolving to Myth III, Lin Yuan decided to give these pure Law Crystals to Endless Summer first.","Lin Yuan was also determined to deepen his collaboration with Sun Ningxiang.","If Sky City wanted to become a top faction, it needed to rely on Law Crystals and Law Crystal fragments obtained from its dealing with Sun Ningxiang.","After some silence, Lin Yuan took out a brocade pouch and solemnly handed it to Endless Summer.","“Endless Summer, use these to increase your power. A while later, I’ll give you some more until you’re able to evolve to pinnacle Myth III and advance toward evolving to Creation Breed. I’m really looking forward to seeing you evolve to Endless Mystical Dream Summer,” said Lin Yuan.","Duan He’s nostrils flared at Lin Yuan’s words.","The more Duan He interacted with the rest of the group, the more he felt that he had truly gained many companions. This feeling only intensified with each passing day, so much so that he had developed a sense of loyalty to Sky City.","Duan He initially worked for Sky City and Lin Yuan because of the oath he had made. But now, he really wanted to contribute to Sky City as one of its members.","It was not just because of the promise he made to Lin Yuan or because he knew that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’s disciple.","Since Duan He knew Lin Yuan’s background, he could guess the contents of the brocade pouch.","In order to increase Endless Summer’s power, the brocade pouch had to be full of pure Law Crystals.","Duan He used to be confused about biased affection.","As someone who knew Lin Yuan’s background, Duan He assumed that the Law Crystals came from the Moon Empress. He had no idea that they actually came from the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","When he saw how casually Lin Yuan produced so many pure Law Crystals, Duan He felt that the Moon Empress showered too much affection on Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had no clue that Duan He felt this way.","Even if Lin Yuan did know, he would just laugh and tell Duan He that his Master doted on him more than Duan He could imagine!","Endless Summer received the brocade pouch. The slight heaviness of the package weighed heavily on Endless Summer’s heart.","Since Endless Summer had started out as a weak flower growing deep in the Endless Forest and had slowly climbed its way up until it had evolved into a Myth Breed expert, it had already experienced countless life-threatening dangers and brushes with death.","It had already lost track of all the effort it had put into grasping opportunities to be able to mutate and evolve.","As it had evolved to Myth Breed, Endless Summer knew full well how difficult the journey had been.","There was an immeasurable number of outstanding feys that were stuck at Myth III and were unable to overcome the Trial of World Creation.","It was just like how many Fantasy Breed feys were unable to change their willpowers into laws and overcome the World Cleansing.","If Endless Summer could cross this chasm on its own, regardless of how special its double tree core cycle was, it was uncertain where the road ahead would lead.","But since it had Lin Yuan’s help now, it did not need to put in any effort to scale this mountain.","It would not be able to repay this favor because Lin Yuan was gifting it with the true road to heaven.","Once it overcame the Trial of World Creation and evolved to Creation Breed, its life would be completely different.","Fantasy Breed feys existed in fantasies and were just feys that could manipulate willpower.","Myth Breed feys were created from laws.","But the Creation Breed level transcended the world. The laws would open the curtains to an imperceivable world.","It would be immortal.","Endless Summer did not outwardly express much. It just looked deep into Lin Yuan’s eyes and nodded.","Endless Summer stared at the lovely feature wall and smiled brightly.","The smile would be enough to spread warmth in winter.","The Mother of Bloodbath was overjoyed for Endless Summer. It was also still digesting its own recent impressive improvements.","Recently, the Mother of Bloodbath had been using ts exclusive skill External Blood Bone to transform the Red Water Blood Snakes that Lin Yuan had evolved to Bronze/Legend so that the three of them would fall under its control.","The Mother of Bloodbath was already halfway done and only needed one or two days more.","At that time, the Mother of Bloodbath’s power would grow by leaps and bounds.","The Mother of Bloodbath looked at the pile of close to 20 dead Fantasy Breed feys by Duan He’s feet and the three king-class and two pinnacle king-class experts, and its gaze sharpened."]},{"number":716,"title":"Chapter 716 - Return from Faraway Mansion Almost Became a Natural Toilet","paragraphs":["A bone-piercing chill accompanied the Mother of Bloodbath’s sharp gaze.","Just as the Mother of Bloodbath was about to consume the blood energy from the Fantasy Breed feys and king-class experts, it realized that Lin Yuan had grabbed its wrist.","When Lin Yuan lifted the Mother of Bloodbath’s hand, he thought,? Thank God I have quick reflexes. If the Mother of Bloodbath absorbed the Fantasy Breed feys’ blood energy, these feys would never be complete. The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen wouldn’t have been able to extract the willpower from inside the dead feys.","When he saw the Mother of Bloodbath’s look of confusion, Lin Yuan quickly said, “These dead Fantasy Breed feys are of use to me. I’ll give them to you to absorb the blood energy once I’m done with them.”","Lin Yuan thought back to the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box with the Blood Brew Grapevine inside.","With the nourishment from the Eyes of Relinquish, a few Blood Brew Grapes were ripe.","Lin Yuan went on to say, “There are a few ripe Blood Brew Grapes on the Blood Brew Grapevine. I’ll give them to you along with these Fantasy Breed feys.”","The Mother of Bloodbath’s eyes lit up with joy and surprise.","Lin Yuan cultivated the Blood Brew Grapes at an incredible speed.","How many high-grade feys’ essence blood did Lin Yuan use to water the Blood Brew Grapevine in order for it to grow Blood Brew Grapes so quickly? He even said there was more than one that was ripe. This is such amazing news.","The Mother of Bloodbath had always been strong-headed. It also knew of Sky City’s current situation.","When it had fought against Nightmare VI, the Mother of Bloodbath realized how weak it was.","After Lin Yuan had been sucked into the water world dimensional rift, the Mother of Bloodbath felt endlessly helpless. Thus, it became obsessed with becoming stronger.","With the nourishment from the blood energy in the Blood Brew Grapes, the Mother of Bloodbath would be able to undergo World Cleansing in three days.","At that time, it would be able to evolve to Myth III and attain Body Weaponization.","The Mother of Bloodbath felt that it needed to reach Myth III at the very least in order to protect Lin Yuan.","This was so it could properly fulfill its role of being Lin Yuan’s Path Protector.","“Okay. When I absorb the blood from these Fantasy Breed feys, I’ll also separate out their essence blood to be used as a high-grade spiritual ingredient.”","While the Mother of Bloodbath was speaking, it felt its hand itch and a thirst burned within it.","Lin Yuan knew that the Mother of Bloodbath was about to unleash its bone crusher persona again.","Although Lin Yuan did not have much need for high-grade spiritual ingredients as he could use pure spirit qi to solve all his fey evolution needs, Sky City still had a genuine Class 4 Creation Master—Master Hong Shen.","In the future, Sky City would need more and more spiritual ingredients.","The Fantasy Breeds belonging to the king-class experts sent to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce were a great resource to Sky City.","This solved Lin Yuan’s current urgent problem.","He desperately needed willpower because of the Astronomical Parliament’s requirement.","When Lin Yuan checked these 20 Fantasy Breed feys using True Data, he found that the weakest one was a Diamond IV/Fantasy I Thunder-Toothed Sword Cat.","The strongest one was a Diamond X/Fantasy V Hypnotizing Crabapple.","The Hypnotizing Crabapple had to be the reason that Zhou Luo had been injured despite having Duan He’s protection.","The Hypnotizing Crabapple was among the feys that were being studied by Class 5 Scholars.","Its powers of scrambling its victim’s control were in the top ten.","Besides the Hypnotizing Crabapple were other feys, such as four Diamond X/Fantasy V feys, a Wave-Chasing Dolphin, a Hooked Stinger Jellyfish, a Crimson-Mouthed Kite, and a Peach Poison Butterfly.","This pile of high-quality Fantasy Breeds would allow the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to accumulate impressive willpowers.","Not only would this allow the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to increase its power, but it also gave Lin Yuan willpowers that he could use on the Astronomical Parliament.","Lin Yuan kept the 20 dead Fantasy Breed feys into the Diamond fey storage box. This was when Listen, Zhou Luo, and Master Hong Shen walked in.","Both Listen and Master Hong Shen had dark rings around their eyes. Listen’s charming eyes were weighed down by thick eyebags.","It was clear that he had not slept well in some time.","Master Hong Shen nodded toward the group in the yard.","When he saw Lin Yuan, he hastily said, “Young Master, you locked yourself away for the last few days. The owner of the green mountain behind the mansion wants to sell it, so I took the initiative to snatch it up before the rising faction Golden Pig Nurturing Base could.”","Master Hong Shen’s tone turned angry.","“This rising faction is really unreasonable. They actually want to use the green mountain to rear Black Back Mountain Boars and other feys to be used as spiritual ingredients. If they were allowed to do so, any gust of wind would leave our mansion smelling like a natural toilet. Even the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’s flowers’ fragrance won’t be able to cover the stench from the 100,000 pigs’ feces.”","Lin Yuan initially planned on asking Master Hong Shen about how the Lava Dragon Lizard was doing.","But after he heard what Master Hong Shen said, Lin Yuan could not help but be shocked.","Master Hong Shen usually did not care about his appearance, but now he had silently fought to protect the mansion’s environment.","If 100,000 Black Back Mountain Boars were really reared on the mountain, no one other than Chu Ci would be happy in the mansion.","Lin Yuan had heard of the Golden Pig Nurturing Base.","They had only popped up in the last six months and were considered impressive.","They were also decently popular on Star Web.","Apparently, the person who had founded the Golden Pig Nurturing Base had started out from a normal farm in a small city.","Later, due to the dimensional rift, the farm had been overtaken by dimensional lifeforms.","Only the owner of Golden Pig Nurturing Base had survived the dimensional rift."]},{"number":717,"title":"Chapter 717 - Concentrated Killing Intent","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The owner had started to rear Black Back Mountain Boars due to several reasons, and soon his luck surged along with the price of pork.","This had allowed the Golden Pig Nurturing Base to accumulate resources rapidly and become a successful rising faction.","Lin Yuan truly admired someone like this who built their organization from the ground.","But no matter how much admiration he had, Lin Yuan could not allow himself to live in a toilet.","Lin Yuan could not help but voice his praise, “Good job. Thank you for buying the green mountain behind the mansion!”","Since Master Hong Shen had bought the green mountain, the only piece of land left untouched was the forest next to the green mountain.","Lin Yuan felt that he might buy the forest as well.","The cost of the forest was nothing to Sky City.","Although the Black Back Mountain Boars could only live on the mountain, Lin Yuan would be in trouble if the land was used to rear 100,000 boars.","Lin Yuan planned on leaving this matter to Master Hong Shen to handle.","When Master Hong Shen heard Lin Yuan’s praise, his face brightened, and he said with a broad smile, “Young Master, I checked out the green mountain. There’s nothing special about it, but it’s covered with jagged rocks. If we cut through the rocks, we can use the space to build the fey breeding room.”","While Master Hong Shen was speaking, he thought back to the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that Lin Yuan had given him.","As a Creation Master, Master Hong Shen’s excitement lasted for two days after he saw the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","He was shocked at how compatible the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were with the spirit fluids concocted by Creation Masters.","Master Hong Shen also felt that given his power, he should be able to multiply the valuable Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Suddenly, Master Hong Shen remembered a problem that had been plaguing him for a long time.","“Young Master, although nurturing plant-type feys in the basement is an excellent resource, there is no light underground. Even if we use plants like Starlight Grass to light up the space, it won’t be able to compare to the effect that sunlight has on the plant type feys’ growth.”","A mysterious smile appeared on Lin Yuan’s face. “Don’t worry about this. You can leave it to me. Since you bought the green mountain, why not buy the forest next to it too? We’ll be able to build a bigger basement.”","Lin Yuan had become resolute on making the basement a reality after he heard Master Hong Shen’s suggestion.","At first, Lin Yuan might have been troubled by the lack of light, but he now had 99 new Sunlight King Lotuses. Each of them was a small sun and would solve the issue of the basement having no light.","Lin Yuan was more worried that Master Hong Shen would find the 99 small suns too blinding.","A large reason Lin Yuan wanted to build the basement was that it was discrete.","Moreover, the basement was directly below the mansion and could be considered a part of the mansion.","If the mansion had any secrets they needed to protect, they could be stored in the basement.","Lin Yuan asked Master Hong Shen, “How is Zhou Luo’s Lava Dragon Lizard doing?”","Master Hong Shen’s expression became grim.","“It’s fine now. If the Lava Dragon Lizard uses my spirit fluid to nourish itself for two weeks, it’ll return to its original state. If its wound had been five centimeters deeper, its organs would have fallen out of the side of its body that had been split open.","“If I was a minute later, it might have died due to loss of blood. Although Zhou Luo is fine, these king-class experts’ attacks badly affected the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. The employees that were outside the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce were all killed immediately by the king-class experts’ feys.”","At that moment, Listen’s weary voice sounded. “Young Master, I’ve settled most of the matters, and the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce can continue to function normally. The first batch of luxury goods that we tried selling has received a great response. Several factions wanted to order from us, but I rejected them all.”","When he heard what Listen said, Lin Yuan knew that Listen did not want him to worry about the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s affairs.","Listen was also assuring Lin Yuan that he would be able to manage the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce well and handle such dangers.","Since Lin Yuan had chosen to trust Listen and left the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce for him to manage, he did not ask any more about the chamber of commerce’s future plans.","“When you return to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, take Endless Summer with you,” said Lin Yuan.","Color returned to Listen’s tired face. He had witnessed Endless Summer’s power and had also been saved by it. Now, he felt incredibly comforted.","Listen was not afraid of any pressure that other chambers of commerce would try to exert on the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. He was confident that he was smart enough to handle the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s business aspects.","But when it came to brute force, Listen’s brain was useless.","Liu Jie, who had been silent all this time, said, “There are still four months left until the dimensional rift becomes active. According to the announcement made by the Spirit Guards, the dimensional rift’s active period cannot be disturbed by any thearch-class experts causing trouble in the Royal Capital. Otherwise, they’ll be thrown into the Spirit Guards’ Sin-Cleansing Pool.","“But four months later, even if the Zheng family doesn’t send any more thearch-class experts, the Miao family will send some to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.”","Lin Yuan lifted his head and looked at the afternoon sun slowly sliding toward the west. He looked back at Endless Summer and said, “I believe that in less than four months, Sky City will have a thearch-class expert of our own. If anyone from the Zheng family or Miao family appears near the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, kill them upon sight.”","Endless Summer nodded and promised, “I will guarantee the safety of every employee in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.”","Endless Summer’s expression was extremely stern because this was the first time it sensed such a concentrated killing intent emanating from the gentle Lin Yuan."]},{"number":718,"title":"Chapter 718 - Miao Zhi and the Price","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan touched the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box on his sleeve and thought,? We never figured out who from the Zheng family sent the mysterious messenger pigeon. It’s time to figure out what their goal is.","...","In the secret room in the Zheng family’s main mansion, bottles containing various rare spiritual ingredients lined the shelves.","A pale-faced young man dressed in Creation Master robes reclined on a sofa.","A black and white sable jumped down and quickly swiped a chess piece. It crushed the piece and swallowed it.","At that moment, the loud thud of the table being slammed stunned the sable, and it quickly tossed the rest of the piece into the teapot.","The young man dressed in Creation Master robes lost his previous relaxed demeanor. Instead, he roared, “Are there devils running about the Royal Capital? This group had so many king-class experts and pinnacle king-class experts. How could we lose all communication with them? I don’t believe the Zheng family doesn’t have a grip on the Royal Capital!”","At that moment, the old man standing next to Zheng Kaiyuan smiled and said, “Don’t be angry, Young Lord. I don’t think you need to be overly concerned about the words that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s experts carved on the Royal Capital table. I think you should bring this up with Madam. She definitely has a grip on the Royal Capital.”","The smiling old man talked about the Zheng family with an air of nonchalance. But when he mentioned the ‘Madam’, a look of utmost respect appeared on his face.","Zheng Kaiyuan toyed with the turquoise ring with crimson deep-sea engravings on his thumb.","He looked at the smiling old man and said sullenly, “If I go to Mother for everything, Father won’t be happy. Moreover, this team of king-class experts was sent from the Zheng family’s spy team. Father cannot find out that we lost so many of them.","“Why don’t I send Nightmare IV and Nightmare V to the Royal Capital? They excel at espionage. If we send them to investigate who’s behind the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, they should be able to do a good job.”","The smiling old man’s throat itched. After he heard what Zheng Kaiyuan said, he almost started to cough as he anxiously implored, “Second Young Master, please don’t make any impulsive moves! The two pinnacle king-class experts from this team were with Nightmare VI when it followed the third lineage and was killed.","“They both said that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce has to have an emperor-class expert on their side. They also said that the weakest king-class expert they have is at the highest king-class expert level. There’s no other way to explain how they killed the Suzerain/Myth II Nightmare VI.”","The smiling old man’s words made Zheng Kaiyuan frown deepen.","Zheng Kaiyuan looked at the sable sharpening its claws on the chessboard and clearly craving for the pieces in the teapot. He felt a twinge of annoyance and waved his hand to send his favorite Yin-Yang Senluo Sable into the spiritual spatial zone.","The smiling old man took the opportunity to say, “Young Lord, not only does the Zheng family’s blood run in your veins but so does the blood of the Miao family. No one will dare to go against the Spirit Guards’ order regarding the upcoming active period of the dimensional rift.","“The Zheng family is just a veteran faction, and it won’t be able to move freely in Indigo Azure City at this time. Any inappropriate movement that causes trouble will incite ire from the two Spirit Guards that are currently stationed in Indigo Azure City.","“The Miao family, however, is different. They are a top faction. If you bring this matter up with Madam, she might be able to solve the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce problem for you immediately.”","Zheng Kaiyuan said vexedly, “Uncle He, you’re so annoying! If I tell Mother about this matter, any movement on her part and Master will immediately know that I haven’t been properly practicing how to concoct spirit fluids recently and increasing my powers as a Creation Master. Then, I’ll be sent back to Connected Beast Park and locked away to train for a year.”","Uncle He’s smiling expression faltered.","The Young Lord he knew did not like hard work. He had to be afraid that Master Miao Qi would lock him up for training back at Connected Beast Park.","Zheng Kaiyuan was silent for a second before he stood up and sighed.","“Come with me to see Mother. Father gave Nightmare I, Nightmare II, and Nightmare III to Big Brother. He gave me Nightmare IV, Nightmare V, and Nightmare VI. If I had Nightmare I, which is so close to evolving to Creation Breed, I would be able to resolve this situation on my own.","“Big Brother is a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and doesn’t care about inheriting the family. It’s such a waste for Father to give him Nightmare I, Nightmare II, and Nightmare III!”","At present, a middle-aged woman wearing a long skirt with many gems embroidered into it was holding her waist-length hair as she elegantly touched the luxury jewelry displayed on the walls.","Her opulent dressing gave the plain-looking middle-aged woman a graceful air.","She frowned slightly and carefully studied the luxury jewelry on the wall. It was like she was stuck over which ring, necklace, and earrings to choose.","A rich-looking old lady walked up behind her. She bowed to the middle-aged woman and said, “Madam, Young Lord is here to see you.”","The middle-aged woman’s frown vanished, and she unhesitatingly grabbed a pair of earrings with Law Crystals embedded into it and put it on.","She walked to the door and kicked Zheng Kaiyuan into the room before grabbing a measuring tape and said excitedly, “Kaiyuan, I was just about to go to you. It’s good that you’re here. Let me measure if you’ve grown taller. I have some time recently to make two sets of clothes for you.”","Zheng Kaiyuan thought to himself how this was not the right time. His mother was a Class 5 Weaver.","Whenever she was free, she would make clothes.","Every time she took measurements, it would take at least an hour to satisfy her OCD behavior.","Zheng Kaiyuan quickly told his mother about why he came.","After Miao Zhi heard what Zheng Kaiyuan said, her eyes flashed with ferocity.","Her sharp glare was like the stinger of a bee.","“Kaiyuan, how much do you know about the faction that’s supporting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce? Everyone in the Radiance Federation knows that the Miao family is supporting the Zheng family. Since you said the opponent still refuses to back down despite knowing who you are and even killed the people you sent over, this means they’re looking down on the entire Miao family and me. Hehe, they will have to pay a terrible price for this mistake.”"]},{"number":719,"title":"Chapter 719 - Guard Ye Banquet","paragraphs":["After Nightmare VI’s death, Zheng Kaiyuan had intentionally sought the Indigo Azure Guard Captain to ask for information.","The Indigo Azure Guard Captain had only mentioned Sky City and did not reveal any other information about the fight.","But the words ‘Sky City’ had left Zheng Kaiyuan completely clueless. He had never heard of such a faction before.","Zheng Kaiyuan had never told anyone else this. But when his mother asked him, Zheng Kaiyuan replied honestly, “Mother, after my investigation, I heard that the faction supporting the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce is called Sky City. But I haven’t been able to find out anything about Sky City.”","Zheng Kaiyuan assumed that he had said something very ordinary, but his mother drew her brow together tightly, and the ferocious glint in her gaze intensified. The bee stinger had turned into the venomous stinger of a scorpion.","The menace in Miao Zhi’s eyes covered the light reflecting off the earrings embedded with Law Crystals.","She started to laugh coldly as she shrieked, “Sky City! Sky City again! I can’t believe that one month before Sky City fought against my Miao family’s Connected Beast Park, they already got on the wrong side of my son.”","Although Miao Zhi had married into the Zheng family, she was still a main member of the Miao family and still held a lot of authority in the Miao family.","Naturally, she was aware of the Miao family’s schemes against Condense Fairy Orchard.","This step in the strategy was extremely important to the Miao family.","The Sun family had collapsed, and the once-grand family was left with one old lady and two children who struggled to keep themselves afloat.","To the Miao family, the Sun family was a juicy piece of meat.","As a top faction, if the Miao family’s Connected Beast Park could devour Condense Fairy Orchard, the Miao family could use the Sun family’s resources to dominate the market on plant-type feys.","At that time, the Miao family would have the right and correct role to wrestle against the Long family from Ascending Dragon City.","Thus, the Sun family was an important piece of the puzzle that had to be seized at all costs.","However, Sky City’s sudden appearance caused the Miao family’s initially perfect trap for the Sun family to fall through.","Now, instead of heading for inevitable doom, Condense Fairy Orchard had a chance to be saved.","After a thorough investigation, the Miao family was shocked to find out that Sky City barely existed in the physical world. They were just like ghosts that only appeared on Star Web, so the Miao family was unable to go after them.","Now, Miao Zhi could use their connection to her son to attack the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce that was connected to Sky City.","Whether it was a dragon or a snake, those hiding in the shadows were terrifying.","But if one could just grab hold of their tails, one would have the chance to yank the dragon or snake out of hiding.","“Mother, Sky City has a strong fighting ability. At the very least, they have king-class battle prowess.”","Zheng Kaiyuan told Miao Zhi about how he had sent Nightmare VI to help the third lineage to work with Jiao Hanzhong to kill the masked youth.","When Miao Zhi was asking her son about how the masked youth looked, a look of confirmation appeared in her eyes.","According to Zheng Kaiyuan’s information, the two masked youths’ masks had different patterns.","One of them was wearing a mask with majestic sky city patterns, which matched that of the masked youth that appeared in Sky City’s private faction territory.","Miao Zhi felt that it was highly likely that they were the same person.","This meant that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was very important to Sky City. But Miao Zhi could not understand why a small chamber of commerce like the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce that could not even be considered a rising faction would be valuable to Sky City when the latter already controlled an enormous amount of Creation Master resources.","“Kaiyuan, leave this matter to me. You should focus on increasing your Creation Master powers and prepare to enter next year’s youth Creation Master Conference so you can finish in the top ten.”","When Zheng Kaiyuan heard what Miao Zhi said, he nodded helplessly. He said slightly with a slightly troubled tone, “I know. I’ve been concocting spirit fluids for 12 hours in the breeding room every day. I’ll definitely be able to become a Class 3 Creation Master in a year.”","Miao Zhi shook her head. “12 hours is far from sufficient. When I called my sister, she told me to make sure that you’re working as hard as you did in Connected Beast Park. You have to concoct spirit fluids for 16 hours at least every day.”","Zheng Kaiyuan’s expression soured, and he said dejectedly, “I know. I’ll do my best.”","Miao Zhi adjusted his collar and said, “You can’t just try your best! You have to make sure that you’ll be able to reach the level of a Class 3 Creation Master in a year’s time. My sister said that if I can’t ensure that you’re spending 16 hours every day concocting spirit fluids, I have to send you back to her.”","Zheng Kaiyuan froze.","Miao Qi was nice in every other way and gave him whatever he wanted, but she was strict to a fault!","The two long years he had spent training under Miao Qi were Zheng Kaiyuan’s nightmare.","Besides eating, voiding himself, and sleeping for four hours, the rest of the time was spent in the breeding room concocting spirit fluid after spirit fluid. Even prisoners had much more freedom!","Most importantly, every time he failed to concoct a spirit fluid or the spiritual ingredients were not homogenized enough, Master Miao Zhi would look at him with scorn and start berating him.","Zheng Kaiyuan quickly barked, “I’ll spend 16 hours every day concocting spirit fluids, not a minute less! Other than concocting spirit fluids, I’ll also spend an hour every day writing reflections on the process of concocting spirit fluids.”","When she heard what Zheng Kaiyuan said, Miao Zhi nodded with satisfaction.","A thought seemed to occur to her as she said, “My sister wanted me to tell you that in two weeks, the Spirit Guards’ Chief Guard Ye will host a Guard Ye Banquet. Apparently, she has accepted a disciple that she wants to announce. My sister will personally come to fetch you to the Guard Ye Banquet.","“This time, the Bamboo Monarch, Chef Supreme, and the Moon Empress will all be in attendance. They’ll also bring along their disciples.","“I heard the Moon Empress, who used to be the only one without a disciple, has secretly accepted a disciple. She even turned her nose at the Long family. I wonder how the special person she chose looks like.","“Kaiyuan, you have to make sure to make a good impression on Chief Guard Ye and the Moon Empress’ disciples. It’ll make your journey in the future a little smoother!”"]},{"number":720,"title":"Chapter 720 - Im the Best at Making Friends!","paragraphs":["Miao Zhi paused for a while before saying, “If you can become friends with Chief Guard Ye and the Moon Empress’ disciples, it will benefit not only yourself but also the Miao family and Zheng family. Then, you will be able to smoothly inherit the Zheng family. You’ll also be able to use your status as the head of the Zheng family to gain authority in the Miao family.”","Miao Zhi felt that her nagging and relaying of Miao Qi’s messages to Zheng Kaiyuan had fallen on deaf ears.","Zheng Kaiyuan nodded enthusiastically.","“Mother, don’t worry. I’m the best at making friends!”","After she nagged at him a little while longer, she was finally relieved.","“The Guard Ye Banquet will be held in the Royal Capital. Given the order issued by the Spirit Guards, I can’t assign anyone to cause trouble at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. If a large commotion is caused, it will be seen as a great disrespect to Chief Guard Ye.","“After the Guard Ye Banquet is over, I’ll send people to end the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. After that’s settled, I’ll personally conduct a detailed investigation into Sky City.”","...","Lin Yuan carried the Flawless Muscle Growth Camellia that Listen had brought back into his room.","He opened his palm, and a small white pigeon appeared in his palm.","After this white pigeon was summoned from the fey storage box, it flew toward Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","But a flap of Chimey’s wings sent the white pigeon crashing to the ground.","Chimey was about to screech at the small pigeon when Lin Yuan stopped it.","Lin Yuan was truly afraid that Chimey would kill the Messenger Pigeon. After all, the Silver Messenger Pigeon was no match for the Gold/Fantasy Chimey.","After stopping Chimey, it landed on Lin Yuan’s ear and glared dangerously at the Messenger Pigeon that was struggling to get up.","Chimey was not a violent fey. It had immediately attacked the Messenger Pigeon because it sensed that the Messenger Pigeon felt animosity toward Lin Yuan.","Since the Messenger Pigeon was a Silver messenger-type fey, it did not excel at attacking. However, its rapid pecking attacks could still harm Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was the person closest to Chimey, and it would allow any harm to befall him.","After the Messenger Pigeon climbed back up, it turned and shot off toward the window.","Lin Yuan’s window happened to be open, so the Messenger Pigeon quickly flew out.","Lin Yuan did not stop the Messenger Pigeon from escaping, nor did he instruct Chimey to attack it.","Soon after the Messenger Pigeon flew out, it disappeared.","Lin Yuan closed his window.","He was not the Messenger Pigeon’s owner and could not deliver messages using it.","Lin Yuan released the Messenger Pigeon after so long and allowed it to return to his owner because he had an ulterior motive.","Since someone within the Zheng family was providing him with clues at the beginning of his war against the Zheng family, that person had to be after something.","All Lin Yuan needed to do now was to wait to see if the Messenger Pigeon would bring him any news.","The Zheng family’s inner circle was divided and had a traitor amongst them. This could only be an advantage to Lin Yuan.","An enemy’s enemy was your friend. Moreover, this friend was in the Zheng family’s inner circle and was up to date on all the happenings inside the Zheng family.","Now that he was done with this task, Lin Yuan headed to the Spirit Lock spatial zone with Chimey. He saw Genius squatting with its five voluminous tails swaying behind it. It was holding spirit fluid and spreading it over the Soldier Ration Radish’s sprouts.","Lin Yuan did not feel any stress about being tasked by Condense Fairy Orchard to nurture the Soldier Ration Radish.","Whenever the Soldier Ration Radish grew new branches, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope would cut them down, and Genius would store the extra branches that were overcrowding the Spirit Lock spatial zone into a Platinum fey storage box.","Although the Soldier Ration Radish was only Bronze/Epic, it grew new branches at an astonishing rate.","According to legend, the Soldier Ration Radish would reach its true power when it reached Platinum grade.","The Soldier Ration Radish had yet to reveal its true power, but its current state could already be considered an impressive source of grain.","Chimey realized that Lin Yuan and Genius had work to do, so it dutifully returned to the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree nest to absorb the strange flame energy from the leaves.","It did not take long for Chimey’s feathers to turn golden.","When Genius saw Lin Yuan walk over to it, it hastily kept the Soldier Ration Radish and potion away.","Lin Yuan bent over to pick up Genius and place it on his shoulder.","“Genius, how has your research on the Soldier Ration Radish been going? Can you come up with a way for the new branches to grow roots?” asked Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan saw the Soldier Ration Radish branches that Genius was experimenting on, he scratched the back of his head.","The Soldier Ration Radish was heavily absorbing the pure spirit qi.","Lin Yuan could sense the Soldier Ration Radish’s strong separation ability.","But once the branches separated from the Soldier Ration Radish, they would be as good as dead. In order to preserve the nutrients inside the branches, the wounds would heal using the last vestiges of separation ability.","When Lin Yuan injected a large amount of pure spirit qi into the Soldier Ration Radish, he could only allow the Soldier Ration Radish to grow more vibrantly. The spirit qi could not spark the Soldier Ration Radish’s strong separation ability to life and allow it to grow new bodies through its separated branches like the Usnea could.","Lin Yuan could understand this.","When Mother Nature was creating a new lifeform, it had to include some disadvantages in all beings that had the potential to disrupt the natural balance.","Although the Usnea was weak, it could flourish anywhere.","Although the Soldier Ration Radish was strong, it was very rare.","Only Class 5 Creation Masters like Chef Supreme knew how to nurture the Soldier Ration Radish.","But Lin Yuan was not acquainted with Chef Supreme and could not consult him on the techniques to nurture the Soldier Ration Radish.","The Sun family had one Soldier Ration Radish, but Lin Yuan did not think that they knew how to divide it successfully. Otherwise, the Sun family would have sent him more than one Soldier Ration Radish.","Since the pure spirit qi could not be of use, Lin Yuan did not know what to do."]},{"number":721,"title":"Chapter 721 - Scheming After a Food Trump Card","paragraphs":["Genius answered in its child-like voice, “Yuan, I haven’t figured it out. I tried several Grade 3 spirit fluids that are supposed to nurture plant-type feys, and one of them is even targeted at increasing the growth of plant-type feys’ roots. But once the leaves separate from the Soldier Ration Radish, they become useless.","“Yuan, I think that once the branches leave the main plant, it loses its separation ability. I want to test the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots. Did you notice that the Soldier Ration Radish and the Usnea’s difference lies in that the Usnea’s vines will grow continuously?","“If the Usnea isn’t pruned after some time, the roots will turn to wood. At that point, the branches will stop growing and will be tightly bound to the roots. After these wood vines grow, they will separate from the wooden roots. Thus, I think that the Soldier Ration Radish’s wooden old roots might have separation ability.”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched.","This Soldier Ration Radish belonged to the Sun family, and Lin Yuan had checked the old roots.","There were only three of them!","The three old roots formed one root. It could be said that that was the Soldier Ration Radish’s main body.","If he cut the old roots, even if he treated it in the future, the Soldier Ration Radish’s source injury of losing its roots would not regrow.","Genius went on to say, “Yuan, the Soldier Ration Radish is Bronze/Epic now. If it’s evolved to Legend quality, its separation ability might increase.”","When he heard what Genius said, Lin Yuan paused to think before he decided to call Sun Ningxiang.","Lin Yuan felt that a man should only gain his wealth through righteous means.","After listening to Genius’ speculation, he did start to want the Soldier Ration Radish.","Lin Yuan wanted to do all he could to try to cultivate a resource like the Soldier Ration Radish.","In this era where spirit qi has awakened, being able to form a contract with a fey was more important than any other basic necessity.","This was not supposed to be difficult.","Although many spirit qi professionals did not have avian feys, one could still get far by riding on land feys.","Basic necessities like having clothes and a home might be important, but humans could still live without them.","However, humans could not live without food.","Spirit qi professionals continuously increased their power. They bathed in spirit qi to become stronger, and their bodies also needed increasing amounts of food and nourishment.","This was why high-grade spirit qi professionals always felt like they were not full.","Additionally, spirit qi professionals also needed to form contracts with feys.","Feys also needed a large amount of nourishment every day in order to remain healthy and active.","If Lin Yuan could cultivate the Soldier Ration Radish, he would secure a huge store of grain.","Since the Soldier Ration Radish could also be used to feed herbivorous feys, carnivorous feys, and omnivorous spirit qi professionals, Lin Yuan would be able to obtain a trump card in terms of food production if he was able to attain the Soldier Ration Radish.","No matter what happened in the future, Lin Yuan would not need to worry about a lack of food.","If it was possible, Lin Yuan even wanted to buy this Soldier Ration Radish from Sun Ningxiang.","Sun Ningxiang quickly picked up the call and said in a friendly tone, “Haha, I was about to come to you. I didn’t expect you to call me. I forgot to tell you yesterday that you don’t need to rush to evolve the feys. Besides the 80 mutated plant-type feys that I sent for you to evolve using pure spirit qi, I have another 100 feys that need to evolve their qualities. I’ll send you 100 Law Source Crystals too.”","Sun Ningxiang’s words surprised Lin Yuan because she revealed conflicting information.","Although she said that she was not in a rush, she had sent him another 100 feys even before he had sent her the last batch of 80 feys.","On the one hand, Lin Yuan could understand that Sun Ningxiang wanted to curry favor with him by using the 100 Law Source Crystals to earn his trust.","But if this was true, Sun Ningxiang’s trust indirectly demonstrated Condense Fairy Orchard’s less than ideal circumstances.","It proved that Sun Ningxiang did not have any other choice but to trust him.","If it were Lin Yuan, he might only go so far as to trust that the other party would fulfill the deal.","But this situation would not happen to someone that he had only met a few times.","Even if it did, he would only trust someone like Gao Feng, who he had traded with many times and was a trustworthy friend.","Moreover, even if Lin Yuan paid Gao Feng out of trust before their deal was settled, he would not pay for the second deal before the second trade was completed.","Lin Yuan had instructed Wen Yu to investigate Condense Fairy Orchard’s problems, and he would have his answer tomorrow.","Initially, Lin Yuan only wanted to understand the faction that he was working with so that he could be prepared.","However, Sun Ningxiang’s actions made Lin Yuan interested in the Sun family’s problems.","Since Sun Ningxiang had expressed her trust in him again, Lin Yuan needed to provide a response.","“I’m not rushing, but I’ve finished evolving the 80 feys. I will send them to you through Ostrich Logistics later. You’ll receive them in three hours.”","Once Lin Yuan finished speaking, he heard Sun Ningxiang gasp in surprise.","Sun Ningxiang was absolutely stunned!","It had only been about six days since she sent the 80 feys to Lin Yuan. Even if all of Sky City’s Creation Masters worked on this task, a pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master would only be able to evolve two per day.","This meant that this task could only have been completed by about ten pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","Sun Ningxiang did not believe that Sky City had about ten pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","There were only a few tens of pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters in the Radiance Federation, including those hidden away in major factions.","Even Connected Beast Park only had 5 pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","Connected Beast Park was a faction that banked on their Creation Master resources.","In Sun Ningxiang’s opinion, it was impossible for Sky City to have twice the number of pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters than the Zheng family."]},{"number":722,"title":"Chapter 722 - Long Time No See, Dimpled Smile","paragraphs":["For some reason, Sun Ningxiang felt more and more like Sky City could actually have Class 5 Creation Masters.","This meant that Sky City often concocted and stored Grade 4 spirit fluids.","How else could they evolve so many feys so quickly?","Sun Ningxiang was about to try to obtain more details, but before she could, Lin Yuan said, “Among the feys you sent over was the Soldier Ration Radish. I’m very interested in it. I’m wondering if you would be willing to part with it? You can state any price you want for the trade.”","Lin Yuan was trying to come up with a way to obtain the Soldier Ration Radish but did not expect Sun Ningxiang to reject him immediately.","“I’m sorry. I can’t give away the Soldier Ration Radish.”","From Sun Ningxiang’s tone of resolution, Lin Yuan knew that it would be difficult to convince Sun Ningxiang to part with the Soldier Ration Radish.","However, Lin Yuan still wanted to try.","“You mentioned last time that you need Bronze/Legend Muscle Growth Camellia. It’s very rare, but I can give you some Muscle Growth Camellia stems.”","Sun Ningxiang’s breath hitched.","She needed the Bronze/Legend Muscle Growth Camellia to treat her grandmother’s necrotized muscles and alleviate her pain.","She knew that her grandmother’s injuries were too severe. A small number of Muscle Growth Camellia stems could only slow the damage to her grandmother’s muscles.","Moreover, her grandmother had other injuries.","In fact, the necrotized muscles were the lightest of injuries that her grandmother sustained.","However, the Soldier Ration Radish was the Sun family’s hidden power.","The Sun family’s only Soldier Ration Radish had been given to her grandfather by Chef Supreme after helping him with something that almost cost her grandfather’s life.","Her grandfather also had not asked Chef Supreme to evolve any feys for him. It was only then that Chef Supreme gave her grandfather the Soldier Ration Radish.","Hence, Sun Ningxiang would never trade away the Soldier Ration Radish.","Sun Ningxiang rejected Lin Yuan again and said, “I’m really sorry, but I can’t give the Soldier Ration Radish away.”","Lin Yuan was not surprised by Sun Ningxiang’s repeated rejection, but he did not expect her mind to be so unchangeable.","Frankly, Lin Yuan was not desperate for the Soldier Ration Radish.","“Fine, I don’t have to have the Soldier Ration Radish. But the Soldier Ration Radish has three old roots. I want to use the Muscle Growth Camellia’s stems to trade for one of the Soldier Ration Radish’s roots.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Sun Ningxiang frown, and she struggled with the dilemma for some time.","It would cause the Soldier Ration Radish great damage if its old roots were cut off and the old roots could not be regrown.","Even if the old roots could be regrown, the time it would take was unknown.","The Soldier Ration Radish that Chef Supreme had given her grandfather only had one old root. It was only after the Sun family’s decades of nurturing that it had grown the three roots it had today.","Nonetheless, even without the full Muscle Growth Camellia, just some stems could significantly prolong her grandmother’s life.","This could also prolong the Sun family’s survival.","Just as Sun Ningxiang was about to agree, Lin Yuan said, “How about this, Sky City will evolve the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality first. I’ll only cut the old roots after.”","Lin Yuan’s words replaced Sun Ningxiang’s hesitant compromise with enthusiastic agreement.","“No problem. If you can evolve the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality, I will give you complete Law Crystals as per our previous deal.”","Sun Ningxiang had sent the Soldier Ration Radish to Lin Yuan because she wanted him to evolve it to Epic quality.","She planned on bringing the Soldier Ration Radish back to Condense Fairy Orchard and evolving its grade.","The vines from the Soldier Ration Radish could earn Condense Fairy Orchard a tidy sum that could reinvigorate Condense Fairy Orchard’s drying financial well.","If the Soldier Ration Radish was decayed and buried underground, it would become nutrients that would nourish the soil and improve the growth of other plant-type feys.","However, she did not expect that Lin Yuan was going to evolve the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality instead of the promised Epic quality.","This greatly motivated Sun Ningxiang.","The Bronze/Epic Soldier Ration Radish was much weaker than its Bronze/Legend counterpart.","If Lin Yuan could evolve the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality, the effects of cutting off its old roots seemed minimal in comparison to the amazing benefits that the Legend-quality Soldier Ration Radish would bring to Condense Fairy Orchard.","If they were lucky, it would only take a few years. If they were unlucky, it would take decades.","There was always a chance for the Soldier Ration Radish to grow more old roots. It would eventually have three old roots again.","But Condense Fairy Orchard might never have the chance to evolve the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality again.","Lin Yuan initially intended on evolving the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality in exchange for one of its old roots. He was shocked to hear that Sun Ningxiang was still going to give him complete Law Crystals.","This gave Lin Yuan a good impression of Sun Ningxiang.","“If Condense Fairy Orchard has any more feys that need to be evolved, you can send them over. Sky City will complete the transaction at the same speed.”","Lin Yuan hung up the call.","When Sun Ningxiang heard the dial tone, a radiant smile spread across her face.","It was like someone who had lived in darkness for a long time could finally see light.","When Apricot saw Sun Ningxiang’s smile, she was stunned.","Apricot had grown up with Sun Ningxiang. In Apricot’s memories, Sun Ningxiang used to have a constant smile on her face when she was young.","During their childhood, Sun Ningxiang had been smiling sweetly every time Apricot saw her.","Her smiles were even adorned with cheerful dimples.","But ever since trouble had befallen the Sun family, Sun Ningxiang had stopped smiling.","After seeing Sun Ningxiang smile after so many years, Apricot felt like she was dreaming.","Apricot could not help but lament to herself.? The direct descendant of a top faction! It’s such an elite status! Yet, her title also forces her to undergo unimaginable pressure.","Apricot’s heart ached as she gazed at Sun Ningxiang’s smile."]},{"number":723,"title":"Chapter 723 - Pure Spirit Qi is Still Useful","paragraphs":["Sun Ningxiang stood up from the chair and looked forward to the Ostrich Logistics’ delivery from Lin Yuan.","She was treating Sky City well and had no choice but to trust them.","In order for Sun Ningxiang to escape from Connected Beast Park’s control and free herself from her current struggles, she could only bet everything on this last stand.","If Ostrich Logistics’ delivery in three hours later had no issues, Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother’s tightly wound nerves would finally relax.","Lin Yuan scrutinized the Soldier Ration Radish’s vines as he looked at the Soldier Ration Radish’s branches that did not absorb any pure spirit qi.","He felt hopeless and clueless.","He had been trying to think of a way to solve the Soldier Ration Radish problem as he packed the evolved feys into the Diamond fey storage box that they came in.","Lin Yuan carried the Diamond fey storage box with him out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone and gave it to the sitting Mother of Bloodbath.","He told it to give the Diamond fey storage box to Ah Neng, who was going to come to collect it.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he noticed that the Soldier Ration Radish vine in his hand had changed completely.","The vine had changed from lush green to dark green. Its texture also changed from soft to hard.","When Lin Yuan ripped the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaf, he realized that the wound did not immediately heal like it did in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The torn Soldier Ration Radish leaf’s sap dripped out and covered Lin Yuan’s fingers.","Lin Yuan was slightly taken aback and furrowed his brow.","But his frown quickly disappeared as he thought,? It looks like my pure spirit qi is not completely useless to the Soldier Ration Radish. It’s just that the leaves can only heal their wounds under the influence of pure spirit qi. It’s not enough to trigger the separation ability to allow the Soldier Ration Radish’s roots to absorb nutrients.","Lin Yuan immediately circulated and injected his pure spiritual power into the broken Soldier Ration Radish.","Soon, the broken leaves changed from dark green to their original lush green.","The leaves’ wounds also quickly died.","But the dead leaf had not healed. Instead, it was crushed into an irregular shape by Lin Yuan.","The sap that flowed out was also quickly replaced, and the leaf became just as plump as before.","When he saw this change, Lin Yuan stormed back into the Spirit Lock spatial zone. He felt that there was a high chance he could use the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots to grow new roots out.","He might even be able to repot the Soldier Ration Radish under the influence of pure spirit qi.","But since he had decided to evolve the Soldier Ration Radish to Legend quality, it was undoubtedly the best decision to cut the old roots after it was evolved.","Lin Yuan soon started to prepare to use the Soldier Ration Radish’s evolution to evolve the other feys as well.","Besides the Soldier Ration Radish, Lin Yuan also needed to evolve the Muscle Growth Camellia to Legend quality.","In the next transaction, Lin Yuan would be able to send some of the Muscle Growth Camellia’s stems to Sun Ningxiang.","Naturally, the evolution of two feys was not worth Lin Yuan using one spirit qi crystal.","After pondering over it, Lin Yuan decided to evolve the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish too.","He took out a spirit qi crystal and smashed it before directing the spirit qi toward the Muscle Growth Camellia, Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, and Soldier Ration Radish.","The Muscle Growth Camellia and Soldier Ration Radish evolved shortly after.","Although the evolved Soldier Ration Radish did not grow a fourth old root, its gold spots appeared on the old red roots, which also became thicker.","Lin Yuan could clearly sense that the Legend Soldier Ration Radish’s separation ability had doubled.","The Epic Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves were very large, but the Legend Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves were much smaller.","The smaller leaves clustered on the vines, and each of them was fleshy.","Lin Yuan placed one of the leaves in his mouth and chewed on it.","He noticed that its taste had a refreshing natural taste. It was also slightly sour and was not particularly tasty.","However, the leaf had a nice texture that was similar to the texture of raisins.","Due to the high water content in the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves, it was even bouncier and crisper than raisins.","When Lin Yuan swallowed a few leaves, he soon felt full.","Since he felt full after eating only four leaves, Lin Yuan could not help but marvel at the Soldier Ration Radish.","Given the rate at which the Soldier Ration Radish grew vines, the Bronze/Legend Soldier Ration Radish might not be able to sustain the entire Xia Region, but it could feed 100,000 spirit qi professionals and their feys with some to spare.","As for the Muscle Growth Camellia, it did not change much after evolving to Legend quality. It just became slightly larger, and many pink buds appeared amongst the leaves.","When Lin Yuan saw the pink buds, he plucked all of them.","The Muscle Growth Camellia was fundamentally used for tea. Every year, it would bloom when its body had sufficient nourishment.","The Muscle Growth Camellia’s healing properties lay in its leaves and not its flowers.","Since the flowers would drain away some of the nourishment, it weakened some of the Muscle Growth Camellia’s healing abilities.","But after Lin Yuan plucked all the flower buds, the Muscle Growth Camellia would not grow more flowers for a long time.","The spirit qi in the spirit qi crystal had been used up. Unfortunately, the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish did not evolve to Legend quality.","When Lin Yuan observed the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, he discovered that its tail had become shorter, its body was fatter, and the sarcoma on its head had grown larger."]},{"number":724,"title":"Chapter 724 - Lin Yuan Was Beaten Until His Nose Bled","paragraphs":["The Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish was even cuter than it was before. The five colors on its body had also become more vibrant.","It was normal for a fey that had evolved to look different, but it was astonishing that the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish had experienced such a change despite not having evolved.","Lin Yuan observed the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish and confirmed that it had not evolved in the direction of the dragon-species bloodline. This meant that the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish evolved its own bloodline after absorbing the pure spirit qi.","This was good news to Duan He.","Lin Yuan thought for a while before talking some feys he had harvested out of the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","He evolved these good quality feys to Bronze/Epic before crushing another spirit qi crystal.","Under the influence of the immense amount of spirit qi, the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish quickly evolved to Legend quality, but its appearance did not improve.","However, it was already impressive enough that the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish could evolve its bloodline to this level.","When Duan He formed a contract with the Five Fortune Ranchu Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, its exclusive skill would suit Purple Demon and greatly increase its endurance.","The five Bronze/Epic feys successfully evolved to Legend quality, and then Lin Yuan stored them back in the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","Since Lin Yuan was momentarily done with evolving feys, he walked up to the evolved Soldier Ration Radish and plucked off the longest old root.","He circulated the spiritual power in his body and injected pure spirit qi into the Soldier Ration Radish.","The part where the old root broke off formed a thin membrane, which slowly thickened and the color darkened. Finally, it became the color of the old root’s outer surface.","After he fixed the Soldier Ration Radish’s wound, Lin Yuan started to check the old root in his hand.","He immediately injected spirit qi into the old root and caused it to heal quickly.","Although Lin Yuan worked hard for an hour, he did not successfully incite the old root to grow new roots like he wanted it to.","Genius pointed at the crystal bottle on the floor and said in a child-like voice, “Yuan, use the spirit fluid I concocted that’s meant to increase the growth of plant-type feys’ cells and roots. See if that has any effect.”","Lin Yuan received the crystal bottle from Genius and looked at the verdant sparkling spirit fluid before soaking the Soldier Ration Radish inside.","Unfortunately, the Soldier Ration Radish’s wound had completely healed due to the concentrated spirit qi and could not absorb the spirit qi through soaking.","Lin Yuan decided to use Source Sand’s Metal Consume Manifestation and a feather made of Day and Night Spirit Silver appeared in Lin Yuan’s hand.","He used the feather to make an incision of about three centimeters at the part where the Soldier Ration Radish’s wound had been.","Next, he poured the spirit fluid into a tray and placed the Soldier Ration Radish’s wounded side down in the tray.","Lin Yuan injected spirit qi into the tray.","When the Soldier Ration Radish’s wounds healed again, Lin Yuan checked the point of amputation carefully.","This was when he noticed that a few white feathers had appeared at the amputation point.","But these almost unnoticeable white furs did not grow any longer no matter how much more spirit qi Lin Yuan injected into the Soldier Ration Radish or how much more spirit fluid it was soaked in.","Lin Yuan tried to plant the Soldier Ration Radish in Revival Soil.","This did not cause the Soldier Ration Radish to grow many vines, which meant that the Soldier Ration Radish could not grow new vines by absorbing nutrients through its roots.","Genius, which had been observing the Soldier Ration Radish’s vines, said dejectedly and with a hint of self-blame, “Yuan, if only I could concoct Grade 4 spirit fluids. Grade 4 spirit fluids are much stronger than Grade 3 spirit fluids! They might be able to revive the dormant liveliness in the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots.”","When he heard Genius mention the ‘dormant liveliness’, his eyes lit up.","If the Soldier Ration Radish just lacked liveliness, Lin Yuan had something that could spark it to life.","He had the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire that could give plant-type feys a second chance at life.","Even though the Twin Red Pagoda’s Lifeform Sacrificial Fire had not yet matured, it was already much stronger than it was originally.","When it had first materialized, it was no bigger than Lin Yuan’s fingernail. Now, it was as large as Lin Yuan’s thumb.","Lin Yuan hastily placed the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots next to the Twin Red Pagoda and placed the newly grown roots on the moving Lifeform Sacrificial Fire. He circulated his spiritual power and injected a large amount into the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots.","The Lifeform Sacrificial Fire’s brilliant green flames touched the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots and entangled itself with the old roots.","This energetic green flame infected the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots with a concentrated air of liveliness.","Lin Yuan realized that with his continuous effort of injecting spirit qi, the Soldier Ration Radish’s fine roots started to grow rapidly.","He squatted next to Lifeform Sacrificial Fire for 20 minutes. The white roots suddenly turned yellow.","At that moment, Lin Yuan blacked out.","A forceful blow landed on his face, and he inhaled sharply.","When he recovered, he realized that he had been knocked two meters away by the Soldier Ration Radish’s angry vines. There was also warm blood flowing from his nose.","Lin Yuan knew that his nose was bleeding due to the vines’ attack.","As he wiped the blood, he massaged his face. He could not help but be amazed by the plant-type fey’s strength.","Lin Yuan looked rather pathetic at the moment, but his lips still curled upwards into a smile.","This was because he finally had a real Soldier Ration Radish.","No matter where he found in the future or what kind of disaster struck, Sky City would never have to worry about food, and no one would be able to threaten them using the reason of a food source."]},{"number":725,"title":"Chapter 725 - Morbius Was a Stones Throw","paragraphs":["When Genius and Chimey saw the Soldier Ration Radish attack Lin Yuan, Chimey flew out of the nest in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree.","While it was flying, it changed from a golden sparrow to a blue songbird and landed on Lin Yuan’s ear.","Genius also climbed atop Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","Chimey used its wings while Genius used its tail to caress Lin Yuan’s flushed face.","Even the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope ran over to Lin Yuan’s feet and nudged them in a show of concern.","Lin Yuan smiled and felt that these three scamps were really thoughtful.","In contrast, the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was sleeping away on the Jasmine Lily.","It was not that Lin Yuan despised the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly. In fact, he interacted with the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly regularly.","Every time he came to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan would allow the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly to absorb the scale powder from other feys in order to nourish it and strengthen its scale powder.","As a Bronze insect-species fey, the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was not very smart and only knew how to rely on its innate skill to accomplish tasks.","The Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was undeniably the most comfortable on the Jasmine Lily.","But as the seventh most beautiful fey, the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was the pride of the Blue Flash Butterflies and had the right to fight for the position of most beautiful.","Although the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was just an insect-species fey, Lin Yuan was its contractor and could sense its gender.","The Blue Flash Purple Butterfly that Lin Yuan had formed a contract with was a true blue male.","Lin Yuan wondered if when the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was nurtured to Myth II in the future, it would become a skinny otaku.","The Blue Flash Purple Butterfly was a major problem for Lin Yuan now because he only needed to comprehend a Willpower Rune that was compatible with the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly for all the feys in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to have evolved to Fantasy Breed.","At that time, Morbius would naturally become Fantasy Breed as well.","When Lin Yuan evolved the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly to Silver grade, he could even spirit-lock another fey using Morbius’ exclusive skill.","Lin Yuan was also very much looking forward to the exclusive skills that Morbius would gain once it evolved to Fantasy Breed.","Morbius had only started sleeping after Lin Yuan left the evolving water world dimensional rift.","The queen he had dreamed of in his soul was the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen that he had formed a contract with.","This meant that the events of his dream were all true.","The terrifying copper-colored glow surrounding the sacred source lifeforms Grace Queen and Sword of Service were becoming clearer and clearer to Lin Yuan.","The familiar copper-colored glow was the color of the Morbius bracelet.","Lin Yuan could not help but hypothesize that Morbius falling asleep was related to the Grace Queen and Sword of Service.","He felt that Morbius might wake up after it evolved to Fantasy Breed.","In his previous lifestyle, Lin Yuan would usually spend time with Genius and Chimey. Other than that, he would share his growth reflections with Morbius at night before he slept.","Since Morbius had been slumbering for some time, Lin Yuan missed it deeply.","But Lin Yuan still could not understand what the carrots that he dreamed appeared in every corner of his soul world were.","Lin Yuan remembered that the carrots had healed his soul injury and enabled him to feel extremely comfortable long after he awoke.","He could still feel the faint refreshingness from the carrots in the depths of his soul.","Unfortunately, he was still clueless about the carrots.","As he looked at the sleeping Blue Flash Purple Butterfly, Lin Yuan sighed.","The sigh was not for the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly but rather for himself.","This was because Lin Yuan was not confident that he would be able to comprehend a Willpower Rune that was compatible with the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly.","He still had no idea what kind of Willpower Rune would suit the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly.","Currently, there was a Willpower Rune that Lin Yuan had comprehended in a fit of carnage.","This Willpower Rune was the second one that Lin Yuan had comprehended.","In the beginning, this Willpower Rune was intended to belong to Red Thorn.","However, after Lin Yuan saw the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia next to the Radiant Moon Palace, he comprehended a Willpower Rune that was even more compatible with Red Thorn.","Thus, this Willpower Rune had been set aside until now.","If Lin Yuan could combine this carnage Willpower Rune with the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly, Morbius would be able to immediately evolve to Fantasy Breed.","A wave of impulsion shot through Lin Yuan’s veins, which he promptly suppressed.","Lin Yuan knew that if he forced the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly to combine with the carnage Willpower Rune that it was not compatible with, not only would it be irresponsible, but it would also defeat Lin Yuan’s original intention of contracting the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly. The Blue Flash Purple Butterfly would be ruined.","He frowned deeply. Although some spiritual ingredients could facilitate the comprehension of Willpower Runes, Lin Yuan had always been extremely confident with the rate at which he could comprehend Willpower Runes. Hence, he never had a need for those rare spiritual ingredients.","Moreover, Lin Yuan already owned some spiritual ingredients that could facilitate the comprehension of Willpower Runes.","These included the Flowing Cloud Beeswax pendant that he was wearing that could rapidly transfer spirit qi.","This allowed Lin Yuan to activate his mind and soul by triggering the Extreme Token in the moonlight domain with his spiritual power.","When Lin Yuan was in his clearest state of mind and soul, he could increase his ability to comprehend Willpower Runes.","Lin Yuan felt that if the chance arose in the future, he should accumulate more of these spiritual ingredients that could facilitate the comprehension of Willpower Runes.","The Flowing Cloud Beeswax given to him by the Moon Empress was an incredible item that increased his comprehension of willpower.","One person only needed to carry one of such spiritual ingredients.","If more were worn, the mind and soul could experience recoil.","Although Lin Yuan no longer needed spiritual ingredients that could facilitate the comprehension of willpower, he felt that it was always good to collect such items that could raise a spirit qi professional’s innate potential.","Chu Ci, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie should all have one.","But Lin Yuan knew that he was overthinking things.","Chu Ci had Cold Moon as her Master, Wen Yu had Mystic Moon as hers, and Liu Jie had the Chief Guard of the Spirit Guards as his.","It was likely that they were already carrying items that could increase their comprehension of willpower."]},{"number":726,"title":"Chapter 726 - The Harvest From the Blood Brew Grapevine","paragraphs":["Nonetheless, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to collect such spiritual ingredients.","These spiritual ingredients that could increase spirit qi when worn would eventually come of use.","Lin Yuan walked to the Twin Red Pagoda and used the feather made from Day and Night Spirit Silver to cut the Soldier Ration Radish’s newly grown vines.","He filled a jade pot with Revival Soil and soul-nourishing clay and buried many energy ores inside.","Next, he planted the Soldier Ration Radish in the jade pot.","As he looked at his handiwork, Lin Yuan poured Grasswood Fountain Water into the jade pot until the pot was completely soaked.","Lin Yuan looked at the old root that had been broken off. It was almost 15 centimeters long.","The three-centimeter-long old root grew roots and grew into a Soldier Ration Radish after the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire roasted it.","Lin Yuan was definitely not going to waste this 15-centimeter long old root.","He broke down the steps to nurture the Soldier Ration Radish into five steps.","This time, Lin Yuan was extremely careful and was not struck again by the rapid growth of the Soldier Ration Radish’s vines that sprouted after being roasted by the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire.","At the end of his hard work, Lin Yuan soon obtained six Soldier Ration Radishes from the old root.","Lin Yuan looked extremely satisfied with the six Soldier Ration Radishes in the jade pot.","If a war broke out, the Soldier Ration Radish would become a precious resource that was more valuable than the Island Whale.","After all his hard work, Lin Yuan possessed such a precious resource.","Although the Soldier Ration Radish’s old root was still very small, it managed to produce six living Soldier Ration Radishes.","This was six times more than what the Sun family had.","From now on, Lin Yuan only needed to wait until these Soldier Ration Radish old roots grew bigger and he would be able to start evolving them.","Liu Jie had woken him up early. Since he was done with his task and had worked in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for some time, Lin Yuan could barely keep his eyes open.","He left the Spirit Lock spatial zone, collapsed onto his bed, and fell into a deep sleep.","The next day, Lin Yuan woke up to his throat feeling dry. He rubbed his head awkwardly.","It seemed that he had been so exhausted yesterday that he had snored in his sleep.","When he woke up, a thought occurred to him, and he slapped his forehead.","He had promised to give the Mother of Bloodbath the Blood Brew Grapes and dead Fantasy Breed feys.","However, he had thrown himself into tackling the Soldier Ration Radish yesterday in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and was so tired afterward that he had forgotten.","Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, summoned the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, and instructed it to absorb the dead Fantasy Breed fey bodies that occupied almost half of the space in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen swayed its skirt as it started to dance.","Twenty fine lines poked through the skirt and penetrated the bodies of the dead Fantasy Breed feys, and the willpowers in the Fantasy Breed feys’ bodies were extracted.","Lin Yuan was used to seeing the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorb Law Crystals, Law Source Crystals, and now, willpowers.","Lin Yuan summoned the Blood Brew Grapevine out of the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box with a wave of his hand.","When he saw the wildly overgrown Blood Brew Grapevine, Lin Yuan felt that it had to be the happiest fey as it had access to as much blood energy as it wanted.","The Blood Brew Grapevine had even grown two other vines out of the vines that grew Blood Brew Grapes.","The two new vines entwined around the main vines and helped the main vines support the weight of the Blood Brew Grapes.","This carefree consumption of blood energy could be described as indulgent.","Although Lin Yuan felt that it was slightly wasteful for the Blood Brew Grapevine to absorb all the blood energy from the Eyes of Relinquish, he did not do anything that would alter this situation.","The Blood Brew Grapevine grew at a comfortable rate and used the nutrients it absorbed to maintain every part of its body.","It no longer lived for the sole purpose of producing Blood Brew Grapes and had to live in accordance with someone else’s specific plan.","The two new vines could only help to bear the weight of the Blood Brew Grapes if they were supplied with enough blood energy.","The Blood Brew Grapes that grew were twice as large as those that had grown without the support of the extra vines.","The larger Blood Brew Grapes naturally had more blood energy in them as well.","However, the time it took for the Blood Brew Grapes to grow remained unchanged.","In a way, the Blood Brew Grapes’ growth progress had increased.","In any case, Lin Yuan had the flesh of water world dimensional lifeforms in a Diamond fey storage box.","No matter how indulgent the Blood Brew Grapevine was, as long as Red Thorn’s grade did not evolve, Red Thorn would take at least a year to consume all the water world dimensional lifeforms in the Diamond fey storage box.","When Lin Yuan had repotted the Blood Brew Grapevine, he had also made a new supporting structure for the vines.","The supporting structure was enormous, but the vines had already completely filled it up.","Lin Yuan plucked four ruby-like ripe Blood Brew Grapes and went on to enlarge the supporting structure with wooden plants.","This would enable the Blood Brew Grapevine to continue to grow wildly and produce more Blood Brew Grapes.","Once he finished building the supporting structure, Lin Yuan plucked some of the older leaves off the Blood Brew Grapevine, which he planned on giving to the Mother of Bloodbath.","The Blood Brew Grapevine’s older leaves had less blood energy than the Blood Brew Grapes, but they still had more than what was in blood spirit ingredients.","In order for the Mother of Bloodbath to increase its power, it had to absorb as much blood energy as possible.","Moreover, removing the Blood Brew Grapevine’s old leaves could allow it to grow new leaves.","This would allow it to grow better and mature quicker.","After he was done with these tasks, Lin Yuan returned the Blood Brew Grapevine to the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had finished absorbing the willpowers from the 20 dead Fantasy Breed feys’ bodies, and they had already been fully etched on its skirt.","Lin Yuan stored the dead feys’ bodies away and went to look for the Mother of Bloodbath."]},{"number":727,"title":"Chapter 727 - The Mighty External Blood Bone","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan arrived at the Mother of Bloodbath’s door and knocked, only to realize that it was not in the room. Hence, he went to the training room on the third floor that had been built especially for the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer.","Hu Quan had put in a lot of effort and used a lot of resources to build the training room because he wanted to help the two of them.","The walls of the training room were built with the strongest Diamond radium.","This allowed the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer to train and use their abilities as much as they wanted.","When Lin Yuan reached the training room, he realized that the door was locked.","He knocked, and the Mother of Bloodbath opened the door in less than ten seconds.","The Mother of Bloodbath did not camouflage itself since it was in the training room. Its red hair, red eyes, and red armor skirt made it appear exceptionally shocking.","Lin Yuan had seen this side of the Mother of Bloodbath numerous times.","The first person who had seen the Mother of Bloodbath’s human form was Lin Yuan.","After all, he was the one who had helped it overcome its second World Cleansing.","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw that it was Lin Yuan, it opened the door wide and said, “How rare to see you out of your room. Come in quickly.”","Lin Yuan felt slightly embarrassed when he heard what the Mother of Bloodbath said. He had just been working hard in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, but it came off as though he had become an otaku.","The moment Lin Yuan entered the training room, he saw that the walls were perforated with many holes.","Upon closer inspection, he realized that these holes did not come from the spikes on the Mother of Bloodbath’s spider legs. Rather, it looked more like bite marks.","This was because two of the holes formed one set where there were jagged edges.","The Mother of Bloodbath noticed Lin Yuan studying the holes in the wall and explained, “The three Legend Red Water Blood Snakes have become my exoskeleton.”","While it spoke, an immense amount of blood energy radiated around the Mother of Bloodbath.","Shortly after, the images of three snakes appeared behind the Mother of Bloodbath.","The three red snake images curled around the Mother of Bloodbath like in a protective formation. They also looked like assassins that were ready to strike at any moment.","A bone-chilling red gleam lit up in the Mother of Bloodbath’s eyes, and the three snake images became three red snakes that were about 15 meters long each.","These three Red Water Blood Snakes looked very different from their original appearance.","Each of their heads had a razor-sharp horn. The snakes’ scales jutted out of their bodies like jagged bones, and they seemed extremely strong. There were also many sharp spikes lining the snakes’ tails.","Lin Yuan knew that the horns were proof of the Red Water Blood Snakes’ hornless dragon bloodlines.","It seemed that when the three Red Water Blood Snakes turned into the Mother of Bloodbath’s exoskeleton, their hornless dragon bloodlines were fully unlocked.","With these three Red Water Blood Snakes as the Mother of Bloodbath’s exoskeleton, they had absorbed the chelicerae shed by the Mother of Bloodbath. Thus, they were also injected with the Mother of Bloodbath’s bloodline.","The Mother of Bloodbath’s bloodline combined with that of the hornless dragon bloodline to generate these horrifying Red Water Blood Snakes.","Lin Yuan hastily congratulated the Mother of Bloodbath and said, “This exoskeleton of yours should have reached Myth level already, right?”","The three Red Water Blood Snakes had become a part of the Mother of Bloodbath’s abilities, so Lin Yuan could not use True Data to check.","Happiness bloomed across the Mother of Bloodbath’s face as it exclaimed, “It’s all thanks to you evolving the three Red Water Blood Snakes to Legend quality. But the hornless dragon bloodline would never be awakened by my chelicerae. In fact, it suppresses my own bloodline.”","The Mother of Bloodbath looked slightly scornful as it went on to say, “The hornless dragon bloodline is a kind of dragon-species bloodline. However, it can’t compare to my bloodline. The three Red Water Blood Snakes were able to reach my level, but I did not expect that triggering External Blood Bone would require even more blood energy. From now on, when I increase my power, the three Red Water Blood Snakes will also need to be evolved.”","The Mother of Bloodbath shot Lin Yuan a troubled look.","“This means that I’ll need four times more blood energy in order to increase my power from now on. Even if we set aside the goal of evolving to Creation Breed, it’ll probably be a difficult struggle to even evolve to Myth III.”","Not only was Lin Yuan unfazed by the Mother of Bloodbath’s revelation, but he was also even ecstatic.","“So, your External Blood Bone is now four times as strong too? Do each of the Red Water Blood Snakes have the same fighting ability as you?”","The Mother of Bloodbath nodded. It raised its arm, and the three Red Water Blood Snakes turned the color of blood.","“You’re right. But the Red Water Blood Snakes only have my physical power. They can be considered extensions of my body. They cannot use my abilities or exclusive skills.”","Lin Yuan was not affected by what the Mother of Bloodbath said.","He was aware of the Mother of Bloodbath’s physical power.","In normal battles, if the Mother of Bloodbath could control the opponent’s blood, it would be able to deal a lethal blow.","The Mother of Bloodbath could also depend on its physical power for true fighting power.","If the Mother of Bloodbath’s fighting power could be raised, Lin Yuan felt that it would be worth spending even three times the amount of resources.","With greater power, the Mother of Bloodbath would also be more likely to be able to overcome the World Cleansing and Trial of World Creation.","Currently, the Blood Brew Grapevine was growing so wildly that it was capable of producing more Blood Brew Grapes.","With more Blood Brew Grapes, the Mother of Bloodbath would eventually be able to evolve to Myth III.","As for the law power that was required after the Mother of Bloodbath evolved to Myth III, Lin Yuan felt that he would be able to collect it if he worked hard enough.","Lin Yuan asked the Mother of Bloodbath, “Will the amount of law power you need after evolving to Myth III increase as well?”"]},{"number":728,"title":"Chapter 728 - Mother of Bloodbath! Much More Needed!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Mother of Bloodbath nodded before shaking its head.","“I will need more law power because each Red Water Blood Snake is branded with one-third of a blood-type law. In order to evolve to Creation Breed, the blood-type laws in the Red Water Blood Snakes also need to be evolved. However, I won’t need three times as much law power as I do blood energy after I evolve to Myth III. I’ll only need twice as much law power.”","Lin Yuan nodded. Since each of the Red Water Blood Snakes had one-third of a blood-type law branded on them, the three of them made one complete blood-type law. Thus, it was twice as much as before.","He already planned to use the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to prepare one Law Crystal to enable the Mother of Bloodbath to evolve to Creation Breed.","It would make no difference if he prepared two.","Lin Yuan clenched his fist and said with determination, “I will do my best to prepare the law powers you’ll need to evolve to Creation Breed before you evolve to Myth III.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused the Mother of Bloodbath to freeze in amazement.","The Mother of Bloodbath was well aware of how much law power it needed to evolve to Creation Breed. Not even the Moon Empress would be inclined to make such a promise so easily.","But the Mother of Bloodbath had been Lin Yuan’s Path Protector long enough to know that he never lied. He always made good on his promises.","When it saw Lin Yuan’s resolute gaze, warmth flooded the Mother of Bloodbath’s heart.","The Mother of Bloodbath realized that as Lin Yuan’s Path Protector, it had not saved him from many dangers. Yet, it seemed to always be receiving blessings from him.","From the moment it had entered the mansion, Lin Yuan had never had any qualms about providing it with as many spiritual ingredients as it needed to increase its power as it needed.","The Mother of Bloodbath had lost track of how much all those spiritual ingredients cost.","The Mother of Bloodbath could only have attained the level it had today, with the three Red Water Blood Snakes as its exoskeleton, thanks to Lin Yuan.","Now, he was even set on paving the path to heaven for it.","Before the Mother of Bloodbath could speak, Lin Yuan placed two fey storage boxes in its hand and said, “One of the fey storage boxes contains 20 dead Fantasy Breed feys while the other has some of the Blood Brew Grapevine’s old leaves. Take these first. I’ll give you more when the Blood Brew Grapes ripen.”","Lin Yuan left the training room and prepared to bury himself in his work. He felt that after establishing Sky City, which continued to expand, he had been getting busier and busier.","However, he felt good to be able to earn money to sustain the entire faction.","As he reflected on Sky City’s prosperity, he felt an odd sense of achievement.","After Lin Yuan departed, the Mother of Bloodbath picked up one of the fey storage boxes.","It summoned the 20 dead Fantasy Breed feys into the training room and prepared to separate all of them.","But the moment it looked into the contents of the other fey storage box, the Mother of Bloodbath was dumbfounded.","It watched Lin Yuan’s figure until it disappeared. For the first time, the Mother of Bloodbath felt that the sight of his back was expansive and full of strength.","This feeling was strange to the Mother of Bloodbath.","It was undeniably close to Lin Yuan, but as a Suzerain/Myth II fey that had grown to be as strong as it was, why did it still feel a sense of security from Lin Yuan?","This safe feeling made the spider delighted.","Each Blood Brew Grape was brimming with blood energy.","The blood energy in these 200 old leaves of the Blood Brew Grapevine was enough to raise the Mother of Bloodbath’s physical power.","The Mother of Bloodbath swore that it had never used a spiritual ingredient with so much blood energy.","The four Blood Brew Grapes and 200 old leaves had enough blood energy to compete with that which the Deep Sea Blood Mosquito had.","If this went on, the Mother of Bloodnath would only need about 12 or 13 more sets of what Lin Yuan had given it today to be able to evolve to Myth III.","The Mother of Bloodbath suddenly felt that evolving to Myth III was not as much of a struggle as it once seemed.","But to the Mother of Bloodbath, it was best to increase its power as quickly as possible because it was the only way to perform its duty as a Path Protector.","At the thought of its duty as a Path Protector, the Mother of Bloodbath suddenly remembered the safety it had felt from Lin Yuan.","After Lin Yuan left the training room and was about to return to his room, he saw Duan He standing by the entrance.","Lin Yuan could clearly tell from the way Duan He was pacing that he was waiting for him.","He walked up to Duan He and asked, “Senior Duan He, where’s Senior Purple Demon?”","In Lin Yuan’s memory, Duan He and Purple Demon had always been inseparable.","Duan He scratched his head awkwardly. With its dark-type energy head as its main head, Purple Demon’s tsundere personality was too stressful for Duan He to be with it for long periods of time.","Yesterday, Purple Demon had a dream that he was looking at other female snakes.","Purple Demon had woken up and violently attacked Duan He until he woke up. It was still raging a silent war on him.","What kind of torture was this?","However, he still loved the wife that he had been waiting for more than ten years to officially be with.","Duan He walked up to Lin Yuan, took out a fey storage box full of brocade pouches, and handed it to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, you asked me to collect Law Source Crystals for you. Coincidentally, two days ago, the Guard Captain of the Indigo Azure Guards contacted me and asked me to help clean up the outside of the dimensional rift. I rejected him but also tested him with the offer of trading Law Source Crystals. In the end, I only mentioned being able to exchange Law Source Crystals for the chance to evolve feys to Bronze/Epic. He immediately said he could trade 3 Law Source Crystals for one Bronze/Epic fey each time.. Since your offer was 1 Law Source Crystal for one Bronze/Epic fey, his price was much lower, so I immediately agreed.”"]},{"number":729,"title":"Chapter 729 - The Indigo Azure Guards Order","paragraphs":["Duan He raised the brocade pouches and said, “There are 60 Law Source Crystals in each brocade pouch, making a total of 120 Law Source Crystals. The Indigo Azure Guard Captain also sent 40 feys which I brought along with me too. After I give these to you, I have to rush back to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. Purple Demon and Endless Summer are guarding that place. The three of us blazed through the Zheng family’s faction, including two other businesses and one team of soldiers.”","Lin Yuan received the fey storage boxes and brocade pouches from Duan He.","Lin Yuan was the one who had ordered Endless Summer and Duan He to destroy all the Zheng family’s businesses in the Royal Capital.","By giving them a taste of their own medicine, it was exacting revenge for the spirit qi professionals who had died at the hands of the Zheng family at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Neither the Miao family nor the Zheng family’s factions were in the Royal Capital. The Royal Capital was Lin Yuan’s territory.","Since Lin Yuan was destined to collide momentously with the Zheng family, he needed to eradicate the enemy’s vestiges within his territory before the official war broke out.","If the Miao family joined it, when Endless Summer evolved to Creation Breed, Lin Yuan would order it to get rid of their influence in the Royal Capital as well.","Lin Yuan had not asked Endless Summer to attack the Miao family’s faction now because he was unsure if their businesses in the Royal Capital had any strong members.","Thus, he would not ask Endless Summer to risk its life under such uncertain circumstances.","The old Lin Yuan had taken a more passive approach. But after the two attacks that the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce experienced, Lin Yuan’s mindset had changed.","He felt that being passive would just result in being taken advantage of. One needed to strike out with immense strength when the situation called for it.","After all, the fights between factions were usually to the death. They should not be treated lightly.","Lin Yuan had received an unexpected surprise in the form of the 120 Law Source Crystals and 40 feys that Duan He had brought him.","Ever since Lin Yuan had tasked Duan He with gathering Law Source Crystals, the latter only ever managed to collect two or three at a time. This was the first time he had managed to collect so many.","The major factions were definitely not the ones who possessed the most Law Source Crystals. Instead, it was the 36 major cities that had the most, especially the Guard Captains in the main cities who were in charge of cleaning up after the dimensional rifts. They had the highest chance of collecting a large number of Law Source Crystals.","The major cities had probably collected an unimaginable number of Law Source Crystals, which only had symbolic functions over the last hundred years.","However, Lin Yuan was not acquainted with the Guard Captains of the major cities.","Since Duan He had helped the Indigo Azure Guards in the past, he should be connected to the Indigo Azure Guard Captain. Otherwise, he would not have been able to talk business with a government official.","The major factions, especially the top factions, were not usually willing to trade for Law Source Crystals because they did not need money, but the Indigo Azure Guard was different.","If the Law Source Crystals that collected dust in storage could be turned into Bronze/Epic feys, not only would the Indigo Azure Guard’s power increase, but they could also be given out as rewards to raise motivation.","Lin Yuan was also trading for Law Source Crystals with Condense Fairy Orchard and Sea Bliss Clan. However, the deal was one Bronze/Epic fey for one Law Source Crystal.","On the other hand, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain was offering a price that was three times better than what Lin Yuan was obtaining from Condense Fairy Orchard and Sea Bliss Clan. In other words, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain was offering three times the price of what Lin Yuan was expecting.","If he could trade with the Indigo Azure Guard Captain for a long time, he would be able to accumulate law power and Law Crystals at triple his current rate.","The issue of the Mother of Bloodbath’s requirement of double the amount of law power would also be solved.","“Senior Duan He, did the Indigo Azure Guard Captain set a date for the trade?”","Duan He replied with slight embarrassment, “He doesn’t completely believe me. But I do have a decent reputation after all my years in Indigo Azure City. Moreover, I told him about how Purple Demon managed to evolve to Myth II. It was only then that he agreed to hand over the Law Source Crystals first. However, he said that he hopes to be able to get his hands on the Bronze/Epic feys in the next two months before the dimensional rift closes so they can be used to buffer some of the Indigo Azure Guard’s workload in cleaning up after the dimensional rift.”","Duan He was slightly annoyed at this.","It’s clearly bullying!","There were less than four months until the dimensional rift’s active period.","It was too much of a rush to be able to fulfill the order of four Bronze/Epic feys in the span of less than a month.","Lin Yuan was slightly taken aback by what Duan He had said.","He smiled and replied, “Senior Duan He, I’ll have to trouble you to run an errand for me in two days. Please help me to give this batch of Epic quality feys to the Indigo Azure Guard Captain and tell him that I’m very much looking forward to working with him again.”","Duan He wondered if he had misheard. He felt that Lin Yuan talked about evolving Bronze/Epic feys as easily as the Purple Demon hit him.","There were countless king-class experts who could not even nurture one Bronze/Epic fey.","A thought struck Lin Yuan.","His hand shook, and an enormous ceramic barrel appeared in his hand.","Lin Yuan gave the ceramic barrel to Duan He and said, “Senior Duan He, here is the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish that I promised you.”","Duan He’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets.","In a few short days, Lin Yuan had been able to evolve the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish, which was notoriously harder to evolve than regular feys.","Duan He could not help but feel as though a giant tree was sheltering him.","This feeling was the best!","His heart was refreshing and flying!","With this Spirit-Siphon Goldfish to help the Thunderwave Sky Chaos Snail support Purple Demon, Purple Demon’s endurance would increase, and it would be able to use massive explosions freely. It would no longer need to worry about the depletion of its spiritual power.","Duan He felt that if he had this Spirit-Siphon Goldfish previously, he would have been able to save a tidy sum in spite of the enormous expenses incurred by Purple Demon’s nurturing in the dimensional rift.","After Duan He left, Lin Yuan went into his room and entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He took out the 40 feys that needed to be evolved from the fey storage box.","Lin Yuan realized that all 40 feys were exactly the same. All of them were healing-type Hot Spring Slugs.","The Hot Spring Slug was a healing-type fey that could only treat external wounds.","Although its healing powers only had a singular use, its ability to heal flesh wounds was astonishing."]},{"number":730,"title":"Chapter 730 - Hot Spring Slug","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Hot Spring Slug was appointed as a standard fey because of its special characteristic.","Even if one had a special affinity for a certain type of fey, as long as they were a healing-type spirit qi professional, they could form a contract with the Hot Spring Slug.","This was similar to the Vitality Sloth.","All of the feys the Indigo Azure Guard had sent were Hot Spring Slugs. This indicated that cleaning the dimensional rift was extremely perilous.","The Indigo Azure Guard were the same as the Spirit Guards. The only difference lay in that the Spirit Guards handled all the wrongdoings that took place in the Radiance Federation and appeared to be more impressive.","Meanwhile, the Indigo Azure Guard had been protecting the citizens of Indigo Azure City for generations.","At the crux of it all, both groups were equally noble.","Lin Yuan decided that he would do his best to nurture the Hot Spring Slugs.","Although he had this notion, Lin Yuan regretted summoning the 40 Hot Spring Snails.","The Hot Spring Slugs had a nice-sounding name, but they had a ghastly appearance. They looked like thrashing streaks of mucus that left sticky slime in their wake.","Lin Yuan immediately returned the 40 Hot Spring Slugs to the fey storage box.","When he walked to the spirit pool, he noticed the 11 Sunlight King Lotuses he had put in had already grown from the size of a fingernail to that of a watermelon.","Using True Data, Lin Yuan checked these Sunlight King Lotuses. They had evolved to Normal I/Normal.","Lin Yuan would place the Sunlight King Lotuses in the basement.","When Lin Yuan picked up the Sunlight King Lotus, he injected spirit qi into it with an extremely serious demeanor.","Nothing out of the ordinary occurred.","But when he evolved the Sunlight King Lotus to Bronze grade, Lin Yuan realized that it had returned a large amount of spiritual power to him.","Lin Yuan’s spiritual power increased significantly.","He never received a return of spiritual power when he was evolving feys’ qualities.","It was only when he evolved feys’ grades that he experienced such a return of spiritual power.","Lin Yuan had been busy setting up Sky City’s strategies and collecting a massive amount of resources. Thus, he did not have the time to rely on Silver Usneas to slowly increase his spiritual power.","Hence, his spiritual power had come to a standstill.","He did not expect to discover such a shocking change when he was evolving the Sunlight King Lotus.","Lin Yuan started to analyze the situation. *The Sunlight King Lotus returns seven times the amount of spiritual power that the Usnea returns.”","He quickly picked up another Sunlight King Lotus and evolved it.","When the Sunlight King Lotus evolved to Bronze grade, the same enormous return of spiritual power occurred.","This caused Lin Yuan to grin broadly, but he could not help but think why this situation was arising. He could not ask anyone else for the answer unless there was another him in the world that could absorb spirit qi from the surroundings and funnel it into feys to evolve the feys.","Lin Yuan had a significant number of Heaven and Earth Feys—the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia, Twin Red Pagoda, Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, Floating Island Whale, Sky Clouded Crane, Blood Brew Grapevine, and Sunlight King Lotus.","Besides the unhatched Floating Island Whale, Gray, and the 99 Sunlight King Lotuses, the other Heaven and Earth Feys had attained high grades.","Lin Yuan had not had the chance to evolve their grades anymore. He guessed that the Heaven and Earth Feys he evolved would return more spiritual power to him than other feys. Or maybe it was only the Sunlight King Lotus that could produce such an effect.","Lin Yuan felt that it was easy to test his hypothesis.","According to Gray’s shell, the feathers were moving slightly.","It looked like Gray was about to break out of its egg. At that time, Lin Yuan only needed to evolve it to test his idea.","He still had 97 Sunlight King Lotuses that he could evolve.","When he sensed the spirit qi in his body, Lin Yuan felt that he only needed to evolve another 80 Sunlight King Lotuses to promote to a B-rank spirit qi professional.","Lin Yuan had wanted this for such a long time.","When he became a B-rank spirit qi professional, he would be able to control Gold feys. If he could use Rolling Grade, he could possess Diamond Fantasy Breed feys. Thus, his own power would be rocketed even higher.","Additionally, when he promoted his rank, he could inject spirit qi into feys at an increased rate. He would no longer need tens of minutes to evolve feys to Bronze/Epic.","This would greatly increase his productivity and allow him to gather resources at a much quicker pace.","Frankly, trading with Condense Fairy Orchard, the Sea Bliss Clan, and the Indigo Azure Guard at the same time were causing Lin Yuan to burn out.","There was also the possibility of the Indigo Azure Guard increasing the scale of their trades.","At that time, it would be a struggle for Lin Yuan to finish just the Indigo Azure Guard’s orders.","However, Lin Yuan did not want to break off his collaborations with Condense Fairy Orchard and Sea Bliss Clan.","Although the Indigo Azure Guard was offering a much better deal, Lin Yuan could not guarantee that they would continue working with him for an extended period of time.","It was best for him to sow his seeds and play the field.","Lin Yuan could also make plans to squeeze the Sea Bliss Clan dry.","After much consideration, he decided to let go of other matters for now and focus on getting himself promoted to a B-rank spirit qi professional.","He used to think that his path to promotion from a C-rank to B-rank spirit qi professional was very long, and he could not estimate when the promotion would take place.","But now, he had discovered a shortcut that was wide open to him.","No matter what, Lin Yuan was going to seize the opportunity to take the shortcut. Hence, he continued to evolve the other Sunlight King Lotuses to Bronze grade.","He returned all the evolved Sunlight King Lotuses to the amber-button-shaped fey storage box when he was done."]},{"number":731,"title":"Chapter 731 - Promoting to B-rank Spirit Qi Professional","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yun summoned a new batch of Sunlight King Lotuses.","But this new batch was only about the size of a fingernail. They still needed to be nourished with pure spirit qi before they could become feys.","Lin Yuan circulated the spiritual power in his body and started to nurture them one by one.","He first evolved the Sunlight King Lotuses to feys that were the size of watermelons before going on to evolve them to Bronze grade.","This process took Lin Yuan a long time.","Lin Yuan did not evolve the Bronze Sunlight King Lotuses’ quality. It only took 25 minutes for the young Sunlight King Lotus that was not even a fey yet to evolve to Bronze grade, after all.","He could have chosen to evolve the Sunlight King Lotuses to Silver grade as it would enable him to promote his rank quicker, but Lin Yuan curbed the urge.","Ever since Lin Yuan had participated in the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting and gained an understanding of Bei Xu’s life, Lin Yuan’s horizons were broadened.","Lin Yuan felt that the Sunlight King Lotus could no longer just be used as small suns in the basement.","Besides the Radiance Federation, where light was abundant, other continents were devoid of it in this world.","In such a world, the Sunlight King Lotus would be the most precious item.","Hence, Lin Yuan decided to leave the 99 Sunlight King Lotuses at Bronze grade while evolving them to Legend quality. He would slowly evolve them from now on.","As these 99 Sunlight King Lotuses evolved, and along with Lin Yuan’s decision to collect more Heaven and Earth Feys, he felt that he would be able to rocket to B-rank spirit qi professional soon.","While they watched Lin Yuan carefully evolve the feys, Genius and Chimey would feed him pieces of the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves from time to time to replenish his nutrients and hydration.","Lin Yuan had already been burying himself in his work for 33 consecutive hours.","Just as he evolved the 83rd Sunlight King Lotus to Bronze grade, Lin Yuan suddenly felt the sticky fog of spiritual power in his body start to quiver violently.","The sticky fog of spirit qi clumped together, and even more spirit qi swirled around Lin Yuan’s body.","A light rain of spiritual power started to fall slowly.","After the rain of spirit qi in Lin Yuan’s body stopped, the sticky fog became clear crystal.","This meant that Lin Yuan had become a true B-rank spirit qi professional.","Lin Yuan, the B-rank spirit qi professional, exhaled sharply. When he circulated the spiritual power inside his body, he could sense that his spiritual power had increased by at least ten times.","He finally knew why the B-rank spirit qi professionals he had fought against in Star Tower could use spiritual power without restraint when they were directing feys.","He would not need to carefully calculate and portion out his spiritual power during battles with this much spiritual power.","Hence, battles that dragged out would give Lin Yuan the advantage.","Lin Yuan had become accustomed to being careful about using every ounce of spiritual power.","This habit was envied by other spirit qi professionals of the same rank who were unable to cultivate this habit.","He circulated the spiritual power and realized that the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone was clearly being drawn to him.","Lin Yuan was rendered speechless. The speed at which he could absorb spiritual power could already affect the flow of spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan took a Hot Spring Slug out of the fey storage box and injected it with spirit qi.","He realized that the Hot Spring Slug’s grade shot up.","The 40 Hot Spring Slugs from the Indigo Azure Guard were Normal.","Thus, when he was nurturing the Hot Spring Slug, he took the initiative to choose its exclusive skills.","Lin Yuan evolved the Hot Spring Slug to Elite/Epic.","Out of the three Bronze grade exclusive skills, he chose the one that best suited healing flesh wounds in battle.","Following this, he evolved it to Bronze X/Epic.","After Lin Yuan evolved the Sea Bliss Clan and the Sun family’s feys to Epic quality, he did not evolve their grades.","However, he evolved all of the Hot Spring Slugs to Bronze X/Epic.","This was a gesture of goodwill on Lin Yuan’s part for the Indigo Azure Guard.","While he was evolving the feys, he realized that it took him less than ten minutes to evolve a Hot Spring Slug from Normal I/Normal to Bronze X/Epic.","At this rate, Lin Yuan was certain that he could evolve feys eight times faster than before.","Now, Lin Yuan could evolve a Bronze/Epic fey in less than an hour.","He initially thought that he would not be able to fulfill the deal that Duan He had struck and had been prepared to use a spirit qi crystal.","As a man, he had to make good on a deal.","But now, it seemed that he no longer needed to use spirit qi crystals.","Lin Yuan only took about six hours to evolve the 40 Hot Spring Slugs.","After close to two sleepless nights spent in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan placed the fey storage box full of Hot Spring Slugs by the door.","He pasted a note on the fey storage box for Duan He and fell soundly asleep.","While he slept, Lin Yuan smiled slightly.","Since he had been promoted to B-rank spirit qi professional, he could quickly finish all the orders from the other factions while still being able to focus on other aspects of his life.","He had been fraught with work recently, so much so that he felt like a robot.","Lin Yuan cleaned himself up thoroughly and allowed Chimey to cut his hair with its beak when he woke up.","Lin Yuan felt that his hair had become too long. It had already grown past his ears.","In recent years, Chimey had always been the one to take care of his hair.","Moreover, Chimey was very skilled and talented at using its beak to cut hair.","Once Chimey was done cutting Lin Yuan’s hair, Lin Yuan revealed his set of white teeth in the mirror.. He could not help but admit to himself how handsome he looked."]},{"number":732,"title":"Chapter 732 - Genius, Do You Think Im Handsome?","paragraphs":["As Lin Yuan walked down the staircase, he saw that the jade-textured pearwood table next to the water rhinoceros leather sofa was stacked full of papers.","The papers were stacked so high that the top almost touched the ceiling.","It was only after Lin Yuan walked closer that he saw Wen Yu behind it. There were dark circles around her eyes.","When Wen Yu heard the noises, she raised her head and was stunned to see Lin Yuan and his new haircut.","She was not a shallow person, and looks did not matter to her.","But when she saw Lin Yuan with his new haircut, she found it almost impossible to tear her eyes away from him.","Before he cut his hair, his hair had extended past his ears, and it gave the young Lin Yuan an air of elegance.","With this shortened style, the air of elegance had been replaced with energetic radiance.","There was also a refreshing aura surrounding Lin Yuan that gave anyone who laid eyes on him a warm feeling.","In combination with his features, the hairstyle painted an image that was difficult to look away from.","If a person’s features could fight, Lin Yuan’s identity as Black would lose despite his talent in fighting.","Wen Yu quickly stopped flipping through the paper and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, I not only managed to organize all the information about Condense Fairy Orchard but also the information about the Sea Bliss Clan, the Miao family, and the Zheng family. It’s all here.”","As she spoke, she looked up at the looming mountain of paper awkwardly.","When she used Hear Heaven’s Secrets, it resulted in an avalanche of paper.","This avalanche would last for about two days.","It would take Lin Yuan more than two days to just glance through all the paper, much less look each piece over carefully.","Wen Yu shook her head in an attempt to suppress her exhaustion after three days of work without sleep.","“Young Master, let me brief you on the Sun family’s situation. It’s a little special.”","Although it would take Lin Yuan forever to look through the mountain of paper, the information was all in Wen Yu’s brain.","Lin Yuan would be more than willing to discuss the major factions’ situation if this was any other time.","Every time they discussed the major factions’ situations, the points made by Wen Yu about the operational processes always taught Lin Yuan a lot.","But when he saw the darkness under Wen Yu’s eyes, Lin Yuan knew that she had to have worked non-stop from the moment he told her to dig up information on the Sun family.","Lin Yuan could not bear to push her even further by asking her to explain all the information regarding the Sun family to him.","“Wen Yu, let’s try another method of communication.”","Lin Yuan said to Genius, “Genius, use Connected Tails.”","After Genius received Lin Yuan’s order, its white fur crystallized.","Genius was usually a cute white cat. But now, every strand of fur on its body looked as though it had been carved from crystal. The crystals seemed to glimmer with a hint of silver.","Shortly after, Genius’ pupils became vertical bars, and one of its five voluminous tails dropped off.","The tail that dropped off elongated and became a crystal link.","One end of the link was connected to Lin Yuan, while the other was connected to Wen Yu.","It had not been long since Genius evolved to Fantasy Breed, and this was the first time that Lin Yuan had seen it use Connected Tails.","Lin Yuan realized that Connected Tails did not completely coincide with what was described by True Data.","Although the effects were similar to what was described by True Data, some details had not been stated by True Data.","For example, Connected Tails allowed two people to share information, but both parties did not have the same roles.","One end was called the ‘front link,’ and the other was called the ‘end link’.","The person connected to the front link could choose to share information with the person connected to the end link or even not to share.","It was as though there was a plate placed in front of the person connected to the front link, which he could choose to place his thoughts in.","Although the person connected to the end link also had a choice, they would have fewer choices than the person connected to the front link.","The person on the end link could choose to share their own thoughts, but they could not choose which thoughts to share.","Lin Yuan, who was connected to the front link, had already received a large amount of information from Wen Yu.","Through Connected Tails, Wen Yu and Lin Yuan’s brains were practically combined.","There were some complex details in the reports that Lin Yuan now understood.","After grasping all the information from Wen Yu’s three days of work, Lin Yuan severed the Connected Tails.","“I now know all the latest information about the Sun family, the Sea Bliss Clan, the Zheng family, and the Miao family. You haven’t gotten any rest the last few days. Go and get some sleep. You’ve worked hard. You don’t need to push yourself like this in the future.”","As the front link of Connected Tails, Lin Yuan had not shared any information with Wen Yu. Thus, Wen Yu had not felt anything after she chose to share her information with Lin Yuan.","When she heard what Lin Yuan said, Wen Yu was slightly confused.","But when she heard that Lin Yuan had grasped all the information, Wen Yu prepared to go and take a good rest.","After using a lot of energy to collect resources over a long time, Wen Yu’s brain felt slightly muddled when she tried to ponder questions.","After Wen Yu left for her room, Lin Yuan turned to look at Genius and asked, “Genius, do you think I’m handsome?”","Since Wen Yu had been the end link, she had been an open book to Lin Yuan.","After understanding the contents of Wen Yu’s brain, Lin Yuan could not help but marvel at her powerful intelligence.","After Wen Yu organized the information in her mind, she would sort them out even further.","Although these analyses came out of the resources, Lin Yuan felt that the analyses were more valuable than the resources themselves.","Genius did not say anything other than letting out a meow.","The crystal tail shrunk to the size of a tail and rejoined itself to Genius.","Genius swayed its tails. It did not understand why Lin Yuan asked that question.","In Genius’s world, Lin Yuan and Chimey were irreplaceable pillars.","Chimey was female. Thus, Lin Yuan would always be the most handsome being to Genius while Chimey the most beautiful.","Albeit, neither of them was a cat.","After Lin Yuan asked his question, he scratched his head and felt that his question had been too silly.","Lin Yuan sat on the water rhinoceros leather sofa and contemplated the information he received from Wen Yu."]},{"number":733,"title":"Chapter 733 - Five Thearch Soldiers and Condense Treatment","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Zheng family and Miao family were definitely Lin Yuan’s enemies.","When he was looking through the information about the Miao family, Wen Yu had already organized the personalized magazines of the Miao family’s members.","The Miao family had two thearch-class experts situated in the Radiance Federation. This was why Lin Yuan had not instructed Endless Summer to attack the Miao family.","Wen Yu had revised the information about the Miao family and the Zheng family.","From the revised information, Lin Yuan gained a deeper understanding of the Miao family and the Zheng family’s inner workings.","From the exchange of information with Wen Yu, Lin Yuan knew that she speculated that the person who had sent the Messenger Pigeon was the Third Young Master of the Zheng family.","Wen Yu’s opinion and the details in the notes made Lin Yuan inclined to agree with her speculation.","When Lin Yuan thought about the information about the Sea Bliss Clan and their recent movements, his lip curled mysteriously.","Lin Yuan never expected that the Sea Bliss Clan had spent a large sum of money on buying the island protected by Five Thearch Soldiers.","They were preparing to build enormous Angelfish of Bliss farms around the island.","In order to secure peace of mind and settle the issue of the fish farms’ safety at one shot, the Sea Bliss Clan had spent half their wealth in the transaction with Five Thearch Soldiers.","Five Thearch Soldiers lived up to their name. They were the only faction who had soldier as their role.","In the beginning, they were called Three Thearch Soldiers instead because they had three thearch-class experts as members.","Over the next ten years, two of their pinnacle emperor-class experts members had become thearch-class.","It was only then that they changed their name to Five Thearch Soldiers.","Given that they were the only faction that could declare their role as soldiers, it showed how powerful they were. Moreover, they were revered in the soldier world because of their honesty.","They never accept jobs that they could not complete, only those that they were completely certain they would be successful at.","Lin Yuan had been worried that the Sea Bliss Clan was a veteran faction that had a mountain of wealth. But now, it seemed that he need not be so worried.","Even if Lin Yuan dominated all the Aurora pollen in the market, it would not guarantee that there would be zero Aurora pollen being sold in the market.","It would just cause the price of Aurora pollen to skyrocket.","He would also cause the supply of Aurora pollen in the market to decrease and make it very difficult for the Sea Bliss Clan to conduct business.","Money could move mountains. If the Sea Bliss Clan’s store of wealth was very well padded, it would allow them to stay afloat for some time.","However, the Sea Bliss Clan was now building a large-scale offshore farm which naturally caused their finances to deplete. This was enormously helpful to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could tell that the Sea Bliss Clan had essentially placed all their eggs in his basket from Wen Yu’s information.","They had actually taken their contract with Connected Beast Park to the Spirit Guards in order to force Connected Beast Park to pay for the Sea Bliss Clan’s losses.","Anyone could tell that the Sea Bliss Clan had stopped nurturing all other sea feys to focus on nurturing the Angelfish of Bliss.","It was true that Connected Beast Park was pressuring the Sea Bliss Clan, but it was not enough for Connected Beast Park to halt all of the Sea Bliss Clan’s businesses.","Yet the Sea Bliss Clan had immediately bit back and tried to extort Connected Beast Park.","With the Spirit Guards backing the Sea Bliss Clan, Connected Beast Park could only take the loss.","The Sea Bliss Clan’s road appeared to be extremely smooth!","But was the Sea Bliss Clan unafraid of Connected Beast Park’s revenge?","Lin Yuan could understand why the Sea Bliss Clan would spend a large sum on hiring Five Thearch Soldiers to protect the island.","It seemed that the Sea Bliss Clan wanted to use Five Thearch Soldiers to protect themselves against Connected Beast Park’s revenge.","But was it appropriate for the Sea Bliss Clan to pin all their hopes on Lin Yuan?","Lin Yuan was also managing Sky City. If Sky City was cornered into a dead end, he might stake everything on one risky path in an attempt to push forward to the future.","But the Sea Bliss Clan was now staking their future on one unfamiliar faction.","This move seemed insane to Lin Yuan.","It was absolutely crazy!","Although the Sea Bliss Clan was pinning all their hopes on him, they had still tried to take advantage of him.","What kind of manipulation was this?","He felt that if the Sea Bliss Clan collapsed, he could only take half the credit.","Lin Yuan felt that the other half of the credit should be left for the Sea Bliss Clan themselves.","Lin Yuan did not think that the information about the Miao family, Zheng family, and Sea Bliss Clan was important.","However, the information about Condense Fairy Orchard was monumental.","Lin Yuan did not expect that a top faction that supplied over 60 plant-type feys to the market and dominated the market on tens of plant-type spiritual ingredients only had three main members left.","Additionally, it had one wounded elderly and two young ones.","Sun Ningxiang was single-handedly bearing the burden of the entire Condense Fairy Orchard.","Many major factions wanted to subsume Condense Fairy Orchard or at least bite a large chunk out of them.","After Lin Yuan understood Condense Fairy Orchard’s circumstances, he realized why the Miao family wanted to devour Condense Fairy Orchard.","Even Lin Yuan felt a tug of desire for Condense Fairy Orchard’s wealth.","Since Condense Fairy Orchard could dominate the market on tens of spiritual ingredients, they had the authority to inflate the prices.","However, after Condense Fairy Orchard fell into trouble, they did not decide to raise the prices of the spiritual ingredients.","From this action, Lin Yuan could tell that Condense Fairy Orchard was honorable.","If they had increased the prices and thrown the markets into disarray, every business that relied on these spiritual ingredients would crumble.","The crumbling of these businesses would affect an unmeasurable number of people.","Lin Yuan’s plan to target and suffocate the Sea Bliss Clan depended solely on dominating the market on Aurora pollen.","It was clear how much Condense Fairy Orchard had from their dominance of tens of spiritual ingredients.","After he understood the information about Condense Fairy Orchard, Lin Yuan realized that his plan to dominate the market on Aurora pollen was not feasible.","Condense Fairy Orchard might not be able to dominate the market on Aurora pollen, but they had fields of Aurora Morning Glories.","This allowed them to take up at least 20% of the supply of Aurora pollen.","Hence, if Lin Yuan wanted to dominate the market on Aurora pollen, he could not exclude Condense Fairy Orchard.","After all, Lin Yuan was not a producer of Aurora pollen. His method of dominating the market was just buying up as much as he could every two years when the Aurora pollen matured.","If the Sea Bliss Clan could form a connection with Condense Fairy Orchard to obtain Aurora pollen, they would be able to evade Lin Yuan’s dominance of the market and keep themselves afloat.","Lin Yuan never wanted to see this happen."]},{"number":734,"title":"Chapter 734 - Was This the Male Version of Auntie Zhang?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Luckily, Lin Yuan was collaborating with Sun Ningxiang now.","After Lin Yuan understood the information about the Sun family, he noticed that they did not only own Condense Fairy Orchard. They also had Condense Healing, but it stopped functioning after the Sun family fell into trouble.","Most factions had many roles. Other than being a chamber of commerce, soldiers, and breeding base, they could also have healing as one of their roles.","It was just like how the Rhine Guild Club was an illustrious top faction that had healing as one of its roles and consistently remained as one of the top five factions.","However, Condense Fairy Orchard’s Condense Healing was different from other healing groups.","Condense Healing was non-profit and could be considered a charity organization.","Condense Healing had many healing-type spirit qi professionals.","These spirit qi professionals were mostly C-rank and D-rank. There were very few B-rank spirit qi professionals amongst their ranks.","Hence, the feys they contracted were mostly Bronze and Silver grade.","Condense Healing sent these low-grade spirit qi professionals to the 32 cities in Radiance Federation to help the poor, wounded, and helpless by providing them with free treatment.","When Lin Yuan and Chu Ci had been having hard times, they had also received such free treatment.","Although Lin Yuan did not know if the ones that had helped him came from Condense Treatment, he definitely respected them deeply.","The rich were selfish, while the poor were selfless.","Lin Yuan felt that Condense Treatment was spreading warmth and lighting up the corners of the Radiance Federation.","However, Wen Yu’s information did not include anything about injured members of the Sun family.","It only mentioned that when the Sun family had been in danger, the matriarch, a thearch-class expert, had killed three pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","Amongst the three slain Class 4 Creation Masters, one of them had thearch-class battle prowess, yet the Sun family’s matriarch managed to kill him.","It was a testament of the Sun family matriarch’s incredible battle prowess.","However, the information from the Hidden Moon Pavilion did not include any records of the Sun family matriarch’s specific injuries.","Clearly, her injury was the Sun family’s biggest secret.","Given that Sun Ningxiang was in need of Legend Muscle Growth Camellia, Lin Yuan could guess that the Sun family matriarch’s injuries were severe.","Thearch-class experts had an endless supply of spiritual power that continuously nourished their bodies.","In spite of this, the Sun family matriarch’s muscles continued to necrotize.","It seemed that if the Sun family matriarch did not receive thorough treatment soon, her life would come to an end.","It could be that she was already living on borrowed time.","Now that he knew all about Condense Fairy Orchard, Lin Yuan could adjust Sky City’s strategy accordingly.","Lin Yuan thought,? In the future, I might be able to form a deeper partnership with Condense Fairy Orchard.","If Lin Yuan was unaware of Condense Healing, he might also try to take a bite out of them in such a situation.","He might even attempt to devour all of them.","But now, he felt that achieving a win-win situation with the Sun family would be a better choice.","Lin Yuan was the only source that supplied resources to Sky City, and he was the one that garnered the resources as well.","Although Master Hong Shen and Hu Quan could also contribute, their contributions would not even be enough to sustain Sky City’s inner functions.","If he could establish a deeper partnership with Condense Fairy Orchard, he would be able to increase Sky City’s supply chain.","Sky City could be the upper management that generated high-grade feys, while Condense Fairy Orchard would be the lower management that handled the breeding base that nurtured feys.","Their collaboration would allow Sky City’s feys to be connected with the feys in the lower management to form a complete industrial cycle.","Lin Yuan was going to the Divine Wood Federation, where plant-type feys were abundant.","At that time, the Sun family’s breeding base would become very useful.","Additionally, working with the Sun family would allow Lin Yuan to use the Sun family’s connections that they had built over the last century. He would be able to find the spiritual ingredients that he needed even quicker, including Law Crystals and Law Source Crystals.","This would allow the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to rapidly increase its stars.","Although Lin Yuan was only using the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Queen Form’s skirt ability and had never used the Sacred Sword Form’s ability, the ability he was using was already enough to induce an earth-shattering change in Lin Yuan.","It allowed Lin Yuan to produce law power as long as he had Law Crystals or Law Source Crystals.","If the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could increase to 3 Stars and become its growing stage, its Queen Form and Sacred Sword Form would gain an ability each.","Lin Yuan was very much looking forward to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s new abilities.","Recently, Lin Yuan had sensed that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was approaching 2 Stars.","Lin Yuan, who felt refreshed now, realized that he had been so busy working recently that he had not visited the Moon Empress in some time.","After all the work he had done, Lin Yuan also had many questions that he wanted to ask the Moon Empress. Thus, he immediately went to the Radiant Moon Palace’s inner palace.","Lin Yuan realized that the Moon Empress was not alone in the inner palace.","There was also a tall and chubby but also jovial-looking elderly man.","The elderly man shrieked, “Moon Empress, you better not snatch the last piece of Spirit Savory Pig! So what if your disciple likes to eat it? I only managed to snatch it from my first disciple after great effort!”","While the elderly man spoke, a look of wariness came over his face.","His first disciple had acted like a madman after he came back. He had used many Spirit Savory Pigs to try to improve the taste of red braised meat.","Red braised meat was nowhere as delicious as stone pot buns in the first place!","There was something seriously wrong!","The Moon Empress saw that Lin Yuan had come and waved him over.","She shot Chef Supreme a glare before saying, “How can you compare your disciple to mine? But I must admit that your three disciples are fairly filial.”","Chef Supreme flushed as he caught on that the Moon Empress was being sarcastic.","His third disciple would go out to fight every day to increase his power.","But he always pushed himself to the limit, and it was no different from committing suicide.","Chef Supreme never stopped worrying about him.","His second disciple had founded the Spirit Food Pavilion and was making a name for himself so that everyone would know that he was the founder.","He used his reputation to continuously grow his wealth.","His first disciple was no better, for he had even stolen Chef Supreme’s precious daughter. On top of it, he even had a bighearted personality.","Chef Supreme’s precious daughter was never on his side. She had chosen to run away with his first disciple.","If Chef Supreme had not taken a step back as a compromise, he would not even be able to see his daughter.","This life was too much of a struggle!","It was better when the Moon Empress still had no disciple. Now that she had one, and one that she was extremely happy with, Chef Supreme was even more indignant.","Chef Supreme lifted his head to look at Lin Yuan to see the kind of person that the Moon Empress had chosen as her disciple.","When Chef Supreme caught sight of Lin Yuan, he felt that Lin Yuan carried himself extremely well. But when Lin Yuan saw Chef Supreme, he was immediately dazed.","He almost called out ‘Auntie Zhang’.","However, he managed to force the words back down."]},{"number":735,"title":"Chapter 735 - Chef Supremes Greeting Gift","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan looked at the elderly man with a level gaze. The longer he looked, the more he felt that this elderly man was the male version of Auntie Zhang.","Rather, it was the male version of Auntie Zhang with a few added years.","Although Auntie Zhang had a different build from this elderly man, their features were the spitting image of each other.","There were many people in the Radiance Federation, and it was not strange for two people to look alike. If this resemblance was not intentional or a fake facade, the two of them could be related.","When Lin Yuan had just arrived at the Radiant Moon Palace, he heard what the elderly man said.","He had heard his Master mention the Spirit Savory Pig before, and he had also had a taste. In fact, he loved the taste.","From the words exchanged between the Moon Empress and the elderly man, Lin Yuan could tell who the elderly man was.","He was one of the three Class 5 Creation Masters in Radiance Federation—Chef Supreme.","However, Lin Yuan was curious. How were Chef Supreme and Auntie Zhang related?","Shortly after, Lin Yuan thought of Auntie Zhang’s Terror Rabbit that had been close to death.","It was because Morbius had recently awoken at that time that Lin Yuan was able to satisfy his curiosity by checking the Terror Rabbit’s information. It was only then that he had found out that there was more than what met the eye to Auntie Zhang.","Lin Yuan did not dwell on the relationship between Auntie Zhang and Chef Supreme.","Uncle Li would call Lin Yuan almost every other week.","When Chu Ci was around, Lin Yuan and her would talk to Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang for at least half an hour.","When Chu Ci was not around, Lin Yuan would talk to them himself.","Lin Yuan decided that the next time he talked to them, he would ask Auntie Zhang directly.","Lin Yuan had nothing to hide when it came to these two people who had watched him grow up.","When Chef Supreme saw Lin Yuan, he initially felt that Lin Yuan carried himself extremely well.","But when he saw Lin Yuan looking at him calmly, Chef Supreme peered at him a little longer.","It was only then that Chef Supreme felt that Lin Yuan seemed very significant.","Upon further contemplation, Chef Supreme shivered, and the air in the Radiant Moon Palace suddenly seemed slightly chilly.","Chef Supreme hastily looked away from Lin Yuan and shot the Moon Empress a look of embarrassment before thinking,? When I go back, I have to teach that traitor a lesson! Thank God my first and second disciples basically ruined me after I accepted them. After I accepted my third disciple, I became so on edge that I decided never to accept disciples again.","Otherwise, if I had listened to my first disciple and gotten to know this young man, I might have decided to snatch him from the Moon Empress. If the Moon Empress found out, I’d be in trouble!","Given her character, she might decimate my Kitchen Fragrance Palace!","The Moon Empress turned her attention to Lin Yuan the moment she noticed him.","Hence, she did not notice the change in Chef Supreme’s expression.","When she saw Lin Yuan staring at Chef Supreme, the Moon Empress remembered that before accepting Lin Yuan as her disciple, she had seen the information about Lin Yuan that Mystic Moon had collected.","She immediately figured out what was going on.","However, this was Chef Supreme’s personal business, and it was not the Moon Empress’s place to inform Lin Yuan.","The Moon Empress noticed that Lin Yuan’s lips were a little dry and picked up the jade teapot from the table. She poured the spirit tea into the exquisite teacup on the table and handed it to Lin Yuan.","“Drink this Pine Needle He Lu tea and soothe your throat. As the seasons change from winter to spring, the weather is especially dry. You need to hydrate yourself more regularly,” said the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan took the teacup from the Moon Empress, and she turned to say to Chef Supreme, “Chef Supreme, this is my disciple. He’s also my only disciple.”","Although Chef Supreme’s expression did not change, his heart skipped a beat.","He was extremely aware of her temperament and character. This was the woman who would smash a table without mercy at the Radiance Imperial Court.","Yet, she was so calm when it came to her disciple.","From the way the Moon Empress said that this was her only disciple, it was evidence of how much she cared about her disciple.","When top experts accepted disciples, they were definitely also accepting someone who could carry on their legacy.","Chef Supreme had accepted his second disciple after his first disciple because he had realized that his first disciple was never going to carry on his legacy.","Instead, his first disciple kept dragging Chef Supreme to learn more about his Creation Master theories.","As such, Chef Supreme had accepted his second disciple. However, his second disciple had discovered that he was not interested in Creation Master powers.","All he wanted was to cook, which was why he had established the Spirit Food Pavilion.","His third disciple fitted his requirements perfectly. Even though he kept Chef Supreme anxious all the time, he could deal with it.","However, the Moon Empress had decided to stop accepting disciples after just accepting one.","Clearly, she was very satisfied with the one she had.","When Chef Supreme remembered the Moon Empress’s suggestion at the last imperial court, the meaning made more sense than ever.","It was obvious that she was paving the way for her disciple and demonstrating her trust in him.","The road to being a Radiance Envoy had never been paved. It was a path that one had to forage through step by step using grit and ability.","All the Moon Empress did was to provide the latecomer Lin Yuan with a fair chance.","After the Moon Empress introduced Lin Yuan to Chef Supreme, she turned to say to Lin Yuan, “You’re going to the outskirts to train soon, and you haven’t met Chef Supreme yet. You should greet him properly now.”","Lin Yuan walked up to Chef Supreme and greeted him. “Humble greetings, Lord Chef Supreme.”","When Chef Supreme heard what Moon Empress said, his eyebrow started to twitch wildly.","Although she had been addressing Lin Yuan, Chef Supreme knew that she was actually directing her words at him.","She was hinting to Chef Supreme that Lin Yuan was going to train in the outskirts, so Chef Supreme should gift Lin Yuan with something that her disciple could use in the outskirts.","After Lin Yuan’s greeting, Chef Supreme waved his hand, and a small golden toad appeared in his hand.","“Since this is our first meeting, I’ll give you this item made of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad’s stomach and skin.”","While he was talking, Chef Supreme thought about how his first disciple and daughter had asked him to accept Lin Yuan as his disciple. His gaze softened as he looked at Lin Yuan.","The Moon Empress, who was standing next to Lin Yuan, caught sight of Chef Supreme’s expression, and her calm expression shifted slightly.","Lin Yuan thanked Chef Supreme and accepted the small golden toad.","When Lin Yuan used True Data to check the small golden toad, a look of shock came over his face."]},{"number":736,"title":"Chapter 736 - The Precious Source-Type Item","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan received the small golden toad, he felt that it was full of liveliness.","The small toad’s eyes were full of life, as though it was going to jump onto Lin Yuan’s nose at any moment.","It was only when Chef Supreme said that this small golden toad was made from the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad’s stomach and skin that Lin Yuan realized this small golden toad was actually alive.","However, Lin Yuan had never heard of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad.","Genius had evolved to Fantasy Breed and transformed into the Beast that Connects Everything only recently. However, Genius had already read all the books about feys that were available online.","It had also grasped all the information about Class 4 Fey Observers.","The moment Lin Yuan heard about the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad, he communicated with Genius in his mind.","Genius was unfamiliar with the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad, which meant that it had never encountered this fey or any information regarding it.","When Lin Yuan checked with True Data, he immediately knew how he could use this small golden toad.","It was no wonder that Genius did not recognize the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad because it was not a fey.","It was a sacred source lifeform.","The Moon Empress said to Chef Supreme, “You sure are heavy-handed! I can’t believe you’re willing to give this valuable strategic-class resource to my disciple as a greeting gift.”","Chef Supreme smiled amicably and said half-jokingly, “Even if I’m reluctant, I can’t take it back now.”","Chef Supreme never regarded himself as a generous person.","Class 5 was the highest level that Creation Masters could attain in Radiance Federation. There was no lack of top factions and experts that sought Chef Supreme out for help.","If Chef Supreme was a generous person, he would have exhausted himself ages ago.","It was normal procedure for experts to gift each other’s disciples with greeting gifts. The Moon Empress had gifted each of Chef Supreme’s three disciples with one.","Actually, Chef Supreme did not initially intend on giving this sacred source lifeform to the Moon Empress’s disciple.","But now that he knew what kind of person the Moon Empress’ disciple was, Chef Supreme thought back to what his daughter had said when she was trying to force him to accept Lin Yuan as his disciple.","“My husband and I are childless, but we’ve always treated Lin Yuan as our real child.”","Chef Supreme only had one daughter. Hence, besides his other three disciples, Lin Yuan was the closest young person to her.","The largest use of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad was that it could deliver items across long distances, making it useful in the outskirts.","Chef Supreme had initially planned on giving this precious item to his third disciple.","Unfortunately, his third disciple had a knack for causing trouble. Thus, Chef Supreme felt that sending his third disciple to the outskirts would be akin to seeking his third disciple’s death.","As such, Chef Supreme gave this precious item to Lin Yuan as a greeting gift. The Moon Empress would also owe him a large favor.","The Moon Empress glanced at the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad before saying to Chef Supreme, “Thank you.”","Lin Yuan immediately knew that this item made of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad’s stomach and skin was exceptionally precious.","Otherwise, there was no way that his Master would thank Chef Supreme.","However, Lin Yuan did not think that this valuable item was very shocking.","Nonetheless, he could not deny that it solved one of his problems.","Items like fey storage boxes could not be used in long-distance transportation.","This was general knowledge that Lin Yuan had always been aware of.","Frankly, Lin Yuan had never been worried about this.","It was because he could place the fey storage box in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, which would allow it to be transported through the Space Tunnel without any problems.","But when it came to transporting people, Lin Yuan could not come up with a better idea other than using spatial ingredients.","After all, spirit qi professionals could not be stored in fey storage boxes like feys could.","Although the Space Tunnel could be used as the door between the Radiance Federation and Divine Wood Federation, when the spatial energy inside diminished, Lin Yuan needed to use a large number of spatial ingredients to replenish the spatial energy.","Even if the Space Tunnel could replenish the depleted spatial energy, it would take a long time.","The Space Tunnel had not been built yet, and Lin Yuan did not know how many entities could be transported at one time.","However, he was sure that it would not be many.","Given that the Ethereal Jellyfish was currently Silver I/Legend, Lin Yuan felt that it would be hard to say if the Space Tunnel could even transport him.","Lin Yuan planned on evolving the Ethereal Jellyfish before he used the Space Tunnel.","The Ethereal Jellyfish had been given to him by the Moon Empress and was a precious strategic-class resource.","The conditions to form a contract with the Ethereal Jellyfish required a spirit concocted from spatial ingredients.","Such spirit fluids could only be concocted by a Class 5 Creation Master.","Even though Lin Yuan could supply pure spirit qi, which even Class 5 Creation Masters could not produce, he was unable to concoct Grade 5 spirit fluids using spatial ingredients.","The Ethereal Jellyfish was similar to the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee in that neither could be combined with the contractor’s Willpower Rune. They needed to reach Diamond X/Legend before comprehending a Willpower Rune from their natural environment and evolving to Fantasy Breed.","Hence, Lin Yuan planned on evolving the Ethereal Jellyfish to the maximum level that he could evolve it to, which was Platinum X/Legend.","This would greatly increase the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Space Tunnel ability.","Lin Yuan had also wondered if he could transport anyone else in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","But once this thought had materialized, Lin Yuan shut it down.","He felt that Morbius’ existence was an even greater secret than the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s ability. He would never reveal this secret to anyone else.","Thus, he could never allow anyone else inside the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He had initially planned on using a large number of spatial ingredients to transport Sky City’s members through the Space Tunnel to the Divine Wood Federation. But now that he had the precious golden toad, he could transport spirit qi professionals like he would in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","However, the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad’s space was very small, only about two square cubics wide.","At the very most, it would only be able to fit 10 people."]},{"number":737,"title":"Chapter 737 - Tower Canons Hundred Year Plan, The Sleepers Revival","paragraphs":["Like the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the valuable item made of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad could not be evolved.","Lin Yuan also felt that other valuable items differed so vastly from the Spirit Lock spatial zone. This made Lin Yuan even more suspicious about what exactly Morbius was.","Lin Yuan squeezed the small golden toad in his hand. The feeling was akin to an extremely soft muscle. This valuable item made of the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad was in Lin Yuan’s knowledge blind spot.","He had been a spirit qi professional for some time, and in the last year, his horizons had broadened rapidly. Even some king-class experts could never hope to experience all that Lin Yuan had experienced in their entire lives.","Nevertheless, he had never heard of spiritual ingredients being turned into valuable items.","The Moon Empress noticed Lin Yuan looking at the small golden toad while in deep thought.","“Sacred source lifeforms aren’t the same as feys and source-type lifeforms. When a spirit qi professional kills a sacred source lifeform, he can gain a spiritual ingredient with a portion of the sacred source lifeform’s powers from the sacred source lifeform’s dead body.","“Class 5 Creation Masters can use such spiritual ingredients to create valuable items. But after the valuable item is made, a large portion of the sacred source lifeform’s powers will be lost. Only about 1% of the powers will be left,” explained the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan immediately understood what such valuable items were.","Apparently, they could only be made from spiritual ingredients that came from sacred source lifeforms’ bodies.","Lin Yuan also found another Creation Master ability: they were able to create valuable items from spiritual ingredients that came from sacred source lifeforms.","Lin Yuan did not expect to find out about this ability.","This made him realize that he was further from becoming a true Class 5 Creation Master than just being unable to evolve feys’ grades.","A bright smile spread across Lin Yuan’s face, revealing a line of pearly white teeth.","“Master, I understand now! Lord Chef Supreme, thank you for your generosity,” said Lin Yuan.","Chef Supreme observed Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress’ affectionate actions. The Master was willing to teach while the disciple was willing to learn.","At the thought of his three worrisome disciples, Chef Supreme’s head started to throb.","He felt that he should stop watching their display of mutual affection. It only made him feel worse to look at other Masters and disciples displaying their close relationship.","“Moon Empress, you didn’t ask me here just to let me take a look at your disciple and for me to give him a greeting gift, right?”","The Moon Empress knew that Chef Supreme was about to leave, so she quickly turned serious.","“Night Leaning Moon also accepted a disciple. In 10 days, Midnight Palace will be holding a Guard Ye Banquet. You better be there.”","Chef Supreme’s expression of jolliness immediately changed as he scoffed.","“What does Night Leaning Moon accepting a disciple have to do with me? The active period of the dimensional rift is almost upon us. Why isn’t Night Leaning Moon staying with the Spirit Guards like she should be? Why did she move back to Midnight Palace?”","The Moon Empress shot Chef Supreme a vexed look. She knew that Chef Supreme and Night Leaning Moon never saw eye to eye. It had been a constant conundrum.","She was not happy about having to inform Chef Supreme about the Guard Ye Banquet either, but it was an extremely important event that Chef Supreme needed to attend.","“Tower Canon is active again. The reason behind organizing the Guard Ye Banquet is for us to come up with a plan to deal with Tower Canon.","“Zixi returned from the outskirts with one of Seventh Page War’s Chanters as its captive. It discovered from the Chanter’s memories that Tower Canon had secretly come up with a hundred-year plan. But it could not discover any details about the plan. All it knows is that the plan is titled ‘The Sleeper’s Revival’.","“Although the details are unknown, it did find out that there are three stages to the plan—Seed, Sprout, and Bloom. It appears as though they’re already at the Sprout stage.”","Chef Supreme frowned and said in a low voice, “I’ll be at Midnight Palace in 10 days.”","The moment the last word left his lips, Chef Supreme disappeared from the Radiant Moon Palace’s inner palace.","The Moon Empress did not turn away from Lin Yuan to speak to Chef Supreme.","Thus, Lin Yuan also became aware of the Tower Canon plan.","Lin Yuan was deeply connected with Tower Canon.","The Suzerain/Myth II Night Calamity Crow and Hunting-Ashes that had appeared in the evolving dimensional rift were Seventh Page War’s subordinates.","Seventh Page War was one of the Eight Pages.","When Lin Yuan heard what the Moon Empress said about the plan, a sense of urgency rose up in him.","Currently, Lin Yuan could not help the Moon Empress, but he still should start preparing.","Since Tower Canon’s ‘The Sleeper’s Revival’ was a hundred-year plan, there would be at least a few decades between the Sprout and Bloom stages.","But none of them knew how long the Sprout stage had been progressing. Nonetheless, Lin Yuan believed that he would definitely become strong enough to be of help to the Moon Empress in three years.","The Moon Empress also had her own plan. For example, she had intentionally not sent away Lin Yuan when she was talking about Tower Canon because he wanted to become a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and was striving to become a Radiance Envoy.","Thus, it was better that Lin Yuan learned these things as soon as possible.","The Moon Empress looked at Lin Yuan and took out a bottle with a silvery sticky fluid inside.","The fluid in the bottle started to produce spatial ripples.","The spatial ripples were spaced closely together, and it looked like hundreds of spatial flowers had bloomed in the sky.","The Moon Empress shook the fluid in the bottle intending to agitate the fluid’s spatial liveliness.","In a flash, the hundreds of spatial flowers turned into a strange rain of petals.","“Mystic Moon has found the location in Startling Lines Continent for the Ethereal Jellyfish to make contact with. You can choose to open a Space Tunnel to the Divine Wood Federation at any time. I made this spirit fluid from the shell of the egg that the Ethereal Jellyfish hatched from. It will be able to evolve the Ethereal Jellyfish to Diamond X/Legend,” said the Moon Empress.","She then took out another jade bowl in which was planted a very small yellow plant.","However, the malnourished yellow plant had a big white flower blooming on top of it.","The outer petals were starting to open.","The numerous small yellow spots on the inner side of the petal looked like stars.","The Moon Empress handed both the spirit fluid and plant to Lin Yuan and said, “This is the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds. If you eat the crystallized pollen, you’ll be able to roll grades. It will allow you to evolve the Ethereal Jellyfish to pinnacle Diamond, which will enable it to comprehend a Willpower Rune sooner. This will increase the Ethereal Jellyfish’s chances of evolving to Fantasy Breed.”","Lin Yuan realized that the Moon Empress had picked up on the fact that he had become a B-rank spirit qi professional.","Lin Yuan did not reject the Moon Empress and received what she was offering.","The Moon Empress was delighted to see Lin Yuan accept her gifts.","Since Lin Yuan was about to go to the Divine Wood Federation, the Moon Empress gave him some solemn advice.","Afterward, the two of them had lunch in the Radiant Moon Palace and conducted a question-and-answer session before Lin Yuan left.","When Lin Yuan returned to the mansion, he saw Master Hong Shen and Hu Quan sitting together.","Master Hong Shen was gesturing excitedly, and his nose looked like it was about to change its shape permanently."]},{"number":738,"title":"Chapter 738 - 300 Meters Underground","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan heard the gesturing Master Hong Shen exclaim, “30 meters is too shallow. It has to be 300 meters. Plus, the space has to be wide enough to be secure! It should be big and strong enough so that even Diamond feys can roll around there without problems.”","Master Hong Shen was already naturally untidy. He probably had not showered in days.","His beard was all matted together.","When Master Hong Shen spoke, several drops of foamy sputum flew up and stuck to his messy beard.","His excited hands grabbed Hu Quan’s pen and drew on the blueprint for the basement.","When Hu Quan heard what Master Hong Shen said, he felt that his brain was exploding.","A fire surged within Hu Quan, and he slammed his pen down and said, “30 meters is enough. Does Young Master know that you want to dig 300 meters down? The soil 30 meters deep is already full of water vapor. One meter deeper, and the water would only be seeping out of the walls. Do you plan on building a water tank in the fey breeding room as well?","“It’s not impossible to build the basement 300 meters underground, but its exterior will have to be reinforced with Gold Trickle Rock Metal. You might not be a Spirit Craftsman, but as a Class 4 Creation Master, you should know how much Gold Trickle Rock Metal costs. If Trickle Rock Metal isn’t used to prevent the basement from flooding, there’s no point in letting any Diamond fey roll around inside. Not even Gold earth-type feys’ elemental abilities will be able to sustain the basement.","“Luckily, the supply of oxygen is an easy fix. Most feys that can produce oxygen will be able to provide enough oxygen to the basement. But what about light? Even if you put in some windows, the light will never be able to reach past 200 meters.”","Master Hu Quan was a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman, and drawing up blueprints was part of his job. He was also proud of his skill in this aspect.","Hu Quan always hated outsiders pointing and scribbling on his design when he was trying to draw.","When Hu Quan and Lin Yuan had been discussing the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake, Hu Quan found Lin Yuan’s opinions refreshing.","They had even given the design a new lease of life.","Moreover, when Hu Quan had been discussing the construction of Submerged Flood Dragon Lake with Lin Yuan, the latter’s suggestions were always accompanied by the provision of a large number of resources.","It was so much that Hu Quan would not need to carefully calculate the use of resources which could have affected the beauty of the design.","Hence, Hu Quan was more than willing to discuss the mansion’s construction with Lin Yuan.","However, Hu Quan found everything Master Hong Shen said to be unrealistic and unreasonable.","If Master Hong Shen had not claimed that Lin Yuan had approved the design, Hu Quan would not be sitting there and allowing Master Hong Shen to pick at his design.","When Master Hong Shen heard Hu Quan’s rebuttal, he did not seem to pick up on the tone of anger.","“When I talked about the basement’s light problem with Young Master, he said that he would be able to solve it,” said Master Hong Shen nonchalantly.","Hu Quan felt that talking about the basement with Master Hong Shen would get them nowhere. He stood up and said, “When Young Master returns, I’ll ask him about the basement’s construction directly.”","This was when Hu Quan noticed Lin Yuan striding in.","Hu Quan quickly said, “Lin Yuan, you’re back! What are your plans for the basement?”","Master Hong Shen turned to see Lin Yuan. His eyes lit up, and he said, “Young Master, I bought the forest. I noticed that the soil there is very fertile. I also discovered a nest of Tunnelling Earthworms. If the Tunnelling Earthworms are specially nurtured, they can evolve into Soil Decaying Earthworms.”","When Lin Yuan heard what Master Hong Shen said, he immediately knew why Master Hong Shen wanted to build the basement 300 meters underground.","At a depth of 300 meters, the environment would appeal to the Tunnelling Earthworms and enable them to evolve into Soil Decaying Earthworms.","With a large number of Soil Decaying Earthworms, they would gain a lot of corrosive soil.","Lin Yuan had instructed Master Hong Shen to study the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. Master Hong Shen and Genius had arrived at the same conclusion: a large amount of corrosive soil was needed for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to produce child ramets.","Otherwise, they would need to wait for the ramet to mature, and by then, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl mother plant would have sucked away all the nourishment.","As a result, the child ramet would die.","Lin Yuan nodded at Master Hong Shen and said, “You did well. I’ll leave the matter of nurturing the Tunnelling Earthworms to you.”","Next, Lin Yuan said to Hu Quan, “Uncle Hu, the basement really has to be 300 meters deep because I’ll be opening a tunnel from there to the Space Tunnel that connects the mansion to the Divine Wood Federation.”","At first, Hu Quan did not understand what Lin Yuan was saying. It did not make sense for Lin Yuan to build the basement 300 meters deep just to nurture the Soil Decaying Earthworms.","The corrosive soil that the Soil Decaying Earthworms produced was not worth much.","Even if a large amount was produced, it would not be worth the cost of building the basement 300 meters deep.","But when Hu Quan heard Lin Yuan mention the Space Tunnel, he immediately realized Lin Yuan’s true intention.","With such a strategy, it was absolutely necessary to build the basement 300 meters deep.","When Master Hong Shen heard what Lin Yuan said, shock flashed across his eyes.","It had not been long since Master Hong Shen had come to the mansion, and he did not even live in the mansion.","Although Master Hong Shen usually got along very well with the rest of them, he did not know how deep Hu Quan and Lin Yuan’s connection went.","Thus, when he talked about building the basement 300 meters deep, he did not mention that Lin Yuan wanted to produce a large number of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Master Hong Shen treasured the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, which all Creation Masters craved to obtain.","Moreover, with the added reason of the Soil Decaying Earthworm, Master Hong Shen thought that digging 300 meters deep would further secure the secret of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","This also eliminated the need to purchase corrosive soil when they started nurturing Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","However, Master Hong Shen never expected Lin Yuan to open a Space Tunnel that connected the mansion to the Divine Wood Federation."]},{"number":739,"title":"Chapter 739 - Construction of the Basement","paragraphs":["Although Master Hong Shen had only recently become a Class 4 Creation Master, he had much more experience than regular people.","Hence, he was aware that the Space Tunnel would be an immeasurably precious strategic resource.","Master Hong Shen always knew that Lin Yuan had a wealth of resources, seeing as he was able to supply spiritual ingredients from a Myth II fey that could heal soul injuries.","Nevertheless, the value of the Cold Snow Pine’s resin could not be compared to that of the Space Tunnel.","This made Master Hong Shen all the more aware of how wealthy his savior, who he planned to dedicate the rest of his life to, was.","Hu Quan sat back down on the water rhinoceros leather sofa, picked up the pen, and said to Lin Yuan seriously, “Lin Yuan, how about you give your opinion this time as well, just like you did about the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake’s construction. I’ll use your suggestions to carefully adjust the blueprint.”","Lin Yuan pondered over Hu Quan’s words. With a wave of his hand, he summoned the Sunlight King Lotus that he had just evolved.","When Master Hong Shen saw the Sunlight King Lotus, he clapped and started to laugh merrily.","However, there was an unnatural note to his laugh.","Master Hong Shen was a picture of calm.","Since Master Hong Shen was a Class 4 Creation Master, he immediately recognized the Sunlight King Lotus.","He had been extremely worried about whether light would be able to reach the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls because their growth heavily depended on it.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls needed to be under sunlight for at least 12 hours daily. Any less and the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls’ growth rate would slow rapidly.","The Sunlight King Lotus would be able to solve the basement’s sunlight issue.","“Uncle Hu, this is the Sunlight King Lotus. After it absorbs sunlight, it can act like a small sun at night that will supply the light that the basement needs. When the basement is constructed, I want you to hang it at the top like a lamp.”","Hu Quan mulled over Lin Yuan’s words for a moment before saying, “It’s doable, but the basement can’t just be one big room. If a single unit is too wide, it’ll make the basement more susceptible to earthquakes. If we keep every room to about 200 square meters, along with the addition of high-grade Trickle Rock Metal, I’m confident that the basement will remain secure as long as Myth Breed feys do not attack it.”","Master Hong Shen did not understand Spirit Craftsmanship but when he heard Hu Quan say that every room could only be a maximum of 200 square meters, his relaxed eyebrows furrowed together.","A mere 200 square meters was definitely not enough to breed the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. At the very most, it would only accommodate 800 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls at a time.","Since they had decided to breed the fey, they should be breeding as much as possible.","Master Hong Shen felt that he could take care of 2,000 Flower Brocade Pearls himself. He would even be able to concoct spirit fluids on the side to enable the Angelfish of Bliss to evolve to Platinum.","Lin Yuan responded calmly, “Uncle Hu, you can hang one Sunlight King Lotus in every room. I have a lot of them.”","Next, Lin Yuan turned to Master Hong Shen and said, “Master Hong Shen, if you’re free, please help to evolve the Sunlight King Lotus in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake to Diamond X/Legend.”","The Sunlight King Lotus that Lin Yuan asked Master Hong Shen to evolve was the ortet that had come from Master Duan Li. Lin Yuan had planted it in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","As a Class 4 Creation Master, Master Hong Shen now had the ability to evolve feys’ grades to Diamond X.","When the basement was constructed, all the sunlight absorbed by the Sunlight King Lotus would come from the ortet in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","All they had to do was connect the Sunlight King Lotus ortet’s roots to the child ramets.","At that time, even if the child ramets’ flowers did not receive sunlight, they would still be able to receive the sunlight stored in the ortet.","Currently, the base of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake was almost completely covered with amazonite and larimar.","By asking Master Hong Shen to nurture the Sunlight King Lotus’s ortet to pinnacle Diamond grade, it would allow Hu Quan’s Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen to build pavilions on the Sunlight King Lotus.","Otherwise, Hu Quan’s work progress would be delayed.","When Master Hong Shen heard what Lin Yuan said, he quickly replied, “Leave it to me. I’ll finish evolving the Sunlight King Lotus in three days.”","This was the first task that Lin Yuan had given to him since he had joined the mansion.","Hence, he had to do a good job.","Lin Yuan went on to say to Hu Quan, “I don’t have many opinions about the basement’s construction. But I would like for the rooms to be as strong as possible. There’s no need to save on metal spiritual ingredients. I think that the best choice is to use the same radium that was used for the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer’s training room’s walls.”","Hu Quan coughed.","He already knew about Lin Yuan’s inclination to always go for the best quality.","The Spirit Craftsmen Association accumulated a large amount of radium.","There was no shortage of Diamond radium where some came from Class 3 subterranean dimensional rifts while most came from Class 4 subterranean dimensional rifts.","But there were many uses for the Diamond radium, resulting in its sky-high price.","Although Hu Quan was a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman, he would have to pay a hefty sum to take a large amount of radium from the Spirit Craftsmen Association.","“Lin Yuan, there’s a large store of radium in the Spirit Craftsmen Association. But they can’t be bought with Radiance dollars. They can only be obtained in exchange for precious resources.”","Lin Yuan’s face lit up with joy. It was amazing that Hu Quan could solve the radium issue. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would have to turn to his connections on the Purchase With No Loss store fan club like he did last time.","Lin Yuan had accumulated a sizable amount of Aurora pollen from the Purchase With No Loss store’s blind trade.","Every day, 30 newcomers joined the fan club."]},{"number":740,"title":"Chapter 740 - Lin Yuans Plan to Reveal His Identity.","paragraphs":["Every night, Listen managed an auction in the fan club for a heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl with an outer layer.","Since the highest bidder won, the loot that would be obtained was uncertain.","However, the spiritual ingredients obtained through the auction were sorted by Listen and placed in separate fey storage boxes, which were stored in the mansion’s storeroom on the third floor.","Lin Yuan could no longer depend on the Purchase With No Loss store’s fan club to accumulate spiritual ingredients.","When he understood the information about Condense Fairy Orchard, he knew that they completely relied on him for Creation Master resources.","This gave Lin Yuan the right to approach Sun Ningxiang for spiritual ingredients.","This path made it much easier for Lin Yuan to collect rare resources.","As for compensation, Lin Yuan could repay her with his hard work.","Since he had become a B-rank spirit qi professional, Lin Yuan’s productivity scared even himself.","Lin Yuan had given Hu Quan, and Master Hong Shen, each two brocade boxes of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls for them to use as saw fit.","Now, Lin Yuan took out another two brocade boxes of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, gave them to Hu Quan, and said, “Uncle Hu, there’s a fair number of elemental pearls inside. It should be enough for you to trade for radium at the Spirit Craftsmen Association.”","Lin Yuan felt that the most basic currency of trade was the elemental pearls that were continuously being produced in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","When Hu Quan accepted the elemental pearls, he anxiously stored them away in a Diamond fey storage box.","Although Lin Yuan did not think much of his action of giving Hu Quan the elemental pearls, Hu Quan was always on guard when he received elemental pearls from Lin Yuan.","He always ended up checking the Diamond fey storage box on his ring finger.","He was afraid that it would accidentally fall or become lost at any time.","Lin Yuan thought for a moment before asking, “Uncle Hu, where do you think will have the best foundation to build the basement on?”","Hu Quan replied, “The green mountain behind the mansion is the strongest. Although it’s only about 400 to 500 square meters wide on the surface, it extends for thousands of meters underground.”","Lin Yuan immediately decided on the scale of the basement.","“Uncle Hu, let’s dig 300 meters under the green mountain and set up as many Spatial Magnets and Floating Silver Strands to cover a 300-meter radius. We have to place enough to completely hide the spatial fluctuations.”","When the long-distance spatial teleportation in the form of the Space Tunnel was made, it would definitely result in strong spatial fluctuations. If they did not strictly block the spatial fluctuations, it could be located by spatial-type feys even if the Space Tunnel was built 300 meters deep.","Once Lin Yuan was done giving out instructions, he did not have anything else to add on about the basement’s construction.","When he thought about the scene between Hu Quan and Master Hong Shen he had encountered when he walked into the house, Lin Yuan said to them, “Uncle Hu, the main reason to build the basement is to create an underground base for Sky City, Besides building the Space Tunnel there, one of its main functions would be a breeding ground for Master Hong Shen to produce a large number of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. Hence, you will have to listen to some of Master Hong Shen’s suggestions about the basement’s construction.”","Hu Quan nodded to indicate that he understood Lin Yuan’s meaning. He also felt slightly embarrassed when he saw Master Hong Shen’s untidy appearance.","His old temper flared, and he said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, I contacted many Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen. One of them is Class 2, about to promote to Class 3. In total, there are about 300 of them. I plan on accepting them into the Heavenly Craft Pavilion. After that, I won’t need to recruit any more. I noticed a few good ones in the previous 200. They will likely promote to Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen after some training. They will be able to hold their own once they promote to Class 4 Spirit Craftsmen. When this new batch of Spirit Craftsmens joins, they can join in the construction on Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.”","Hong Shen patted Master Hong Shen’s shoulder and said, “As the younger brother, let me treat you to a meal. Then, I’ll listen to all your requests and suggestions about the breeding base in the basement.”","Master Hong Shen was completely oblivious to Hu Quan’s temper because his own temper was ten times worse when he was disturbed while concocting spirit fluids.","Although Master Hong Shen was slightly confused, he grinned and replied, “Before we eat, take a trip home with me. I have many bottles of alcohol made from spiritual ingredients that I brewed myself. We can drink some.”","Lin Yuan prepared to return to his room as he watched Hu Quan and Master Hong Shen walk out of the mansion like a pair of brothers. This was when he saw the neatly dressed Liu Jie walking down the stairs.","At the sight of Liu Jie, Lin Yuan remembered the Guard Ye Banquet the Moon Empress had mentioned.","Lin Yuan asked Liu Jie, “Big Brother Liu, if in ten days you don’t need to go to Midnight Palace in advance, let’s go to the Guard Ye Banquet together.”","Before leaving the Radiant Moon Palace, the Moon Empress had told Lin Yuan to go to Midnight Palace to attend the Guard Ye Banquet in ten days at 6:00 p.m.","She had intended on going with him.","However, she, Night Leaning Moon, Chef Supreme, Bamboo Monarch, and the other top experts in Radiance Federation needed to go to Midnight Palace one day earlier to discuss and make preparations for The Sleeper’s Revival.","Even if the Moon Empress brought Lin Yuan along with her, he would not be able to participate in the meeting.","As opposed to having Lin Yuan wait a day in Midnight Palace, he might as well come when the Guard Ye Banquet actually started.","Ever since the Moon Empress had accepted Lin Yuan as her disciple, she had not brought him along to any public events.","Now that Night Leaning Moon also had a disciple, she immediately wanted to hold the Guard Ye Banquet to announce the news to the world.","This made the Moon Empress feel that she should also show Lin Yuan off.","However, she knew Lin Yuan was introverted. Otherwise, he would not have separated his combat-class spirit qi professional and Creation Master identities on Star Web.","Moreover, he had even used a mask to further separate his Creation Master identity.","Hence, she had even asked Lin Yuan if he wanted to reveal his identity at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Lin Yuan could tell that the Moon Empress really wanted him to reveal his identity. Thus, he did not want to reject her."]},{"number":741,"title":"Chapter 741 - Identities Can Hurt","paragraphs":["All the senior members of the Radiance Federation’s elite factions would be bringing their main disciples to the Guard Ye Banquet. Only elite factions and a few of the more established veteran factions were invited.","Hence, Sun Ningxiang, the Miao family’s young direct descendent, and the Sea Bliss Clan’s Qi Haitao were likely to be attending the Guard Ye Banquet.","Lin Yuan felt that this Guard Ye Banquet would be a good chance for him.","He currently had three identities, which were himself as Lin Yuan, Black, and Sky City’s owner.","Lin Yuan had always maintained his original identity as a normal Class 2 Creation Master.","After the Guard Ye Banquet, he would stick on the badge of ‘the Moon Empress’ disciple’ on top of his Class 2 Creation Master identity.","He had always used his identity as Sky City’s owner to interact with the other factions.","Now, he felt that he could change his identity. Instead of his identity as Sky City’s owner, he would use his identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple to interact with the elite factions’ younger generation.","He felt that there was no need for three identities. Two was already enough to shroud himself in mystery and even hurt others.","Liu Jie was stunned when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","He paused for a while to rack his brain to ensure that he had never heard of the Guard Ye Banquet banquet before he asked, “I know what Midnight Palace is, but what is the Guard Ye Banquet?”","Lin Yuan was shocked by Liu Jie’s surprise.","He proceeded to explain to Liu Jie what the Guard Ye Banquet was.","Liu Jie took out his phone and called Night Leaning Moon. Eventually, Night Leaning Moon said casually, “It is happening. I was going to tell you the night before.”","After he ended the call, Liu Jie said to Lin Yuan, “I don’t need to go in advance. We can go together.”","Liu Jie touched the back of his head and chuckled. “Master has been busy with making arrangements for the Guard Envoys. I heard two pinnacle Class 4 dimensional rifts have opened near the lake in the west. They are positioned really near each other and could influence each other to evolve to Class 5. The lake in the west is very remote and is extremely far from the 32 major cities.","“Thus, Master wants to take the opportunity to evolve the two pinnacle Class 4 dimensional rifts to Class 5. Master has already ordered 30 Guard Envoys in Spirit Guards’ Land and his right-hand man to head to the lake in the west.”","Lin Yuan immediately realized that the Spirit Guards were gunning for the sacred source lifeform in the Class 5 dimensional rift.","Since the Guard Ye Banquet was going to be held in Midnight Palace, the elite and top veteran factions had all received prior notice. There were even many elite factions that had already brought their main disciples to the Royal Capital.","Lin Yuan was already notified rather late, and he did not expect that as the main man, Liu Jie would find out even later than him.","Liu Jie saw that Lin Yuan was about to go upstairs and asked, “Lin Yuan, I’m going to see a few king-class experts. They applied to be white-clothed followers and meet the conditions you set out. Do you want to go together?”","Lin Yuan checked the time.","Using Morbius’ True Data, Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds opened at 10:00 p.m.","It was currently only about 2:— p.m. Hence, Lin Yuan went with Liu Jie to interview these king-class experts.","These king-class experts’ main feys did not stand out but had comprehended three Willpower Runes.","They were all middle-aged but were talented at comprehending Willpower Runes.","Unfortunately, they did not have enough resources to nurture feys. Although they were talented, their prowess had been stripped away by reality.","The 4 king-class experts eventually swore to become Sky City’s white-clothed followers.","Lin Yuan also had to keep his promise to give these new white-clothed followers Bronze/Epic feys.","This was extremely easy for Lin Yuan, and four feys would only take him half an hour.","As the leader of the white-clothed followers, he instructed them to continue behaving like normal and collecting resources.","Three days later, Lin Yuan would send the Bronze/Epic feys to the four king-class experts through Ostrich Logistics.","From the beginning, Lin Yuan established the white-clothed-followers plan to use Bronze/Epic feys to earn king-class experts’ loyalty. Then, he would order the king-class experts to go out and collect resources for him to nurture feys.","Zhou Luo had been recognized by Lin Yuan and could be said to be one of the accidents that came out of the white-clothed-followers plan.","It seemed that these four new white-clothed followers still needed some time to improve.","Slowly, Sky City’s white-clothed followers would increase.","When Sky City no longer needed these white-clothed followers, they would become like the clouds that surrounded Sky City.","Sky City could call them back whenever necessary.","The clouds would rapidly gather and produce an incredible effect.","When he returned to the mansion, Lin Yuan went to his room and continued evolving the feys that Sun Ningxiang and the Sea Bliss Clan had sent him.","Three hours later, Lin Yuan was done with a workload that would have taken him more than a day in the past.","Lin Yuan observed the six Soldier Ration Radishes in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. After studying them for some time, he realized that although they were continuously producing vines, the Soldier Ration Radishes’ old roots had not grown at all.","The Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots needed pure spirit qi.","He came to this conclusion after comparing the leaves that he took out from the Spirit Lock spatial zone with those that were left inside to be exposed to pure spirit qi.","However, the pure spirit qi could stimulate the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots but could not trigger it to separate.","At that moment, Lin Yuan thought about the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire’s ability to aid the Soldier Ration Radish’s growth.","Lin Yuan brought the Twin Red Pagoda over and placed it beside the six Soldier Ration Radishes.","He surrounded the Twin Red Pagoda with the Soldier Ration Radishes.","The green thumb-sized flame on top of the Twin Red Pagoda’s flower head danced as per usual.","Lin Yuan realized that the Soldier Ration Radish was growing vines at an accelerated rate.","Through the change in the Spirit Lock spatial zone’s spirit qi, Lin Yuan could sense that the Soldier Ration Radish was also absorbing pure spirit qi much quicker.","Although Lin Yuan could not see any visible change in the old roots, given the rate of the vines’ growth, the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots had to be growing more quickly as well."]},{"number":742,"title":"Chapter 742 - The Mutated Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan decided to leave the Twin Red Pagoda near the Soldier Ration Radishes to increase their growth.","It was already 10:00 p.m., and Lin Yuan summoned the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds.","He realized that the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ withered and yellowed leaves had turned a slightly healthier shade of yellow after slowly absorbing the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ large flower bud had fully bloomed. The yellow spots on the flower bud slowly spread outwards but clustered closely inwards.","Lin Yuan observed that the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ white flowers wilted quickly.","Beautiful things were truly fleeting.","When the white flowers wilted, amber-colored crystallized pollen appeared above the stamen.","Lin Yuan was slightly confused. Common sense told him that the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds should wilt after blooming because the flower had drained all the nutrients.","The Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen that could be used to roll grades had appeared, yet the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds had not died.","Moreover, the nourishment from the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone allowed the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds to turn from yellow to crisp green.","This was when Lin Yuan remembered what the Moon Empress once told him.","If he wanted to cause the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds to bloom, he needed a bottle of Grade 5 spirit fluid made from concentrated spirit qi or three bottles of Class 4 spirit fluids made from spirit qi every day for a month.","Although this showed how precious the Starlight pollen was, it also proved how effectively concentrated spirit qi was on the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds.","Lin Yuan had spirit qi that was purer and more concentrated than what even Class 5 Creation Masters could produce.","He used Morbius’ True Data to check on the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds that the concentrated spirit qi had revived.","Lin Yuan was surprised to discover that the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds had already mutated under the effects of the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","It had mutated into a fey called the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds.","The Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen completely lacked the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen’s ability to roll grades.","However, according to True Data, the pollen from the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds could absorb the energy from constellations to produce luck.","This luck could overcome a person’s bad luck.","The bad luck could include that of a person with an opposing fate, a partner with an opposing fate, a relative with an opposing fate, and so on.","Luck was an illusion, as was bad luck.","If this was any other time, the modern-minded Lin Yuan would not believe in bad luck.","However, Lin Yuan had accidentally run into Wang Fuxiang.","This made him believe that there were truly people who were born with such bad luck.","Initially, he did not believe that she had cursed so many husbands, boyfriends, and lovers dead. He felt that even if she had been telling the truth, it did not have to be a result of bad luck.","Who knew if there was anyone on Wang Fuxiang’s side that could have gone to such extreme measures?","Lin Yuan did not know Wang Fuxiang well.","But when the group was having a meal together, Listen mentioned Langya Pavilion when he was talking about the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s luxury goods.","Langya Pavilion’s role was appraising luxury resources, which included luxury goods.","It was easy to become rich through appraising luxury resources.","Langya Pavilion had to have strong martial force support behind them to be able to gain access to the major factions to appraise their luxury resources.","During the meal, Lin Yuan intentionally asked Duan He about Wang Fuxiang because he seemed to know her well.","Duan He had investigated Wang Fuxiang when he was a Spirit Guard. Hence, he was well aware of her situation.","Duan He would not divulge anything about Wang Fuxiang if anyone else had asked.","But he was a member of Sky City now and knew that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple. Thus, he did not hide anything from Lin Yuan.","From the information that Duan He provided, those who had been cursed dead by Wang Fuxiang had just been affected by her bad luck.","They had met her long ago and only died after confirming their relationship with her.","Moreover, those who had died shared a pattern—those with more power took longer to die.","The Spirit Guards’ detailed investigation discovered that every time Wang Fuxiang invested herself in a relationship, she would become sullen for a long time after the loved one died.","As such, Lin Yuan could not help but believe that there truly were people with bad luck in this world.","The Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen could ameliorate or remove a person’s bad luck according to how much bad luck they had.","Lin Yuan could not help but marvel at this fey’s amazing ability.","Currently, Lin Yuan did not have much use for the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds, so he placed it in a corner of the workbench in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He harvested the amber-colored pollen from the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ withered flower center.","Lin Yuan looked at the crystallized amber-colored Starlight pollen and thought back to the utilization method that the Moon Empress had told him about.","Lin Yuan immediately swallowed the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen.","Soon, he felt a wave of warmth spread through his body, and a bitter taste lingered in his throat.","The bitter taste traveled around his body, making him feel hot and bloated.","However, Lin Yuan found this hot bloatedness to be comfortable.","The Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen could allow spirit qi professionals to roll grades and break through the grade limit to allow them to evolve feys to a higher level.","It also cleansed the impurities in spirit qi professionals.","However, the impurities in Lin Yuan’s soul had been completely cleansed by the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar. Since Lin Yuan did not have any impurities, he did not feel any pain when he was cleansed again.","He also would not expel any impurities.","The Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen cleansed Lin Yuan’s body of impurities by essentially nourishing and massaging his cells.","It made every cell in Lin Yuan’s body reach its healthiest and most lively state.","A moment later, Lin Yuan opened his eyes and realized that he had much more energy than he had before."]},{"number":743,"title":"Chapter 743 - The Evolving Ethereal Jellyfish","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","All spirit qi professionals could sense the limit of the feys they could contract.","After Lin Yuan became a B-rank spirit qi professional, he could clearly sense that his own limit was Platinum X.","The Jasmine Lily could roll grades because Lin Yuan’s body had been cleansed by the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar and because the Jasmine Lily was a fey that came from Morbius’ Spirit Lock spatial zone. Lin Yuan’s spiritual energy did not contract it.","Now that he had consumed the Starlight Intelligent Dark Clouds’ pollen, Lin Yuan could sense that his limit had increased to Diamond X.","He immediately summoned the Ethereal Jellyfish, and it instantly flew toward Lin Yuan’s head and wanted to rest comfortably on top of him.","Lin Yuan seemed to have predicted the Ethereal Jellyfish’s movements as he took a step forward and tilted his head.","The Ethereal Jellyfish landed on Lin Yuan’s neck, its red tentacles wrapping around his neck like a large scarf. It matched Lin Yuan’s white and blue spirit qi clothes and made him look festive.","Lin Yuan extracted the Ethereal Jellyfish from his neck and stroked its antennae and tentacles.","He found that the Ethereal Jellyfish was the most pleasant to the touch as it felt like bouncy jelly. Not even Genius’ soft fur could compare.","Lin Yuan said to the gurgling Ethereal Jellyfish, “Ethereal Jellyfish, I’m going to evolve your grade.”","He took out the spirit fluid made from the Spatial Mother Shellfish’s eggshell that the Moon Empress had given him.","The bottle of spirit fluid did not react in any way to the Spirit Lock spatial zone. It did not produce hundreds of spatial flowers like it did when it was taken out in the Radiant Moon Palace.","Lin Yuan thought,? It looks like the air in my Spirit Lock spatial zone is much more stable than that of the outside world.","The Ethereal Jellyfish was not smart to understand what Lin Yuan had said. But when it felt Lin Yuan stroking its tentacles, the Ethereal Jellyfish lifted its antennae.","It flicked its antennae at Lin Yuan as though it was asking Lin Yuan to give it a trim.","Lin Yuan had already trimmed its antennae a few times in the past. He did not keep the trimmed antennae. Instead, he had established numerous Tentacle Nodes all around the Royal Capital.","Lin Yuan used a feather made of Source Sand’s Day and Night Spirit Silver and cut down the newer antennae.","As he looked at the antennae, Lin Yuan felt that he could establish Tentacle Nodes at the auction site in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, Hu Quan’s Heavenly Craft Pavilion, and the mansion’s basement.","Lin Yuan no longer needed to waste time traveling if he wanted to go to the Radiant Moon Palace. He even planned on giving some of the Ethereal Jellyfish’s antennae to the rest of the people in the mansion.","They would only need to touch the Node Activation on the Tentacle Nodes to return to their starting point where the Ethereal Jellyfish was at.","In a way, Lin Yuan was preparing an emergency life-saving trump card for them.","Even if king-class experts surrounded Listen, he could touch the Node Activation and return to where the Ethereal Jellyfish was.","Lin Yuan was extremely satisfied with the Ethereal Jellyfish the Moon Empress had given him because it was a strategic-class resource that could perform spatial teleportation.","Initially, the Silver Ethereal Jellyfish’s three abilities were beneficial to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan would not have obtained the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen if the Ethereal Jellyfish had not discovered the evolving water world dimensional rift.","He would also not have gained the ability to produce Law Crystals from Law Crystal fragments and Law Source Crystals, much less have the opportunity to go to and from the Divine Wood Federation as he pleased.","Lin Yuan was about to use the spirit fluid to evolve the Ethereal Jellyfish to Diamond X/Legend. Its level would improve by leaps and bounds.","Source-type lifeforms were different from feys. Feys could continuously evolve their bloodlines and transform, but most source-type lifeforms could not evolve and change their names. There were only a few special exceptions, such as Red Thorn and Duan He’s Unmatchable Bird.","The Ethereal Jellyfish was the same, but Lin Yuan was extremely looking forward to the new abilities that would arise.","Lin Yuan opened the cork and poured the silver spirit fluid onto the Ethereal Jellyfish.","When the spirit fluid made contact with the Ethereal Jellyfish, its red body absorbed the fluid like a sponge.","Lin Yuan poured more of the spirit fluid onto the Ethereal Jellyfish, and it absorbed all of it.","After Lin Yuan poured all of the spirit fluid onto the Ethereal Jellyfish, he watched as it started to glow with a silver light.","This silver light encapsulated the Ethereal Jellyfish’s red body.","Shortly after, the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body started to grow.","Since he had his experience of evolving Blackie, he immediately took the Ethereal Jellyfish out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Ethereal Jellyfish looked as though it was drunk as it thrashed around.","The air on the outside was not as stable as that in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. The silver energy in the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body caused small ripples of spatial fluctuations to spread around Lin Yuan’s room.","The red light in the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body suddenly cut through the silver light, and the spatial fluctuations expanded, blocking Lin Yuan’s vision.","While the spatial fluctuations flowed outwards, the Ethereal Jellyfish disappeared in a ball of light.","It reappeared a moment later as though it had never left.","Lin Yuan knew that the Ethereal Jellyfish had traveled through various dimensions.","As its contractor, Lin Yuan could sense that its grade was evolving."]},{"number":744,"title":"Chapter 744 - Gold Ability: Dissociate Catch","paragraphs":["Although the spatial fluctuations blocked the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body, its aura became more and more concentrated.","When the Ethereal Jellyfish’s grade and aura stopped evolving, the red light from his body also diminished back into the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body.","The spatial fluctuations no longer blocked Lin Yuan’s vision.","He realized that the evolved Ethereal Jellyfish’s appearance had changed drastically. Its tentacles used to only be around 30 centimeters, but now, it was about 1.5 meters. Its umbrella had also changed and was no longer red.","Instead, the translucent red had become bright silver. It was as though fresh blood and silvery water fused.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles also became thicker. The three tentacles were now as thick as Lin Yuan’s wrist when they were combined.","Moreover, another main tentacle also grew out after the Ethereal Jellyfish evolved. It was thick and looked to be covered in a light layer of scales.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s original tentacles were like limbs, but this new main tentacle that was almost as thick as Lin Yuan’s thigh was like the main body.","Lin Yuan was shocked as he observed these changes in the Ethereal Jellyfish.","It was because he sensed a clear and crisp thought enter his mind. This clear and crisp thought sounded familiar yet foreign.","When Lin Yuan recovered from the shock, he realized that the Ethereal Jellyfish was greeting him.","Hence, he started to communicate with the Ethereal Jellyfish in his mind.","Lin Yuan realized that the evolved Ethereal Jellyfish did not have any speech production organ and could not communicate with him directly.","However, it was now completely capable of communicating with him through his mind.","Lin Yuan sensed the Ethereal Jellyfish’s precious thoughts.","“Master, look at this main tentacle of mine and see how much more amazing it is as compared to my other three tentacles!”","Lin Yuan touched the Ethereal Jellyfish’s cap and realized that it was even more pleasant to the touch than before. It was now even silkier and bouncier.","Lin Yuan could not help but think,? I think it’ll be super comfortable to hug the Ethereal Jellyfish to sleep!","The Ethereal Jellyfish sensed Lin Yuan’s thoughts and immediately jumped about to indicate that Lin Yuan could hug it to sleep that night.","When Lin Yuan sensed the Ethereal Jellyfish’s thoughts, he started to cough violently.","He immediately realized that he had not given the Ethereal Jellyfish a name because it lacked wisdom. Now that the Ethereal Jellyfish had gained wisdom, he felt that it was time to name it.","Lin Yuan was very confident when it came to his naming skills.","After a moment of contemplation, he said to the Ethereal Jellyfish, “Ethereal Jellyfish, how about I call you Spacie?”","The Ethereal Jellyfish started waving its antennae joyfully when it heard its new name. It traveled through several dimensions before returning to its original spot.","Lin Yuan smiled at the energetic Ethereal Jellyfish and used True Data to check its attributes.","[Fey Name]: Ethereal Jellyfish","[Fey Species]: Ulmaridae/Floating Jellyfish","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Spatial","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Tentacle Node]: By breaking its tentacles, the broken tentacles are treated as a spatial node.","[Node Teleportation]: By sensing a spatial node, it will transport targets toward a certain spatial node.","[Node Activation]: The spatial teleportation marked by the Tentacle Node will be activated, and the target of the activated node will be teleported to other Tentacle Nodes or toward itself. Tentacle Node will be invalidated after the teleportation.","[Dissociate Catch]: When the Ethereal Jellyfish is traveling through various dimensions, it can catch some of the spatial energy in the different dimensions and condense them into spatial crystals.","[Main Tentacle]: A main tentacle will grow from the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body. When a large amount of spatial energy is supplied to the main tentacle, it will fall off. The fallen main tentacle can create a Space Tunnel anywhere that connects to the Ethereal Jellyfish’s location.","[Spatial Shift]: The energy in a specified area can be rounded up. When the Ethereal Jellyfish lights up and goes to another dimension, the energy from the specified area can be brought to the other dimension.","Exclusive Skill:","[Space Tunnel]: Break off a large number of tentacles or fuse the tentacles with spatial spiritual materials in the space to form a special long-distance space passageway. When there are three long-distance space passageways, one of them has to be removed before being able to set up a new one.","Lin Yuan was not surprised by the level that the Ethereal Jellyfish had attained.","He knew early on that the Moon Empress’s spirit fluid would evolve the Ethereal Jellyfish to Diamond X/Legend.","But when he saw the three new abilities on True Data, Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched slightly.","After the temporary shock passed, Lin Yuan’s thoughts started to go wild.","The Gold Dissociate Catch allowed the Ethereal Jellyfish to condense the spatial energy from different dimensions into spatial crystals.","Lin Yuan felt a bit conflicted about this ability.","Dissociate Catch did not have any combat purposes. It could only be used as a form of production.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s Space Tunnel used a large amount of spatial energy when it was used, and now the spatial crystals from Dissociate Catch could replenish the depleted spatial energy.","But to anyone else, gaining a production-type ability like Dissociate Catch that could produce highly valuable spatial crystals would be like hitting the jackpot.","If the Space Tunnel was not used, the spatial crystals could be sold for a more than tidy sum.","But to Lin Yuan, the last thing he needed was more resources.","Although spatial spiritual ingredients were even rarer than spiritual-type spiritual ingredients, as long as Lin Yuan was willing to put in the effort to source for them, he could obtain them from the fan club or the Condense Fairy Orchard’s connections.","However, Dissociate Catch was not completely useless.","At the very least, Lin Yuan could use the Space Tunnel without fear of the depletion of spatial spiritual ingredients. This would save Lin Yuan a lot of trouble as he would not need to collect spatial spiritual ingredients himself."]},{"number":745,"title":"Chapter 745 - Lin Yuans Absolute Defense","paragraphs":["However, the time it took for the Ethereal Jellyfish to produce one spatial crystal was still a mystery to Lin Yuan.","Now that he could communicate with the Ethereal Jellyfish, Lin Yuan did not need to experiment anymore.","Lin Yuan asked the Ethereal Jellyfish, “Spacie, how long does it take for Dissociate Catch to produce one spatial crystal?”","The Ethereal Jellyfish immediately replied through Lin Yuan’s mind, “It takes about 15 hours for me to condense one spatial crystal.”","When the Ethereal Jellyfish was communicating, it lit up with a blinding silvery red light. The Ethereal Jellyfish waved its tentacles around and carefully sensed itself before saying, “One of my tentacles is in a very, very far place. It’ll take two spatial crystals just to get to that place through the Space Tunnel.”","Lin Yuan immediately knew that Spacie was sensing the tentacle that Mystic Moon had left in the Divine Wood Federation.","According to the Ethereal Jellyfish’s estimation, it would take four spatial crystals for him to make a round trip to the Divine Wood Federation.","It also meant that it would take the Ethereal Jellyfish 60 hours to condense the required spatial crystals.","Even with the added effect of the Space Tunnel’s ability to replenish spatial energy, Lin Yuan would need to prepare many extra spatial spiritual ingredients for one trip. Otherwise, he would need to stay at the Divine Wood Federation for two days.","When Lin Yuan understood the strength of Dissociate Catch, he decided never to keep the Ethereal Jellyfish in the Spirit Lock spatial zone or spiritual spatial zone anymore. Instead, he would keep it in the mansion, where it would continuously produce spatial crystals.","Next, Lin Yuan went on to check the Main Tentacle ability.","When he saw Main Tentacle’s description on True Data, he learned what it could do.","He understood Main Tentacle as an emergency Space Tunnel that was not restricted by distance.","When this emergency Space Tunnel was opened, it would continuously deplete the spatial energy in the main tentacle. Once all the spatial energy in the spatial tunnel was used up, the emergency Space Tunnel would disappear.","Although the Space Tunnel created using the main tentacle was only temporary, unlike the permanent Space Tunnel that was created using three of the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles, it could still be kept open for a long time if many spatial crystals were tossed in.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s Space Tunnel had a distance limitation. The Divine Wood Federation, which was the nearest to the Radiance Federation, was basically the maximum distance.","However, the Space Tunnel created using the main tentacle did not have a distance restriction. The only requirement was that the main tentacle had to have sufficient spatial energy in order to keep the tunnel open for as long as possible.","Lin Yuan felt that Main Tentacle was a special ability. If Wen Yu had not already contracted the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan would have thought of Main Tentacle as a useless ability.","Now that Lin Yuan knew about the Astronomical Parliament’s ability, Main Tentacle could definitely be counted as a strategic-class ability.","Through the Astronomical Parliament’s Star Spirit Seat, Lin Yuan could use laws to send main tentacles to Bei Xu or Yin Lin. Then, he would be able to use the main tentacles to open up Space Tunnels to new worlds.","Unfortunately, his communication with the Ethereal Jellyfish allowed him to learn that it would take a long time for the Ethereal Jellyfish to fully grow a main tentacle.","For the time being, he would not be able to open Space Tunnels using this method.","To Lin Yuan, every fully grown main tentacle was like a key that could open doors to new worlds.","Strategy was always more important than mere force.","As for Spatial Shift, Lin Yuan felt that it was an ability that could provide absolute defense against elemental attacks.","Spatial Shift could move a designated area’s elements to other dimensions.","When Lin Yuan encountered elemental attacks in the future, he could use Spatial Shift to transfer the elemental attack somewhere else.","With Spatial Shift, Lin Yuan’s already strong defense was even more complete now.","The Source Sand could withstand physical and elemental attacks, but it was better at defending against the former.","But now, this deficiency was made up for by Spatial Shift.","What’s more, Genius’ Spiritual Energy Expansion could defend against spiritual attacks.","Lin Yuan now felt like an invincible cockroach.","Along with the Spirit-Drawing Ichthyosaur’s Spirit Essence Explosion, the sea of spirit qi in the Spirit Qi Imprint, and the enormous amount of vitality in the Vitality Imprint, Lin Yuan felt that he had essentially become a fey.","Lin Yuan could not help but feel excited when he looked at the Diamond X/Legend Ethereal Jellyfish.","He did not know when the Ethereal Jellyfish would be able to naturally comprehend a Willpower Rune and evolve to Fantasy Breed.","Once the Ethereal Jellyfish comprehended a Willpower Rune, it would have the right to evolve to Suzerain and experience the World Cleansing to become a Myth Breed fey.","Out of all of Lin Yuan’s feys, the Ethereal Jellyfish had the highest grade now.","He opened a window to let the Ethereal Jellyfish out into the mansion, where it could freely produce spatial crystals, and he then returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After the grade roll, Lin Yuan’s cells felt like they were bursting with boundless energy.","Lin Yuan did not need to rest while he was in this state, so he hitched up his sleeves and started evolving feys.","An unknown amount of time passed as he worked.","When Lin Yuan finally checked the time, he realized that he had been working for over 30 hours.","He had finished evolving all the feys Sun Ningxiang, and the Sea Bliss Clan had sent to him.","Meanwhile, he had evolved a gestating Angelfish of Bliss to Bronze/Legend without using any spirit qi crystals and injected a large amount of spirit qi into its eggs."]},{"number":746,"title":"Chapter 746 - Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage.","paragraphs":["The fish eggs were strengthened by the pure spirit qi, causing the Angelfish of Bliss’ abdomen to become much larger.","Once the Sea Bliss Clan got their hands on this Angelfish of Bliss, they would treat it like their most valuable treasure.","But without Lin Yuan’s supply of pure spirit qi, it would not be able to give birth to offspring like it normally would.","Lin Yuan’s hard work had accomplished two weeks’ worth of workload. He felt extremely relaxed as he looked at the evolved feys.","However, he did not plan on sending them out. Instead, he would send them out slowly in batches as per the agreement.","If he sent so many feys at once, it would be too shocking.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to leave the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he heard a soft noise. He noticed that the feathers on the outer layer of Gray’s egg had lost all color, revealing the inner layer with Gray’s white feathers with golden patterns.","After he went over to check, he ascertained that Gray would hatch within a month.","Lin Yuan sliced open his palm and allowed the blood to drip on Gray’s egg to strengthen the bloodline connection between him and Gray.","Next, he fed a heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearl to the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope before leaving the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After he left the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he saw that Zhang Xiaobai and Gao Feng had called him during the 30 hours that he had been working.","Lin Yuan called Zhang Xiaobai back first.","On the other end of the call, Zhang Xiaobai rattled off, “Lin Yuan, let me tell you about this restaurant I found called House of Enviable Fragrance. Although it’s a buffet restaurant, it has all kinds of meat.”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched at Zhang Xiaobai’s words.","When Lin Yuan had accompanied Zhang Xiaobai to a restaurant and had seen him eat a few sticks of grilled lamb, it made Lin Yuan’s mouth water.","But one bite into the grilled lamb and the musky scent had almost caused him to faint on the spot.","His palate was not light, and he ate a lot of red braised meat.","However, he could not stand the intense muskiness.","Just before Lin Yuan replied, Zhang Xiaobai cried out in pain, and Xin Ying’s voice rang out, “Why are you telling Lin Yuan about the meat? You almost made him vomit last time. No one else eats that kind of meat besides you.”","Zhang Xiaobai wailed, “I eat it for you!”","Soon, Lin Yuan heard two or three more yelps of pain from Zhang Xiaobai.","Apparently, Xin Ying had hit Zhang Xiaobai several times.","A moment later, he heard Zhang Xiaobai say in a pained voice, “Lin Yuan, we’ve settled all the issues with our contracts with the Extreme Guild Club. We’re free now and will be going to the mansion to see you soon.”","Lin Yuan’s face split into a bright smile.","He had been contacting Zhang Xiaobai and the rest often, and the four of them had even been to the mansion twice.","Now that the four of them were truly free, they could join his Dome Guild Club.","The base of Dome Guild Club was the area behind the Return from Faraway Mansion. Hu Quan had finished building Dome Guild Club’s building, but the interior had not been set up.","When the four of them came, and after it was decorated, they could stay there.","“Yes, come over. I’ll greet you at the entrance.”","Lin Yuan was about to end the call when he heard Zhang Xiaobai say mysteriously, “When we get there, we have something good to show you.”","After he hung up the call, Lin Yuan could not help but be puzzled. He had no clue what the mysterious thing was.","However, he did not dwell on it as they would be here soon. He would be able to ask them then.","Now, Lin Yuan called Gao Feng.","A moment later, when Lin Yuan was about to give up on the call, Gao Feng picked it.","Lin Yuan realized that Gao Feng spoke to him like someone who had been caught red-handed by their mother.","Lin Yuan asked softly, “Are you with your family?”","Gao Feng made a soft noise of acknowledgment and replied softly, “Give me five minutes.”","The call was promptly hung up.","Five minutes later, Gao Feng called Lin Yuan back.","Lin Yuan had just picked up the call when he heard Gao Feng sigh and say, “I came to the Royal Capital and wanted to have some fun with you. However, my parents have me attending an endless string of parties to get to know some useless people. They won’t give me any free time at all.”","When he heard Gao Feng’s tone, Lin Yuan knew that Gao Feng felt depressed.","“Everyone who comes to the Royal Capital now should be coming to the Guard Ye Banquet, right?” asked Lin Yuan.","Gao Feng’s eyes lit up, and he thought of the mountain of Creation Master resources in Lin Yuan’s possession. “Yes. Are you going to be at the Guard Ye Banquet too?”","Lin Yuan replied honestly, “Yes. Since you’re going to be busy attending parties with your family, we can meet ten days later at the Guard Ye Banquet. I’ve finished evolving the spotted coral jade.”","A look of joy spread across Gao Feng’s face, but a thought seemed to strike him, and his expression fell again.","“Brother, there will be three stages to the Guard Ye Banquet—the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage. I’m not a Creation Master, so my father told me to participate in the Martial Stage. As a support-class spirit qi professional, I’m going to get badly beaten up. I don’t know what my father is thinking! It’s bad enough that he made me enter the Radiance Hundred Sequence exam, but how can he force me to join the Martial Stage too?”","Lin Yuan was slightly confused by what Gao Feng had said.","He had not heard about these three Stages from the Moon Empress.","Hence, he asked in confusion, “Gao Feng, what are the three Stages about?”"]},{"number":747,"title":"Chapter 747 - Deciding the Champion of the Martial Arts Stage","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Gao Feng was stunned by Lin Yuan’s words. He was completely taken aback by Lin Yuan’s lack of knowledge about how the Guard Ye Banquet was going to proceed.","The elite and top veteran factions had already received the information about the Guard Ye Banquet two weeks ago.","The major factions were in a frenzy over the Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage.","There would be many high-priority personalities at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Although Chief Guard Ye had accepted a disciple, other important people had not. Even the important people who already had disciples could also accept more.","The Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage were opportunities for the main members of the top factions to show off their skills.","Yet, Lin Yuan had no clue.","Hence, Gao Feng started to explain in detail.","“The Arts Stage is a chance for the disciples to display their Creation Master abilities, while the Martial Stage is meant to test spirit qi professionals’ powers. However, the better disciples are both spirit qi professionals and Creation Masters. Thus, the Martial Arts Stage is the place for them to showcase their skills. I heard that this time, as long as the participant can remain standing on the stage until the end of the Guard Ye Banquet, they’ll earn an extremely precious treasure. There’s even a rumor that the prize for the champion of the Martial Arts Stage is a sacred source lifeform.”","At this point, Gao Feng was practically salivating. Not even top factions could get their hands on sacred source lifeforms easily.","The Gao family did have a sacred source lifeform, but it was in the hands of Gao Feng’s grandfather, the Gao family’s strongest force.","When Lin Yuan heard about the sacred source lifeform, he inhaled sharply.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie all had sacred source lifeforms.","Chu Ci was still too young, but when she reached 18, she would be able to contract the sacred source lifeform that Cold Moon would have prepared for her.","However, now that Lin Yuan understood how strong sacred source lifeforms were, he knew that every one of them was a unique treasure.","Lin Yuan still had a sacred source lifeform that had not been contracted. This sacred source lifeform was being saved for the Mother of Bloodbath.","Endless Summer now had double tree cores and had the possibility of evolving to Creation Breed. If it was possible, Lin Yuan wanted to prepare a sacred source lifeform for Endless Summer.","Endless Summer was a real member of Lin Yuan’s family, and sacred source lifeforms had an abundance of different abilities.","If the sacred source lifeform’s ability was inclined toward combat, it would greatly boost Endless Summer’s strength and Sky City’s power over the external world.","Even if the sacred source lifeform that Endless Summer contracted had a similar skill set to Wen Yu, it would still be able to contribute to Sky City’s power.","Lin Yuan immediately started aiming for the Martial Arts Stage championship. If he could become the champion, he would gain a sacred source lifeform.","Although Gao Feng had said that this prize was just a rumor, a rumor spread by top factions was likely to be true. Even if it really turned out to be a rumor, the prize would still be impressive.","Gao Feng sighed. “No matter what the prize is, it has nothing to do with me. I only hope that I won’t lose too badly on the Martial Stage!”","Gao Feng’s voice sounded genuinely sullen.","However, Gao Feng never thought that there was something wrong with the feys that he had contracted. In fact, Gao Feng felt that his combat system had become much stronger ever since the Yellow Spring Lily evolved to Gold X/Fantasy II.","When the Yellow Spring Lily evolved to Platinum/Fantasy, Gao Feng would be able to fight for the chance to join an A-level guild club’s main team.","Gao Feng was excited by the S Tournament matches that he had been watching over the last few days. After the Radiance Hundred Sequence exam, he intended to contact several A-level guild clubs to ask if their main team had any open spots.","Given that Gao Feng was the only descendent of an elite faction, he had the airs of an upper class. He was definitely not willing to be a reserve team member of an A-level guild club.","Lin Yuan did not know how to comfort Gao Feng. The latter had told Lin Yuan about his feys’ compatibility and grades. Although Gao Feng’s feys were all high-grade, they lacked attacking power and could not even compete in the Celestial Stairway.","As he pondered over the Martial Arts Stage, Lin Yuan asked Gao Feng, “What are the stipulations of the Martial Arts Stage’s challenge?”","Gao Feng was silent for a second before replying, “All three stages test true power and skills. The Martial Stage and Martial Arts Stage will be in the form of fights. But the Arts Stage and Martial Arts Stage will not be so straightforward. Apparently, the competition settings were decided by the Moon Empress, Chef Supreme, and Bamboo Monarch. It should be really thrilling.”","Gao Feng sounded like he was just repeating what had already been said.","As Lin Yuan listened to what Gao Feng said, he assessed his own ability.","Lin Yuan was weaker than other Creation Masters when it came to evolving fey grades.","Now that Lin Yuan had evolved to a B-rank spirit qi professional, he could use his own spirit qi and inject it into feys to evolve them to Gold.","Lin Yuan felt that this level of grade evolution was the level of a Class 3 Creation Master. As for the ability to evolve grades and use pure spirit qi to transform feys, Class 3 Creation Masters could not even hope to compete with him.","He would even go as far as to say that not even the three Class 5 Creation Masters could compete with him when it came to using pure spirit qi to transform feys. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have had the chance to meet Liu Jie.","When it came to fights, the strongest attacking power he had came from the Jasmine Lily’s reverse-healing and Spirit Essence Explosion, which Lin Yuan had not had the chance to use much yet.","As for defense, if Lin Yuan did not use the Source Sand, his spiritual and elemental defense had reached a relatively high level.","The sea of spiritual energy in Genius’ brain could further improve his level.","Lin Yuan felt that even if Diamond/Fantasy feys that were adept at spiritual attacks attacked him, they would take a severe hit themselves instead.","As for elemental attacks, they would not be able to get close to Lin Yuan at all because they would be immediately transferred to another dimension by the Ethereal Jellyfish."]},{"number":748,"title":"Chapter 748 - Lin Yuans True Strength","paragraphs":["For some reason, Lin Yuan suddenly thought about how he had kept his identity as Black secret for some time.","It was not that he did not want to reveal his identity as Black.","If Lin Yuan revealed his identity as Black, which was a combat-class spirit qi professional, he would be able to use a wider variety of techniques when he used Chimey, the Source Sand, Red Thorn, and the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee.","However, the damage would not be comparable to the Jasmine Lily’s healing abilities.","Hence, Lin Yuan felt that there was no need to reveal Black.","If the Martial Arts Stage prize was really a sacred source lifeform, Lin Yuan was resolved to win even if he had to use the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Blade of Sacred Sword.","After he hung up the call with Gao Feng, Lin Yuan could not help but look forward to the Guard Ye Banquet.","However, Lin Yuan could imagine the stiff competition he would face given that the rest of the participants were the disciples of bigshots and the younger generation of the main teams of major factions.","Although Lin Yuan was already very strong, it had been less than a year since Lin Yuan had become a spirit qi professional.","Lin Yuan knew that the Moon Empress was extremely headstrong, and the Guard Ye Banquet would be the first time that they would be declaring their relationship.","Given his understanding of his Master, the Moon Empress definitely wanted him to shine at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Lin Yuan always knew where he excelled at.","Compared to the disciples of bigshots, Lin Yuan’s fey compatibility was not exceptional.","The other disciples could also have formed contracts with sacred source lifeforms.","As compared to other sacred source lifeforms, his sacred source lifeform was the fusion of two sacred source lifeforms. It was undeniably stronger than singular sacred source lifeforms.","In order for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to use the Blade of Sacred Sword to its maximum potential, Lin Yuan had to feed more laws and willpower to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt over the next ten days.","At this thought, Lin Yuan’s lip curled upwards.","There were now three complete laws on the skirt. The Icy Flames Law was still a step away from Myth III, but the Dead Dream Law and Dark Death Law had reached Myth III.","Lin Yuan had been working hard continuously recently, leading him to have collected a large pile of Law Source Crystals. He had not had the chance to use them yet.","Since the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt could inject the energy from inside the Law Source Crystals into any complete laws, a crazy plan hatched in Lin Yuan’s mind.","Although both Myth III laws were dark-type laws, the Dead Dream Law was much deadlier. Thus, Lin Yuan wanted to test to see if he could use the Law Source Crystals to evolve the Dark Death Law to a Creation Breed fey’s law level in the next ten days.","This would enable the Dark Death Law to create a dark world of death.","This was the only way that Lin Yuan could fight for the Martial Arts Stage’s championship.","Lin Yuan checked the time and realized that his call with Gao Feng had lasted half an hour. He suspected that Gao Feng was actually poisoning him, which resulted in every call with him lasting more than half an hour.","Lin Yuan hurriedly went downstairs to greet Zhang Xiaobai, Tan Ran, Xin Ying, and Lu Pinru.","When he arrived downstairs, he saw Master Hong Shen sitting on the water rhinoceros leather sofa, looking happily at the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp.","Master Hong Shen had clearly just showered and was in one of his rare clean states; even his beard was very tidy.","Lin Yuan could not help but be curious.","Master Hong Shen rose to his feet when he saw Lin Yuan. He chuckled before saying proudly, “Young Master, I’m done evolving the Sunlight King Lotus. I also instructed the Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen under Hu Quan on how to arrange the lotus roots at the bottom of the lake. Additionally, I used spirit qi to direct the Sunlight King Lotus’ roots to grow toward the basement.”","At that moment, a look of worry came over Master Hong Shen’s face.","“The Sunlight King Lotus’ roots need a lot of pure spirit qi. If we want the roots to extend past 1,000 meters, we’ll need more than 200 bottles of Grade 4 spirit fluid. If the pure spirit qi is concentrated, the ends of the roots will be too thin and will be insufficient to provide light to the young Sunlight King Lotuses.","“I’ve already settled the issue of the concentrated pure spirit qi that the Sunlight King Lotus needs. When the basement is finished, the roots will be able to connect. Don’t worry. Young Master, I’ve already prepared several sets of Creation Master instruments needed for the basement using the two brocade boxes of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls that you gave me. When the basement is completed, I’ll immediately start nurturing many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.”","Master Hong Shen rubbed his hands together as he spoke, as though he was full of excited anticipation.","Lin Yuan remembered that Zhang Xiaobai and the rest were arriving soon and said to Master Hong Shen, “Master Hong Shen, Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Lu Pingru, and Tan Ran will be here soon. From today onward, they’ll be the reserve team members of the Dome Guild Club. Please help them to evolve their feys if you’re free.”","Master Hong Shen nodded happily and said, “Since you asked, I’ll definitely do my best.”","While he spoke, Master Hong Shen could not help but acknowledge Zhang Xiaobai, Tan Ran, Lu Pinru, and Xin Ying’s luck to have a friend like Lin Yuan.","Master Hong Shen was well aware of the financial situation of Zhang Xiaobai’s group. Their previous main source of income came from collecting spiritual ingredients for Master Hong Shen.","A large amount of valuable spiritual ingredients and Creation Master resources were necessary to evolve feys.","Even if he evolved their feys for free and did not charge them for his labor, they could not afford the high-grade spiritual ingredients required to concoct the spirit fluids. If they could afford the high-grade spiritual ingredients, they would have achieved a higher level than they were currently at.","By asking Master Hong Shen to evolve their feys, it was clear that Lin Yuan did not want them to have to source for the spiritual ingredients themselves.","With Lin Yuan’s provision of resources, Master Hong Shen felt that Zhang Xiaobai and the rest could consider their struggles to be over.","Their journey was going to be smooth sailing from now on."]},{"number":749,"title":"Chapter 749 - Similar Fantasy Breeds","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan’s one statement allowed Master Hong Shen to understand Lin Yuan’s attitude toward his friends.","It was rare for the leader of a faction to have such sincere sentiment.","Master Hong Shen had joined this faction by coincidence, so this made him feel that he was lucky to be in his position.","When Master Hong Shen saw Lin Yuan walking out, he dashed up to him and said, “Young Master, I’ll go with you to greet the four of them. Let them stay with me for a while. I’ll do my best to finish nurturing their feys before the basement’s construction is completed.”","Lin Yuan and Master Hong Shen arrived at the entrance of the mansion. In less than two minutes, they spotted Zhang Xiaobai and the rest.","Zhang Xiaobai and the rest had been to the mansion before and had already been dumbfounded by the splendor.","This time, they were no longer completely floored by the decor.","But the last time they had come, Lin Yuan had not instructed Hu Quan to begin the construction on Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","When they looked in the direction of the man-made lake, they realized that it had changed vastly.","Zhang Xiaobai jumped down from the avian fey and was about to run to Lin Yuan to envelop him in a bear hug.","When Lin Yuan saw Zhang Xiaobai barrelling toward him with a bag of roasted meat, he quickly dodged. If he allowed himself to be hugged by Zhang Xiaobai, the bag of roast meat would knock into him and leave a large oily stain on his back.","After Lin Yuan dodged Zhang Xiaobai, he asked, “Did the Extreme Guild Club try to make things difficult for you when you terminated your contracts?”","Zhang Xiaobai’s expression turned furious as he replied, “When the Extreme Guild Club saw that Xin Ying, Lu Pingru, and Tan Ran were awake, they suddenly didn’t want to let them go. Luckily, I had the good sense to process the termination in advance, which the leader had already agreed to. All we needed was for the three of them to confirm their consent. Otherwise, they would be forced to stay in the Extreme Guild club until after the winter season, causing them to miss the transfer period. They wouldn’t have been able to join the Dome Guild Club this year.”","While Zhang Xiaobai was speaking, Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran’s expressions turned extremely sour. It was clear that they could not be more disappointed by the Extreme Guild Club’s actions.","Although Tan Ran was already 22 years old, he had a young face. He might not be able to pass off as 13 or 14 years old, but he was still considered a very cute boy.","Tan Ran stepped toward Lin Yuan and asked, “Lin Yuan, where’s the cat, Genius?”","Tan Ran subtly rubbed his fingers together, and Lin Yuan knew that he wanted to caress Genius.","Recently, Genius had been staying in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to concoct spirit fluids. It had been working hard for a long time.","At Tan Ran’s mention of Genius, Lin Yuan summoned Genius out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Genius had a fairly good relationship with Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran, so it immediately greeted them in a child-like voice when it saw the four of them.","Genius’ appearance made the four of their eyes twinkle.","The four of them immediately knew that Genius had evolved when they saw its five voluminous tails.","Zhang Xiaobai went forward to hug Genius, but Genius deftly avoided him. It stared at the bag of roast meat in Zhang Xiaobai’s hand in derision and jumped into Tan Ran’s open arms.","Tan Ran started to lightly massage Genius, making Genius purr in comfort.","It seemed like Genius had Tan Ran wrapped around its paws.","Tan Ran had learned how to caress cats from the Lava Hippopotamus and Silver Gluttony Hippopotamus.","As the group moved into the house, Zhang Xiaobai asked Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, where’s the Mother of Bloodbath?”","The moment Zhang Xiaobai asked that question, the Mother of Bloodbath appeared on the staircase.","Lin Yuan’s hand flew to his forehead.","Zhang Xiaobai and the Mother of Bloodbath had become feasting buddies. Although the Mother of Bloodbath did not eat some of the kinds of meat that Zhang Xiaobai brought, it enjoyed the other kinds he had.","Thus, Zhang Xiaobai always brought a bag of strange meat for the Mother of Bloodbath.","The group sat down and chatted for a while before Lin Yuan asked Zhang Xiaobai, “What is the good thing that you said you wanted to show me?”","Zhang Xiaobai exchanged looks with Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran. The four of them circulated their spiritual energy, and Lin Yuan saw four Willpower Runes shooting out of their spiritual energy.","Naturally, Lin Yuan was overjoyed for them to have comprehended Willpower Runes.","These four Willpower Runes were truly good things.","With these four Willpower Runes, they would be able to have a Fantasy Breed fey each at this year’s S Tournament.","This was a huge advantage for the Dome Guild Club.","When he saw the four Willpower Runes, surprise bloomed on Lin Yuan’s face because he noticed that they were all very similar. The minute differences were insignificant.","They were all hope willpowers that appeared in stressful environments.","It was not just Lin Yuan who was shocked. Even Master Hong Shen and the Mother of Bloodbath’s eyes widened as well.","Every Fantasy Breed fey was unique because of Willpower Runes. But now that Zhang Xiaobai and the rest had comprehended four similar Willpower Runes, if they were fused with the same fey, it would lead to four extremely similar Fantasy Breed feys.","The guards in Radiance Federation, the Guild Alliance, and Spirit Guards all had standard feys.","Standard feys all had standard abilities. Although they were not strong on their own, the standard feys could work together effectively.","For example, the Hot Spring Slugs that the Indigo Azure Guards tasked Lin Yuan with evolving could combine with each other.","During the combination process, they could share their injuries and magnify their healing abilities.","The Guild Alliance’s standard fey was the Plum Rain Wall Clam that could stack Plum Rain Walls. The Plum Rain Walls from two Plum Rain Wall Clams were undeniably stronger than that of just one Plum Rain Wall Clam.","However, these standard feys’ collaboration only applied before the Fantasy Breed quality.","When they evolved past Fantasy Breed, they would transform into utterly different beings.. Not only would they be unable to work together like before, but their abilities could also be affected."]},{"number":750,"title":"Chapter 750 - The Second Source Seed","paragraphs":["This was why the Indigo Azure Guards and Guild Alliance’s experts’ standard feys never evolved past Fantasy Breed.","It was just like the emergency helper with the Plum Rain Wall Clam that had intervened in the fight between Lin Yuan and Meng Xu.","If Zhang Xiaobai and the rest had comprehended different Willpower Runes, Lin Yuan could evolve the feys that would be best suited to their Willpower Runes.","However, now that their Willpower Runes were so similar, Lin Yuan felt that these Willpower Runes that had been comprehended in a particular mental state should not be wasted.","Zhang Xiaobai and the rest probably did not realize the significance of them comprehending such similar Willpower Runes, but Lin Yuan and Master Hong Shen, who were Creation Masters, were well aware.","Lin Yuan looked at Master Hong Shen and asked, “Master Hong Shen, what fey do you think is suited to the Willpower Runes that they’ve comprehended?”","Master Hong Shen immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant.","It could be said that Master Hong Shen had watched Zhang Xiaobai and the rest grow up, so he had a complete understanding of their feys and feys’ compatibility.","Zhang Xiaobai had contracted the Gale Mussel and Bloody Leech.","The Gale Mussel was a normal source-type lifeform that leaned toward defense, making Zhang Xiaobai’s inclination to be toward defense-type insect-species feys.","All of Lu Pinru’s feys were the Glowing Silkworm Weaver. Hence, she was compatible with support-type insect-species feys.","Xin Ying was compatible with power offense-type cat-species feys, while Tan Ran was partial to power offense-type hippopotamus-species feys.","Out of the four of them, only Zhang Xiaobai and Lu Pinru’s fey compatibility were similar since both were compatible with insect-species feys","However, their insect-species feys had two totally different directions where one was support-type, and the other was defense-type.","According to Lin Yuan’s plan, he did not have any fey that could satisfy all four of them.","Thus, he could not choose feys.","As such, Master Hong Shen placed his sights on source-type lifeforms.","Master Hong Shen said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, I’m sure that we won’t be able to find any feys that are suited to all four of them. Although there might be some lifestyle-class feys that they could all form contracts with, lifestyle-class feys don’t have much combat power once they evolve to Fantasy Breed. I think that we should choose from source-type lifeforms.”","Lin Yuan nodded in agreement. He did not expect his thinking to coincide with that of Master Hong Shen.","When Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up at the thought of a type of source-type lifeform, he heard Master Hong Shen say, “There’s a type of source-type lifeform known as Source Seeds. I discovered three in a previous dimensional rift. Unfortunately, they were too weak, and I’ve never heard of them being discovered in any other dimensional rifts.”","Lin Yuan was shocked by Master Hong Shen’s lamenting. He did not understand why Master Hong Shen would talk about Source Seeds in this manner all of a sudden.","However, Lin Yuan felt that disparaging Source Seeds was like disparaging Red Thorn because Red Thorn had evolved from a Source Seed.","Red Thorn’s situation was the production of Source Seeds’ potential and Lin Yuan’s decision-making.","He did not think that Red Thorn was weak. Rather, he felt that Red Thorn was unbelievably strong!","The Silver/Fantasy Red Thorn could securely defend against a Class 1 dimensional rift on its own. Even if more Class 1 dimensional rifts opened and dimensional lifeforms spewed out, they would all be nothing but fertilizer for Red Thorn.","Besides Red Thorn, Lin Yuan had never heard of any other Silver/Fantasy fey in Radiance Federation that could deal with a sea of insects from a dimensional rift on its own.","No matter how strong other Silver/Fantasy feys were, they would eventually be overwhelmed by the continuous insect waves.","Moreover, the gill-shaped flower petals that mutated from Red Thorn could handle not just land combat now. It could now also take on oceanic combat.","Along with the enduring power from Red Thorn’s Eyes of Relinquish and the Spore Growth that could expand tools, Red Thorn could quickly expand its position and sustain the battle for longer.","How could a lifeform like this be considered weak?","However, Lin Yuan would not take the initiative to say that Red Thorn had been evolved from a Source Seed.","Ever since Lin Yuan had come into possession of a mountain of resources, he had intentionally announced on Star Web’s Rare Lifeform Pavilion that he wanted to buy Source Seeds.","Lin Yuan had offered a very high price which would have been more than enough to trade for a fairy source-type lifeform.","Unfortunately, no one had contacted Lin Yuan about it.","This proved that Source Seeds never appeared in the dimensional rift again. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would want to buy and nurture more Source Seeds.","Although Lin Yuan did not know why Master Hong Shen would suddenly call Source Seeds weak, he felt slightly affronted on behalf of Red Thorn.","“If Source Seeds are contracted and nurtured, they can be very strong. After all, there are no weak source-type lifeforms.”","Master Hong Shen touched his beard when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","This was when he remembered that he had trimmed his beard under Wen Yu’s recommendation.","“Young Master, you might be unaware, but I had sought after Source Seeds when I learned that they could grow according to one’s wishes. But after I burned a large hole in my pocket to buy one, I heard that a normal person had managed to nurture one into a vine plant that could carry heavy items.","“Even the most normal source-type lifeforms should be able to do more than carry heavy things after evolving, right?","“If I need something to carry heavy loads, I have buckets of assistants. I don’t need to nurture a source-type lifeform to do it for me. Thus, I temporarily stored the Source Seed away.","“Later on, I heard that a Scholar had researched the vine plant and said that Source Seeds’ evolution ability was not strong. Hence, I gave up on nurturing Source Seeds and tossed the Source Seed into a fey storage box.","“If I hadn’t just been thinking of what source-type lifeforms could be similar, I wouldn’t have thought of trash like Source Seeds.”","When Lin Yuan heard this, he furrowed his brow and hastily asked Master Hong Shen, “Are you still able to find the Source Seed that you bought?”","Master Hong Shen rummaged through the fey storage box.","After some time, a green seed with gray flecks appeared in Master Hong Shen’s hand.","Master Hong Shen quickly wiped the gray flecks of dust off the Source Seed in embarrassment."]},{"number":751,"title":"Chapter 751 - Titan Giant Boa","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Master Hong Shen handed the Source Seed to Lin Yuan and said, “Young Master, if you’re interested in this Source Seed, I’m glad to give it to you. You’re free to study it as you please.”","He had noticed Lin Yuan’s eagerness toward this Source Seed from the moment it was mentioned.","However, Master Hong Shen could not understand why Lin Yuan would be interested in something as useless as the Source Seed.","When Master Hong Shen took out the Source Seed, Lin Yuan’s leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box started acting erratically.","Through the blood contract, Lin Yuan could already sense Red Thorn’s longing for this Source Seed. It seemed to be thirsting to absorb this Source Seed and evolve itself.","Lin Yuan received the Source Seed.","He had initially planned on evolving it into a plant-type fey using his own means.","But since Red Thorn yearned for this Source Seed as much as it did, Lin Yuan gave up on the idea of nurturing the plant-type fey. Instead, he decided to give this faintly glowing Source Seed to Red Thorn to see what changes would occur after consuming the Source Seed.","When Red Thorn sensed this Source Seed, it started to strum its large red gill-shaped flower petals in the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box. It was like a mischievous child that was trying to pester its parent into buying it a toy.","Now that it had Lin Yuan’s promise that the Source Seed would be given to it, Red Thorn stopped moving its flower petals and started to play with the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee.","Red Thorn spat the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee out of the Mouth of Relinquish and swallowed it again playfully.","Lin Yuan turned back to Master Hong Shen and said, “During this active period of the dimensional rift, a few similar source-type lifeforms were discovered in the marsh dimensional rift near Wind Mist City.”","Master Hong Shen’s mouth parted slightly in embarrassment.","Back when his soul had been injured, he would experience random afflictions from his injury. Hence, he had been unable to log into Star Web.","Thus, he might have been a pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master, but he had not been up to date with current affairs.","Although his soul injury was now healed, he still had not cultivated the habit of logging into Star Web to check the news.","He had never heard of this news that several similar source-type lifeforms had been discovered in the marsh dimensional rift near Wind Mist City.","From Master Hong Shen’s lack of reply, Lin Yuan knew that he did not know of the source-type lifeforms that Lin Yuan had spoken of.","To prevent Master Hong Shen from feeling further embarrassment, Lin Yuan went on to say, “10 Titan Giant Boas were discovered in the mash dimensional rift near Wind Mist City. It’s highly possible that more will be found soon.”","Actually, Lin Yuan knew about these Titan Giant Boas not because he was up to date on Radiance Federation news, but because Gao Feng had told him during a call.","During the call, Lin Yuan had not paid much attention to this news.","But now, it seemed that the Titan Giant Boas would be well-suited to Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Tan Ran, and Lu Pinru’s needs.","When Gao Feng had mentioned the Titan Giant Boas, he also talked about how stringent the conditions to contract them were. It needed a large amount of the Medusa Snake Demon’s demon blood and a spirit fluid concocted from the Medusa Snake Demon’s eyes.","The main function of the spirit qi was to prevent the spirit qi professional from becoming petrified.","When the contractor drank the spirit fluid concocted by a Class 4 Creation Master, they needed to combine their own tears with the Medusa Snake Demon’s demon blood.","Under the activation of pure spirit qi, the Titan Giant Boa would be able to break through its shell.","Next, a blood contract and spiritual contract would be used to contract the Titan Giant Boa.","The contractor drank the potion to prevent petrification in order to shield against the Titan Giant Boa’s natural petrification ability.","With so many difficult obstacles, it was no wonder that Gao Feng had been complaining about how difficult it was to contract the Titan Giant Boa.","Firstly, the Medusa Snake Demon was a kind of human being in the marsh dimensional rift that had the power of a Class 6 dimensional lifeform.","Although it had the power of a Class 6 dimensional lifeform that was akin to that of a Diamond fey, it only appeared in Class 4 dimensional rifts.","It was an extremely rare and mysterious dimensional lifeform.","At the same time, numerous high-grade dimensional lifeforms always accompanied the appearance of the Medusa Snake Demon.","After the Medusa Snake Demon died, it would quickly turn into a rock.","Hence, in order to obtain the Medusa Snake Demon’s demon blood, one needed to go through hordes of marsh dimensional lifeforms first.","A Class 4 Creation Master was definitely needed for the Grade 4 potion and pure spirit qi.","It was challenging to find a Class 4 Creation Master in the Radiance Federation.","Wind Mist City was one of the middle-lower class cities amongst the 32 main cities.","But as the highest elite and only elite faction in Wind Mist City, the Gao family sat at the top of the hierarchy in Wind Mist City. Hence, the Gao family had obtained eight of the Titan Giant Boas that were found in the marsh dimensional rift near Wind Mist City.","According to Gao Feng, the Gao family had already hatched three Titan Giant Boas.","All of the Titan Giant Boas had the same Normal ability, Nest of Snakes Share Life.","Nest of Snakes Share Life allowed every Titan Giant Boa in a set area to share the burden of damage received, essentially sharing their lives.","No matter which Titan Giant Boa had been dealt with an injury, as long as it was within range of the other Titan Giant Boas, it would be able to share its recovery and injuries with them.","Gao Feng had also said that the newly born Titan Giant Boa was already at a length of seven meters, while one of the Titan Giant Boas that the Gao family had nurtured to Gold had reached a length of 40 meters.","It truly lived up to its name!","Its large strength was evidence of its high defensive skills.","If Zhang Xiaobai and the rest could really form contracts with the Titan Giant Boas, its original powers to sustain damage would only continue to climb.","Lin Yuan was certain that if Zhang Xiaobai and the rest could contract Titan Giant Boas, which Master Hong Shen would then evolve, no one besides Radiance Hundred Sequence members and A-level guild club members at their peak condition could kill off the four Titan Giant Boas."]},{"number":752,"title":"Chapter 752 - The Rapport of Partner Factions","paragraphs":["The Titan Giant Boa’s enormous size indicated that it relied on its physique as its main method of attack.","Despite its brutish attack technique, it did not lumber around because its eyes also possessed petrification abilities.","The petrification could be counted as a form of elemental damage.","When other lifeforms were petrified, the cursed earth-elemental energy would enter the lifeform to alter and mutate the other elements inside the lifeforms.","The combined effect of the Titan Giant Boa’s enormous size and eyes made it adept at defense and attack.","As a boa-species lifeform, the Titan Giant Boa could also manipulate its body.","The Titan Giant Boa’s ability to manipulate its body could be said to be its strongest method of attack and killing.","If Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Tan Ran, and Lu Pinru entered the S Tournament, any member of the main team would be able to work together with them.","The four Titan Giant Boas’ large bodies could easily defend against physical and elemental damage, generating a solid defense.","Master Hong Shen had never heard of the Titan Giant Boa, so there was no way that he had any understanding of it.","However, he completely trusted Lin Yuan’s judgment.","Given Master Hong Shen’s understanding of Lin Yuan, when the latter mentioned the Titan Giant Boas because he was already anxious to get his hands on them.","Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran sat on the water rhinoceros leather sofa, their eyes slightly damp.","The four of them had shown their Willpower Runes to Lin Yuan because they were just sharing their joy with their friend. Additionally, as future team members, they were also showing their improvement to the rest of the group.","However, they did not expect that after Lin Yuan found out about their Willpower Runes, he would immediately start to ponder over feys that could be suited to them.","Zhang Xiaobai and the rest were already friends that had already defied death alongside Lin Yuan. They were able to trust each other with their lives during such moments.","It could even be said that Lin Yuan was their savior.","If not for Lin Yuan’s Red Thorn, the four of them would likely have died in the fight to protect Millstone Town.","If Lin Yuan had not extended invites to them a few days ago, the four of them would not have been able to gain a new goal and hope atop the mountain, which led them to comprehend the Willpower Runes.","Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran were all people who wore their hearts on their sleeves. They accepted Lin Yuan’s kind gesture. They had already agreed that they would help Lin Yuan with some chores in the Dome Guild Club.","The four of them were veteran participants at the S Tournament.","Although they were always reserve team members, they were well aware of how a guild club was run.","A guild club did not just participate in the S Tournament.","The four of them were confident that they would be able to help Lin Yuan manage the nitty-gritty aspects of the Dome Guild Club.","Lin Yuan picked up his phone and was about to call Gao Feng, but he remembered that he was with his parents. Gao Feng would have to sneak out like a criminal to pick up the call, so Lin Yuan left a message for Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan: Gao Feng, I’m interested in the Titan Giant Boas that you mentioned. Please keep four for me.","After he sent the message, Lin Yuan set down his phone, which rang less than two minutes later.","Lin Yuan checked his phone and realized that Gao Feng had already replied to him.","Gao Feng’s message read:","Gao Feng: No problem. I’ll inform my family tomorrow to save four uncontracted Titan Giant Boas and send them to me. I’ll hand them over to you at the Guard Ye Banquet.","Lin Yuan smiled as he read Gao Feng’s message.","He realized that he had a sort of rapport with Gao Feng.","When Gao Feng was in need of a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman, Lin Yuan would help out Gao Feng without hesitation.","Now that he needed four dimensional lifeforms, he only gave Gao Feng a heads up before Gao Feng agreed without any questions asked.","This demonstrated the deep trust between both of them.","Otherwise, they would not have been able to agree on a million Radiance dollar deal so promptly.","Ever since Lin Yuan and Gao Feng worked together as rising factions, Lin Yuan handled the Creation Master resources while Gao Feng was in charge of the logistics.","Their territories did not cross, but when problems arose and solutions needed to be implemented, Gao Feng would always approach Lin Yuan for discussion.","Lin Yuan felt that he and Gao Feng were great partners that had a very good rapport.","At the thought of Gao Feng’s power and fey compatibility, he felt that he might be able to invite Gao Feng to join his Dome Guild Club.","With Lin Yuan’s understanding of Gao Feng’s fey compatibility, it could be termed as the gospel of positional feys.","If Liu Jie’s Insect Queen, his Red Thorn, and the Source Sand could achieve the support of Gao Feng’s Breeze Hibiscus and Spirit Spring Lily, all of them would be able to produce explosive fighting power.","But Gao Feng’s Yellow Spring Lily also had strong battle significance and could greatly increase its team’s fault tolerance to ensure that the main feys would not be knocked off by the opponent.","Although Lin Yuan’s main team still lacked two main members, his team was already more than capable of producing serious damage.","Lin Yuan was still the healing-type spirit qi professional in the main team and reserve team, while Chu Ci and Zhang Xiaobai were defense-type spirit qi professionals, and Lu Pinru was the support-type spirit qi professional.","Lin Yuan and Chu Ci were definitely going to work toward healing and defense directions, respectively.","As compared to their main roles, both of them were clearly much stronger at attacking.","Zhang Xiaobai and Lu Pinru stuck by their roles.","But when they formed contracts with the Titan Giant Boas, the Dome Guild Club would have brute force as its front.","Given this, the team sorely needed support from Gao Feng.","Initially, Lin Yuan had planned on waiting for the Radiance Hundred Sequence’s exam to bring this matter up with Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan could tell that Gao Feng really wanted to join a guild club to participate in the S Tournament in their recent conversations.","Thus, he decided that he and Liu Jie would ask Gao Feng together at the Guard Ye Banquet. Otherwise, if Gao Feng spoke with other guild clubs and joined them, Lin Yuan would definitely have regrets.","Lin Yuan’s high expectations for teammates made it difficult to find a member like Gao Feng."]},{"number":753,"title":"Chapter 753 - Lu Pinrus Spiritual Transformation","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan chose the Titan Giant Boa for Zhang Xiaobai and the other three not only because it existed in abundance and could be paired with standard feys, but also because of its large size that made it highly compatible with Zhang Xiaobai’s group’s Willpower Runes.","Although no one could guarantee the exclusive skills that a fey would gain after it fused with a Willpower Rune and evolved to Fantasy Breed, Lin Yuan had evolved enough feys to Fantasy Breed to understand fey and Willpower Rune compatibility.","The hope Willpower Runes that Zhang Xiaobai’s group had comprehended while under great stress was slightly similar to the new life one that Lin Yuan had sensed from plants.","Lin Yuan felt that it was likely for this hope Willpower Rune that was comprehended under great stress to result in the fey it fused with to gain revival exclusive skills.","This kind of exclusive skill was suited to feys that fought with brute force rather than by inflicting elemental damage.","Now that he had decided on the fey for Zhang Xiaobai’s group to contract, Lin Yuan said to Master Hong Shen, “Master Hong Shen, there’s still some time to go before the basement’s construction is completed. I’ll handle the Titan Giant Boas. You should spend the next few days evolving Zhang Xiaobai and the rest’s feys to the maximum that they can be evolved to.”","Zhang Xiaobai and the other three’s feys were already at Gold. With Master Hong Shen’s Class 4 Creation Master powers, he should be able to evolve their feys to Legend quality without any issues.","There were still six months before the S Tournament, but the Dome Guild Club was only freshly established.","To enter the S Tournament, they needed to join in the long round-robin competition season that took place right after the S Tournament season.","They could only join the S Tournament’s elimination rounds if they did well in the round-robin competition season.","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Chu Ci did not have the time to waste on the S Tournament’s round-robin competition and elimination rounds.","After training Zhang Xiaobai and the other three, they would be sent to represent the Dome Guild Club at the round-robin competition and elimination rounds.","Master Hong Shen stood up and said firmly to Zhang Xiaobai and the rest, “Let’s go. You can stay with me for now. I haven’t cleaned up the new mansion that I bought, so while I’m helping you to evolve your feys, the four of you can clean up the mansion.”","Master Hong Shen sniffed in derision before adding, “My mansion is really too messy now. I can’t even see where I’m walking.”","He did not feel embarrassed to declare the messy state of his mansion so publicly.","When Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran heard what he said, their eyelids twitched violently.","If even Master Hong Shen was calling it messy, that place had to be nothing short of a sty!","Luckily, the four of them had helped Master Hong Shen clean up his treatment center over the years and were well prepared.","Lu Pinru stood up from the sofa but did not walk over to Master Hong Shen. Instead, she went to Lin Yuan and stared at him for a moment before saying, “Lin Yuan, I really want to thank you for healing my injured soul. Ever since you healed me, my spiritual energy has transformed. It’s now three times more than it was before and is still rising.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes widened to the size of saucers.","Lu Pinru had always been a spirit qi professional with impressive spiritual energy. This was why she could contract so many Glowing Silkworm Weavers.","Lin Yuan quickly racked his brain to come up with a reason for Lu Pinru’s spiritual energy’s transformation. He felt that it had something to do with the blow that her spiritual energy had received when her five senses were stolen as well.","It could be said that her soul getting injured was a blessing in disguise, for it opened the door to such a huge opportunity.","If Lin Yuan had to guess, he did not think that many other people would receive such an opportunity because the combination of having one’s five senses stolen on top of having a soul injury was a grievous attack on one’s spirit.","No one could be certain of the consequences.","If there were even the slightest of missteps, it could result in a severe deterioration of intelligence to the point of becoming a vegetable.","In worst cases, death would follow.","Lu Pinru’s spiritual energy was now three times stronger than what it was before, meaning that she could contract three times the number of Glowing Silkworm Weavers.","Since the various silk clothing was produced by the silk from the Glowing Silkworm Weaver, there would be a quantitative change in the production.","If Lu Pinru could form contracts with more than 10 Glowing Silkworm Weavers, she could easily toss out silk clothes.","The various silk clothing was all consumables. When one was damaged, it could be replaced with a new one.","Moreover, a fey could put on numerous clothes during a fight.","When Lu Pinru was weaker, the defensive abilities of the silk clothes were not noticeable.","But when she became stronger, the support she could provide had a similar defense to 100 of Shi Xu’s Silent Thunder Armored Crocodile’s Rapid Thunder Armor Protection.","As Lin Yuan looked into Lu Pinru’s eyes, he did not immediately pick up on the significance of her resolute gaze.","“Lin Yuan, I’ll be by your side from now on. Even after I pass the eligible age to participate in the S Tournament, I want to remain in the guild club as one of its employees,” said Lu Pingru.","Lin Yuan immediately understood Lu Pinru’s meaning.","A bright smile of resignation blossomed on Lin Yuan’s face, and he stood up to take Lu Pinru’s hand as he lad her to Zhang Xiaobai, Xin Ying, and Tan Ran.","“We solidified our relationship back at Millstone Town. I won’t say much more but let’s do our best at the S Tournament together,” said Lin Yuan to the four of them.","Lu Pinru stretched out his hand to them, just like what they did back at Millstone Town.","This time, the only difference was that Lin Yuan’s palm was not placed on top of theirs but rather supporting their palms from below.","When their five hands were stacked tightly on top of one another, their radiant smiles almost blinded Master Hong Shen.","Their friendship and ambition to work toward their dream drummed up the fighting spirit in Master Hong Shen.","Master Hong Shen could not help but be amazed at their youth."]},{"number":754,"title":"Chapter 754 - Red Thorns Body","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After Master Hong Shen led Xin Ying, Zhang Xiaobai, Lu Pinru, and Tan Ran away, Lin Yuan wandered toward Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","He had not seen Blackie in a few days and did not know how it was doing in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","Even before he reached Submerged Flood Dragon Lake, he spotted a sea of blue in front of him.","The Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen were building pavilions atop the Diamond X/Legend Sunlight King Lotus.","Each Spirit Craftsman was holding a blueprint that Hu Quan had especially drawn.","Every Class 3 Spirit Craftsman needed to perfectly adhere to the pavilion’s design as they built it.","Lin Yuan looked down and felt that the view of Submerged Flood Dragon Lake resembled the sky.","The blue amazonite at the lake’s bottom made Submerged Flood Dragon Lake appear bottomless, expansive, and pure.","Lin Yuan watched as a few Angelfish of Bliss swam by, leaving rainbow ripples in their wake.","At that moment, Lin Yuan saw a long black silhouette appear under Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","He immediately recognized it to be Blackie, which had come to greet him.","Lin Yuan hastily backtracked by five meters. With how well he knew Blackie, he would have been drenched if he had not moved away.","His prediction was right as Blackie drew a fountain of water out with it.","Although Lin Yuan had moved backward by five meters, his shoes still became wet.","As he looked at the 18-meter long Blackie, Lin Yuan stroked its head helplessly. He ignored his wet shoes and jumped onto Blackie’s back to allow Blackie to carry him a few rounds around the mansion.","Since Master Hong Shen’s mansion was next to Lin Yuan’s, and the forest and green mountain behind the mansion also belonged to Lin Yuan, Blackie flew Lin Yuan around the large perimeter.","Lin Yuan looked in the direction of the tunnel’s construction and said to Blackie, “Blackie, go down and take a look.”","The arrival of Lin Yuan at the green mountain drew the attention of all the Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen there.","Lin Yuan jumped down from Blackie’s back and asked the Spirit Craftsman nearest to him, “Where’s Master Hu Quan?”","This Class 3 Spirit Craftsman was apparently dazed as he was silent for a while. He then timidly replied, “Master went underground to check out the condition of the soil.”","The dazed Spirit Craftsman went back to his work and started sanding down planks of Trickle Rock Metal.","The dazed man’s reaction made Lin Yuan feel a little awkward.","The nearby Liu Tong, who was moving planks of Trickle Rock Metal, immediately noticed his awkwardness.","Liu Tong did not expect the legendary Young Master of the Return from Faraway Mansion to inspect their work and quickly ran up to Lin Yuan with a smile and said, “Young Master, you can ask me all your questions. If you’re looking for Master, I’ll go down and inform him of your presence now.”","Lin Yuan was taken aback by the sudden appearance of this Class 3 Spirit Craftsman.","After confirming that he was not acquainted with this Class 3 Spirit Craftsman, he could not help but admit that his appearance had eased Lin Yuan’s awkwardness.","Since Hu Quan was checking on the condition of the underground soil, Lin Yuan did not interrupt his work as he was just here on a whim.","“There’s no need to fetch Master Hu Quan. Are there enough feys to supply oxygen in the basement?”","Liu Tong had approached Lin Yuan in order to leave an impression.","He did not expect Lin Yuan to entertain him, or rather he could not believe that Lin Yuan was as approachable as he was being.","Liu Tong replied in a detailed manner, “Young Master, Master Hong Shen sent over 500 Gold Green Oxygen Sea Anemones that can each supply two hours of oxygen when removed from the water. There are about 150 Spirit Craftsmen that enter the basement to work at a time. Hence, there are more than enough feys to supply oxygen in the basement.”","When Lin Yuan heard this Class 3 Spirit Craftsman’s reply, he realized that his Class 3 Spirit Craftsman spoke conscientiously.","Seeing as Hu Quan would not be coming out anytime soon, Lin Yuan thanked the Spirit Craftsman that had informed him of the basement’s construction process and went back to ride Blackie back to the mansion.","Lin Yuan’s casual word of thanks stunned Liu Tong.","Liu Tong had joined the Heavenly Craft Pavilion to hone his Spirit Craftsman skills and would occasionally chat with Hu Quan to find out Hu Quan’s impression of him.","As such, Hu Quan could place Liu Tong’s name to his face now.","But there were more than 500 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen in the Heavenly Craft Pavilion. The addition of the 300 Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen placed more pressure on Liu Tong’s shoulders.","Since he had coincidentally run into Lin Yuan today, Liu Tong mustered up his courage to reply to Lin Yuan’s question.","However, he did not expect to be overwhelmed by Lin Yuan’s thanks.","He could tell Lin Yuan’s polite demeanor from his thanks and sense that Lin Yuan did not regard anyone below him. Instead, he viewed Liu Tong as his equal who was also deserving of respect.","As he watched Lin Yuan mount the enormous flood dragon fey, Liu Tong gathered his courage and shouted, “Young Master, Liu Tong bids you goodbye!”","When Lin Yuan heard the Class 3 Spirit Craftsman bidding him goodbye, he turned and waved to Liu Tong.","He instinctively logged Liu Tong’s name in his mind.","Liu Tong watched Lin Yuan disappear in the distance atop the flood dragon fey and balled his fists together to motivate himself.","His skills as a Class 3 Spirit Craftsman were relatively solid, and it was highly likely that he would become a Class 4 Spirit Craftsman.","Liu Tong worked hard and ensured that he did more than the other Class 3 Spirit Craftsmen. He believed that one had to be prepared to seize opportunities instead of laying back and waiting for the door to open to those who were talented.","Hence, he was always ready and waiting for the day where his opportunity to shine would arise.","...","Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone when he returned to the mansion and summoned Red Thorn out of the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","After Red Thorn was summoned, it immediately wrapped its thornless vine around Lin Yuan’s wrist.","Despite Red Thorn’s gentleness, Lin Yuan’s wrist still felt like an elephant’s trunk was grabbing it.","The lethality of Red Thorn’s ortet mutated when it evolved to Fantasy Breed and was no longer deadly.","However, the ortet became extremely strong after absorbing the flesh of so many dimensional lifeforms.","Red Thorn waved its vines at Lin Yuan and used its gill-shaped petals to produce a voice that said, “Yuan, I want a pretty bow and my body.”","When Lin Yuan heard that Red Thorn wanted a pretty bow, he instantly took out a red cloth and tied it around Red Thorn’s vines.","But at the mention of Red Thorn’s ‘body’, Lin Yuan was confused.","He did not know what was the ‘body’ that Red Thorn wanted."]},{"number":755,"title":"Chapter 755 - In Broad Daylight! A Big Transformation!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan asked Red Thorn, “You’re right here. What body do you want?”","Red Thorn immediately replied in a small voice, “It’s the Source Seed you have.”","Lin Yuan immediately took out the Source Seed.","When Red Thorn saw the Source Seed, Lin Yuan sensed Red Thorn’s intense craving for the Source Seed through their connected bloodline.","It was as though Red Thorn was currently incomplete, and this Source Seed actually belonged to Red Thorn’s body.","Red Thorn used its smooth vine to grab the Source Seed and placed it in the spore cavity of the Mouth of Relinquish.","At that moment, a change occurred, and Red Thorn’s entire plant started to tremble violently.","Shortly after, Lin Yuan sensed strong plant energy flowing out of Red Thorn’s spore cavity.","This strong plant energy quickly filled up the area just outside the Mouth of Relinquish.","After this plant energy flowed out, Red Thorn did not leave any lifeform traces before it fell asleep.","This sudden change in Red Thorn and its abrupt slumber did not cause Lin Yuan to panic.","It was obvious that Red Thorn was in the midst of a positive transformation.","Lin Yuan carefully contemplated what Red Thorn had said about its body but did not come to a conclusion.","Eventually, he used True Data to check on the sleeping Red Thorn.","True Data confirmed that Red Thorn was truly going through a transformation.","However, Red Thorn was not sleeping because it was transforming after absorbing the Source Seed’s energy.","It was because the special energy needed for Red Thorn’s transformation was not complete.","Hence, Red Thorn did not have any other choice but to remain frozen in a state of slumber.","If the special energy was not made up for, Lin Yuan would have to abandon Red Thorn’s chance to transform in order to wake it up.","Lin Yuan was definitely not going to give up on the chance for Red Thorn to transform.","However, he needed to quickly solve the issue of Red Thorn’s slumber because the Blood Brew Grapevine could not do without Red Thorn’s Eyes of Relinquish0.","The Blood Brew Grapevine grew numerous unripe Blood Brew Grapes, and every vine that the Blood Brew Grapes grew on also had two extra supporting vines growing out of it.","Without the energy from the Eyes of Relinquish, the Blood Brew Grapevine would quickly run out of nutrients and divert what little nutrients it had left away from the vines, causing the vines to wither.","This would reduce the production of blood energy.","If that happened, all of Lin Yuan’s hard work would have been for nothing, and the Mother of Bloodbath’s evolution to Myth III would be delayed.","Lin Yuan refused to let this happen.","He worked the gears in his head and made a wild guess. His eyes lit up.","Red Thorn was transforming because it had consumed the Source Seed. Evidently, Red Thorn’s transformation was linked to the Source Seed.","It was highly likely that the special energy required by Red Thorn was the Source Seed’s energy.","However, there were only three known Source Seeds. one had been evolved into Red Thorn by Lin Yuan, and the other had been placed in Red Thorn’s spore cavity.","The last Source Seed had been evolved into a vine plant by a normal person.","After the normal person died, the vine plant was also wasted away due to the contract.","But the vine plant had been donated to the Fey Observer Association by the dead contractor’s family.","It had been made into a specimen by the Fey Observer Association and was being kept in the Fey Observer Association’s storeroom.","Lin Yuan could only retrieve the vine plant from the Fey Observer Association for Red Thorn.","He would feed it to Red Thorn to see if it would cause Red Thorn to transform. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would be rendered helpless.","Lin Yuan immediately left the Spirit Lock spatial zone and headed to the Fey Observer Association.","However, the Fey Observer Association was not a normal place, much less the Fey Observer Association situated in the Royal Capital.","This concerned Red Thorn’s transformation and the Mother of Bloodbath’s transformation, so Lin Yuan highly prioritized this matter.","In order to easily get his hands on one of the Fey Observer Association’s specimens, Lin Yuan needed to make use of something he had left untouched for some time.","Lin Yuan shook his hand, and a brocade box appeared in his palm.","This brocade box had a layer of moon silk on top that faintly glowed with moonlight.","Lin Yuan opened the brocade box and took out the Class 2 Creation Master crest with a moon engraved on it.","He removed the Class 2 Creation Master crest on his chest and replaced it with the one with the moon engraving.","...","The Fey Observer Association in the Royal Capital did not allow avian feys to stop there. Thus, they immediately directed the avian fey that Lin Yuan arrived on inside.","Lin Yuan saw an elderly man shouting from the entrance, “Fey Observers! Class 1 to 3 exam materials! Better than the information you find on Star Web! 5,000 Federation dollars for one! We’re only selling ten today. First come, first serve!”","In spite of all the elderly man’s yelling, few people in the Fey Observer Association paid attention to him.","The rare glance thrown in the elderly man’s direction was that of anger, as though he was doing something utterly despicable.","Lin Yuan felt that if not for the people from the Fey Observer Association around the area, these angry people would have beaten this elderly man up.","The elderly man spotted Lin Yuan and was about to advertise his Fey Observer materials to him when he noticed the moon engraving on his Class 2 Creation Master crest.","The old man was stunned, and his expression shifted.","He softly murmured, “Thousand Faced Fantasy Moth, remove the thousand faces.”","When Lin Yuan heard this voice, he was shocked because it was not the same raspy aged voice from before. Instead, it was the gentle and calm voice of a woman.","A black moth with a thousand metallic patterns on its body flew out of the elderly man’s body, and the old man’s body melted away like a mirror of foam.","In the old man’s place was a woman who seemed to be about 40 years old and wearing a long light-green skirt.","Lin Yuan stared in astonishment at this transformation. He did not know or dare to ask how this elderly man had changed into a middle-aged woman.","It was a terrifying event to take place in broad daylight!"]},{"number":756,"title":"Chapter 756 - Lan Qin","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The transformed middle-aged woman dressed in a long light green skirt walked up to Lin Yuan and said, “Welcome, my name is Lan Qin, and I’m the head of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.”","While the middle-aged woman was talking, the Thousand Faced Fantasy Moth landed on her hair and looked like a hair ornament.","If not for the intermittent flapping of the Thousand Faced Fantasy Moth’s wings, it would be imperceptible as a living being.","Lin Yuan was bewildered by the transformation. He did not expect this to happen at the entrance of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","He also did not expect that the elderly man who had been peddling Fey Observer materials would turn out to be the head of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","Lin Yuan bowed to the middle-aged woman and said, “Greetings, Madam.”","As he spoke, he used True Data to check on the Thousand Faced Fantasy Moth and found out that it was only Platinum VIII/Legend.","When Lin Yuan became a B-rank spirit qi professional, the mist-like spirit qi professional condensed into a fluid, and his ability to sense spiritual power improved significantly. He could already sense the strength of other spirit qi professionals’ spiritual power through circulating his own spiritual power.","This was the innate comprehending ability of B-rank spirit qi professionals.","Lin Yuan could tell that Lan Qin’s rank was about the same as his.","However, Lan Qin had a much higher store of spiritual power than him. It far exceeded that of B-rank spirit qi professional.","Nonetheless, given that Lan Qin remained a B-rank at her advanced age, it was clear that she was not gifted at combat.","Nonetheless, Fey Observer skills were mutually exclusive from fighting power.","The knowledge about feys and source-type lifeforms that Fey Observer had was a type of lifestyle-class spirit qi occupation.","In this world where martial law ruled, Lan Qin had to be a Class 5 Fey Observer in order for her to become the head of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Organisation with her weak fighting skills.","Moreover, she had to be at the peak level of Class 5 Fey Observers.","Although this was the first time that Lin Yuan had seen Lan Qin, he had heard of her.","When Lin Yuan had logged into Star Web, he had heard of Lan Qin’s prodigious reputation.","Fey Observers were not Creation Masters and could not nurture feys, but they were revered as ‘The Mothers of Main Dragons’.","By studying the triggers in dragon-species feys’ bloodlines that allowed them to mutate into dragon-species feys and training the bloodline to evolve into the main dragon-species fey, Lan Qin confirmed the most important components that led to dragon-species feys’ evolution.","It was because of Lan Qin’s research that led to more main dragon-species feys appearing in Radiance Federation.","The knowledge that one could gain in life was endless. It was incredible for a person to be able to generate information that was imperative to the world.","Creation Masters needed to concoct spirit fluids to evolve feys. Thus, they needed to have a grasp on Fey Observer and spiritual ingredient information.","But every field had its specialists. The information that Creation Masters knew about Fey Observers and spiritual ingredient analyses could not compare to that of Fey Observers and Spiritual Ingredient Analysts of the same class.","It could be said that Scholars, Fey Observers, and Spiritual Ingredient Analysts shared in the glory enjoyed by Creation Masters.","Many spirit fluid recipes came from Scholars, Fey Observers, and Spiritual Ingredient Analysts.","However, Creation Masters were needed to test these recipes.","Lin Yuan was surprised that Lan Qin would address him with such respect.","But this respect made Lin Yuan more aware of the Moon Empress’ status.","Lin Yuan carried the Creation Master crest that the Moon Empress had given him because he wanted to obtain the Source Seed from the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association with ease.","Lan Qin had clearly seen the moon engraving on his Creation Master crest and figured out his background.","From the way Lan Qin addressed him with such respect because he was displaying his status as the Moon Empress’ disciple, he could tell how much respect Lan Qin had for his Master. Otherwise, as the head of the Fey Observer Association, she could have pretended not to know of his arrival and came to escort him herself.","Although Lan Qin had greeted him with such respect, Lin Yuan did not put on airs as the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Lin Yuan sincerely offered his respect to this Class 5 Fey Observer and her boundless knowledge.","Lan Qin quickly reached out and gently pushed Lin Yuan up from his bow and said, “My Lord, I can’t have you bowing to me.”","Lin Yuan’s lips twitched awkwardly, and he replied, “Master, as your junior, I don’t deserve to be called Lord by you.”","Lan Qin smiled warmly. “I shall call you Young Lord then. You must have some business to attend to here. Let me take you in, and you can tell me what you need.”","Lin Yuan nodded and bowed in thanks as he said, “My apologies for inconveniencing you.”","When Lin Yuan followed Lan Qin into the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association, the people at the entrance could not help but freeze and stare in shock.","Many of these people had come to participate in the Fey Observer exam.","The Fey Observer Association was not as strict as the Creation Master exam but still had intervals. If one failed a Fey Observer exam, they would still be able to try again in another exam one month later, unlike the Creation Master exam, which only allowed one try per year.","Hence, the entrance to the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association was always crowded.","Many people appeared every month to take part in the Fey Observer exam.","Although there were 12 chances to take part in the Fey Observer exam each year, the exam topics were always challenging. Many of the questions were extremely difficult. Even the best students that had consumed all of the Fey Observer information could fail if they were careless.","Every time these people came to take part in the exam, they would see an elderly man peddling Class 1 to 3 Fey Observer materials at the entrance."]},{"number":757,"title":"Chapter 757 - The Only Goal","paragraphs":["The materials sold by the elderly man were truly cheaper than those sold on Star Web, and many people had purchased them.","However, when the people who purchased the materials brought them home and scanned through them, they would inevitably abandon them because there was more than three times the information offered on Star Web.","The Fey Observer information sold on Star Web was already difficult enough to understand, much less those sold by the elderly man.","Now, everyone knew that the elderly man was a facade.","Many people cursed out loud after they saw Lan Qin enter the Fey Observer Association.","“Crap, that stupid old man is actually Master Lan Qin! Thank God I didn’t demand a refund from that old man.”","“Oh my God, I can’t believe my goddess Master Lan Qin has been right in front of me all along! I had no idea!”","“It’s settled! I’m going to lock myself up for three months to carefully study the information I got from Master Lan Qin. Even if I still end up failing the Class 2 Fey Observer exam in three months, at least I won’t get negative points.”","A weak voice amongst the crowd peeped, “Hey, don’t you guys find that young man next to Master Lan Qin familiar? He’s the guy from the Allstar Match that...”","Before this weak voice finished, it was overshadowed by a chain of thunderous curses.","Although there were only 200,000 tickets to the Allstar Match, it had also been streamed live on Star Web.","Given that the Allstar Match was the precursor to the S Tournament, it generated a lot of buzz in the Radiance Federation. Thus, most people in the Radiance Federation had seen the live stream of the Allstar Match and remembered Lin Yuan’s performance.","Lin Yuan had worn something different when he participated in the Allstar Match, which was why he had not been immediately recognized.","Most of the people had found Lin Yuan to be familiar, but this small reminder triggered the full memory about Lin Yuan.","As Lin Yuan walked alongside Master Lan Qin, he told her about the reason he had come to the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association and said, “Master Lan Qin, I remember that the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association has a rule. The feys or source-type lifeforms that have been made into specimens by the Fey Observer Association can be traded for an equally valuable specimen that has not been recorded by the Fey Observer Association before after six months of storage.”","Master Lan Qin immediately knew why Lin Yuan had come and replied, “You’re right. Young Lord, what would you like to trade for? I’ll immediately get someone to arrange it for you. Many top factions have come to the Royal Capital recently. A lot of them will probably come to the Fey Observer Association to trade for feys or source-type lifeforms that have been turned into specimens. As such, there will be a lot of changes happening to the specimens in the association. Although the specimens are made public on Star Web, it’s highly possible that many specimens will be taken during this time. But don’t worry. There’s still an abundance of specimens in the Fey Observer Association for now.”","Lin Yuan could not help but feel anxious when he heard what Master Lan Qin said.","He knew that the Source Seed that had been nurtured into a vine plant had been stored as a specimen for a long time.","If the Source Seed had been traded away and ruined or used in research, it would be futile even Lin Yuan found out who the new owner was. He would have no choice but to give up on Red Thorn’s chance at transformation.","“Master Lan Qin, the only goal I have of coming here is to obtain the Source Seed.”","Lin Yuan’s voice was solemn and sincere. Lan Qin could tell how important it was to Lin Yuan.","She raised an eyebrow when she heard that Lin Yuan was after the Source Seed.","Lan Qin frowned, not because she knew that the association no longer had the Source Seed, but because she could not remember much about Source Seeds.","As a Class 5 Fey Observer, she interacted with countless feys and source-type lifeforms every day.","She did not have a photographic memory, so naturally, a source-type lifeform like the Source Seed, which was already dead and did not have much potential left in it, had not left a deep impression on her.","If not for the Source Seed’s special characteristics, it would not even be considered being made into a specimen by the Fey Observer Association.","“Young Lord, if the Source Seed is in the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association, I’ll definitely deliver it to you.”","Lin Yuan nodded at Master Lan Qin’s assurance and said seriously, “Master Lan Qin, the Source Seed is really important to me, and I hope that you’ll be able to check if it’s still here as soon as possible. Even if it has already been traded away, I hope you’ll be able to tell me which faction traded for it so I’ll be able to retrieve it.”","Lin Yuan knew that the Fey Observer Association did not guard its specimens strictly.","Most of the people working in the Fey Observer Association had the authority to approve trades.","The Fey Observer Association even encouraged factions to exchange for specimens in bulk because it would ensure that the Fey Observer Association maintained fresh specimens. This would allow Fey Observers to have a stock of topics to study. They would not need to buy feys and source-type lifeforms to study.","Hence, Lin Yuan was really afraid that the Source Seed would have already been traded away.","The only thing that Lin Yuan could use to comfort himself was that the vine plant was not useful to most people. It was unlikely that there would be a person who was willing to trade resources for the Source Seed.","Lin Yuan and Master Lan Qin had already reached the top floor of the Fey Observer Association.","“Take a seat in my observer room first. I’ll personally ask my assistant to check on the Source Seed for you,” said Master Lan Qin.","Lan Qin had stopped walking as she opened a door on the other side of a wall and said to the woman cleaning up inside, “Xiao Fan, go to storage and check if there’s a Source Seed.”"]},{"number":758,"title":"Chapter 758 - Only The Jasmine Lily","paragraphs":["Lan Qin quickly added, “If you do find it, use the highest authority to bring it to my observer room.”","The woman called Xiao Fan immediately set down her cleaning tools and lifted her head to see Lin Yuan standing next to Lan Qin.","Xiao Fan bowed to Lan Qin and then to Lin Yuan before saying, “Yes, I’ll see to it immediately.”","Xiao Fan walked out of Lan Qin’s observer room.","Lin Yuan took in Master Lan Qin’s observer room and noticed that it was very clean.","The design was minimalistic and did not have any unnecessary decorations.","Most of the space in the room was taken by the workbench, which currently had half the body of a dragon on it.","The dead dragon took up half the space on the workbench and was about 12 meters long.","This dead dragon’s blood and bone marrow had been completely extracted, but its flesh and skin radiated immense might from its dragon-species bloodline.","The dragon-species fey’s might mostly came from its blood and bone marrow.","It was clear that the dead dragon-species fey on the workbench was a main dragon-species fey.","Clearly, Master Lan Qin had been focusing on researching main dragon-species feys.","Besides the dragon-species fey, there was also a soft substance that had come from the body of a fey. This soft substance was stored in a crystal bottle.","Lin Yuan noticed that the crystal bottle was made of Blocking Crystal, a spiritual ingredient that could suppress power.","High-grade feys would still emit terrifying might after death which could harm weaker people.","It was just like how Lin Yuan had felt like his blood was concussed and that he would vomit blood at any time when he fought Nightmare VI on the island outside Indigo Azure City. This was in spite of him circulating his spiritual power to defend against Nightmare VI’s might and the Lava Dragon Lizard using Lava Shield to shield him.","Master Lan Qin was not powerful and needed to use Blocking Crystal to prevent herself from being hurt by high-grade feys’ might when she was studying them.","Under normal circumstances, Blocking Crystal could block the might of Myth III feys flawlessly, but Lin Yuan could clearly sense the faint might coming from inside the bottle. It seemed that the substance in the Blocking Crystal bottle came from a Creation Breed fey.","Lin Yuan had yet to interact with Creation Breed feys personally.","Master Lan Qin caught Lin Yuan looking at the workbench and smiled. She reached out to point at the sofa next to the workbench and said, “This Fiery Red-eyed Black Dragon has been dead for too long and no longer has any research value. Take a seat first. Even if Xiao Fan uses the highest authority to claim the Source Seed, it will still take half an hour for the Source Seed to get here. If the Source Seed has been traded away, Xiao Fan will bring the details of the trade instead.”","Lin Yuan nodded and sat down on the sofa relaxedly. He stopped worrying over whether the Source Seed was still in the Fey Observer Association.","Even if it was gone, Lin Yuan could find its new owner through the details of the trade.","If the Source Seed really could not be found, there was nothing he could do about it.","Lin Yuan had just sat down when he heard Lan Qin say, “Young Lord, I’m slightly curious about what fey you used during the Allstar Match. I saw your fight and can only guess that you used a healing-type fey. However, there isn’t a healing-type fey that can match up to the fey you used.”","A strong look of curiosity appeared on Master Lan Qin’s face.","No healing-type feys could absorb a target’s vitality, but some could gain limited manipulative abilities when they evolved to Fantasy Breed. Yet, the healing-type fey that Lin Yuan had contracted could cause the target to feel happy while they were being harmed. It was too special.","Lin Yuan replied honestly, “Master Lan Qin, the only healing-type fey I contracted is the Jasmine Lily.”","He did not elaborate.","When she heard what Lin Yuan said, Lan Qin looked shocked with a hint of realization.","She had considered many possibilities but did not think of the Jasmine Lily at all.","The Jasmine Lily’s initial power was just too weak.","But as a Class 5 Fey Observer, Master Lan Qin was well aware of low-grade feys’ evolution potential.","The improbably Jasmine Lily turned out to be the actual one.","Although Master Lan Qin was not a strong combat-class spirit qi professional, she knew that spirit qi professionals were not open about their contracted feys.","Lin Yuan’s answer had solved Master Lan Qin’s question. Thus, she would not ask Lin Yuan to summon the Jasmine Lily for her to observe.","After Lin Yuan answered Master Lan Qin’s question, he realized that Master Lan Qin’s gaze was locked on him.","As a junior, Lin Yuan could not speak freely to Master Lan Qin. But from the way she was staring at him, it seemed that she did not have anything else to say.","This made Lin Yuan antsy.","A moment passed, and Master Lan Qin said, “Young Lord, you’re the one who got full marks on the Class 1 Scholar, Class 1 Fey Observer, and Class 1 Spirit Ingredient Analyst exams, aren’t you? The questions set by Elder Ning are much harder than those set by the Fey Observer Association. Among the many Creation Master Associations, there are only about two or three people out of 1,000 who can pass the lifestyle-class exams.”","Master Lan Qin did not say anything more.","Lin Yuan might not be Master Lan Qin’s disciple, but her eyes shone with admiration for him now.","Lin Yuan was surprised that Master Lan Qin had figured out that it had been him.","After all, he was the only person in Radiance Federation who knew that he had scored full marks in the three lifestyle-class spirit qi professional exams to gain the right to take the Creation Master exam."]},{"number":759,"title":"Chapter 759 - Dark Clouds Bird Shrine","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Redbud City’s Creation Master Association set their own questions, but the participants needed to submit their exam scripts and results to the various lifestyle-class associations after the exam.","They also needed to submit a photo of themselves when they handed in the exam materials. Hence, it was not strange that the head of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association would recognize him.","However, Lin Yuan was confused by the meaning behind Master Lan Qin’s words.","While Lin Yuan was pondering over Master Lan Qin’s words, Master Lan Qin stretched out her hand and gave him a Bronze fey storage box.","“I won’t be selling these Class 1 to 3 Fey Observer information that I consolidated myself anymore. You can have a look at them. I might not be your Master, but I hope to see you pass the Class 2 and 3 Fey Observer exams with flying colors,” said Master Lan Qin kindly.","Master Lan Qin’s words of encouragement made a wide smile stretch across Lin Yuan’s face. He solemnly received the Bronze fey storage box with both hands.","“Master Lan Qin, I will carefully look through all the Class 1 to 3 Fey Observer information inside.”","Initially, he did not understand why Master Lan Qin would pretend to be an elderly man and sell Fey Observer materials at the low price of 5,000 Federation dollars.","When Lin Yuan had been working at the spirit-lifeform store in Xia Region, he had only managed to earn 5,000 Federation dollars after he worked himself to the bone for half a year.","5,000 Federation dollars was nothing to Master Lan Qin, but she had definitely spent a long time collecting these materials.","She was trying to give hope to the next generation.","It was hope that she had as a Fey Observer that wanted to train a competent next generation.","After Master Lan Qin handed Lin Yuan the Bronze fey storage box, she suddenly remembered how she had collected money in exchange for these Class 1 to 3 Fey Observer materials that she spent days and nights putting together.","A lonely shadow passed across Master Lan Qin’s gaze as she sighed and said, “Young Lord, there is three times the amount of information here than what can be found on Star Web. It will come off as lengthy. I also added in some results about fey experiments. All this might take up a significant chunk of your time.”","Lin Yuan noted Master Lan Qin’s lonely expression, and his heart ached.","He quickly replied, “Master Lan Qin, I think the most important part of being a student is the rigor. This comprehensive information is a blessing to the other Fey Observers and me.”","The age lines around Master Lan Qin’s eyes softened as she smiled brightly.","She was about to strike up a conversation with him when someone knocked on the door.","After three knocks, Xiao Fan walked in and bowed to both of them before saying, “I have located the Source Seed. Since it did not stand out and could not be used as a spiritual ingredient, it has been left in the trash pile. However, the specimens in the trash pile were traded away yesterday as Class 3 materials.”","Lin Yuan furrowed his brow. He was a step too late, after all.","However, he still let out a breath of relief because this also meant that the Source Seed would probably not have been used yet.","Master Lan Qin turned and said to Lin Yuan, “If it was traded away as Class 3 materials, it should still be in the association now and going through final processing. It will only be sent out at 5:00 p.m. tonight.”","She checked the time and realized that it was almost 5:00 p.m.","Master Lan Qin said anxiously, “Young Lord, I’ll go with you to retrieve the Source Seed from the pile.”","When Xiao Fan heard Master Lan Qin address Lin Yuan as ‘Young Lord’, a look of astonishment crossed her face.","A quick glance at the Class 2 Creation Master crest on Lin Yuan’s chest, and she immediately realized why he had been addressed as so.","This was truly one of the chosen ones and was unbelievably special.","Why did a person like him come to the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association personally?","Regardless of what she was thinking, Xiao Fan said softly to Lan Qin, “Madam, the specimens were ordered by the Li family’s Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.”","Xiao Fan had used Master Lan Qin’s highest authority to retrieve the Source Seed from the pile of specimens.","However, this pile had been ordered by Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, and they had already negotiated a price with the Fey Observer Association.","The pile was already as good as belonging to Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Although it did not seem to be a serious matter to snatch one of the items, it could be seen as a sign of offense to Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","This was why Xiao Fan had decided not to use the highest authority after much hesitation.","But now that a person of Lin Yuan’s status wanted the Source Seed, there was no longer any need to consider Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s feelings.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine could only smile and accept the situation as this person snatched an item from them.","Master Lan Qin frowned slightly at Xiao Fan.","When Xiao Fan came in empty-handed, Master Lan Qin knew that Xiao Fan was bothered by something.","Thankfully, the Source Seed was still in the association. If the Source Seed had been taken and used by Dark Clouds Bird Shrine during the time that Xiao Fan came to report to them, Master Lan Qin would not be able to face Lin Yuan.","Lan Qin could tell that the Source Seed was extremely important to him from Lin Yuan’s attitude.","Lin Yuan’s expression relaxed when he heard the exchange between Xiao Fan and Master Lan Qin. Now, he knew that the Source Seed was still in the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","This matter concerned Red Thorn’s transformation, and Lin Yuan would do anything to obtain this last Source Seed."]},{"number":760,"title":"Chapter 760 - The Unexpected Familiar Face","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","When Lin Yuan and Master Lan Qin went downstairs and headed toward the Fey Observer Association’s storeroom, he listened as Master Lan Qin explained to him the process of converting feys and source-type lifeforms to specimens.","Lin Yuan found the process to be too convoluted.","Even elite factions only had Class 3 authority, while Master Lan Qin had Class 5 authority.","Master Lan Qin wanted to give Lin Yuan Class 4 authority, and he did not reject her or show overt excitement.","He had never needed to obtain specimens from the Fey Observer Association before.","The feys and source-type lifeforms that were made into specimens by the Fey Observer Association were all dead.","These dead feys and source-type lifeforms could be useful if they were nurtured but did not have any especially valuable use to them.","The dead feys and source-type lifeforms that contained valuable spiritual ingredients had already been separated and sent to the Spiritual Ingredient Analyst Association when they first arrived at the Fey Observer Association.","Most of these specimens that factions had traded for were also used in Fey Observer-related research in the hopes of gaining a better understanding of feys.","However, Lin Yuan had no need to study feys because True Data already contained flawless information about all entities.","True Data could provide more comprehensive information as Morbius evolved.","Lin Yuan used his own abilities to evolve feys. His method completely differed from that of normal Creation Masters because he did not use many spirit fluids.","After Genius evolved to the Beast that Connects Everything, its spiritual energy increased so much that it did not need to worry about running out of spiritual energy when it picked up new knowledge.","Genius’ knowledge developed from an intangible source to tangible power.","When it combined Precise Memory and Knowledge Analysis, Genius had already created many different spirit fluid recipes.","These spirit fluid recipes were mostly unfeasible, but there was one regarding the Soldier Ration Radish that had already succeeded.","Genius used the Soldier Ration Radish’s vines as spiritual ingredients and combined the Soldier Ration Radish’s separation ability with the spirit fluid with the help of the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire.","This spirit fluid was named Luxuriant Spirit Fluid, and it could be used to increase the growth of plant-type feys.","There had been no obvious effects when Genius used the Luxuriant Spirit Fluid on the Soldier Ration Radish’s old roots, but when it was poured on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, many new Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls grew out.","After being showered with the Luxuriant Spirit Fluid, a week’s worth of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls grew out within a few hours and were ready to be removed from the ortet.","Now that Lin Yuan had the information that Genius had accumulated, it was like he had gained numerous top Fey Observers, Spiritual Ingredient Analysts, and Scholars.","The information from these top Fey Observers, Spiritual Ingredient Analysts, and Scholars was also perfectly combined and working in unison.","Genius used his creativity and knowledge to generate a kind of wealth for Lin Yuan that was far more precious than the heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Lin Yuan saw a large metal door at the end of the corridor.","“Young Lord, that’s the storeroom,” said Master Lan Qin.","Lin Yuan walked through the large metal doors to see towering stacks of Gold fey storage boxes.","Every Gold fey storage box had a form attached to it that detailed the fey or source-type lifeform inside.","Four or five staff members in long robes were moving the Gold fey storage boxes around, while an elderly man with a loud voice was talking to two youths in front of the Gold fey storage boxes.","Lin Yuan saw that the elderly man’s long Fey Observer robes had five gold circles on it and knew that he was a Class 5 Fey Observer.","The Royal Capital’s Fey Observer had one President and five Vice Presidents.","This elderly man was either one of the Vice Presidents or in the upper echelons of the Fey Observer Association.","When Lin Yuan saw the faces of the two youths, he was stunned.","One of the young men had large eyes, a stocky body, and very short hair. He was wearing white half armor that radiated frigidity, and it looked to be made of Winter Crocodile skin.","The man next to the man in the white half armor was wearing a simple light-colored long robe. His eyes resembled that of a dragon, but his lips were thin. He looked distant and cold.","Lin Yuan knew this person. He was Sequence #3 in the Radiance Hundred Sequence, Long Tao.","He was well-acquainted with Long Tao.","Lin Yuan and Long Tao had experienced the Class 3 dimensional rift battle and had become friends.","However, Long Tao was friends with the combat-class spirit qi professional Black and not the Creation Master Lin Yuan.","Long Tao’s head was lowered as he used his phone while the man in white half armor conversed with the elderly man.","The man in white half armor saw the approaching Lin Yuan and Lan Qin.","Although the man in white half armor did not recognize Lin Yuan, he recognized Lan Qin, who was the President of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","The man greeted Lan Qin and said, “Hello, Master Lan Qin. I was going to visit you once we settled this batch of specimens. My father brought three kinds of mandarin ducks that Dark Clouds Bird Shrine has evolved with us. We hope that you can take a look at them.”","Lan Qin’s eyes lit up.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine specialized in nurturing avian-type feys.","The Gray Rapid Pigeon, Divine Travel Black Swallow, and Rainbow Clouds Swan that were used as transport in the Radiance Federation mostly came from Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","The Li family nurtured new types of avian-type feys every once in a while.. These avian-type feys were largely used as modes of transport and were immediately sought after by the entire Radiance Federation when they were released."]},{"number":761,"title":"Chapter 761 - Long Taos Sixth Sense, Black and Lin Yuan!","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lan Qin was very interested in the feys that the Li family nurtured, especially when they were the rare mandarin duck-species feys.","Since the Li family was planning to release three types of mandarin duck-species avian-type feys, it seemed that they were planning on changing the current avian-type feys that were being used as modes of transport in the Radiance Federation. They wanted to push for a couples-style of avian-type feys!","However, Lan Qin still had serious business to attend to.","Lan Qin was definitely much better closer to Li Xuan than she was to Lin Yuan.","She had been working with Dark Clouds Bird Shrine for decades and had basically watched Li Xuan grow up.","She felt that he was a good boy with an upstanding character. However, besides his character, his temper still left something to be desired.","Li Xuan always prioritized the Li family name. He was straightforward and stubborn, which caused him to offend others easily.","If Lin Yuan told Li Xuan that he wanted something that the Li family had already claimed and Li Xuan did not notice Lin Yuan’s status or chose to disregard it, the outcome would be disastrous.","Lan Qin did not know Lin Yuan well, but she did know the Moon Empress. If Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress shared the same personality and temperament, any wrong move on Li Xuan’s part would result in him being punished.","Thus, Lan Qin hastily said to Li Xuan, “Little Xuan, this Lord requires one of the source-type lifeforms inside this batch of specimens. The Source Seed has to be taken out now.”","Li Xuan immediately knitted his brow.","However, he did not immediately voice his objection because he heard Lan Qin address the person as ‘Lord’.","He carefully scanned Lin Yuan, and his eyes widened shortly after.","Li Xuan was not shocked to see the Creation Master crest on his chest, but rather that Long Tao had walked up to Lin Yuan and reached out his hand to him.","Li Xuan and Long Tao had grown up together and knew each other well.","This was how Li Xuan knew about Long Tao’s arrogance.","Long Tao was Sequence #3 in the Radiance Hundred Sequence, as well as the Eldest Young Master in Ascending Dragon City. He was also the only direct descendant of the elite faction Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","He had been born with a golden spoon and looked down on everyone.","When he made friends, he did not bother with their status but rather if he could get along with them.","Given that he had just taken the initiative to reach out his hand to the young man next to Lan Qin, it meant that he genuinely regarded this young man as one of his friends.","What Li Xuan did not know was that Long Tao’s action stumped Lin Yuan.","When Long Tao had gone with Lin Yuan to Radiance Moon Mountain, Long Tao had seen how Mystic Moon and Cold Moon were treating Lin Yuan and knew that he had gone for nothing.","Long Tao knew that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","If Lin Yuan had not replenished Long Tao’s spirit qi after the battle, Long Tao might have fallen and humiliated himself after his victory at the Radiant Moon Palace.","Long Tao held Lin Yuan in high regard.","Nonetheless, Long Tao would only greet Lin Yuan. He would never display friendliness and reach out his hand.","However, when he saw Lin Yuan, Long Tao felt that this young man had an extremely familiar gaze.","Long Tao felt that this person was the young man wearing a silver mask.","Lin Yuan instinctively took Long Tao’s outstretched hand.","From its grip strength to feel, this handshake made Long Tao all the more certain that this was Black.","This was just a gut feeling that Long Tao could not explain.","Long Tao released his hand, looked into Lin Yuan’s eyes, and said, “It’s been some time since we parted at Leaning Moon Mountain.”","Long Tao paused for a moment before continuing. “I guess it hasn’t been that long because I saw you at the Allstar Match as well. I was going to treat you to a meal after the Allstar Match, but you left early. I wanted to buy you a meal to thank you for replenishing my spiritual power on Leaning Moon Mountain.”","Lin Yuan shot Long Tao a bright smile and replied, “There will be plenty of chances to have a meal together in the future.”","The sound of Lin Yuan’s voice made Long Tao’s gaze become more suspicious.","It was easy for a person to hide their appearance and age with a mask, but they were unable to hide their voice.","Lin Yuan’s voice resembled that of Black’s too closely. In fact, they were identical.","“There’s no better day than the present. It’s almost 5:00 p.m. now. How about we have dinner together and catch up?”","Lin Yuan nodded and said, “Sure. However, I almost never eat out when I’m in the Royal Capital. Brother, you’ll have to pick a place, and I’ll treat you.”","Long Tao’s furrowed brow of suspicion relaxed, and he cheerily answered, “Okay. How about we go to the House of Enviable Fragrance? I heard that you know the owner. It’s another buffet restaurant opened by Shi Xu.”","Lin Yuan’s addressing of Long Tao as ‘brother’ was effective. Whether Lin Yuan was Black or not, his attitude was enough for Long Tao to be sure that Lin Yuan sincerely wanted to become friends.","Both of them were fine with paying for the meal as a gesture. Even if either of them had a large appetite, the cost of one meal would be peanuts to both of them.","While they spoke, Long Tao never broke his gaze with Lin Yuan. He noticed the confusion that flashed across Lin Yuan’s eyes and could not help but be slightly dumbfounded.","Long Tao had decided to mention Shi Xu to see if a look of recognition would cross Lin Yuan’s eyes.","Now that Lin Yuan was looking at him with clear curiosity, Long Tao assumed that he had been overthinking.","However, he did not know that Lin Yuan’s confusion was not because of Shi Xu. Instead, Lin Yuan was wondering if the House of Enviable Fragrance that Long Tao had mentioned was the one where Zhang Xiaobai had bought roasted meat in bulk.","It was no wonder that Lin Yuan was curious because the name ‘House of Enviable Fragrance’ had entered his ears too often recently.","Li Xuan heard Long Tao and Lin Yuan mention Leaning Moon Mountain and thought about how Lan Qin called Lin Yuan ‘Lord’.","Even if he had not seen the Creation Master crest on Lin Yuan’s chest, Li Xuan would have acknowledged Lin Yuan’s status by now.","The elite faction community was abuzz with the news that the Moon Empress had accepted a disciple, but who this disciple was had been a mystery.","Now, it appeared that the Moon Empress’ disciple was this person standing before him."]},{"number":762,"title":"Chapter 762 - Initiating Friendship","paragraphs":["After Lin Yuan’s status was revealed, Li Xuan knew that he would instruct someone from Dark Clouds Bird Shrine to pack up the weird Source Seed and send it to Lin Yuan.","He could not help but feel slightly sour over this. He knew that he could not get around to doing this.","Li Xuan was a smart person and knew what the consequences of him opposing this action would be.","Regardless of whether Lin Yuan would have an adverse reaction to his rejection, Lan Qin was never going to allow him to take this specimen out of the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","But because he could not say no, Li Xuan felt that Lin Yuan was essentially robbing their Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Lin Yuan was currently reminiscing with Long Tao.","When they were done reminiscing, Lin Yuan quickly walked up to Li Xuan as he thought about what would be the best thing to give Li Xuan in exchange for the Source Seed.","Lin Yuan was not a bully.","After becoming the Moon Empress’ disciple, Lin Yuan only relied on hard work to increase his power and expand Sky City.","During this process, he had kept his identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple a secret.","If not for how important the Source Seed was to Red Thorn’s evolution, Lin Yuan would not have thought of using his identity as the Moon Empress’s disciple.","Back when he had just become a spirit qi professional and first logged onto Star Web, he had been 1.78 meters tall. Later, he grew to 1.79 meters.","He had logged into Star Web’s Celestial Stairway to battle and refreshed his identity card during the new year.","The new identity card revealed to Lin Yuan that he had grown to 1.80 meters.","Li Xuan was 1.88 meters tall and obviously towered over Lin Yuan.","But as he watched Lin Yuan walk over to him, Li Xuan could not help but feel a sense of pressure.","The young man stopped in front of Li Xuan, and his hand trembled.","A moment later, a strange plant appeared in the young man’s hand.","There was a small golden bean growing atop the plant. The small golden bean was shining gold and had several pink lines running around it, making it look bouncy and cute.","When Lin Yuan took out the strange golden plant, the Class 3 Creation Master Long Tao and Class 5 Fey Observer Master Lan Qin inhaled sharply.","Li Xuan was neither a Creation Master nor a Fey Observer and did not know what the strange plant was.","Lin Yuan said in a warm and crisp voice, “I apologize for needing you to pick out something from a pile that has already been packed, but the Source Seed is really important to me. This is a Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl that was mutated from a Flower Brocade Pearl.","“The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s leaves are three times more effective than that of the Flower Brocade Pearl. Moreover, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl can increase the effectiveness of spirit fluids by improving the homogenization of spiritual ingredients. It is also very mild-natured and can be used in conjunction with other support-type Creation Master spiritual ingredients, including the Flower Brocade Pearl.","“I would like to use this Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to exchange for the Source Seed. Is this acceptable to you?”","Li Xuan immediately replied, “No problem. I’ll go and check which fey storage box the Source Seed is in now.”","Li Xuan had always been more partial to coaxing than brute force.","If Lin Yuan had tried to force Li Xuan to snatch the Source Seed away, Li Xuan would have suppressed his anger but bear the grudge forever.","Although the other party was clearly capable of trying to force him using brute force, he had offered an explanation and apologized instead.","The way that Lin Yuan had asked if it would be acceptable to Li Xuan now made the situation seem more like Lin Yuan needed Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s help instead of trying to snatch something from them.","This not only protected Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s reputation but also stroked Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s ego as the Moon Empress’ disciple had taken the initiative to ask them for help.","Naturally, Li Xuan was going to help the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Li Xuan did not know what the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was.","However, it was not only three times better than the Flower Brocade Pearl and could improve the homogenization of spiritual ingredients, but it was also able to be used in conjunction with other support-type Creation Master spiritual ingredients. This was enough for Li Xuan to trade for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl without hesitation.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine needed a large amount of Creation Master resources to nurture avian-type feys. They even needed high-class Creation Master resources in order to nurture rare avian-type feys.","High-class Creation Master resources were a faction’s most precious resource and were always regarded as necessary costs.","Since the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl could be used in conjunction with other support-type spiritual ingredients, it would lower the difficulty of concocting high-grade spirit fluids. This would increase the rate at which Creation Masters could concoct spirit fluids.","As such, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl would increase Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s Creation Master resources and raise its productivity.","Lin Yuan smiled at Li Xuan, who was carefully checking through the fey storage boxes for the Source Seed.","He had enough experience to know how to not easily start grudges with others.","After running Sky City for so long, he was well aware that connections were important to a faction. Hence, he took care to establish as many connections as he could.","Rather than using his status to snatch the Source Seed from Li Xuan, it was better to strike a deal with him and improve Sky City’s network in the process.","Although Lin Yuan did not start off with the plan to trade for the Source Seed with the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, Master Hong Shen had accidentally discovered that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl could be used with other support-type Creation Master resources.","This accidental discovery raised the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s value and allowed Lin Yuan to gain more leverage when he was trading the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","It could be said that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was a resource that would benefit a faction’s Creation Master resources.","When a faction gained many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, it would affect the direction and strategy of the major factions.","Lin Yuan’s method of trading the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls would not result in them landing in the hands of his enemy factions.","Frankly, something like the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl that could benefit a faction’s Creation Master resources in multiple ways was the perfect blow to enemy factions."]},{"number":763,"title":"Chapter 763 - The Fake Skeleton Creation Dragons Bone Marrow","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Miao family’s Connected Beast Park, whose main role was Creation Master resources, would be greatly impacted by the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","If Lin Yuan struck up a deal with Connected Beast Park, he would be helping them to increase their Creation Master resources.","But if Lin Yuan refused to trade Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with the Miao family and traded with the factions that opposed the Miao family instead, he would be strengthening the Miao family’s enemies.","He would be subtly weakening the foundation on which the Miao family built their livelihoods.","When something as incredible as the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl appeared, those who had not used it before would definitely be suspicious of its true power.","Hence, there needed to be a credible source who could witness the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s effects.","Lan Qin, Long Tao, and Li Xuan were witnesses to the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s power and could help Lin Yuan spread the word.","Frankly, Lin Yuan had not intended on revealing the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl now.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet in his possession had yet to produce 10 child ramets.","But when he saw Long Tao and Li Xuan, Lin Yuan wanted to try to see if he could coax a gem out of this situation and incite them to trade Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with him.","This would allow him to obtain Law Source Crystals.","As it stood, the Law Source Crystals that Lin Yuan had were not enough to evolve a Myth III Dark Death Law to Creation quality.","Lin Yuan was not afraid of other factions gaining Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Although the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl Lin Yuan was holding was alive, it could not be considered as a genuine fey. It was just relying on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet.","If he had to define the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that spawned from the ortet, Lin Yuan would say that it was a spiritual ingredient that could sustain growth.","Hence, Lin Yuan was not afraid of other people studying this Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl child ramet. As long as he had the ortet, he would still be able to dominate the market and dictate the monopoly on Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Lin Yuan did not know how many specimens Li Xuan had reserved from the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","Li Xuan worked quickly. Within a few minutes, he finished searching through seven or eight Gold fey storage boxes.","However, he had yet to find the Source Seed that Lin Yuan wanted.","During this time, Lin Yuan was not idle. Lin Yuan studied Long Tao and Master Lan Qin’s expressions when Li Xuan started looking through the fey storage boxes.","Long Tao walked over to Lin Yuan and fixed his gaze on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl in Lin Yuan’s hand.","Lin Yuan handed the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to Long Tao and said, “Brother, if you want to inspect it, why not take a closer look? You can even pluck a few leaves and test its effects in spirit fluid concoction.”","Li Xuan watched as the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was handed to Long Tao and quickly barked to the five employees who were moving the Gold fey storage boxes, “Stop moving things. Help me find the Source Seed from these fey storage boxes first.”","He quickly walked over to Lin Yuan and threw a wary look at Long Tao, as though he was afraid that Long Tao was going to steal the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","Although Li Xuan was not a Creation Master or a Fey Observer and could not judge the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s effects for himself, he did not doubt what Lin Yuan had said about its effects.","After all, this Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl had been produced by the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Lan Qin heard Lin Yuan’s suggestion and said, “I’ll find you an empty observer room so you can use the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to concoct a spirit fluid.”","Long Tao shook his head and replied, “There’s no need for such inconvenience.”","He grabbed two Gold fey storage boxes and used them to build a simple makeshift workbench.","Long Tao then took out four kinds of spiritual ingredients.","Specifically, he took out Silver Dragon Beast Blood, Silver Dragon Beast Bone Powder, Fire Strong Scales, and the leaves of the Gold Burning Sweet Flag and started to concoct the spirit fluid.","It was common knowledge that all dragon-species feys emitted dragon aura.","When Lin Yuan saw the spiritual ingredients that Long Tao took out, he immediately knew that Long Tao was preparing to concoct a Grade 2 potion that would trigger terrifying dragon-species feys.","Creation Masters always needed a quiet environment to concoct spirit fluids in.","Long Tao had chosen to concoct this Grade 2 spirit fluid under scrutiny because he was confident of his success.","This also showed how confident Long Tao was in his powers as a Creation Master.","After mixing the four spiritual ingredients, he shook his hand and produced a drop of purplish-golden sticky blood, which he poured into the spirit fluid.","When Long Tao took out the drop of purplish-golden blood, the Fey Observer storeroom was bombarded with the stench of blood.","There was also the odor of blood specific to terrifying dragon-species feys laced in the overwhelming stench of blood.","When he was learning about the Radiance Federation’s elite factions, he had paid attention to the Long family’s Coiling Dragon’s Valley due to his relationship with Long Tao.","He had found out that Coiling Dragon’s Valley had a fey known as Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon.","Technically, Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s Creation Master resources were not that different from that of Connected Beast Park’s.","The Long family could exert pressure on the Miao family with Creation Master resources because of the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon.","The Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon was consumed while eating and looked extremely horrifying.","Its body was covered with an exoskeleton that seemed to encapsulate layers of soft bone.","Not even five kilograms of flesh would be gouged out even if a knife was plunged into the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon.","But having all this bone was not a weakness to the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon but rather an advantage.","This was because the purplish-golden bone marrow in the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon’s bones could increase the success rate of spirit fluid concoction by greatly reducing the time needed for the Creation Master to concoct the spirit fluid.","A moment later, as Li Xuan’s eyelid twitched wildly, Long Tao plucked one golden leaf from the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","He was about to carefully drip the sap from the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s leaf into the spirit fluid when he realized that the leaf had already turned into a liquid on its own.","The liquefied lead became a smooth sap-like substance and dropped into the spirit fluid.","Long Tao used his spiritual energy, and the concoction was soon completed.","He looked at the completed young dragon potion in his hands and tried to suppress his emotions.","However, he could not hide the brilliant gleam in his eyes."]},{"number":764,"title":"Chapter 764 - New Thousand Layer Scheme and Underlying Power","paragraphs":["Long Tao had concocted countless Young Dragon Potions in his time. At its best, the potion was 62% homogenized.","Now that he was concocting the Young Dragon Potion in front of other people, he was still affected despite his solid experience.","He felt that he would be lucky if the spiritual ingredients in this Young Dragon Potion could be 50% homogenized. Yet, the spiritual ingredients of this potion were 72% homogenized.","Long Tao was not arrogant enough to attribute this to the increase in his Creation Master powers. Moreover, the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow that he had added could only shorten the concoction time and not increase the homogenization percentage.","This meant that the extra 10% more than his best record could only be due to the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","When Long Tao was concocting the spirit fluid, he had also been keeping track of the time. He had used 21 minutes to complete the concoction of this spirit fluid.","This was three minutes faster than when he just added the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon’s bone marrow.","Now that Long Tao had performed a credible test on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s value soared in Long Tao’s mind.","He felt that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was a treasure to Creation Masters.","Long Tao glanced at the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl again before returning it to Lin Yuan and said, “It can’t be confirmed that it can increase the success rate of spirit fluid concoction based on one test. In terms of time taken, it can reduce the time by at least 3 minutes when used in conjunction with the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon’s bone marrow. Given this, we can assume that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl reduced the time taken by about 13%. It also improved the homogenization of spiritual ingredients by at least 10%.”","The longer Long Tao talked, the more he sounded in awe of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","However, he had his own principles. Since he was friends with Li Xuan, he would never snatch the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl from him.","The results of Long Tao’s experiment made Master Lan Qin’s eyes shine with impressed astonishment. On the other hand, Li Xuan’s gaze became brighter and brighter.","When Li Xuan heard Long Tao talk about how the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl could increase spiritual ingredient homogenization by at least 10%, he could not help but clap his hands together. His smile almost stretched as far as his ears as well.","Li Xuan was an emotional person. When he had experienced Lin Yuan’s demeanor, all his unhappiness disappeared, and he even had a good impression of Lin Yuan.","He did not use his elite status to bully others. This was a rare trait in the disciples of elite factions.","Moreover, Lin Yuan’s title was far above most people’s perceptions, and the disciples of elite factions could not even hope to hold a candle to him.","After Li Xuan discovered the effects of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, he felt thankful toward Lin Yuan.","Li Xuan was well aware that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls’ true power could not be unleashed by a Class 3 Creation Master like Long Tao.","But in the hands of a Class 4 Creation Master from Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, the evolution of Bronze/Epic feys and even the effectiveness of pure spirit qi on the mutation of feys would be increased by at least 10%.","This was an immense blessing.","The more Li Xuan looked at Lin Yuan, the better he felt. Li Xuan said to Lin Yuan and Long Tao, “Bring me along for dinner tonight!”","Long Tao had already planned on asking Li Xuan to have dinner with them since they had come to the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association together.","But now that Li Xuan was requesting to join their dinner, it meant that he wanted to get to know Lin Yuan without Long Tao’s introduction.","Long Tao did not reply but looked toward Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had no reason to object to this because he also wanted to build a connection with Li Xuan.","“No problem, I’m fine with it. However, I’m not familiar with where to find good food in the Royal Capital. We’ll both have to follow Brother Long Tao’s lead.”","Lin Yuan reached his hand out to Li Xuan and said, “Nice to meet you. My name is Lin Yuan.”","Li Xuan was singing praises of Lin Yuan’s character to himself. He quickly smiled and received Lin Yuan’s outstretched hand with both his hands and replied, “My name is Li Xuan. Haha, since I invited myself, I shall pay for the meal!”","The elderly Class 5 Fey Observer standing off to the side picked up a long vine plant and said, “This should be the Source Seed.”","As he spoke, a strange expression appeared on the elderly man’s face, and he stole a look at the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl in Lin Yuan’s hand.","The elderly man could not figure out why Lin Yuan would be willing to use something as valuable as the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to trade for something like the Source Seed that barely deserved to be stored in a fey storage box here.","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up when he saw the vine plant. He hurriedly placed the vine plant in the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","Although Red Thorn was still sleeping in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it sent out a signal of craving when it sensed the Source Seed. This craving was identical to the one that Red Thorn had expressed for the second Source Seed.","When Lin Yuan sensed the signal, it confirmed the guess he had made in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. It seemed like the three Source Seeds that were discovered in the dimensional rift might not be three separate source-type lifeforms but actually part of one entity.","Now that he had the Source Seed, the large stone in Lin Yuan’s heart was finally lifted.","All he needed to do now was to feed the Source Seed to Red Thorn and wait to see Red Thorn finish its transformation.","With the Source Seed in hand, Lin Yuan gave the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to Li Xuan.","Lin Yuan had accomplished his goal of coming to the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association.","He noticed Master Lan Qin’s gaze shift and asked, “Master Lan Qin, would you like to study the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl?”","Master Lan Qin nodded and replied, “I do want to. I was going to ask Little Xuan for two leaves, but the leaves liquefy soon after leaving the plant, so it’s pointless.”","Master Lan Qin had only looked at the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl for a while but managed to catch the main points.","Lin Yuan was willing to allow other factions to get their hands on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl because he was sure that it would not be handed out easily.","However, it was also likely that factions would be unwilling to share such a precious resource.","But if Lin Yuan continued to give out Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, it was probable that a faction would complain about the leaves.","However, the liquefaction of the leaves would prevent this.","The liquefied sap would lose its vitality in two minutes. Hence, it would be impossible to trade the sap.","This was the reason Lin Yuan was willing to allow others to get their hands on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","As someone who liked thousand-layer schemes, Lin Yuan definitely had more than two layers in his scheme surrounding the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","The third layer was already in existence but had a prerequisite."]},{"number":765,"title":"Chapter 765 - Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage","paragraphs":["As Master Lan Qin continued looking forlorn, Lin Yuan lowered his hand, and a new Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl appeared in his hand.","Lin Yuan’s action floored the people present, but Long Tao and Li Xuan soon recovered.","Lin Yuan handed the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to Master Lan Qin and said, “Master Lan Qin, I still have some Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. If you want to study them, you can have this one.”","Master Lan Qin quickly waved him away and said, “Young Lord, you cannot do this.”","Master Lan Qin had already made a general observation of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was not a complicated lifeform, but its appearance was extremely strange.","Master Lan Qin was unable to come to a definite conclusion about the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl. She felt that it had to be a succulent-type fey similar to the String of Pearls.","Master Lan Qin was not alone. When Lin Yuan had first laid eyes on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, he was stunned too.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s child ramets did not look like its ortet. Yet, Lin Yuan viewed this as a positive feature.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s ortet looked very similar to the Flower Brocade Pearl, but its child ramets differed from the Flower Brocade Pearl vastly in terms of appearance.","Rather, the child ramets resembled the String of Pearls.","The String of Pearls was a healing-type fey that was often disregarded. Hence, it was difficult for one to link it to the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","It was just like how if Lin Yuan summoned Genius and Chimey and said that they were the Hundred Questions Beast and Sound Bird, he would immediately be called crazy.","Master Lan Qin had not accepted the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, so Lin Yuan said, “Master Lan Qin, you gave me a set of study materials just now. Take this Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl as a gesture of my thanks.”","Master Lan Qin was quiet by nature, and she became even more solemn when she reached middle age.","However, when she heard what Lin Yuan said, she could not help but roll her eyes.","My study materials are only worth 5,000 Federation dollars and are even tossed aside by people!","However, when she saw Lin Yuan’s sincere gaze, Master Lan Qin smiled and reached out to take the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl from Lin Yuan.","“I shall study this Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl for a month, after which you can retrieve it.”","Lin Yuan did not oppose her proposition because he knew that she might not take the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl with her if he did.","“Sure. But I won’t be returning the information you’re giving me!”","Master Lan Qin was slightly surprised.","When she looked at Lin Yuan again, her gaze was different now. It was gentler and kinder.","“You better make good on your word. Don’t you dare return any of it to me.”","Master Lan Qin accompanied Lin Yuan, Long Tao, and Li Xuan to the Fey Observer Association’s lobby. As she watched Lin Yuan’s figure grow smaller, she could not help but sigh to herself.","You really can’t help but like this boy!","When they left the Fey Observer Association, Li Xuan stuck his thumb out, and a fey carriage appeared in front of him.","The moment the fey carriage appeared, the people around the entrance of the Fey Observer Association could not hold their gasps to themselves.","The unanimous gasp of amazement was almost deafening.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan was seeing a fey carriage.","There were six handsomely vibrant avian-type feys at the front of the fey carriage.","These six avian-type feys carried themselves with intimidating power, akin to the might of dragon-species feys.","However, the aura emanating from these six avian-type feys was more subtle and elegant than that of dragon-species feys.","Lin Yuan instinctively used True Data to check these beautiful avian-type feys and discovered that they were all luan-species feys with pure bloodlines.","The bloodlines of these six luan-species feys were on the cusp of being unlocked. If the opportunity arose, they would likely evolve into main phoenix-species feys.","Li Xuan stroked one of the Afterglow Mist Cinnabar Phoenixes and spoke to them before saying to Lin Yuan and Long Tao, “Brothers, get on! We’re not far from the House of Enviable Fragrance, and it’ll be even faster on this Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage.”","Long Tao rolled his eyes at Li Xuan and said to Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, if not for you, Li Xuan would never allow me to ride his Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage. This is his baby.”","Li Xuan seemed to silently be confirming what Long Tao said as he responded jokingly, “Of course. If it was just you, I wouldn’t have summoned the Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage. At the most, I would have ordered a Divine Travel Black Swallow for you.”","Long Tao scoffed. “You can ride on the Divine Travel Black Swallow yourself. It might even cure your chronic hemorrhoids.”","Lin Yuan immediately nodded in understanding. It seemed that everyone agreed that the Divine Travel Black Swallow was not comfortable to ride on.","But how does Long Tao know that Li Xuan has hemorrhoids?","Lin Yuan could not help but be curious.","He had never been especially interested in fey carriages, but when he saw the carriage that the six Afterglow Mist Cinnabar Phoenixes were pulling, he decided that he would have to ask Hu Quan to create a fey carriage when he returned home.","The fey carriage was just too cool.","At that moment, Lin Yuan finally understood why men liked cars.","The decoration of the carriage’s exterior, along with the six feys that pulled it, painted an unbelievably beautiful picture.","When Lin Yuan climbed into the carriage, he realized that the interior was much more spacious than it appeared from the outside.","The Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage’s interior was decorated with a carpet made of the feathers of various avian-type feys, and a long table in the center of the carriage had several jade-textured utensils in the shape of the Afterglow Mist Cinnabar Phoenix.","There were also several fruits on the table, whose fragrance permeated the air in the carriage. The pleasant scent created a comfortable environment when mixed with the mist as the carriage soared through the sky.","Lin Yuan felt that he was floating in a magical land illuminated by the afterglow.","Long Tao and Li Xuan looked at Lin Yuan with dumbfounded expressions. It was clear that they could not figure out how to say what they wanted to say.","Long Tao and Li Xuan immediately knew what each other was thinking."]},{"number":766,"title":"Chapter 766 - A New Source-Type Lifeform","paragraphs":["Long Tao had not tried to snatch the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl out of friendship.","But now that he knew Lin Yuan still had more Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, it was natural for him to want to try his best to gain one.","If Coiling Dragon’s Valley could gain enough Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, the Long family would have a high chance of lifting themselves up to a new level and be able to beat other elite factions with similar roles.","Although Lin Yuan was enjoying the decoration in the Six Phoenix Afterglow Mist Carriage and the scenery of the afterglow, he was still thinking.","He was also waiting for the pre-requisite for the third level of his scheme to be fulfilled.","Lin Yuan had noticed Long Tao and Li Xuan looking at him with suppressed expressions of eagerness.","His finger tapped on the long table. It seemed that he could expect a significant harvest at the dinner later on.","Since it was going to be a deal made with two top factions, there would be an immense exchange of resources. It would be a good chance for Lin Yuan to gain the rare resources that he lacked.","Lin Yuan and Long Tao already had a relationship, but Lin Yuan was not going to compromise in a deal between factions.","A bony hand appeared in his line of vision, holding a red lychee.","He immediately recognized this hand as belonging to Long Tao.","Lin Yuan took the lychee.","Long Tao picked out a pear for himself and took a bite before saying, “Although the House of Enviable Fragrance has a buffet, there won’t be many vegetables. Most of the food will be roasted and fried. You should eat some fruits first to prepare your stomach.”","Shi Xu and Zhao Xiaochun came to Long Tao’s mind.","Shi Xu had become clingy and headed to Dragon Gate Guild Club whenever he had the chance.","Both the Rhine Guild Club and Dragon Gate Guild Club’s members knew that Shi Xu was acting this way to court Zhao Xiaochun.","But it was currently the latter half of the S Tournament season, and the competition matching had not been settled yet.","No one could say whether or not the Dragon Gate Guild Club would be grouped with the Rhine Guild Club.","During this time, even the movements of the reserve team members from both guild clubs would be scrutinized, much less the main team members.","Long Tao had contacted Li Ang several times, but Li Ang seemed unbothered.","What made Long Tao bewildered was that not only did Li Ang appear unbothered, but he was also accepting interviews almost obsessively.","He’s already born with average looks and has a messy beard. What is he thinking? Because of all his interviews, as the Dragon Gate Guild Club captain, I have no choice but to attend some events to quell the rumors about Shi Xu.","The thought of the rumors made Long Tao’s blood boil.","The Dragon Gate Guild Club allowed their members to act rashly, but they also wanted to find a safety net.","If Shi Xu really joined the Dragon Gate Guild Club, Long Tao would be overjoyed.","Unfortunately, Shi Xu would never join the Dragon Gate Guild Club. He only came to find a life partner.","During this time, Shu Xu seemed to have given up eating in favor of spending time with Zhao Xiaochun.","Long Tao knew that Shi Xu had opened the House of Enviable Fragrance for Zhao Xiaochun’s benefit, but it seemed like overkill to tailor the menu completely to Zhao Xiaochun’s tastes.","Shi Xu is really a sucker. Since you have the guts to chase Zhao Xiaochun, it serves you right to be broke!","Although Long Tao was begrudging Shi Xu and Zhao Xiaochun internally, his expression remained unchanged.","Lin Yuan’s eyelid twitched when he heard what Long Tao said, and he could not help but feel that the owner of the House of Enviable Fragrance had good taste.","He did not enjoy eating vegetables at all. As long as he had meat to eat, he would even be fine with not eating vegetables for a whole year.","Lin Yuan’s favorite kind of food also happened to be the fried kind.","Li Xuan watched in shock as Long Tao handed Lin Yuan a lychee before rolling his eyes so far back that he almost saw the back of his head.","He had assumed that Long Tao and Lin Yuan merely knew each other, but he did not know that their relationship was so friendly.","It even appeared as though the both of them were old friends.","But no matter how close they were, Long Tao had never given Li Xuan a lychee before despite also being close.","This indicated that Long Tao was ready to talk about the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with Lin Yuan.","Li Xuan already had a Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl but the more, the merrier when it came to something as valuable as the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s three Class 4 Creation Masters might not be able to compete with the Long family’s nine, but Li Xuan felt that it would be enough if he could gain three Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls from Lin Yuan.","Li Xuan was not like Long Tao who was the only direct descendant of Coiling Dragon’s Valley and was destined to inherit the entire Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","Rather, Li Xuan always had to compete with the other disciples in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","If he could gain a few Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, he would be able to curry favor with his seniors in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Moreover, Li Xuan felt that his seniors would be happier if he could form a connection with Lin Yuan than if he brought back a few Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, after all. His status was enough for Li Xuan’s seniors to pay close attention to him.","As Lin Yuan expanded Sky City, he realized the importance of connections.","Li Xuan had grown up in a top faction, so it need not be said that he was also aware of this.","He decided that he would ask Lin Yuan to trade Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with him before Long Tao could. However, he needed to come up with an appropriate item to trade for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Since he was the one initiating the trade, he could not ask Lin Yuan what he wanted.","As the Moon Empress’ disciple, Lin Yuan could even ask for the stars without batting an eyelash.","Suddenly, Li Xuan remembered something that had recently come into his possession.","But Li Xuan was rather reluctant to trade this item even if it meant that he would receive Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","However, further thought about the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls’ effects on Creation Masters and his future position in the Li family made Li Xuan grit his teeth.","A light pink transparent crystal appeared in Li Xuan’s hand.","The light pink crystal jumped slightly after it was summoned. The rhythm resembled that of a young beating heart."]},{"number":767,"title":"Chapter 767 - The Source-Type Lifeform Fairys Heart","paragraphs":["It was rare for spiritual ingredients and feys to emit a pink glow. There were only a few plant-type feys that could bear flowers that radiated with pink light.","Lin Yuan had not yet noticed the pink glow coming from Li Xuan’s hand with the mist billowing into the fey carriage.","But the sound of a beating heart soon drew Lin Yuan’s attention.","Lin Yuan looked over and realized that the sound was coming from a pink rhombus gem.","He used True Data to check the pink rhombus gem.","Once he did, his eyes were permanently glued to the pink rhombus gem.","“Lin Yuan, take a look at this source-type lifeform Fairy’s Heart,” said Li Xuan.","Li Xuan handed the Fairy’s Heart to Lin Yuan.","Li Xuan had been reluctant to show the Fairy’s Heart, but he felt determined once he passed it on to Lin Yuan.","He did not launch into an introduction of the Fairy’s Heart’s abilities.","Since Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, he should be able to easily see what made the Fairy’s Heart so precious.","When Lin Yuan saw the Fairy’s Heart, he decided that he had to trade for it.","He had never divulged to anyone outside of the Return from Faraway Mansion about how he had Law Crystals.","But if Li Xuan wanted to trade for the Fairy’s Heart with Law Crystals, Lin Yuan would agree without hesitation.","The Fairy’s Heart’s abilities were just too important to Lin Yuan. It was utterly different from regular source-type lifeforms.","Regular source-type feys could form contracts with spirit qi professionals, and those that were slightly special would rely on residing in the bodies of other feys or source-type lifeforms to survive like the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee.","However, the Fairy’s Heart was completely different.","The information from True Data stated that the Fairy’s Heart could be combined with any fey.","After it was combined, it would allow the fey to transform into a fairy-type source-type lifeform.","However, the Fairy’s Heart would not disappear after it was used. Instead, it would enter the fey’s body to replace its mind and soul without affecting the fey’s original abilities and evolution potential.","Once it entered the fey’s body, a small fairy would hatch from it after some time.","When the small fairy opened its eyes, the first person it saw would become its faith and its everything.","Lin Yuan felt that this combination between the Fairy’s Heart and a fey was something out of a fantasy novel.","The fey that was combined with the Fairy’s Heart might transform into a fairy source-type lifeform, but it would lose its original mind and soul.","Hence, Lin Yuan could not use the Fairy’s Heart on the feys he had contracted.","If Lin Yuan used it on the feys he had contracted, they would undoubtedly change after their minds and souls were replaced.","They would no longer be Lin Yuan’s partners.","Frankly, it was unrealistic for him to combine the Fairy’s Heart with his own feys.","According to the Fairy’s Heart’s abilities, it could turn any fey into fairy-type lifeforms.","However, there were strict conditions or rather probabilities to consider.","Firstly, the Fairy’s Heart could only combine with feys and not source-type lifeforms, and the fey could not be a higher grade than Silver.","Next, the Fairy’s Heart’s own spiritual energy and soul were not strong, and it would be rebutted by the mind and soul of the fey it combined with if the fey was too strong-headed.","It would result in both the minds and souls of the fey and the Fairy’s Heart mutually destroying each other, resulting in both lifeforms dying.","The smarter the fey, the higher the chance of failure when it transformed into a fairy-type source-type lifeform.","Hence, it seemed the safest to choose plant-type feys because their spiritual energies and souls were exceptionally weak at Silver grade.","As long as the Fairy’s Heart was combined with a plant-type fey of Silver grade and below and was not affected by external disturbances, the success rate should be 100%.","Moreover, the Fairy’s Heart’s method of recognizing its owner was simple and secure. It could not be more convenient.","If the Fairy’s Heart could transform a plant-type fey into a fairy-type fey, it would be like giving the plant-type fey the gift of freedom.","This would fix two of the plant-type fey’s flaws.","With the intelligence of a fairy-type fey, the plant-type fey would be able to perfectly carry out a spirit qi professional’s orders.","After a fairy-type lifeform hatched from inside the plant-type fey, the plant would continue to exist.","However, the plant’s abilities would be centered in the hatched fairy’s body, and the plant would become an incubator.","If the hatched fairy-type lifeform was killed outside of the plant, it would not actually die.","With a large amount of spirit qi and some time spent under warmth, it would hatch in the plant’s body again.","As long as there was enough spirit qi, the fairy-type lifeform that hatched from the Fairy’s Heart would not die.","The last thing Lin Yuan lacked was spirit qi.","Li Xuan watched as Lin Yuan remained silent. He grit his teeth, and another identical Fairy’s Heart appeared.","Li Xuan handed the other the Fairy’s Heart’s to Lin Yuan and said, “This Fairy’s Heart was found in a Class 4 dimensional rift. It came as a pair. If it’s possible, I would like to use these Fairy’s Hearts to trade for one Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.”","When Lin Yuan received the second Fairy’s Heart, a broad smile stretched across his face.","He had been struggling over the usage of the Fairy’s Heart. The moment he saw the Fairy’s Heart, he immediately had two plant-type feys in his mind.","However, the issue was now solved without him lifting a finger.","Now both plant-type feys could be used."]},{"number":768,"title":"Chapter 768 - No Exchange Only Borrow","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As much as Lin Yuan wanted the Fairy’s Heart, he did not immediately agree.","He looked up at Li Xuan and said seriously, “I see no problem with using the Fairy’s Heart to exchange for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl. Since you’re offering two Fairy’s Hearts, I can also give you two Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.”","Before joy could bloom on Li Xuan’s face, his expression shifted when he heard what Lin Yuan said next.","“However, I cannot trade two Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. Instead, you can borrow them. Dark Clouds Bird Shrine can use them as you please.”","Li Xuan furrowed his brow, and Long Tao did too.","It seemed that they did not understand what Lin Yuan meant by ‘borrow’. They also seemed to rarely encounter such an exchange.","Borrowing meant that it would have to be returned, and once it was returned, they would no longer have access to it.","Long Tao was fine with this. If he could borrow a few Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls from Lin Yuan, Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s Creation Master resources would be increased significantly.","Besides its value, Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s Creation Master resources would also have much greater influence.","It was worth it even if he could only borrow the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","However, Li Xuan could not accept only being able to borrow them.","The Fairy’s Heart was an extremely precious source-type lifeform. It would only be worth it if he could borrow the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls for at least a year.","Any less time than a year would be a loss to Li Xuan.","He would definitely gain his seniors’ approval when he brought the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls back.","But once his seniors became used to using the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, the loss of this treasure when Lin Yuan retrieved it would upset his seniors.","Hence, Li Xuan could not accept only borrowing the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Li Xuan glanced at Long Tao and noticed that he was silently frowning.","He turned his head back and was about to give his reply to Lin Yuan when the latter chuckled and said, “Borrowing is just a method of transaction. Please don’t dwell on it. As long as you don’t sell or rent the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls out to other factions, you can borrow them for up to a century. However, if you do rent them to other factions, you will have to return them immediately.”","Lin Yuan spoke with determination, but it made both Li Xuan and Long Tao relax their brows.","The borrowing period of a century was as good as permanent trades. Lin Yuan only stipulated a time because he did not want the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to land in the hands of others.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine could understand this thought. It was just like how when the two factions were trading rare resources. They would sometimes request that the other party not allow the resources to leave their possession.","Li Xuan immediately nodded and said, “No problem. Dark Clouds Bird Shrine will never give away the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.”","He grinned and asked, “Li Xuan, may I know how many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls you have? I would like to borrow as many as possible!”","Now that Li Xuan had secured three Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls but still wanted more, Long Tao could not stay silent anymore.","“I also want to borrow a few Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. However, I don’t have any Fairy’s Hearts. Can I use other source-type lifeforms in the exchange?” murmured Long Tao.","Long Tao took out five or six different types of source-type lifeforms. A quick scan and Lin Yuan realized that none of these source-type lifeforms were less valuable than the Fairy’s Heart.","Although they were equally as valuable, Lin Yuan did not have as much use for them as he did the Fairy’s Heart.","Rather than accumulating source-type lifeforms, there were other resources that Lin Yuan needed more urgently.","Lin Yuan did not immediately reply to Long Tao. He said to Long Tao and Li Xuan, “Since you both want Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, we won’t be able to properly discuss the deals at the crowded House of Enviable Fragrance. Why don’t we push dinner back a bit and head up to the clouds for a bit first?”","Li Xuan immediately picked up on what Lin Yuan meant and said softly, “Afterglow Mist Cinnabar Phoenixes, go up into the clouds and use Shade Flowing Afterglow.”","After Li Xuan issued the order, six phoenix cries sounded out in response.","Lin Yuan looked out and saw that the Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage was rapidly soaring up to the sky.","However, the inside of the carriage did not experience the feeling of rapid ascent.","When Lin Yuan had used True Data to check on the Afterglow Mist Cinnabar Phoenixes, the ability Shade Flowing Afterglow left an impression on him.","Shade Flowing Afterglow could effectively blow the flow of spirit and energy and prevent external spying.","This greatly raised the Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage’s obscurity.","Once Shade Flowing Afterglow encased the Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage, Lin Yuan said, “Forget about source-type lifeforms. I’ll be happy to exchange for any Law Source Crystals if you have any.”","Lin Yuan’s words silenced the interior of the Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage for a full minute. Long Tao gulped and asked, “How many Law Source Crystals are worth one Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls?”","Lin Yuan reached out three fingers.","“Add a zero at the back of this number, and it’ll be worth one Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.”","The price of 30 Law Source Crystals for one Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was hefty as compared to the previous price of one Bronze/Epic fey.","However, Law Source Crystals were not useful and only had decorative functions.","When compared to the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, which could replace Creation Master resources, Law Source Crystals were as good as garbage.","Moreover, a top faction should have accumulated a mountain of Law Source Crystals after 100 years. This was why Lin Yuan could ask for 30 law source crystals.","Lin Yuan assumed that his price was already very high, but he did not expect both Long Tao and Li Xuan to reply immediately, “I want 17!”","“I want 9!”","Long Tao and Li Xuan had a simple mindset.","Li Xuan now had three Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, enough for his family’s three pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters.","With another nine, the other Class 4 Creation Masters would also be able to use the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls."]},{"number":769,"title":"Chapter 769 - ne Shattered Crystal","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Long Tao also had a similar idea. 17 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were just enough for all the Class 4 Creation Masters in his family to use.","His family definitely had enough Law Source Crystals, and they had no reason to oppose this trade.","Lin Yuan had had 10 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, and after giving Li Xuan three and one to Master Lan Qin, he was left with six.","However, Li Xuan and Long Tao wanted to trade a total of 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","“I don’t have so many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls on hand now. I currently only have six. If you want the rest, you’ll have to order in advance. I can’t be exact about how long it’ll take, but it won’t take more than eight days.”","While Lin Yuan spoke, he was already thinking. He wanted to combine the two Fairy’s Hearts with the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet.","The second he had seen the first Fairy’s Heart, he tried to decide between the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet and the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet needed to absorb the nutrients in its child ramets to strengthen itself.","Ever since Master Hong Shen had started nurturing the child ramets, he spent all his time concocting spirit fluids to speed up the growth of the child ramets. He wanted to nurture the child ramets before the ortet could react in time to absorb their energy. This would allow the child ramets to be separated from the ortet.","When Lin Yuan combined the Fairy’s Heart with the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet, it would transform into a fairy-type source-type lifeform.","He also wanted the transformed lifeform to lay eyes on him first so that he would be able to control the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet as he pleased.","This would allow Lin Yuan to suppress the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s instinct. He would not only be able to prevent the ortet from absorbing the nutrients from the child ramet but also order the ortet to inject nutrients into the child ramets so that they would be able to free themselves from the ortet as soon as possible.","Master Hong Shen would then be free to attend to other tasks.","This would save Class 4 Creation Master labor for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan need not worry about the depletion of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet’s nutrients because the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone would be able to perfectly replenish the depleted nutrients.","When the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet transformed into the fairy-type source-type lifeform and gained intelligence, Lin Yuan would probably discover new abilities that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl had never displayed as a plant-type fey.","Lin Yuan could not be sure of the speed at which the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet would be nurtured. The eight-day period was not on account of the ortet’s natural growth rate but from Genius’ Luxuriant Spirit Fluid.","Genius could concoct three bottles of Luxuriant Spirit Fluid every day, meaning it could concoct 20 bottles in a week.","20 bottles of Luxuriant Spirit Fluid would be enough for ten child ramets to separate themselves from the ortet.","Long Tao and Li Xuan were surprised to hear how easily Lin Yuan agreed to such a huge request. They were over the moon.","It was not just them who were happy. Lin Yuan was too.","This deal of 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls would allow Lin Yuan to exchange for 780 Law Source Crystals in eight days.","This deal would allow Lin Yuan to gain much more Law Source Crystals than he had gained in the past.","Lin Yuan had been unsure if the amount of Law Source Crystals he had would be enough for the Dark Death Law to evolve from Myth III to Creation I.","But now, he was confident that he had enough.","Lin Yuan suddenly thought about the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow that Long Tao had used at the Fey Observer Association.","“Long Tao, I’m wondering if you’ll be willing to trade for some of the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow with me.”","Long Tao waved his hand and handed Lin Yuan a large crystal bottle that was half-filled with purplish-golden sticky fluid.","Lin Yuan took the crystal bottle and was surprised by the weight. The Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow was indeed dense.","“This bottle of Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow is my gift to you. If you need any more, just ask. Don’t hold back!” said Long Tao.","Long Tao was definitely feeling even more positively about Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan had asked for a Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon from him, he would be in a difficult position.","Long Tao had noticed how unique the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was when Lin Yuan took it out in the Fey Observer Association. It could not be separated.","The Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon was both female and male. It would lay an egg every decade, which would hatch in five years.","Thus, the Long family was always strict over the management of the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragons. Only main Coiling Dragon’s Valley members were allowed to even look at the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon.","Only the main members had the right to extract Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow.","Every Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon was a few tens of meters long. Their large appetites allowed them to quickly absorb nutrients and produce new bone marrow.","Hence, despite how valuable the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow was, the Long family did not treasure it.","Even the Class 2 Creation Masters from Coiling Dragon’s Valley could use the bone marrow as they pleased.","This was why Coiling Dragon’s Valley still had a hold over Connected Beast Park despite their rapid expansion.","It could be said the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon was the Long family’s roots and could never be allowed to fall into the hands of others.","Even if it was Lin Yuan who wanted one, Long Tao would have to turn him down.","However, Lin Yuan knew his limits and had only asked for the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow.","Long Tao heaved a sigh of relief.","Lin Yuan did not reject Long Tao’s gift. He stored the crystal bottle with the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow in the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","He did not want the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow for himself but for Master Hong Shen and Genius.","Master Hong Shen and Genius used traditional Creation Master methods and evolved feys through the use of spirit fluids.","When used in conjunction with the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s leaves, the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow could greatly improve Genius and Master Hong Shen’s efficiency.","There were at least 1,000 drops of Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow in the large crystal bottle, which was enough for Genius and Master Hong Shen to use for a long time.","Long Tao’s gift touched Lin Yuan.. He flipped his hand, and a shattered gem the size of Lin Yuan’s pinky fingernail appeared in his hand."]},{"number":770,"title":"Chapter 770 - Treasures Came From Garbage and No Thanks Needed","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan gave the small shattered gem to Long Tao and said, “Since you gave me the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow, let me give you something in return.”","Long Tao did not want to accept what Lin Yuan was offering because the Fake Skeleton Creation Dragon bone marrow was not valuable to Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","But when he got a good look at the shattered gem in Lin Yuan’s hand, he could not bring himself to say no.","He never expected Lin Yuan to produce this Law Crystal with pure law power as such an item was the specialty of Class 5 Creation Masters.","Although Coiling Dragon’s Valley had thearch-class experts, even they would have to ask for the Moon Empress, Chef Supreme, and Bamboo Monarch’s help to produce Law Crystals with pure law power.","They would need to make a request one year in advance as well as pay a mountain of resources.","Even so, the thearch-class experts’ requests might not be approved.","Besides Law Crystals that came from the three Class 5 Creation Masters, all Myth III feys needed to absorb Law Crystals of the same type to increase their own laws and raise their power.","However, even if the Law Crystals were of the same type as the Myth Breed feys, it would be difficult for them to absorb the law power.","They also needed precious spiritual ingredients to temper the laws in the Law Crystals in order for the fey to absorb the laws.","As opposed to this, pure law power was much easier for the Myth Breed feys to absorb and enable the fey to comprehend the laws.","The Law Crystals with pure law power also had a strong ability to cause the fey to transform.","Myth Breed feys could only absorb law power when they reached Myth III, and a small piece of Law Crystal with pure law power could cause a fey stuck at pinnacle Myth II to experience World Cleansing to reach Myth III. A large number of Law Crystals with pure law power could cause a Myth Breed fey stuck at pinnacle Myth III to evolve even further.","This would complete their transformation and allow the fey to transform into Creation Breed.","Long Tao’s father had one fey that had been stuck at pinnacle Myth II for years.","His father’s fey had been secretly attacked when it had just evolved to Myth Breed and injured its roots.","Even though a Creation Master had healed it, it was difficult enough for it to evolve to Myth II. As for evolving to Myth III, it would be impossible.","Last year, his father had begged his grandfather to step out and ask the Bamboo Monarch to nurture a Law Crystal with pure law power.","Unfortunately, the one-year waiting period had ended, and the Bamboo Monarch rejected them.","Apparently, the Bamboo Monarch had been stained with bad luck and could not help nurture Law Crystals.","As such, Long Tao’s father’s spirits had been down.","As his son, Long Tao did not want to see his father so depressed.","Moreover, Long Tao was close with his father’s fey in question. It would often play with him when he was young, and it was as good as his real uncle.","Naturally, Long Tao wanted his father’s fey to break through to Myth III.","Now that Lin Yuan had given him a small Law Crystal, it was enough for the fey to cross the chasm.","When Long Tao received the Law Crystal from Lin Yuan, he stood up and bowed deeply as he said, “I’ll accept this Law Crystal. I won’t express my deep thanks for this but if you need anything in the future, feel free to ask.”","Lin Yuan was taken aback by Long Tao’s strong gratitude. He immediately realized that the Law Crystal he had given to Long Tao was of huge help to Long Tao.","However, Lin Yuan did not know in what way he had helped Long Tao.","He was able to produce this Law Crystal so openly because he was the Moon Empress’ disciple, which did not make his gesture seem inappropriate.","It was also because he was subtly signaling to Long Tao and Li Xuan.","Lin Yuan could use the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to exchange for 780 Law Source Crystals, which was the resource that he needed most urgently.","Lin Yuan also wanted to exchange Law Crystal fragments with Long Tao and Li Xuan, as well as complete Law Crystals.","He would need to use something less valuable to gain treasures, and the Law Crystals with pure law power was a good lead.","Lin Yuan had just given Long Tao the byproduct from manipulating Law Source Crystals.","If this could lead Lin Yuan to gain the resources he needed, he would likely be able to evolve Endless Summer from Myth III to pinnacle Myth III before the Guard Ye Banquet.","This would enable Endless Summer to undergo the Trial of World Creation and become Creation Breed.","Given the precious nature of the resource, Lin Yuan could not bring up the Law Crystal trade so easily.","He needed the other party to initiate the conversation.","Lin Yuan also would not allow the Law Crystals with pure law power to fall into the hands of others.","Something as useful as this could only be used by his inner circle, like Bronze/Legend feys.","Long Tao was overwhelmed with excitement when he saw the Law Crystal with pure law power while Li Xuan’s eyes widened significantly.","At the thought of his family’s situation, a look of resolution appeared in Li Xuan’s eyes mixed with happiness.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was different from Coiling Dragon’s Valley because Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had only become a top faction in the last 70 years.","They still lacked the solid foundation that Coiling Dragon’s Valley had.","In their early days, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had relied on Coiling Dragon’s Valley to raise themselves.","Although the Li family had dominated more than 50% of the market on numerous avian-type feys in recent years, they still lacked the right to request the Moon Empress, Chef Supreme, and Bamboo Monarch to create Law Crystals for them.","Li Xuan did not need to trade many Law Source Crystals with Lin Yuan in order to form a supply chain with him.","His position in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would soon rise higher than some of his seniors.","Lin Yuan, Li Xuan, and Long Tao had discussed all that they wanted to discuss in the Six Phoenix Afterglow Luan Carriage above the clouds. During the meal, they only had casual and happy conversations.","Although Lin Yuan did not drink alcohol often, he still shared one cup with the other two.","Outside of their trading, Li Xuan and Long Tao were extremely outstanding disciples.","Once they acquainted themselves, they saw how late it was and left contact numbers for each other.","Lin Yuan proceeded to return to the mansion."]},{"number":771,"title":"Chapter 771 - Red Thorns Request to Evolve","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan returned to the mansion, he saw Liu Jie packing up the dishes on the table.","Liu Jie noticed Lin Yuan’s return and said, “Lin Yuan, Master asked me to go to the Spirit Guards’ land so that she can help evolve my sacred source lifeform. I may have to stay there for the next few days. I’ll return before the Guard Ye Banquet so that we can go together.”","Liu Jie had told Lin Yuan early on about how he had contracted a sacred source lifeform, but he did not tell Lin Yuan about its abilities to prevent Lin Yuan from worrying.","As such, there was no reason for Liu Jie to hide his reason for going to the Spirit Guards’ land.","Lin Yuan walked over and helped Liu Jie pack the food. He also prepared himself to immediately combine the Fairy’s Heart with the Flower Brocade Pearl after transforming Red Thorn in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","After the Flower Brocade Pearl became a fairy-type lifeform, it would be able to produce a high number of ripe child ramets.","Although Lin Yuan had been relying on his own strength to advance himself, he had never truly pulled away from the Moon Empress’s influence.","Without the Moon Empress, he would have died at the hands of Cheng Wu or in the water world dimensional rift.","Before, he had evolved several valuable feys in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, such as the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp.","However, he never thought of giving those items to the Moon Empress because the Radiant Moon Palace had feys that had just as good or even better abilities than the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp.","Although Lin Yuan would be able to show his sincerity to the Moon Empress by giving her the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp, it would be useless to her.","When Lin Yuan decided to nurture Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, he had planned on nurturing 100 of them to give to the Moon Empress.","The 100 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were going to be Lin Yuan’s gesture of sincerity.","It would also be the first proof of Lin Yuan’s improvement over the last eight months.","After he sent Liu Jie off, Lin Yuan flashed himself into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan was stunned the moment he entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone because he saw the Mouth of Relinquish in the slumbering Red Thorn trembling violently.","The trembling Mouth of Relinquish was covered with concentrated plant energy.","When the plant energy exploded around the Mouth of Relinquish, it seemed that it was going to rip out of the Mouth of Relinquish.","However, the Mouth of Relinquish was a resilient wall that kept the plant energy secured inside.","Lin Yuan quickly went up to it and placed his hand on the part of the Mouth of Relinquish that was not covered with teeth as he circulated his spiritual power to sense the changes taking place in Red Thorn.","He could not contain the delight that rose in him.","The plant energy came from the Source Seed that Red Thorn had absorbed.","Lin Yuan did not expect so much plant energy to come from one Source Seed.","He immediately took out the third Source Seed and dropped it into the half-open Mouth of Relinquish.","The plant energy had been stuck in the Mouth of Relinquish, but now, the sleeping Red Thorn was like an awakening beast that was ferociously roaring.","The violent sound waves coming from the Mouth of Relinquish made Lin Yuan’s ears ring.","Lin Yuan watched as the Mouth of Relinquish opened and closed continuously and felt that it resembled a sommelier that was savoring a divine wine.","He could sense Red Thorn’s plea through his connection with its bloodline.","In the past, Red Thorn’s pleas were only made while it was evolving. But this time, it had issued a plea after consuming two Source Seeds.","However, this plea was different from those that Red Thorn had issued in the past. Previously, the pleas were asking Lin Yuan how it should go about unlocking a new ability.","But this time, it was asking Lin Yuan which of its two abilities it should evolve.","Lin Yuan pondered over the query.","It had not been easy for Red Thorn to progress to where it was now from the Source Seed it had started out as.","Red Thorn was Lin Yuan’s first source-type lifeform and was his earliest partner after Chimey and Genius.","It was also the result of his parents offering up their lives and service.","Lin Yuan had invested a lot of effort into nurturing Red Thorn.","The first direction that Lin Yuan had taken when nurturing Red Thorn was to supply it with energy by allowing it to consume flesh.","This allowed Red Thorn to become a predatory plant and caused it to grow the Mouth of Relinquish.","The second direction Lin Yuan had taken was apparent in Red Thorn’s digestive ability.","Its digestive ability allowed Red Thorn to grow a corrosive cavity that complemented the brutal vine ramet and caused it to grow the Tongue of Relinquish.","This direction fulfilled Lin Yuan’s initial dream of developing Red Thorn’s combat style.","The style came from countless improvements.","The third direction that Lin Yuan had evolved Red Thorn was its method of proliferation.","With the first and third evolutions, Red Thorn was now a fey that could fight by relying on a colony.","Spore Growth allowed Red Thorn to fight using its sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan felt that Red Thorn’s third evolution was the main one.","The third evolution allowed Red Thorn to gain Spore Growth and also connected Red Thorn’s first and third evolutions.","The three evolutions together formed a unique combat system.","As for the fourth evolution direction, Lin Yuan had evolved Red Thorn’s storage ability.","This increased Red Thorn’s stamina and allowed Spore Growth to expand its reach.","Essentially, Red Thorn’s abilities improved overall and raised its tolerance in battle.","The Eye of Relinquish that had emerged from the fourth evolution not only increased Red Thorn’s storage ability during battle but also helped Red Thorn expand its reach. The leftover Eyes of Relinquish would be sent to the sea of flowers through the vines connecting Red Thorn and the child ramets.","From this, the blood energy stored in the Eyes of Relinquish would become the source of strength for Red Thorn to attack its enemy.","In battle, Red Thorn had always relied on its corrosive digestive fluids and vines to cause damage.","When faced with a weak enemy, Red Thorn could attack from multiple directions. However, it would be stuck when faced with a strong enemy.","Nonetheless, when the Eyes of Relinquish were used in battle, they would be able to cause damage against strong feys.","This would increase the sea of flowers’ strength and attacking power, and the strong enemies would also be at Red Thorn’s mercy.","Lin Yuan could only choose two of these four impressive evolution directions to continue evolving Red Thorn.","He felt stuck in a dilemma and did not know how to go about making a choice."]},{"number":772,"title":"Chapter 772 - The Strange Sea Burial Lotus Flower","paragraphs":["The mercurial aspect of life was complex and ever-changing. Every sudden change had endless possibilities hiding behind it.","It was just like how the Tongue of Relinquish had replaced the corrosive cavity.","The useless flowers had not only provided Red Thorn with the ability to communicate with humans after it evolved, but the petals had also become gill-shaped and increased Red Thorn’s ability to breathe underwater.","After Red Thorn had absorbed a large number of water world dimensional lifeforms, its ability to breathe underwater was perfectly transferred to the brutal vine ramets through the corrosive cavity in the spore cavity.","This enabled Red Thorn to fight as well underwater as it did above water.","Such were the improvements that came with sudden evolution.","Thus, considering these sudden possibilities, Lin Yuan felt that all four abilities should be evolved.","However, the Mouth of Relinquish’s original mutation evolved again. The Source Seed that Lin Yuan had dropped into the Mouth of Relinquish acted as though it was alive as it rapidly spat out the hidden plant energy in its body.","If Lin Yuan did not make a decision soon, the Mouth of Relinquish would fail to contain the increasing plant energy.","Finally, Lin Yuan gnashed his teeth and made the best decision he could.","“Red Thorn, evolve the absorption and digestion abilities,” instructed Lin Yuan.","After Red Thorn evolved in those directions, Lin Yuan tested Red Thorn by ordering it to continue consuming while it was digesting and continuously producing more Eyes of Relinquish.","Lin Yuan only relaxed after he sensed Red Thorn’s agreement.","After Lin Yuan gave his order, the burning Mouth of Relinquish shut the plant energy off and quietened down.","But the Mouth of Relinquish remained open and continuously produced Eyes of Relinquish as Lin Yuan had instructed.","Lin Yuan returned Red Thorn to the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","Red Thorn needed to sleep for some time after each evolution. Lin Yuan did not know how long it would sleep this time.","However, he knew that once it awoke, it would present him with a huge surprise.","In the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box, Red Thorn gobbled the water world dimensional lifeforms around it and produced Eyes of Relinquish, which were transported to the Blood Brew Grapevine.","The Blood Brew Grapevine had not been without the supply of Eyes of Relinquish for long. It had only been two hours.","However, in the two hours, all the vines other than the main vine had become limp.","It looked about to wither at any time as all the nutrients had been left for the main vine.","Now that the supply of Eyes of Relinquish was restarted, the Blood Brew Grapevine could continue consuming it.","If Lin Yuan had waited till the Blood Brew Grapevine adjusted itself, he would have suffered seriously when the unripe Blood Brew Grapes wilted due to a lack of blood energy.","Lin Yuan let out a breath of relief after observing Red Thorn in the leaf-shaped Diamond fey storage box for a while.","He had decided to choose Red Thorn’s absorption and digestive abilities after careful contemplation.","He felt that they could be considered one unit supporting each other and forming the pillar that held up Red Thorn’s combat system.","Without Red Thorn’s absorption and digestive abilities, there would be no point in evolving its storage and spore abilities.","The storage ability was just a large barrel that Red Thorn could dip into when necessary.","If Red Thorn’s source of water did not change, it would not matter how good its storage medium became, and it would still be unable to store up water.","The spore ability could be seen as the way that Red Thorn expanded its reach and healed itself in battle.","Despite its importance, if Red Thorn could not supply enough blood energy, the spores would still be unable to unleash great power.","Although Lin Yuan could not be sure if there would be any benefits to evolving Red Thorn’s absorption and digestive abilities, the two abilities directly affected Red Thorn’s combat power.","Red Thorn had always been able to absorb flesh.","Red Thorn’s energy gain had been set when it divided itself and would not change significantly, but it was able to consume other items once it was evolved.","Although energy could not be obtained for evolution, the flesh could still be absorbed to strengthen itself.","Red Thorn could absorb and transfer the innate abilities in the dimensional lifeforms.","It was just like how Red Thorn could absorb the energy and transfer the abilities of metal spiritual ingredients to newly grown vines.","To what extent could Red Thorn’s fighting abilities be evolved?","Lin Yuan chose to evolve Red Thorn’s absorption ability first to change Red Thorn’s evolution potential.","But he also decided to evolve the digestive ability as it needed to have the digestive ability of a similar level.","Otherwise, when Red Thorn consumed metal spiritual ingredients, it would not be able to digest them without a strong digestive ability.","The evolved digestive ability would also increase the effects of the Mouth of Relinquish.","This would not only speed up the evolution of Red Thorn’s grade but also speed up its storage ability and evolve the production of Eyes of Relinquish.","The spore cavity would be supplied with more energy and produce more spores that could evolve the sea of flowers.","This was exactly compatible with Red Thorn’s fighting style.","All Lin Yuan needed to do now was quietly wait for Red Thorn to finish transforming.","He walked to the spirit pool and carefully studied the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower had expressed a craving for the spotted coral jade recently.","The first batch of coral jade in the Spirit Lock spatial zone had matured. Besides a portion of the spotted ones that Lin Yuan had promised to Gao Feng, Lin Yuan had set aside those that he intended on covering the bottom of Submerged Flood Dragon Lake with.","The Angelfish of Bliss in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake were all Platinum grade and did not need as much spotted coral jade.","Thus, Lin Yuan poured the remainder of the spotted coral jade into the spirit pool to cover the bottom.","When the Sea Burial Lotus Flower encountered the spotted coral jade, it started to enthusiastically absorb the pure spirit qi.","A large amount of Bone Lotus Flowers was activated to cover all the spotted coral jade at the bottom of the spirit pool to absorb the energy inside.","But contrary to Lin Yuan’s expectation, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower was not absorbing the energy inside the spotted coral jade as quickly as it did with pure spirit qi.","Instead, it was taking its time."]},{"number":773,"title":"Chapter 773 - Incubating Fairies","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower looked like a harmless small white flower.","Lin Yuan had been making adjustments to this small white flower for some time and was completely aware of its situation.","But after absorbing the spotted coral jade, many pretty corals had appeared next to the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s roots.","The corals were colorful and covered the Sobbing Sea Crystals that grew from the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s roots.","A spot was left at the bottom of the roots for Lin Yuan to pull out the Sobbing Sea Crystals.","Lin Yuan could not help but be amazed.","He also immediately understood this situation arose from the Sea Burial Lotus Flower mutating after absorbing the spotted coral jade.","After the mutation, the small white flowers on the Sea Burial Lotus Flower also grew numerous strange spots.","These spots seemed to be climbing up the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s flowers.","Lin Yuan was very familiar with the spots that were growing on the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s flowers. They came from the spotted coral jade that had been absorbed.","However, Lin Yuan was still unclear on what effects the spots would have.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower would have to absorb the spotted coral jade for some time and complete its mutation before the effects of the spots would become apparent.","At that time, he would be able to use True Data to check on the changes that had taken place in the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Lin Yuan tried touching the new corals that grew out and noticed the Sea Burial Lotus Flower suddenly reached out a rainbow coral lotus and wrapped around Lin Yuan’s finger.","This made Lin Yuan’s finger feel a warm suction and allowed him to sense a faint messy thought.","The messy thought stunned Lin Yuan, and he instantly realized that his previous guess had been correct.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower was currently mutating, and one of its markers was that its thoughts would become more apparent.","Lin Yuan circulated his spiritual power and used his finger to transfer the pure spirit qi to the rainbow coral lotus that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had stretched out. Ten minutes later, he finally plucked his finger away from the reluctant Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","He had considered forming a contract with the Sea Burial Lotus Flower before.","Now that he had two Fairy’s Hearts, he could allow the Sea Burial Lotus Flower to transform into a fairy-type source-type lifeform along with the Flower Brocade Pearl.","As long as Lin Yuan was the first person that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower saw afterward, it would make no difference if Lin Yuan actually formed a contract with the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","This would also save Lin Yuan some of his already scarce spiritual energy that he could use to form contracts with other feys.","Only a short period remained before the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s thoughts would become clear and intelligible.","As such, Lin Yuan could not wait till the Sea Burial Lotus Flower finished mutating. He needed to immediately combine it with the Fairy’s Heart.","Otherwise, when the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s thoughts became intelligible, Lin Yuan might end up sacrificing both the Sea Burial Lotus Flower and Fairy’s Heart.","Genius had been hard at work concocting Luxuriant Spirit Fluid.","Lin Yuan walked over to Genius but did not disturb it.","He waited till Genius finished concocting another bottle of Luxuriant Spirit Fluid before he picked up Genius and said, “Genius, you don’t have to concoct Luxuriant Spirit Fluid from today onward.”","Genius let out a meow and said in a child-like voice, “Then I shall help Master Hong Shen by concocting Platinum Water Potions so that the Angelfish of Bliss can evolve to Platinum grade soon.”","A surge of warmth crept over Lin Yuan’s heart, but he shook his head and said, “Genius, I’ll take you to pick out a few Hundred Questions Beasts when I return from the Guard Ye Banquet. I’ll evolve those Hundred Questions Beasts, and you can use Connected Tails to teach them to see if they can pick up how to become Creation Masters.”","Genius said with an air of responsibility, “I will be a good teacher and teach those kitties properly. I’ll make sure that they will be of help to you.”","Lin Yuan could not help but scratch Genius’s small nose.","Genius was even smaller than the average Hundred Questions Beasts, yet it was calling them kitties.","Lin Yuan massaged Genius’ head and said, “If you’re successful, you won’t have to work so hard anymore.”","Genius nodded obediently and nudged Lin Yuan’s with its voluminous tails as a show of clingy affection.","Chimey, which had stayed in the nest in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, saw that Genius was finally starting to relax and quickly flew over to land on Genius’ head.","Its small feet stepped on Genius’ head as though asking Genius if it had forgotten about Chimey’s live stream.","Although Chimey had become Gold/Fantasy, it still could not figure out how to work Star Web’s live stream.","Hence, it had not dared to live stream all this time as it was afraid that a GIF would block it without Genius’s help.","After Lin Yuan played with Chimey for a while, Genius and Chimey went back to the top of the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree.","Lin Yuan laid the Sea Burial Lotus Flower and Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl on each side of him.","He placed each Fairy’s Heart on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet and flower core of the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","Soon, the pink gems that were the Fairy’s Hearts started to crack.","The pink energy flowed from the gem into the Sea Burial Lotus Flower and Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","Shortly after, the pink energy disappeared, and Lin Yuan quietly waited for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl and Sea Burial Lotus Flower to change.","It was not long after that Lin Yuan saw a flower grow out of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl ortet and the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s flower core.","The flower stopped growing after it reached a height of one meter and a small ball grew at the top of it.","The small ball started to expand, and Lin Yuan was sure that it was a fruit.","The fruits that were growing on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl and Sea Burial Lotus Flower were different in that the one on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl was golden with pink patterns while the one on the Sea Burial Lotus Flower was white with moving colored spots."]},{"number":774,"title":"Chapter 774 - The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls Transformation into a Fairy","paragraphs":["It was actually not urgent whether the Sea Burial Lotus Flower finished mutating or not.","Once it transformed into a fairy-type source-type lifeform, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower would still be able to absorb spotted coral jade and continue mutating.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower would be able to communicate clearly with Lin Yuan when it gained intelligence and would choose the spotted coral jade for itself.","There were many different kinds of spots on the coral jade, and almost every ten spots were different.","When Lin Yuan had been nurturing the spotted coral jade, he did not think to organize them and just took whatever he saw.","However, now that he thought about it, it seemed that the more spots a coral jade had, the better it was for the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s evolution.","Both flowers started off growing at the same rate.","But it soon became clear that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s flower was growing much faster than the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s flower.","The fruit had to be containing the fairies that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl and Sea Burial Lotus Flower was going to transform into.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower was slightly slower because the transformation faced resistance from the messy thoughts forming in the Sea Burial Lotus Flower.","While the two fruits grew larger, they were also expeditiously absorbing the spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan placed his hand on the fruits and circulated his spiritual power to inject pure spirit qi into the fruits.","With Lin Yuan’s help, the two fruits were visibly becoming larger.","Lin Yuan dared not leave the Spirit Lock spatial zone at this time in case the two rascals that hatched recognized someone else as their master.","If that happened, Lin Yuan might break out into tears.","The fairies that hatched formed a lifelong attachment to the first lifeform they saw.","The lifeform did not have to be human.","There were many lifeforms in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, not to mention that the two fairies could also gaze upon each other first.","Hence, Lin Yuan instructed Source Sand to create two separate rooms in front of him using ferromanganese chain blades.","The rooms were sealed on all sides except for the entrance where Lin Yuan stood. This would ensure that the two fairies that hatched would see him first.","Soon, the fruit on top of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s flower broke open.","A small fairy with transparent wings about the size of Lin Yuan’s palm flew out.","The fairy’s long pink hair was the same shade of pink that was on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","The fairy’s white skin contrasted against the golden tutu it was wearing. The round tutu made it look like a golden bell.","After the fairy hatched, it started to inspect its surroundings curiously and flew over to Lin Yuan the moment it spotted him.","It held Lin Yuan’s face and stroked it affectionately before flying around him in a dance-like fashion.","At that moment, Lin Yuan noticed that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fruit was also about to break open.","He quickly hid the hatched fairy behind him to ensure that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy would see him first.","A small figure in white armor that was etched with lotus flower carvings and had three sets of silver wings at its back emerged.","Its long silver hair swayed behind it, and it looked like a blooming silver lotus.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy was dazed for a moment before it laid eyes on Lin Yuan.","Its stern expression turned a strange scarlet as it flapped its wings and landed on Lin Yuan’s finger to look up into his eyes.","Lin Yuan was almost hypnotized by the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy. Why did it have to look at him with such a flushed expression?","Suddenly, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy started to cry out in an extremely pleasant voice.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy hurriedly waved its small hands around and seemed to be signaling something to Lin Yuan.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy had acknowledged Lin Yuan as its master after taking one look at him.","However, Lin Yuan had not formed a contract with the Sea Burial Lotus Flower. Thus, it could not communicate with him spiritually.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower and Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl had acknowledged their master like how dogs would.","Although the person had a limited relationship with the dogs, the dogs regarded the person as their everything.","It was likely that these two fairies felt closer to Lin Yuan due to this bond at first sight as compared to the feys that Lin Yuan had formed contracts with.","A thought struck Lin Yuan as he looked at the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy’s anxious movements.","Fairy-type source-type lifeforms were more intelligent than spirit qi professionals, and they could learn languages through listening.","However, it would take some time.","It would take them a month of training before they could communicate and reply freely.","But with the capable Genius as their teacher, it would not require so much time.","Lin Yuan shouted up to the top of the tree, “Genius, come teach your students.”","Genius heard Lin Yuan’s shout and let out a short meow before it tunneled out of the foliage.","It ran to Lin Yuan’s leg and climbed up to Lin Yuan’s shoulder to nuzzle his face.","“Yuan, I’ve finished learning all the Class 4 Scholar, Fey Observer, and Spiritual Ingredient Analyst knowledge. However, there isn’t any Class 5 knowledge available on Star Web to buy. Thus, I’ve been looking through the information banks on Star Web on my own and picking up random knowledge. From now on, I’ll be able to teach the little kitties even better,” said Genius in a child-like voice.","Lin Yuan knew that Genius was thinking about how it would have to teach the Hundred Questions Beasts soon.","It seemed that Genius was full of responsibility.","“Okay. Regarding the Class 5 information, I’ll take you to the Hidden Moon Pavilion with me soon. The 108th, 109th, and 110th levels are set aside for Class 5 Scholar, Fey Observer, and Spiritual Ingredient Analyst knowledge. We can go look at them together.”","While talking to Genius, Lin Yuan noticed that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy continued hiding behind him ever since the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy emerged.","Lin Yuan was slightly surprised by this.","He placed a hand behind his back, and a weight landed on his fingers.","Lin Yuan knew that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy had landed on his fingers.","He brought his hand back to his front and immediately saw the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy quivering slightly as though it was afraid of something."]},{"number":775,"title":"Chapter 775 - Six-Winged Silver Corona and Two-Winged Brocade Zither","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan immediately deemed this situation as important.","There was nothing indecent in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy had been very lively when it had just hatched.","It had not seemed afraid at all.","It all started when the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy hatched.","This meant that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy was naturally afraid of the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy.","Lin Yuan tried moving his right hand closer to his left.","When the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy came closer to the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy’s terror became more obvious.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan remembered the information that the Moon Empress had shared about fairy-type source-type lifeforms and noticed something he had missed.","There were many dragon-species feys with many dragon-species feys’ bloodlines that could not be unlocked.","As such, they would not be able to completely unlock the wyrm-species fey and terrifying dragon-species feys’ bloodlines, much less moving upwards to become the main dragon-species fey.","But it was not only dragon-species feys that had clear bloodline levels. All feys had set rankings that separated their bloodline.","There were even some feys and source-type lifeforms that had even stricter discrepancies between their bloodline rankings. This included fairy-type source-type lifeforms.","The bloodline of fairy-type source-type lifeforms was separated mainly based on their number of wings.","Fairy-type source-type lifeforms with one pair of wings were the most common and considered the lowest bloodline level.","Next up were fairy-type source-type lifeforms with two pairs of wings.","These source-type lifeforms were already considered the elite amongst fairy-type source-type lifeforms. Liu Jie’s Insect Queen and Chu Ci’s Burning Sunflower Twins were fairy-type source-type lifeforms with two pairs of wings.","In the information regarding fairy-type source-type lifeforms in the Radiance Federation, those with two pairs of wings were considered to be the top.","It was only three years ago that a fairy-type source-type lifeform had unexpectedly transformed when it evolved to Myth Breed and grew a third pair of wings.","This had completely rewritten the understanding of fairy-type source-type lifeforms in the Radiance Federation.","According to legend, fairy-type source-type lifeforms with three pairs of wings were the emperors of fairy-type source-type lifeforms. The fairy-type source-type lifeforms with only one pair of wings had zero authority.","The fairy-type source-type lifeforms with three pairs of wings also had a fair amount of bloodline power over those with two pairs of wings.","It was found that fairy-type source-type lifeforms with three pairs of wings could rely solely on their bloodline to suppress two-thirds of the fighting power of those with two pairs of wings.","It could be seen as a form of bullying.","Besides being an icon of bloodline ranking, the number of wings also indicated a fairy-type source-type lifeform’s potential.","Lin Yuan did not expect that one of the fairies he hatched using the Fairy’s Hearts would have three pairs of wings.","He felt that one of the reasons was that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower had an extremely high potential while it was mutating.","Another reason was that luck was on his side.","Otherwise, it was impossible for him to attain a fairy-type source-type lifeform with three pairs of wings so easily.","Moreover, the fairy-type source-type lifeform with three pairs of wings that was recorded had been transformed from one with two pairs of wings.","This meant that fairy-type source-type lifeforms had a chance of transforming and gaining more wings when they evolved.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy had three pairs of wings. Does this mean that the mutating Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy with an ocean of potential has a chance of transforming to gain four pairs of wings?","When Lin Yuan was about to comfort the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s three pairs of wings started to flap faintly.","It flew off Lin Yuan’s finger and landed behind the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy looked at Lin Yuan and took the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy’s hand in its own.","Lin Yuan sensed that the quivering Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy had frozen.","He immediately knew the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy to reach out to soothe the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy.","He was surprised that the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy was so empathetic.","Lin Yuan said, “Genius, use Connected Tails and transfer all knowledge regarding language, world affairs, and general knowledge to them.”","Genius responded with a meow. Its bright blue eyes shone as two of its tails fell off.","With Genius’s body as the source, the two tails extended toward the two fairy-type source-type lifeforms.","When the Connected Tails reattached to Genius’ body, Lin Yuan heard a cold and intimate voice ring out next to his ear. “Master, please give me a name!”","Another lively but more subdued voice chimed in eagerly, “Master, I want a name too!”","Fairy-type source-type lifeforms were very intelligent, and intelligent lifeforms always placed priority on being named.","Lin Yuan felt that naming could not be easier.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy had bright silver hair and spots on its white armor. Its skin was fair, and its personality was haughty yet intimate. Lin Yuan felt that Silver Corona would be a good name for it.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s fairy was wearing a pink and golden skirt. It also had a very petite figure.","Although it had a lively personality, it was very obedient. Taking into account the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl’s characteristics, Lin Yuan felt that a good name for it would be Brocade Zither.","Lin Yuan said to the two fairies, “One of you shall be named Silver Corona while the other shall be named Brocade Zither. How does that sound?”","Immediately after Lin Yuan named them, he heard the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s voice in the depths of his soul.","“Lin Yuan, you’ve changed!” said the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Lin Yuan was surprised by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s words. He did not understand how he had changed.","Did I become more handsome?","However, Lin Yuan could tell that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was a bit hurt from sensing his soul.","He did not know what had happened to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, but he knew of a good way to comfort it.","Lin Yuan said to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, “I’ll treat you to a feast soon. I’ve accumulated almost 1,000 Law Source Crystals.”","Once Lin Yuan spoke, he used his soul to sense the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s mood and realized it was no longer upset."]},{"number":776,"title":"Chapter 776 - Silver Corona Completely Transformed","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was only full of happiness and hope now.","Lin Yuan could not help but sigh at how easily gluttons were placated with food.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl and Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairies murmured the names they were given, and the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy flew up to Lin Yuan’s shoulder to kiss his face.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s fairy’s cold expression became even more flushed as it whispered, “Master, I like the name Silver Corona.”","Lin Yuan did not think that it was strange for Silver Corona to kiss him as it was just a sign that it liked its name.","Although Brocade Zither also wanted to fly up to Lin Yuan’s shoulder and be closer to him, it did not dare to land next to Silver Corona.","Silver Corona noticed how Brocade Zither was acting and pulled Brocade Zither down to land on Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","“Master, I like my name too,” said Brocade Zither meekly.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Silver Corona and Brocade Zither’s characteristics.","Brocade Zither’s True Data showed that it had perfectly inherited everything from the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","[Fey Name]: Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl (Brocade Zither)","[Fey Species]: Crassulaceae genus/Cyperus-type","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Source/Fairy","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Copious Juices]: Increase the amount of juices stored in the leaves and congeal it into protein when properly nourished.","[Wrap Leaves]: When the leaves mature, a layer of wood protein will form on the exterior, which will store all the energy from inside the leaves.","Exclusive Skill:","[Lively Plant Pearls]: After training, the plant pearls will form new ones if they are sufficiently nourished. When nutrients are depleted, the new pearls will provide the main pearl with some nourishment. However, if the new pearls grow newer Lively Plant Pearls, they will separate from the main body to form an independent plant pearl.","It could be said that besides the change in type, the abilities and exclusive skills were all the same.","But after the Sea Burial Lotus Flower transformed into Silver Corona, the information on True Data had changed significantly.","The information about Silver Corona indicated that it was transforming.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower had been growing quickly in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and its grade had unknowingly evolved to Silver VII/Epic.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower had always been different from other feys, and it did not evolve even when Lin Yuan injected pure spirit qi into it.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s grade and quality were connected to the strength of the Sobbing Sea Crystals.","However, after the Sea Burial Lotus Flower transformed into Silver Corona, its method of evolution seemed to have changed slightly.","Such change was indicated as a suppressed state on True Data.","Feys knew best how to evolve themselves.","When Silver Corona’s intelligence had still been developing, Lin Yuan had to guess everything about its transformation and evolution.","Now, Lin Yuan could just ask Silver Corona if he had any questions about it.","“Silver Corona, is there anything I can do to help you during your transformation?”","Silver Corona hurriedly replied, “Master, I was just about to ask you if you could pluck my Sobbing Sea Crystals for me.”","Lin Yuan was surprised by Silver Corona’s words. The Sobbing Sea Crystals were Silver Corona’s main source of energy.","Why does Silver Corona want me to pluck its main source of energy? Won’t it cause its grade to drop from Silver VII/Epic to Normal I/Normal?","However, Lin Yuan did not reject Silver Corona’s request.","Lin Yuan strode toward the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s main body and plucked the Sobbing Sea Crystals.","Once Lin Yuan plucked the Sobbing Sea Crystals, Silver Corona weakly collapsed onto Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","Brocade Zither was very nervous and worried about seeing Silver Corona fall from mid-air.","Lin Yuan checked on Silver Corona and the Sea Burial Lotus Flower using True Data and noticed that both had fallen to Normal I/Normal.","At that moment, Lin Yuan heard Silver Corona exclaim in delight, “Master, I can finally break through and complete my transformation!”","Silver Corona weakly flew over to the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s main body. A moment later, rainbow lotus flowers bloomed at Silver Corona’s feet.","The rainbow lotus flowers caused corals to grow towards the roots.","Suddenly, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s roots became active and wrapped around the corals like snakes.","Finally, the roots seemed to melt and combine with the corals.","The spots on the corals quickly moved toward the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s white flowers through the roots and caused the number of spots on the white flowers to double.","At that moment, Lin Yuan noticed Silver Corona’s aura shift from its cold intimacy to intense loneliness.","This intense feeling of carnage made Lin Yuan feel as though he had returned to a desolate sea bed that only had Bone Lotus Flowers as far as the eye could see.","As the spots on Silver Corona’s armor increased and moved, a large crown made of corals appeared on its head.","The crown looked extremely odd and was at least twice as large as Silver Corona’s body.","When the crown appeared, Silver Corona’s aura started to increase.","The spots in the coral jade had mostly been transferred to the small white flowers.","Lin Yuan realized that the Normal I/Normal Sea Burial Lotus Flower had evolved to Elite X/Epic and was evolving to Bronze grade.","He also noticed that Silver Corona was no longer a carcinoma fey.","It had now transformed into a fey with true abilities.","“Master, please choose my exclusive skill!” said Silver Corona.","Silver Corona’s aura increased again when it spoke, and it broke through its Bronze grade limit to become Bronze I/Normal."]},{"number":777,"title":"Chapter 777 - Exclusive Skill","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan saw Silver Corona’s three exclusive skills, he could not help but inhale sharply.","Although Silver Corona was a carcinoma fey that had transformed, it was still a fey that was inclined toward carnage.","Lin Yuan felt that all three exclusive skills would spread copious carnage.","The three exclusive skills were:","[Hanging Devil’s Soul]: The target that Bone Lotus Flowers have attacked will have its soul trapped within the Bone Lotus Flower’s bone soul. The bone soul will have a cursing effect and use the powers of the dead to curse the living. The aura of the dead will be used to suppress the living’s vitality.","[Hermit’s Dead Servant]: The Bone Lotus Flower will absorb the target’s body when attacking it. 1% of the target’s power will be injected into the target’s soul to cause the target to be pregnant with its dead soul. The dead soul will consume itself, and when the Bone Lotus Flowers gain 36 hermit dead servants, every hermit dead servant will be able to create a layer of mist over the Bone Lotus Flowers.","[Parasitic Bone Seed]: The Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s Sobbing Sea Crystals will become a parasitic seed that will be planted in bone. When the Sea Burial Lotus Flower activates the seed, the energy in the seed will be released into the bone to increase the bone’s strength.","Lin Yuan felt that all three exclusive skills were impressive.","However, after some comparison, Lin Yuan decided to give up on Parasitic Bone Seed.","In every living being, bones only served the purpose of supporting and protecting organs.","When the bone that Parasitic Bone Seed hardened suffered physical damage, the bone would be able to sustain heavy attacks.","If Lin Yuan chose Parasitic Bone Seed, his much lacking defense would be supplemented.","Lin Yuan’s defense would be perfectly formed when used in conjunction with Genius’ Spiritual Energy Expansion and the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Spatial Shift.","However, Parasitic Bone Seed required the use of one Sobbing Sea Crystal every time the ability was used. As such, Parasitic Bone Seed would be too precious to utilize.","Moreover, Lin Yuan needed to use the Sobbing Sea Crystals to evolve the Jasmine Lily.","Lin Yuan also could not accept having a parasitic seed embedded in his body.","Although Parasitic Bone Seed was a support-type ability, Lin Yuan still felt uncomfortable about it.","Hanging Devil’s Soul and Hermit’s Dead Servant appeared to be similar, but there were vast differences between them.","No matter which of the two exclusive skills Lin Yuan chose, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower would be destined to use the sea of flowers as its main combat attack on land.","However, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s combat style was very different from Red Thorn’s.","Red Thorn’s sea of flowers was more lively and could be used in any battle.","However, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s sea of flowers needed a piece of land where the living targets’ souls could be absorbed to increase the sea of flowers’ power.","If Red Thorn’s Sea of Flowers was thought of as a weapon, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s would be more like a defensive attack mechanism that had to be rooted to a base.","Since Lin Yuan planned on going to the Divine Wood Federation, he would be able to plant many Bone Lotus Flowers around his base there.","This would allow his base at the Divine Wood Federation to become a restricted area.","Restricted areas always attracted risk-takers.","There was a saying that curiosity killed the cat.","Cats might have nine lives, but spirit qi professionals only had one.","Once news of the restricted area spread, there would be an endless stream of people who would take the risk and end up helping the Sea Burial Lotus Flower increase its power.","In order for the news of the restricted area to spread, many people had to die at the hands of the Sea of Flowers first.","As the Sea of Flowers’ power increased, there would also be even stronger individuals who stepped forward to take the risk.","Lin Yuan felt that this idea of his made him seem like some kind of Demon Lord that awaited for brave souls to challenge him.","Frankly, Silver Corona’s exclusive skills did not need to take the life of spirit qi professionals. Another good method would be to find an active dimensional rift and build a base there instead of extracting dimensional lifeforms out of the dimensional rift.","The endless supply of dimensional lifeforms would feed and sustain the sea of flowers.","When this thought struck Lin Yuan, he decided which of the two exclusive skills he would choose.","He felt that Hermit’s Dead Servant was better suited to the combat system that Lin Yuan had in mind for Silver Corona.","Hanging Devil’s Soul was not weak. In fact, it was much better at nurturing souls than Hermit’s Dead Servant.","Hanging Devil’s Soul could trap a dead target’s soul in the Bone Lotus Flowers, but there would not be much damage done to the soul.","Hermit’s Dead Servant could only incorporate 1% of the target’s power into the soul and form a dead soul in the Bone Lotus Flower.","This meant that Hanging Devil’s Soul would be much better at increasing the effectiveness of the sea of flowers.","However, Hanging Devil’s Soul was not as premium as a form of nurturing the dead soul.","Since Lin Yuan wanted to create a sea of flowers outside of his base at the Divine Wood Federation to make it into a restricted area, he needed a strong entity to defend the area.","As the sea of flowers killed more living creatures, the powers of the 36 dead servants would continue to climb as well.","This would form a cycle of support between the Bone Lotus Flowers.","Lin Yuan was also very interested in the dead servants’ ability to create a mist over a battleground.","The mist would cover the entire sea of flowers and hide it.","A restricted area was dubbed as so because it was kept very secretive.","If they could be seen clearly, it would be considered a dangerous area instead of a restricted area.","Lin Yuan made a decision and said to the waiting Silver Corona, “Silver Corona, choose Hermir’s Dead Servant!”"]},{"number":778,"title":"Chapter 778 - A Scary Ability Centered on Carnage","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After Silver Corona received Lin Yuan’s order, it immediately chose its exclusive skill.","When it was done evolving, the aura of desolate carnage dissipated, and it returned to its intimate demeanor as it flew around peering at Lin Yuan.","Silver Corona noticed Lin Yuan looking at it, and it hastily looked away. But its flushed face became like a fiery cloud that drifted over its face.","Lin Yuan was secretly surprised as he watched the flying Silver Corona.","While Silver Corona had been evolving, Lin Yuan had used True Data to check on the effects of the spots that Silver Corona had absorbed.","It was these effects that made Lin Yuan understand why Silver Corona had three pairs of wings.","From the moment it was born, it reached the pinnacle of the fairy-type source-type lifeform bloodline.","Lin Yuan composed himself before looking at the information on True Data again.","[Fey Name]: Sea Burial Lotus Flower (Silver Corona)","[Fey Species]: Water Willow/Water Bone Lotus","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Source/Fairy","[Fey Quality]: Normal","Abilities:","[Spotted Coral]: Different effects are generated when trained according to the spots on the coral jade.","1. Nurture Spot Style: Nurture the spots that were absorbed from the spotted coral jade in the Bone Lotus Flowers. The Bone Lotus Flowers will use a living being’s life and soul to nurture the spots to give them vitality. The spots with vitality can use the living being’s original strength to increase the strength and stamina of the Bone Lotus Flowers.","2. Burial Spot Style: Place the spots in between the Bone Lotus Flowers. The spots will eat the Bone Lotus Flowers and become bone insects. According to the abilities, the bone insects will retain the spot’s abilities and can deal with attacks on the Bone Lotus Flowers. The external lifeforce will be absorbed, and when the external lifeforce is still weak, their soul can also be absorbed.","[Bone Powder Mist]: The Bone Lotus Flowers will vomit out the living being’s bones that could not be digested. The bone powder will fly up into the sky and stay in the coral spots once it reaches a set thickness of layer.","Exclusive Skill:","[Hermit’s Dead Servant]: The Bone Lotus Flower will absorb the target’s body when attacking it. 1% of the target’s power will be injected into the target’s soul to cause the target to be pregnant with its dead soul. The dead soul will consume itself, and when the Bone Lotus Flowers gain 36 hermit dead servants, every hermit dead servant will be able to create a layer of mist over the Bone Lotus Flowers.","The more Lin Yuan looked at Silver Corona’s True Data, the harder it became for him to compose himself.","When Lin Yuan saw Silver Corona’s Hermit’s Dead Servant, Spotted Coral and Bone Powder Mist seemed to be very strong.","Lin Yuan had chosen Hermit’s Dead Servant to be Silver Corona’s exclusive skill because it suited the idea that Lin Yuan had in mind and because it would be compatible with Spotted Coral and Bone Powder Mist.","He had already used True Data to check on countless feys. He had also seen the data of Myth Breed feys like the Mother of Bloodbath.","However, the Mother of Bloodbath’s normal abilities were not as complicated as Silver Corona’s.","Silver Corona’s Spotted Coral was separated into two states, Nurture Spot Style and Burial Spot Style.","The spots that Silver Corona absorbed came from spotted jade, which appeared because the pure spirit qi had led the coral jade to display its life patterns.","The coral jade was the petrification of deep-sea corals, and corals were formed from countless small coral polyps.","The Nurture Spot Style used the coral polyps’ original abilities to evolve the Sea of Flowers.","Lin Yuan also knew that every kind of spot could support the Sea of Flowers to some extent.","The Burial Spot Style was the result of Silver Corona’s carnage after transforming into a fairy-type source-type lifeform.","This state allowed Silver Corona’s original attack style to become more flexible.","Once the spots nurtured by the Bone Lotus Flower entered the Burial Spot Style, they would start to eat the Bone Lotus Flowers and become bone insects.","The small bone insects would be able to kill any lifeform that entered the Sea of Flowers.","The bone insects’ attack would absorb not only the lifeform’s vitality but also its soul.","Moreover, the small bone insects would be subtly absorbing the vitality and soul, making this form of attack imperceptible.","The people who stepped into the restricted area would feel their vitality draining away and becoming weaker until they had no chance of escape.","By the time the lifeform sensed itself getting weaker, it would probably already be time for the bone insects to attack.","The Nurture Spot Style increased the sea of flowers while the Burial Spot Style enabled bone insects to release hidden explosive lethality.","This allowed the spots’ effects to be maximized to the extreme.","In order to activate the portion of the sea of flowers that the bone insects had eaten, Silver Corona only needed to accumulate its spiritual power and the vitality of the lifeform.","Silver Corona’s Spotted Coral was enough for Silver Corona to use carnage and robbery to raise its ferocity.","Bone Powder Mist was very malleable and could act as both support and attack.","The Bone Lotus Flowers would vomit out the undigested bone, but the coverage of the bone powder was not strong.","Although the bone powder could block light, it could only block spying by spirit qi professionals from a distance.","When the spirit qi professionals were near, the bone powder’s obscurity ability would weaken significantly.","But now that Silver Corona had Hermit’s Dead Servant, the 36 dead servants could all produce a layer of mist to cover the sea of flowers.","The 36 layers of mist would be able to make up for the Bone Powder Mist’s shading ability.","The actual impressive part of Bone Powder Mist was not the shading ability. It was that Bone Powder Mist increased the area of battleground that Silver Corona could control and allowed the sea of flowers to also control the battle from the air.","This would turn the battleground from being just on land to being on air instead.","Even if someone attacked the sea of flowers from the air, as long as it was in the area above the sea of flowers, they would be attacked by the bone insects, and their vitality and soul would be drained away."]},{"number":779,"title":"Chapter 779 - Brocade Zither Feels Inferior","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan waved to Silver Corona and let out a heavy breath before saying, “Silver Corona, come here.”","Silver Corona quickly flew up to Lin Yuan’s face, reached out to touch his nose, and looked into his eyes.","Lin Yuan could not help but smile brightly at Silver Corona as he waved and summoned a large amount of coral jade.","“Silver Corona, take a look at these coral jades. Pick out those that can increase the variety of your spots.”","Silver Corona bumped its face against Lin Yuan’s nose and said in a haughty and affectionate voice, “Master, you’re so nice to me!”","The crown on Silver Corona’s head lit up, and eight rainbow lotus flowers grew out of Silver Corona’s silver hair.","The rainbow lotus flower petals were like fingers that sifted through the pile of coral jades.","A calm and warm smile spread across Silver Corona’s face. It did not look like a fey that lived to kill at all.","Lin Yuan also felt slightly down when he saw how happy Silver Corona was around him.","Silver Corona was basically one of his contracted feys.","Naturally, Lin Yuan was happy that Silver Corona was strong. However, this power astonished him.","Silver Corona’s power was considered annihilation-class amongst carcinoma feys. It could be considered a king amongst carcinoma feys.","If Silver Corona casually unleashed its power, it would quickly become an unmitigated disaster.","Lin Yuan felt that this power could rival that of sacred source lifeforms.","When compared to the abilities of sacred source lifeforms, Silver Corona could not match up.","However, when it came to increasing battle power, Silver Corona could devastate any battle on land.","Lin Yuan could not help but clench his fist when he thought about this power that he held.","But when he thought about Chu Ci, the Moon Empress, Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang, and everyone in the Return from Faraway Mansion, Lin Yuan’s heavy spirits lifted and were replaced by a sense of power.","Besides being to be used as a method of killing, power could also protect.","Lin Yuan needed this power to protect those around him.","Silver Corona’s power was only at Bronze grade now. Lin Yuan could not imagine what it would become when it evolved to Myth Breed.","After Silver Corona became a fairy-type source-type lifeform, its method of evolution had changed completely.","The Sea Burial Lotus Flower could absorb pure spirit qi and condense it into Sobbing Sea Crystals. However, Sobbing Sea Crystals could no longer affect the current Silver Corona’s grade and quality.","Now, the Sea Burial Lotus Flower’s Sobbing Sea Crystals were just an innate ability.","Silver Corona and Red Thorn had similar methods of evolution now. The only difference was that Red Thorn needed to consume flesh to evolve while Silver Corona absorbed the souls of living beings to do so.","After Lin Yuan returned from the Radiant Moon Palace, he could use the Ethereal Jellyfish to activate its tentacles and open a Space Tunnel to the Divine Wood Federation.","But the basement had not been fully constructed yet. Moreover, the Guard Ye Banquet was almost here, and Lin Yuan did not have the time to personally make a trip to the Divine wood Federation for training.","Lin Yuan felt that after he created the Space Tunnel, he would need to use the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles to find another suitable location.","The location that Mystic Moon had chosen would never have a large number of low-class dimensional rifts opening there.","In order to nurture the 36 dead servants quickly, Lin Yuan could not think of a better way than to use dimensional lifeforms.","Silver Corona quickly sorted through the coral jades.","Lin Yuan laid out the coral jades that Silver Corona had chosen on the Spirit Lock spatial zone floor.","He took out another large pile of coral jades for Silver Corona to look through. Since spotted coral jade could increase Silver Corona’s battle power, Lin Yuan could move around the items in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to make more space for the nurturing of coral jades.","Ever since Silver Corona hatched, Brocade Zither had clearly been acting very shy.","Under the pressure of its bloodline, Brocade Zither could not express any overwhelming emotion, regardless of how kind Silver Corona was to it.","Lin Yuan gestured for Brocade Zither to land on his palm and said, “Brocade Zither, how many pearls can you nurture at once?”","Brocade Zither coyly reached out one finger.","Lin Yuan frowned and asked in disbelief, “1 string?”","Brocade Zither shook its head.","Lin Yuan guessed again. “10 strings?”","Brocade Zither shook its head again.","This made Lin Yuan feel relieved as he asked again in a more relaxed tone, “100 strings?”","Once again, Brocade Zither shook its head.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to happily increase his guess, Brocade Zither said sweetly, “Master, this one finger means that I can keep producing. I can produce as many strings as I please! After all, the strings are just casual snacks to me!”","Brocade Zither took a breath of pure spirit qi and continued. “With so much spirit qi in here for me to absorb, I don’t even want to eat those snacks anymore.”","Lin Yuan looked at Brocade Zither in shock. He did not expect the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl to think of the strings of pearls as snacks.","As for what it said about continuous production, Lin Yuan was rendered speechless.","He knew that Brocade Zither had misunderstood what he meant and asked, “Brocade Zither, how long does it take one string to separate itself from you?”","Brocade Zither stuck out another finger and replied, “About 1.5 hours. However, I won’t be able to eat them once they’re separated from me.”","Lin Yuan gently pinched Brocade Zither’s face and said, “You little imp. Why even think of eating these snacks when you can have all the spirit qi you want in the Spirit Lock spatial zone? Brocade Zither, nurture a few strings for me. The strings of pearls are really useful to me!”","Brocade Zither nodded in delight.","Once Brocade Zither transformed into a fairy-type source-type lifeform, it became highly intelligent. It regarded Lin Yuan as its father and felt deep affection for him.","However, Silver Corona had hatched before they could become close.","Silver Corona was born with six wings, while Brocade Zither only had two. This made Brocade Zither uncontrollably terrified of Silver Corona.","Brocade Zither suddenly felt inferior."]},{"number":780,"title":"Chapter 780 - What Does the City Lord of Sky City have to do with Lin Yuan?","paragraphs":["Now that Brocade Zither knew that it could be of help to Lin Yuan, its feelings of inferiority decreased significantly.","Brocade Zither joyfully flitted around, and its round golden tutu bobbed around adorably.","Lin Yuan brought Brocade Zither over to the Pure Land of Bliss. The Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus. which had been planted in the Pure Land of Bliss to heal itself, had been moved to the mansion’s yard.","This had left a hole in the Pure Land of Bliss that Lin Yuan had yet to fill.","Now, Brocade Zither could nurture Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls in the space left behind.","The Pure Land of Bliss would also increase the rate of production of child ramets.","Brocade Zither nurtured Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls differently from Master Hong Shen.","When Master Hong Shen nurtured child ramets, he used external energy in the form of spirit fluids.","Meanwhile, Brocade Zither injected its own energy into the child ramets.","After a prolonged period, Brocade Zither’s body would be damaged.","However, the Pure Land of Bliss was different because it had healing effects.","Brocade Zither would not be affected even if it continuously used its own resources to produce child ramets.","When Lin Yuan brought Brocade Zither over to the Pure Land of Bliss, it immediately started to plant child ramets.","Brocade Zither first planted numerous Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls in the Pure Land of Bliss before it released a golden pillar of light.","The golden pillar of light landed on the child ramets, which started to grow rapidly.","Lin Yuan squatted down by the Pure Land of Bliss’s side and carefully observed the Brocade Zither nurturing the child ramets.","He realized that Brocade Zither only needed about an hour to finish nurturing a child ramet in the Pure Land of Bliss.","According to this rate, Lin Yuan would gain 20 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls per day.","This rate of production far exceeded Lin Yuan’s expectations.","Brocade Zither was as productive as five Class 4 Creation Masters combined.","This efficiency gave Lin Yuan a new business idea.","If Brocade Zither could keep this rate up, Lin Yuan would be able to change the way he used Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. He would be able to sell the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls commercially.","When there were enough Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls in the market, Lin Yuan just needed to evolve Brocade Zither.","Once Brocade Zither gained new abilities, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls it nurtured would be fundamentally strengthened.","As such, Lin Yuan would earn a large sum again as though the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were new on the market.","This cycle would allow Lin Yuan to accumulate innumerable resources.","Although this felt slightly like cheating, it was not Lin Yuan’s fault that he was the only one who possessed the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl. Hence, no matter how shady this source of wealth was, Lin Yuan would always dominate the market.","As long as Lin Yuan continued to produce better Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, there would definitely be buyers. The stronger the effects of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, the more factions and high-class Creation Masters would want to buy them.","The factions and high-class Creation Masters would benefit from the improved effects.","Lin Yuan would be able to create more Creation Master resources while still increasing his own store of Creation Master resources.","The factions and Creation Masters who did not manage to buy any could only be resigned to being left in the dust.","Lin Yuan would control the direction in which Creation Master resources flowed amongst the factions by continuously evolving the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","When Long Tao brought back all the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that he had obtained from Lin Yuan back to Coiling Dragon’s Valley, Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s Creation Masters would be able to subdue other factions once they evolved their resources.","There were no everlasting secrets amongst factions. The Miao family would definitely learn about the existence of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls sooner or later.","Once they found out, Connected Beast Park would definitely be anxious to get their hands on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls so they could compete with Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","Otherwise, Connected Beast Park would be crushed under Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s feet.","Lin Yuan touched his chin as he fell deep into thought.","I have three different identities. My identity as the City Lord is enemies with Connected Beast Park. But what does the City Lord of Sky City have to do with my identity as Lin Yuan? As Lin Yuan, I’m the Moon Empress’ disciple! Even if the Miao family comes to me, or if I lure them here, I can always use the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to burn an enormous hole in their wallets!","Lin Yuan might be enemies with the Miao family, but he would not mind using a different identity to suck Connected Beast Park dry.","He did not mind if the Miao family obtained the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls eventually.","By the time they did, Lin Yuan would be able to evolve Brocade Zither.","At that time, Lin Yuan just needed to form another deal with Long Tao, and Coiling Dragon’s Valley would pull ahead of Connected Beast Park again.","Even if Connected Beast Park begrudged him for cheating them, they would have to approach him again, and he would be able to violently shake their pockets empty.","He would not show any mercy to the Miao family. It was a must to be as greedy as possible.","Even if Connected Beast Park could make a comeback, Lin Yuan was determined to utterly crush them.","Lin Yuan checked the time and summoned the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen from the depths of his soul.","He had gathered a fair number of Law Source Crystals and decided to let the Sacred Source Wielding Queen absorb those he had on hand first.","The Sacred Source Wielding Queen had absorbed a significant number of Law Source Crystals.","Moreover, it needed some time to absorb Law Source Crystals.","If he did not make good use of time, the Sacred Source Wielding Queen would probably be unable to finish absorbing all the Law Source Crystals before the Guard Ye Banquet.","If the Dark Death Law could not evolve into the Dark Death World because of this, Lin Yuan would be tempted to smash his head into a wall.","When he had shown Long Tao the Law Crystals, he had noticed the yearning in Li Xuan’s eyes.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would probably approach him to trade for Law Crystals in the next few days.","At that time, he would be able to gain more Law Source Crystals and complete Law Crystals."]},{"number":781,"title":"Chapter 781 - A Fey for Bei Xu","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan also placed all hopes on evolving Endless Summer to Creation Breed before the Guard Ye Banquet on the Law Crystal trades with Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","He licked his lips when he looked at the laws carved all over the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","The depiction of the world on the skirt was formed from many different laws and willpowers. It was absolutely breathtaking.","When Lin Yuan shut himself off, he would sometimes come out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone to stretch his legs.","Since the Lava Dragon Lizard’s roots were injured, it had not gone to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce to help. Instead, it had remained in the mansion to heal.","When Lin Yuan took breaks, Zhou Luo would ride the Dark Snake Spiny Dragon that had been evolved to pinnacle Platinum/Fantasy I and battle with Lin Yuan.","When the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard had been evolved to Bronze/Legend, its dragon-species bloodline had subtly entered the transformation phase.","Later, when Master Hong Shen had evolved the Dark Snake Dragon Lizard, its dragon-species bloodline was completely unlocked and became the terrifying-dragon-species Dark Snake Spiny Dragon with pure bloodline.","The Dark Snake Spiny Dragon excelled at controlling dark-type elements to curse and cause damage to targets.","When Lin Yuan fought against the Platinum X/Fantasy I Dark Snake Spiny Dragon, he did not hide his powers because Zhou Luo was basically family.","It was also a good opportunity for Lin Yuan to test Blackie’s Spirit Essence Explosion.","Lin Yuan realized that his body was highly resistant to the Dark Snake Spiny Dragon’s dark-type energy during the fights.","Although he could not completely disregard the Dark Snake Spiny Dragon’s abilities, Lin Yuan felt that he could well-withstand the dark-type element that was thrown at him.","Given this situation, Lin Yuan immediately came up with a reason for this scenario.","When Lin Yuan activated the Myth III Dark Death Law and Dead Dream Law on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, he realized that he could perfectly defend against the dark-type elemental damage from the Dark Snake Spiny Dragon.","He was astounded by this discovery and decided that he would devote more time to nurturing the world on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","As more types of laws appeared on the Sacred Sword Wielding’s skirt, the stronger the laws became.","As the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s contractor, Lin Yuan would be able to sustain various types of damage.","This was high-level protection for Lin Yuan.","As such, Lin Yuan would be able to remain fearless even in the face of solo battles against experts.","Lin Yuan gave the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen all the Law Source Crystals that he had so that it could absorb them.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen grinned blissfully and said, “Lin Yuan, there are a total of 317 Law Source Crystals here. It’ll take me more than a day to absorb them all.”","Lin Yuan nodded. As he looked at the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s obvious displays of joy, he could not help but say, “We’ll have another 780 Law Source Crystals coming in tomorrow. You can eat to your heart’s content!”","He had initially thought that it would take seven or eight days for his deals with Long Tao and Li Xuan to go through.","Now that he had Brocade Zither to independently nurture Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls for him, Lin Yuan would be able to prepare all the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls for Long Tao and Li Xuan by tomorrow.","Lin Yuan’s words made the Sacred Source Wielding Queen feel that it was the luckiest sacred source lifeform in the world.","It was dressed up prettily in laws and willpowers every day. All it had to do was concentrate on eating.","But when it thought of the deadline that Lin Yuan had in mind, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen said, “Lin Yuan, even 1,000 Law Source Crystals won’t be enough to transform the Dark Death Law into Dark Death World. It’ll require more Law Source Crystals.”","Lin Yuan did not seem to be surprised by this. If it was that easy to use law power to create a world of laws, there would not be so many feys that were stuck at pinnacle Myth III.","There would also not be so few Creation Breed feys.","“Leave the worrying about Law Source Crystals to me. You just focus on absorbing the energy inside the Law Source Crystals,” exclaimed Lin Yuan.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen suddenly felt as though its master had become slightly more handsome.","While the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was absorbing the Law Source Crystals, Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone and logged into Star Web for the first time in a long while.","Wen Yu had been managing the private faction territory while Listen managed the Purchase With No Loss store fan club.","With them in charge of the nitty-gritty tasks, Lin Yuan could set his mind at ease.","Lin Yuan did not go to the Purchase With No Loss store, nor did he check its fan club this time because it was almost time for the Astronomical Parliament.","Wen Yu would be able to hold the second meeting of the Astronomical Parliament tomorrow.","Lin Yuan had a simple reason to log into Star Web this time, which was to prepare a suitable fey for Bei Xu.","He was preparing a fey for Bei Xu even though he was not sure if Bei Xu was going to attend the parliamentary meeting because Bei Xu was just too weak in that underground world. He would die at any time without a fey by his side.","Lin Yuan was not even sure if Bei Xu was still alive.","If Bei Xu had survived the seven days and regained his seat on one of the north-south constellation seats, Lin Yuan would send a fey to Bei Xu through Star Spirit Seat even if Bei Xu did not request for one.","As the system, Lin Yuan could not watch one of the MCs die because he was too weak.","Lin Yuan had seen Bei Xu and Yin Lin’s lives through their willpowers as though he had been watching a movie.","There had been no ups in Bei Xu’s life. He had remained in the pits from the moment he was born.","Compared to the MCs that Lin Yuan had read about in novels, Bei Xu was the most tragic one.","He was so tragic that Lin Yuan was obliged to give him a helping hand.","After finding out about the terrible conditions that Bei Xu had to suffer through in the Grotto Continent, Lin Yuan had spent the last six days thinking about what kind of fey he should nurture for Bei Xu.","The fey that Bei Xu contracted had to fulfill three conditions.","The first was that the fey had to be compatible with the willpower that Bei Xu had comprehended.","The second condition was that it had to have powerful attacking power and be able to heal Bei Xu to a certain extent.","In a place where danger was everywhere, Bei Xu needed to have access to healing as well.","In the Grotto Continent, where only the factions had access to feys, it was impossible for Bei Xu to find a healing-type spirit qi professional.","The third condition was that the fey had to be able to act as a light source. Otherwise, even if Bei Xu had acclimatized to the darkness underground, his actions would be largely limited without a fey that could exude light.","Although these three conditions seemed stringent, there was one fey that could satisfy all three.","However, the method to nurture this fey was complicated and difficult.","But to someone like Lin Yuan, who had impressive abilities and pure spirit qi, he was not bothered by the complexity and difficulty."]},{"number":782,"title":"Chapter 782 - Blade Bat","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The fey that Lin Yuan had in mind for Bei Xu was called the Blade Bat, a very normal fey that could easily mutate and evolve.","Many bat-species feys with high-class bloodlines evolved from Blade Bats.","However, it was not easy to nurture the Blade Bat using one’s own willpower.","Bei Xu was affiliated with attacking-type toothed feys.","As a bat-species fey, the Blade Bat was technically a toothed fey. It had sharp teeth, which made it fit the category of toothed fey.","Bei Xu’s Willpower Rune had indicated that it was a willpower with hidden sharpness.","This kind of willpower was extremely suited to the Blade Bat’s attacking style. In fact, it fitted perfectly.","As for the second condition, Lin Yuan needed to search through the Rare Lifeform Pavilion on Star Web.","All of the Blade Bat’s Normal abilities were winged blades because it was the species’ fundamental ability.","When the Blade Bat evolved to Elite, its impressive transformation abilities would be displayed.","The Elite Blade Bat had many types of abilities. However, there was one particular ability that was rare—Bat’s Teeth Sucking.","Bat’s Teeth Sucking allowed the Blade Bat to suck the target’s blood after it was killed.","The Blade Bat would use the blood to recover the damage it sustained during the battle, and it would also be able to circulate the blood energy to its contractor to heal its contractor.","Bat’s Teeth Suckng was extremely rare, but not many people in the Radiance Federation would choose it because it was not of much help during a battle.","However, this ability would be of great use to Bei Xu.","Although Bat’s Teeth Sucking’s healing properties could not compare to that of a healing-type spirit qi professional, it could help Bei Xu survive in the perilous underground environment.","The ability to light up was one of the Blade Bat’s innate abilities because it had a fusiform-shaped horn on its head.","Its main function was to help the Blade Bat with echolocation.","In an underground world full of rocks and obstacles, the Blade Bat’s echolocation ability would be much more useful than a pair of eyes.","When there was too much vitality in the Blade Bat, the fusiform-shaped horn would be filled with energy and glow dark red.","This would solve the issue of light to a certain extent.","It could be said that the Blade Bat was made for Bei Xu.","The Blade Bat was not an expensive fey in the Radiance Federation. It was of a similar price to Chu Ci’s Sharp Iron Horn Bull.","Normally, spirit qi professionals who ventured into subterranean dimensional rifts would contract the Blade Bat. Hence, there was a supply of Blade Bats on the market, and most of the low-class Blade Bats that were recorded on Rare Lifeform Pavilion had rare Elite abilities.","After browsing, Lin Yuan soon found the Blade Bat with Bat Teeth Sucking and bought it at a price of 80 Radiance dollars.","It was easy to buy the Blade Bat, but Lin Yuan would need to invest a fair amount of resources and effort into nurturing it.","Since the Blade Bat mutated easily, it had to set a good foundation when it was Bronze grade.","The Blade Bat was a metal- and dark-type fey. Bei Xu’s hidden sharpness willpower leaned toward dark-type. Hence, Lin Yuan needed to try his best to trigger the Blade Bat’s dark-type bloodline so that it would mutate in the direction of dark-type.","The Blade Bat’s specialty was that it could consume feys’ blood to evolve itself.","Lin Yuan did possess some essence blood that had come from Nightmare VI on the deserted island.","The Dream-Eating Bat had mutated from the Blade Bat.","Lin Yuan decided to allow the Blade Bat to consume a drop of the Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood when he was nurturing the Blade Bat.","The drop of Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood should be enough to trigger the dark-type in the Blade Bat’s body and suppress the metal-type.","This would allow Bei Xu to bring out the best effects when he combined his Willpower Rune with the Blade Bat.","Lin Yuan left Star Web after he bought the Blade Bat.","He was not ignoring Yin Lin.","Yin Lin had been blind since birth, and the world that he sensed through her was one that only the blind could understand.","The world was messy and only had touch, sounds, and imagination.","However, Lin Yuan could not be certain of Yin Lin’s location from this world he sensed. Hence, he could not prepare a fey for her.","But according to the limited senses that he gathered from Yin Lin’s willpower, he was sure that she was no commoner. After all, Yin Lin had an accurate sense of taste, and the things she ate were of Gold ingredients.","The Blade Bat that Lin Yuan had bought on Star Web was about to arrive.","When it arrived, Lin Yuan started to evolve the Blade Bat.","After Lin Yuan evolved the Blade Bat to Elite, he took out the bottle of Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood.","The crystal bottle was filled with about 20 drops of Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood.","Lin Yuan hesitated for a moment before he fed a drop of the essence blood to the evolving Blade Bat.","The Blade Bat’s greyish-black body glowed black tendrils of blood aura after it consumed the drop of essence blood.","The black tendrils of blood aura seeped out of the Blade Bat’s body and shattered the spots on the Blade Bat’s wings.","Lin Yuan suddenly realized that he had been too careless. Although the Blade Bat could consume the essence blood of feys to evolve its powers, the Dream-Eating Bat was a Suzerain/pinnacle Myth II fey.","Using True Data, Lin Yuan discovered that this Blade Bat was about to die.","Just when he thought that he would have to go back to Star Web to find another Blade Bat with Bat Teeth Sucking, he suddenly realized that this Blade Bat seemed to have started to absorb the Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood.","The energy from the Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood filled up the Blade Bat and healed the Blade Bat’s broken wings.","This turned the hair on the Blade Bat from greyish-black to inky black."]},{"number":783,"title":"Chapter 783 - Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess Wants to Compete with Other Hosts","paragraphs":["Under the influence of the Dream-Eating Bat’s essence blood, the Blade Bat successfully evolved.","While it was evolving, the bloodline mutated several times in succession. It transformed from the Blade Bat to the Sharp Blade Blade Bat to the Shadow Blade Bat and finally Sharp Shadow Bat.","The transformation to the Sharp Shadow Bat occurred when Elite/Epic evolved to Bronze grade. Hence, three exclusive skills appeared after the evolution to Sharp Shadow Bat was completed.","[Shattered Sharp Shadow]: During an attack, the bladed wings will shatter while cutting their target and increase the size of the wound inflicted.","[Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed]: The venom in the Sharp Shadow Bat’s fangs will be injected into the target and turn the target into a blood zombie.","[Bat’s Burial]: Set the blood in the body alight and use its own power to abruptly break through its limits. After the blood is burnt through, the body will enter a near-death state due to the lack of blood.","After seeing the three exclusive skills’ information, Lin Yuan chose Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed without hesitation.","Shattered Sharp Shadow depended on the attacking power of the Sharp Shadow Bat’s wings and increased the damage dealt from one slash to a small blast.","It would even explode a hole in the target’s body and cause the organs inside to fall out through the hole.","Although Shattered Sharp Shadow could increase the Sharp Shadow Bat’s damage power, it was centered on the Sharp Shadow Bat’s original attacking power.","It would be slightly useful during a battle but would not make much of a difference. After all, its effectiveness depended on whether the wings could break through the target’s defense.","Bat’s Burial was a suicidal technique that set fire to the blood.","If Bei Xu used this ability, the Sharp Shadow Bat would become useless in the battle.","In a near-death state, the Sharp Shadow Bat could not recover itself through Bat’s Teeth Sucking.","Thus, Lin Yuan saw Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed as the only choice.","Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed was truly impressive. It allowed Bei Xu to be able to control other spirit qi professionals in the lonesome underground world of the Grotto Continent.","Bei Xu sorely needed this ability.","Blood and betrayal were rampant in the underground world. Bei Xu’s lackeys could be killed the moment he blinked.","Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed alleviated Bei Xu’s worries about always having to look over his own shoulder.","Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed allowed the Sharp Shadow Bat to have complete control over the blood zombies. When injured during battle, the blood zombies’ vitality could even be extracted for self-healing.","Even if Bei Xu’s power to create blood zombies was not strong, it was enough to act as a moving healing source.","This was enough to make Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed worth it.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Bronze Sharp Shadow Bat. He realized that the Sharp Shadow Bat’s Normal and Elite abilities had also evolved.","[Fey Name]: Sharp Shadow Bat","[Fey Species]: Toothed Bat Species/Horseshoe Bat Species","[Spirit-Lifeform Grade]: Bronze (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Dark","[Fey Quality]: Normal","Abilities:","[Winged Shadow Blade]: Flap the wings to create the image of the bladed wings.","[Bat Colony Sucking]: Summon a colony of bats made from shadows to suck the target.","Exclusive Skill:","[Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed]: The venom in the Sharp Shadow Bat’s fangs will be injected into the target and turn the target into a blood zombie.","Now that the Blade Bat had evolved into the Sharp Shadow Bat, the close-combat fey could fight from a distance using shadows.","Winged Blade had transformed into Winged Shadow Blade. It would definitely be more flexible during battle.","Fighting from a distance would also reduce the likelihood of the Sharp Shadow Bat sustaining damage.","Bat’s Teeth Sucking had evolved into Bat Colony Sucking, which delighted Lin Yuan.","Although Bat’s Teeth Sucking would not be of much use during battle because it needed the Blade Bat to be close enough to the target to suck its blood, the target did not need to be dead to use Bat’s Teeth Sucking.","It was just that the Blade Bat needed to attach itself to the target to suck its blood.","The Blade Bat could not move around easily when it was sucking the target’s blood and would be injured easily. It was safer to suck the target’s blood after killing it.","But Bat Colony Sucking avoided this issue and could be used during battle.","Bat Colony Sucking would be able to summon a large number of shadow bats, which would use their sharp fangs to attack the target and suck the target’s blood to heal the Sharp Shadow Bat.","Lin Yuan nodded in satisfaction as he looked at the Sharp Shadow Bat he had nurtured.","He also could not help but be amazed by the improvement in abilities that came from the evolution of a fey’s bloodline.","Lin Yuan called Genius down from the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree again and instructed it to concoct a spirit fluid that could evolve the Sharp Shadow Bat.","He also started to evolve the Bronze/Normal Sharp Shadow Bat and prepared to spend the rest of the day evolving it until it reached Legend quality.","Lin Yuan was willing to break the bank for Bei Xu because he had seen a resemblance in Bei Xu’s will for survival with that of Chu Ci.","Both did not shy away from hard work and maintained hope despite being in unfavorable environments.","Moreover, Lin Yuan also had great ambition to expand Sky City to other continents. It was just that his current abilities prevented him from acting on his ambition at the moment.","Bei Xu would become one of Lin Yuan’s arms and help Lin Yuan spread the seed of Sky City to other continents.","These two reasons made it worth it for Lin Yuan to use a resource like the essence blood of the pinnacle Myth II Dream-Eating Bat on Bei Xu.","Genius concocted spirit fluids while Lin Yuan nurtured the Sharp Shadow Bat. Chimey continued to live stream on the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree.","Chimey looked at the screen and softly interacted with the live stream’s audience.","Ever since Chimey could talk, it felt that live streaming became much more interesting.","It did not need to seek help from Genius to type out replies like it did in the past.","In spite of Chimey’s unparalleled singing abilities and intelligence, it was not skilled at learning how to manipulate the functions that came with the live-streaming room.","While Chimey was replying to questions, a request asking it to compete with other hosts on Star Web caught its eye.","Chimey could not help but be curious about if it would be fun to compete with other live streamers."]},{"number":784,"title":"Chapter 784 - Whats Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess and Blacks Relationship?","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Bai Hao was a regular at Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ live-streaming room.","Ever since he had stumbled on Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ live stream, he had basically taken up a permanent spot.","Every once in a while, he would be pushed down to the second place position.","Nonetheless, he would immediately throw presents in and quickly regain his position at the top of the list.","The last few days had been the happiest in Bai Hao’s life because Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess had been live streaming basically every day. She had also started talking and interacting with the chat.","A person’s singing voice was different from their speaking voice.","Bai Hao placed a lot of importance on the quality of one’s voice, and he had fallen for Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ singing voice the moment he heard it.","Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ singing voice seemed magical as Bai Hao had been turned off by everyone else’s singing voice from the moment he heard Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","But after he heard Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ speaking voice, Bai Hao fell even deeper and harder for her.","Compared to her ethereal singing voice, Bai Hao liked how Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ speaking voice was more grounded and lively.","Now, he preferred to hear her talk more than sing on her live streams.","Hence, he started to actively post messages in the chat in the hope of hearing her responses.","As a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence and a guild club that participated in the Allstar Match, Bai Hao’s every move was scrutinized by the public.","The reporters that followed him were extremely upset that he used his original celebrity account to become a fan of Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","They had contacted him to ask him to sever his ties with Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","Instead of doing that, Bai Hao had publicly announced that he was her fan.","This had made his dedicated reporters even busier than ever.","Bai Hao sent out a chain of messages once Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess was done singing her new song.","Lord Ranger Bai Hao: “Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess, you should compete with other hosts on Star Web! With me around, you can’t lose!”","With the previous requests to compete combined with Bai Hao’s current one, Chimey promised itself that it would not lose and said, “Okay, I shall do it. But how do I compete?”","Chimey had always had difficulty understanding the functions that came with the live-streaming room, and it did not know how it should go about competing either.","When they heard Chimey’s murmurs, the live-stream audience was stunned.","The goddess with the voice of an angel was too adorable when she was confused.","Chimey read through a chain of messages before it finally figured out where the button to compete was.","It pressed the button resolutely.","The moment it pressed the button, a thought struck Chimey. It remembered Genius saying that the moment it left its live-streaming room, the GIF on its face would disappear.","In order for the audiences of both live-streaming rooms to watch the live stream of the competition, both live-streaming rooms were combined into a new live-streaming room.","With this thought in mind, Chimey left its Star Web account.","It patted its chest with its wing and thought to itself,? That was a close one! Thank God for my quick reflexes. Or else I would have been exposed!","However, Chimey did not know that a competition could not be stopped halfway once it started.","Even if one side left or was disconnected, it would be stuck on the withdrawal page.","When Chimey had entered the competition, it was in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree. Its background was the hundreds of Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol leaves.","The golden leaves mixed with the hundreds of different colored fires looked like rainbows were bursting out of the sun.","Now, at the corner of Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ beautiful set background was a moving sparrow.","Chimey had been absorbing the energy from the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree when it was live streaming and had not put on its usual camouflage.","This scene shocked the people in the live-streaming room, and the chat exploded with messages.","At first, the messages all came from the audience of the other live-streaming room.","The Lost Man of Integrity: “What’s going on? What’s the other host doing? Is it stuck, or did she get disconnected?”","Half-Person Half-Ghost: “Damn, what’s going on with Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess? Why is it stuck? Why can’t I see Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess?”","Amber Button: “Just a small question. Can it be that that bird is the one that’s live streaming?”","Shadow Black: “Are you dumb? The fey with the best voice is the Songstress Bird. But how can Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ songs compare to that of the Songstress Bird?”","Amethyst: “I have a guess, but I don’t know if I should say it.”","Hidden Shadow: “Oh my God. Let me say something. Don’t you think that that bird looks familiar?”","Blue Wind Rain: “Oh my God! I didn’t realize it until you said it. Isn’t that bird the one that appeared when Black was fighting at the Celestial Stairway?”","Three Small Cucumbers: “Many people were guessing why Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess paid attention to Black out of all the people on Star Web. Now I know why. Do Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess and Black know each other? Why else would Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess ignore the first position even after all the money that he had thrown in?”","Although Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess was offline, the competition was still ongoing.","The scene was becoming even messier.","Soon, many Star Web reporters and spectators joined the live-streaming room to participate in the excitement.","The most mysterious host that appeared on Star Web was Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","After the end of the Allstar Match, Chu Ci and Lin Yuan’s performance were the centers of attention. With Lin Yuan’s power and mysterious background, he was a top young expert that had materialized out of nowhere.","Lin Yuan looked around 18 years old and was of a similar age to people’s guesses about Black.","Hence, many people compared Black and Lin Yuan.","Moreover, Black had been keeping a low profile other than the occasional fights on Celestial Stairway.","Black’s dedicated reporter Tian Ningning also only wrote a few articles about Black’s fights on Celestial Stairway. She did not report on anything else.","This caused Black’s popularity to fall and the curiosity from his fans to increase.","Now, the exposure about the bird fey in the live-streaming room caused the low-profile Black and popular Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess to be linked together. This piece of news took Star Web by storm overnight!"]},{"number":785,"title":"Chapter 785 - Bei Xu Clung on with Difficulty","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Not even the news about the S Tournament’s events could overwhelm the news about Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess and Black.","The most conflicted person in the live-streaming room was Bai Hao.","He was conflicted about the relationship between Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess and Black because Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess had essentially become his emotional pillar in the last six months.","When he could not watch Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ live streams, he could not focus on anything else.","Although Bai Hao was single, he understood emotions and knew that he was only feeling this way because he missed Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ voice.","In spite of his uncertainty about Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ relationship with Black, Black had to be close with Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess for his fey to appear by her side.","This upset Bai Hao greatly.","He was also excited because Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ willingness to compete with other hosts meant that she was not opposed to showing her face in a live stream.","The beauty-host community was the most cutthroat. Since Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess was a beauty host and was not against showing her face, it had to mean that her looks were above average.","The Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess could participate in a competition again soon, which would give him a chance to see how she really looked like.","Bai Hao felt that Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess’ connection with Black gave him a chance to get to know her offline.","He had heard that Black was going to participate in this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence exam. Given Black’s performance of his power at the Celestial Stairway, it was almost guaranteed that he would be able to join the Radiance Hundred Sequence.","At that time, both he and Black would be members of the Radiance Hundred Sequence. Bai Hao felt that Black would not reject his request to connect him offline with his idol.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan was nurturing the Sharp Shadow Bat.","Chimey flew over and silently landed on his earlobe. This seemed strange to Lin Yuan.","He moved Chimey to his wrist and noticed that Chimey’s eyes kept darting in another direction instead of meeting his gaze. It seemed to be ashamed about something.","This confused Lin Yuan, and he did not know what had happened to Chimey.","However, he did not dwell on it.","Lin Yuan did not know that Tian Ningning had caught him and that she was currently sending Black a continuous chain of messages on Star Web.","...","It was as dark as night in the Grotto Continent. It was only at noon that a sliver of light would penetrate the underground world.","The few hours where sunlight entered the underground world was a reward to the creatures that lived in the Grotto Continent.","The middle of the afternoon was the warmest time in the Grotto Continent. At that moment, there was a young man huddled amongst a pile of rocks.","The young man had a resolute look on his face, but his scraped-up face that had sand sticking to it made him look rather sorry.","He was holding a stone awl and staring at a large armored insect chewing at small weeds on the ground nearby.","With one hand on the stone awl, Bei Xu placed his other hand on his abdomen and pressed down tightly.","This was to prevent his stomach from growling as it would attract the attention of the large brown armored insect.","Bei Xu could not help but think,? Today is my lucky day. I can’t believe a Rock Hermit Insect wandered near my rock pile. Looks like I don’t have to go hungry today! I was really afraid that I was about to die of starvation soon and miss my chance to enter the Astronomical Parliament through my dreams.","The Astronomical Parliament was the only light at the end of the tunnel in Bei Xu’s life.","Over the last few days, Bei Xu’s mind had been filled with thoughts about that god-like man that was wrapped in laws and willpowers.","He was looking forward to meeting the man again.","As he watched the Rock Hermit Insect’s belly grow larger as it ate, Bei Xu lunged forward from his pile of rocks.","But after Bei Xu charged out of the rock pile, the pain from his injury caused him to tighten his jaw.","There was a wound about 20cm long on his calf. Although he had stitched it up to the best of his ability, his sudden movement strained the injury and caused dark red blood to flow out, quickly wetting the makeshift stitches.","He could not be bothered with the injury as he leaped over to the Rock Hermit Insect.","He raised the rock awl and smashed down on the Rock Hermit Insect’s weak outstretched neck.","However, the stone awl did not pierce through the Rock Hermit Insect’s neck. It was just embedded halfway in the neck.","Still, Bei Xu did not panic because he had not hoped the stone awl would penetrate through the Rock Hermit Insect’s neck.","The current situation was what he had expected.","After the single strike, Bei Xu immediately turned and dashed back to his hiding spot amongst the pile of rocks.","He picked up the slab of rock he had prepared in advance and held it against the entrance of his hiding position.","Suddenly, the Rock Hermit Insect opened its back armor and started flapping its wings.","When he heard the sound of the Rock Hermit Insect’s wings, Bei Xu felt a sense of relief.","The Rock Hermit Insect opened its back armor and wrapped it around his head.","The structure of its body was designed to protect the Rock Hermit Insect’s head from being injured during flight.","But this also allowed Bei Xu to push the stone awl deeper into the Rock Hermit Insect’s neck.","Since the Rock Hermit Insect had just eaten a large number of weeds, it had gained weight and prevented it from flying quickly.","After the Rock Hermit Insect lifted itself off the ground, the stone awl broke through the neck and got stuck in the armor.","Although the Rock Hermit Insect’s reaction was slow, it had gotten a good look at Bei Xu when he attacked it.","It charged at Bei Xu’s hiding spot like a small bomb.","The Rock Hermit Insect crashed against the stone slab, and Bei Xu felt his organs shake, his limbs go numb, and a bitter-sweet taste rise up in his throat.","However, he did not release his grip on the stone slab.","The insect cried out, and the sound of impact was covered along with Bei Xu’s grunt.","Half an hour later, the impact against the stone slab weakened significantly. Yet Bei Xu still refused to let up.","After some more silence, Bei Xu picked up a sharpened stone and walked out of his hiding spot."]},{"number":786,"title":"Chapter 786","paragraphs":["It was already after the middle of the afternoon, and the sunlight was weakening.","It was difficult for the light to reach the underground world, and it slowly darkened.","Bei Xu shook his trembling hands. He immediately started to clean up the dead Rock Hermit Insect.","First, he used the sharpened rock to cut out the Rock Hermit Insect’s eyes and plucked out two bean-sized soft bones.","These two soft bones were extremely special and could emit faint light to illuminate the dark world he lived in.","Bei Xu cradled the two soft bones like they were treasures and started to carefully separate the Rock Hermit Insect’s armor.","After he was done separating the armor, he cut out the white wings that were almost two meters long.","Bei Xu proceeded to cut out the insect fat below and cut out two shining pieces of flesh from within.","Now, he tossed the Rock Hermit Insect aside.","Bei Xu had finished separating out all the usable parts of the Rock Hermit Insect and would reach its organs if he cut any deeper.","The Rock Hermit Insect could digest the hard weeds that grew underground because its digestive fluids were extremely corrosive.","This was its greatest weapon.","Even if Bei Xu did not touch the digestive fluids himself, the sharpened rock would also be corroded away.","Bei Xu had spent three days sharpening the rock and could not allow it to be ruined so easily.","He carefully placed the parts of the Rock Hermit Insect that he had separated out in his hiding spot except for the insect oil.","Next, he carefully set up the slab of rock again.","Bei Xu cut open his stitches and wiped them over with the insect oil.","He sighed to himself.","“With this insect oil, I won’t have to worry about infection even though it’ll still take a while for my leg to heal.”","He forcefully wrapped the injury up again and dragged the insect carcass to the river that was a kilometer away.","Bei Xu pushed the carcass into the river.","As he looked around at his pitch-black surroundings, Bei Xu felt his way back to his hiding spot.","Bei Xu did not feel at ease and pushed a second slab of rock against the entrance before he lay down the wings and sat down on top.","With the faint light from the soft bone, Bei Xu cut a few pieces of the flesh using the sharpened rock.","He did not scarf down the flesh and stopped once he had eaten the bare minimum.","Bei Xu cut the flesh thinly and laid it on the rocks to dry so they could be stored and consumed later.","Under the dim light, the exhausted Bei Xu forced himself to stay awake for a few more hours before he lay down and fell into a deep sleep on his new bed.","The sleeping Bei Xu smiled slowly as though he was looking forward to dreaming about something.","In the Azure Federation...","Yin Lin gently lifted her head and looked at her colorful world.","In the last six days, Yin Lin had thrown away her beloved books and taken in as much of this world that she had spent her whole life imagining as she could.","Although she could not see clearly, she still could not get enough of it.","At that moment, Yin Lin saw a human figure approach her.","She sniffed and asked, “Mom, why are you back so early today? It’s not even tea time yet.”","Next to Yin Lin was an elegant middle-aged woman dressed in a long azure skirt. She reached out and gently caressed Yin Lin’s face like she was stroking treasure.","Shortly after, she waved, and two furry creatures appeared in her arms.","The two creatures were very energetic and looked around curiously. They also let out high-pitched sounds every once in a while.","The middle-aged woman asked, “Lin Lin, have your eyes been okay during the last few days?”","A wide and beautiful smile spread across Yin Lin’s calm face. She seemed happy to be able to see the world.","“Mom, I’m still only able to see colors, light, and shapes. But I should be able to see everything after tomorrow.”","The middle-aged woman shot a look of pained affection at Yin Lin and assumed Yin Lin was only saying so to comfort her.","The middle-aged woman was already content that Yin Lin could see light, colors, and shapes.","She also started to blame herself again.? If only I had been more careful, I wouldn’t have fallen for the trap and caused Yin Lin to be born blind .","“Lin Lin, one of these is the Spirit White Lion that is passed down by your father’s family, and the other is the Azure Cloud Leopard that is passed down by my family. Both are compatible with your Willpower Runes. Why don’t you form contracts with them? This way, you’ll have two more friends to accompany you aside from me, Dad, the butler, and Si Si.”","Yin Lin did not immediately reach out to receive the Spirit White Lion and Azure Cloud Leopard. Instead, she asked in shock, “Aren’t the Spirit White Lion and Azure Cloud Leopard—”","Before Yin Lin could finish her question, her mother said, “When you couldn’t see anything, your father had decided to create a simple and peaceful environment for you. Thus, we never told you about anything that happened at home. But now that you can see a blurry version of this world, it’s best that you have these two feys by your side to protect you.”","Yin Lin’s clear head was suddenly slightly dizzy.","She had just heard that her father’s family passed down the Spirit White Lion while her mother’s family passed down the Azure Cloud Leopard.","These were two feys that she had read about many times in the history books about the Azure Federation.","As one of the three main federations, the Azure Federation was vast and prosperous.","The major families in the Azure Federation all had iconic feys that they passed down the generations.","The families had strict rankings like Creation Masters.","The Spirit White Lion was the iconic fey of the Class 4 Yin family.","The Azure Cloud Leopard was the iconic fey of the Class 5 Guan family.","There were only eight Class 5 families in the Azure Continent, and their iconic feys were considered the pride of the federation.","Yin Lin had always known that her father’s surname was Yin while her mother’s surname was Guan.","However, she never expected that her status would be so prominent."]},{"number":787,"title":"Chapter 787","paragraphs":["The middle-aged woman saw Yin Lin’s look of disbelief and gently lowered her head to place a kind kiss on Yin Lin’s forehead.","“Listen to me and form a contract with these feys first. We’ll take you to see Grandma and Grandpa after you form contracts with them so that Grandma can evolve them.”","The middle-aged woman made a silent prayer.","She had found many high-class spirit qi professionals and Creation Masters to try to help heal Yin Lin’s eyes.","However, all of them had said that Yin Lin’s genetic model could not function properly because she had been injured in the womb.","It was an injury that could not be healed.","But now that Yin Lin’s eyes had recovered partially, the middle-aged woman felt that it was a miracle sent from heaven.","But at the same time, she could not help but hope that this miracle would carry on and bless her daughter by healing her eyes even further.","She hoped that Yin Lin would be able to lead a life as crystal clear as any other regular girl.","Yin Lin felt that she needed some time to digest what her mother had just said, but she still calmly reached out her hand and replied, “Mom, I will form contracts with the Spirit White Lion and Azure Cloud Leopard now! Give me one day to properly digest everything, and I’ll go with you to see the rest of the family in two days.”","The middle-aged immediately placed the Spirit White Lion and Azure Cloud Leopard in Yin Lin’s hands.","Yin Lin circulated her spiritual energy and formed contracts with the two feys.","After she was done forming contracts, Yin Lin immediately sensed two little lives connected with hers.","She hugged the Spirit White Lion and Azure Cloud Leopard tightly and thought,? Contracting these two feys has given me strength, and I’ll be able to see clearly tomorrow.","Yin Lin had not forgotten about her promise to use everything she had to exchange for clear sight. With this strength, she was ready to enter the Astronomical Parliament to earn the promise she had made.","...","After Lin Yuan evolved the Sharp Shadow Bat, he stretched.","Even with Lin Yuan’s abilities, it had not been easy for him to evolve a fey for 24 hours straight.","Once he evolved the Sharp Shadow Bat to Legend quality, he received two spirit fluids from Genius and left the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He did not notice that Chimey was anxiously flying around the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree.","When he walked out of the room, he saw that Wen Yu was waiting outside.","When Wen Yu noticed Lin Yuan, she immediately asked, “Young Master, it’s almost time for the Astronomical Parliament. When do you think would be the best time to conduct it? I need half an hour to prepare the ritual beforehand.”","Lin Yuan nodded and replied, “You should go to the training room to prepare. We’ll conduct the parliamentary meeting in half an hour.”","He assumed that Wen Yu would immediately head off to the training room to prepare. Yet, she stood motionless as though she had something to say.","Clearly, she had something to say to him but did not know how to say it.","As such, Lin Yuan asked, “What’s wrong? You can say anything to me.”","Wen Yu quickly shook her head.","Instead of speaking, she took out a stack of information and placed it in Lin Yuan’s hand before turning to walk toward the training room.","Lin Yuan was slightly confused by Wen Yu’s response.","After he looked at the information that Wen Yu had handed him, he suddenly felt like his body was about to be split apart.","At the same time, some of his long-held questions had been answered.","The first time he had gone for training and met Zhang Xiaobai and the rest, the song Zhang Xiaobai had been singing should not exist in the world.","Lin Yuan had asked Zhang Xiaobai and found out that the song Zhang Xiaobai sang was sung by a host called Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess.","He had originally been interested in this. But after the battle at Millstone Town, the thought had fallen to the back of his head.","Later, Lin Yuan would often see news about Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess on Star Web, but he had never listened to her sing on a live stream.","After reading the information about Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess, Lin Yuan had been meaning to meet her and learn how she sang such songs.","However, he never imagined that the most popular host on Star Web would be his Chimey.","Moreover, Chimey was not a singing host but a beauty host.","As he read through the timings of Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess that Wen Yu had compiled, he realized that Chimey had started secretly live streaming ever since they were in the spirit lifeform store.","When he read the part about the time Sparrow Voice Loli Goddess started to speak and reply to messages, it coincided with the time that Chimey had evolved to Clear Voice Luan Sparrow and gained the ability to speak.","No wonder Chimey always sought him out to learn new songs.","Lin Yuan felt that he should have a talk with Chimey.","Just when Lin Yuan was about to return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to talk to Chimey, Lin Yuan’s phone started to ring.","He saw that the call was coming from Li Xuan, and his eyes narrowed.","When Lin Yuan answered the call, Li Xuan’s carefree but slightly solemn voice said, “Brother, I need to ask a favor from you.”","Lin Yuan immediately knew why Li Xuan was calling.","He had actually been waiting for Li Xuan to seek him out.","Lin Yuan admired the way that Li Xuan got right to the point. Hence, Lin Yuan also spoke straightforwardly. “Just shoot! Big Brother, If I can help, I’ll definitely do my best.”","Lin Yuan’s words and his addressing of Li Xuan as ‘Big Brother’ allowed Li Xuan to sense Lin Yuan’s sincerity.","Li Xuan had already formed a good impression of Lin Yuan back at the Royal Capital’s Fey Observer Association. At the House of Enviable Fragrance, he had wanted to form a relationship with Lin Yuan even more after getting to know him better.","“Brother, I’m calling on behalf of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine to ask you for some Law Crystals. We will definitely offer a satisfactory price. Given the magnitude of this transaction, my elders want to meet you.”","Lin Yuan checked the time and replied, “No problem. Why don’t you come to my mansion to talk?”"]},{"number":788,"title":"Chapter 788","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan paused for a moment before continuing. “I’ll send you my address soon. But you might have to wait for half an hour when you’re here. I have something to attend to first.”","On the other end of the call, Li Xuan clenched his fist in excitement and said, “I’ll head over with my elders now. Brother, you’re really doing me a big favor!”","Lin Yuan smiled brightly and replied, “I’m sure you’ll return the favor when I need help in the future.”","After the call ended, Lin Yuan checked the time and decided not to go to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to talk to Chimey. Instead, he walked toward the training room on the third floor and prepared to enter the Astronomical Parliament.","Lin Yuan revealed the location of the Return from Faraway Mansion to Li Xuan and told him to bring his elders from Dark Clouds Bird Shrine because he had a special motive in mind.","His identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple would be revealed at the Guard Ye Banquet that was going to take place a week later.","All of the elite factions would be searching for information about him.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was going to be Lin Yuan’s messenger to the other top factions.","The other top factions would discover where Lin Yuan lived by asking Dark Clouds Bird Shrine for information.","Lin Yuan wanted all the top factions to know where his territory was.","Given his identity as the disciple of the Moon Empress, no one from the Royal Capital would dare to start trouble at the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Moreover, the Return from Faraway Mansion was not just home to the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Before the Floating Island Whale hatched, the Return from Faraway Mansion was also Sky City’s main base.","If Sky City really ended up clashing up with the Zheng family and Miao family in the future, the Miao family would be able to discover the Return from Faraway Mansion after collecting some clues.","He decided to brand the Return from Faraway Mansion with his title as the Moon Empress’ disciple so that even if the Miao family and Zheng family discovered any clues from the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, they would not suspect that the Return from Faraway Mansion was connected to Sky City.","This was the best way to keep Sky City a secret.","It would also ensure that no one would dare to venture in even if the basement under the mansion was discovered.","By the time Lin Yuan arrived at the training room, Wen Yu was already done with the Astronomical Parliament’s ritual.","Lin Yuan sat down on a chair and fell asleep as he returned to the vast starlit sky with Wen Yu.","But this time was different from the past because Lin Yuan had already formed a contract with the Leo throne.","This time, Lin Yuan instantly appeared on the Leo throne.","The enormous Leo constellation hung in the sky above Lin Yuan.","When the Leo constellation lit up, the Libra constellation also lit up.","Wen Yu, who was seated on the Libra throne, said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, I only called for the Andromeda and Perseus north-south constellation seats. If nothing happens in 15 minutes, I’ll start allowing the other north-south constellation seats to choose targets.”","Lin Yuan nodded slightly.","He knew that Wen Yu’s spiritual energy would only be able to sustain the Astronomical Parliament for half an hour.","Hence, waiting for 15 minutes was already pushing the limit.","Nevertheless, Lin Yuan felt that they would not need to wait 15 minutes to start the parliamentary meeting.","As long as nothing had happened to Bei Xu and Yin Lin, Lin Yuan was confident that the Andromeda and Perseus seats would be able to attract their willpowers and souls.","Bei Xu and Yin Lin would appear in their respective north-south constellation seats.","The cat’s eye stone on Wen Yu’s forehead shone, and Bei Xu and Yin Lin were immediately pulled into the Astronomical Parliament.","When Bei Xu and Yin Lin finally laid eyes on the vast starlit sky that they had been looking forward to for the last week, they let out a sigh of relief.","Immediately after the breath of relief, the two of them dazedly turned to look at the shining Leo constellation and Libra constellation.","Since Bei Xu lived in the Grotto Continent, he had never walked above ground.","The last time he had entered the Astronomical Parliament was the first time that he had seen a sky full of constellations.","He had thought of his last coincidental visit as a beautiful dream that had manifested when he was close to death.","When he had woken up after the Astronomical Parliament, Bei Xu only believed that his experience had been real after realizing that his injury had been healed.","Thus, he was completely dumbfounded when he returned to this patch of starlit sky for a second time.","Yin Lin was the same as Bei Xu.","Although she had been sure that the Astronomical Parliament was real, this was only her second time looking at this world clearly.","When she gathered her senses again, Yin Lin immediately focused her attention on Lin Yuan and Wen Yu.","Lin Yuan and Wen Yu met Yin Lin’s gaze.","Lin Yuan was shocked. The last time he had checked on Yin Lin through her willpower and soul, he could guess that she came from the Azure Continent.","Most of the information in Yin Lin was about the Azure Federation.","Since the various federations closed each other off, it was difficult for people outside the Azure Federation to access its history books.","Other than the information in the books, Lin Yuan had sensed that Yin Lin only had her strange imagination, her sense of taste, and her sense of touch.","But from what she ate, Lin Yuan felt sure that Yin Lin came from an extremely wealthy family.","The second time Yin Lin came to the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan was surprised.","Now, other than being sure that she came from Azure Federation, Lin Yuan also found out her prominent status.","Both the Azure Federation and Radiance Federation were part of the three major federations. It was clear how strong the Azure Federation was.","If someone like Yin Lin existed in the Radiance Federation, she would probably be from a top faction like Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Frankly, Yin Lin’s status exceeded that of Li Xuan.","There were only about 50 top factions in the Radiance Federation, and there were only 12 Class 5 families in the Azure Federation.","If Yin Lin could form a contract with a north-south constellation seat, Lin Yuan would have added someone with elite status as one of his main characters.","As long as there was a use for it, Lin Yuan would gain a huge benefit."]},{"number":789,"title":"Chapter 789","paragraphs":["The Grotto Continent, where Bei Xu lived, was very far from the Radiance Federation. It was a remote and desolate continent.","If Lin Yuan did not use the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles, Lin Yuan couldn’t reach the Grotto Continent.","But the Azure Federation was different.","Although the Azure Federation was also far from the Radiance Federation, the Radiance Azure Waterway connected them.","A mature Island Whale took three months to make a return trip along the Radiance Azure Waterway,","Using a strategic-class resource like the Island Whale, there was occasional transportation of resources between the Radiance Federation and Azure Federation.","Lin Yuan tapped the armrest of the golden throne, and the imprint of the lion on his wrist that signified his authority in the Astronomical Parliament radiated with a powerful aura.","When he saw both Yin Lin and Bei Xu looking at him, Lin Yuan said, “If you’ve made a decision about what I told you to go back and think about, place your hand on the seat in front of you and inject your willpower into it.”","Wen Yu could only sustain the Astronomical Parliament for half an hour. Thus, Lin Yuan did not say much else to Yin Lin and Bei Xu.","If Yin Lin and Bei Xu both chose to form contracts with the north-south constellation seats, they would officially become members of the Astronomical Parliament.","He would have plenty of time to talk to them after they became members.","Although trust was important between people, a binding contract was always safer.","Lin Yuan needed to pay the price of laws and willpower to help Yin Lin and Bei Xu through the Star Spirit Seat.","If Lin Yuan could not be certain of Yin Lin and Bei Xu’s loyalty, he would be a fool to invest a large number of resources.","Neither Yin Lin nor Bei Xu hesitated as they had both made their decision early on in the seven-day window.","Yin Lin and Bei Xu placed their hands on the Andromeda seat and Perseus seat, respectively.","As they injected their willpowers in, two clouds in the sky in the Astronomical Parliament lit up.","One of the clouds formed a crown carrying Andromeda while the other formed a sword brandishing Perseus.","These two clouds were not as radiant as the Leo throne or Libra throne, and they glowed silver instead of gold.","However, the two clouds still made the sky in the Astronomical Parliament more beautiful.","The Andromeda and Perseus clouds moved above Yin Lin and Bei Xu, respectively. A simple image of their constellation appeared on Yin Lin’s neck and Bei Xu’s hand.","When the images of the constellations appeared, Bei Xu and Yin Lin were delighted.","They felt the magical properties that came with the image.","It was as though the images could communicate with the respective north-south constellation seats and act as a siren that called the contractors to the Astronomical Parliament.","Wen Yu looked at Yin Lin and Bei Xu and said, “Next time, I’ll call you to the Astronomical Parliament through the images on your bodies. When you feel that mark grow hot, go to a place where you won’t be disturbed and combine your willpower and soul with the constellation image. This way, you’ll be able to come to the Astronomical Parliament without sleeping and dreaming to be called by the constellations.”","Bei Xu and Yin Lin touched their constellation images and felt a sense of calm settle over their hearts.","It was too difficult for them to have to be asleep every time they entered the Astronomical Parliament.","After all, anxiousness could lead to insomnia.","Even if they did not have any problems falling asleep, there were other external factors to consider.","There were even anatomical limitations such as having to wake up to pee which could cause one to miss the chance to enter the Astronomical Parliament.","It would be too much of a headache.","When Yin Lin and Bei Xu formed contracts with the Andromeda seat and Perseus seat, they had essentially sworn on their Willpower Runes.","Lin Yuan coughed lightly and stood up from the Leo throne. He first asked Bei Xu, “Since you’ve formed the contract, why don’t you tell me what you want?”","Bei Xu bowed to Lin Yuan and replied, “Brother Celestial, I want a fey to form a contract with.”","At that moment, it was as though a thought suddenly struck him as he said with slight embarrassment, “Can I make an additional request?”","Lin Yuan was astonished by the way Bei Xu addressed him.","Is Bei Xu an idiot? Who calls someone Brother Celestial? Is he going to call Wen Yu Sister Celestial too?","Lin Yuan hastily replied, “Since you’re a member of the Astronomical Parliament, you can call me by my code name. In the Astronomical Parliament, I’ll also call you Perseus.”","While Lin Yuan was speaking, he noticed the hopeful look of yearning in Bei Xu’s eyes. Lin Yuan frowned slightly and wondered what request Bei Xu wanted to make.","Lin Yuan felt that the Sharp Shadow Bat that he had prepared for Bei Xu would be extremely suitable to Bei Xu’s life in the Grotto Continent.","However, every spirit qi professional had the right to have specifications about the fey that they formed a contract with.","Hence, Lin Yuan respectfully agreed to Bei Xu’s wishes.","“If you have a request, just tell me.”","Bei Xu said with a hint of hopefulness, “I want to contract a fey that can fight.”","Bei Xu automatically added, “As long as it’s not one as lousy as the Rock Hermit Insect!”","Lin Yuan was shocked when he heard Bei Xu’s request.","What kind of request was this?","Lin Yuan sensed the way that Bei Xu had lived for the past week through Bei Xu’s willpower. Each and every day had been a struggle with Death itself.","No one in the Radiance Federation was willing to contract the Rock Hermit Insect that Bei Xu had mentioned.","Bei Xu had made such a request because he was going to offer his everything. Yet, he was so hopeful when he was making such a less than basic request.","Evidently, his life had been torturous.","Lin Yuan’s heart ached for Bei Xu due to his similar yearning for survival that Lin Yuan had when he was taking care of Chu Ci. On top of it, Bei Xu’s life was hundreds of times more terrible than Lin Yuan’s had been.","“Of course, I can fulfill your request. You can actually have higher expectations for the feys you want to contract from now on.”"]},{"number":790,"title":"Chapter 790","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan circulated his law power and chose a portion from one of inferior quality that he had more than one of.","When Wen Yu activated the Astronomical Parliament’s Star Spirit Seat, Lin Yuan used these laws that he had chosen to exchange for the spirit fluid Genius had concocted, the Sharp Shadow Bat, and a Diamond fey storage box. Lin Yuan handed these items to Bei Xu.","Lin Yuan struggled with his pain over losing the laws and said to Bei Xu, “When this parliamentary meeting is over and you return to reality, I hope you’ll be pleasantly surprised by the fey you see. I also prepared a small present for you.”","Bei Xu looked delighted.","The last time Lin Yuan had mentioned a small present, Bei Xu had basically come back from life. Bei Xu extremely looked forward to this new small present.","Now, Lin Yuan turned his attention to Yin Lin and asked, “Perseus wants to contract a fey. What would you like?”","Yin Lin resolutely laid out the conditions that she had thought of long ago. “Leo, I want to be able to see the world as clearly as a normal person.”","Lin Yuan did not find Yin Lin’s request to be unexpected, and he agreed immediately.","He activated the willpowers in his body and used a portion that he had already set aside to exchange for Star Spirit Seat to instruct the Jasmine Lily to release vitality through Severed Limbs Growth to Yin Lin’s body.","Lin Yuan did not know how much vitality was needed to heal Yin Lin, and he could not accurately sense the situation in Yin Lin’s body through her willpower.","Lin Yuan used more willpower and only stopped the Jasmine Lily from injecting vitality into Yin Lin once the amount it injected had exceeded the amount of vitality in Yin Lin’s body.","Now that he had fulfilled both Bei Xu and Yin Lin’s requests, Lin Yuan felt that their promises had been sealed.","As the system, Lin Yuan prepared to issue tasks to Yin Lin and Bei Xu.","It had been 27 minutes since the second Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting had started. Wen Yu’s face had started to lose color.","Hence, Lin Yuan did not plan to issue complicated tasks.","“Both of you go and establish a faction in the worlds that you’re from. You can decide for yourselves what the faction does and its roles.”","When Bei Xu and Yin Lin heard Lin Yuan’s task, a strange look came over their faces.","Yin Lin looked at Lin Yuan like she was staring at a god. She looked at this man who had just given her sight with gratitude.","To someone like Yin Lin, who spent her life blind and confined to a wheelchair, she was extremely intrigued by Lin Yuan’s mission to start a faction.","After a moment’s contemplation, Yin Lin asked Lin Yuan, “Leo, if you want us to start factions, we need to give the factions the same name.”","Lin Yuan had not planned on telling Yin Lin and Bei Xu about Sky City.","But since she had asked, Lin Yuan replied, “You can choose the name. But one day, when your factions have developed enough to leave the land where you come from, you can add Sky City to the front of your faction’s name. Before that happens, you can just keep the name Sky City in your hearts.”","Yin Lin made sure that Lin Yuan’s words were etched in her brain.","The name Sky City also had a sort of magical quality to it that was imprinted in the depths of Yin Lin’s soul.","Now that Yin Lin had a new lease on life, she found the first goal in her life.","Bei Xu’s expression was extremely sour, and his face was devoid of color. He stammered and said, “L... Leo, there’s been a curse on my waist from the moment I was born. The curse is a stone insect. I might not be able to start a faction.”","Bei Xu’s face looked ashen as he spoke.","He did not expect that the first mission Lin Yuan gave out would be one that Bei Xu would not be able to accomplish.","Bei Xu had been imbued with courage and hopes ever since Lin Yuan had pulled him back from death’s door. The last thing he wanted was to disappoint Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan heard about the curse and stone insect, he thought back to the experiences in Bei Xu’s life and knew what Bei Xu was talking about.","Although the Grotto Continent was a poor and remote place, it was crueler than anyone could imagine.","Those who were cursed from birth had to live their lives according to the curse.","The curse that was carved on them was like an icon of their status in the Grotto Continent.","The ‘stone insect’ curse on Bei Xu’s body meant that he would have to dedicate his life to working in the mines.","However, Lin Yuan found that this method of setting a person’s status was ridiculous.","The Grotto Continent’s curse was just a lame trick.","The curse was formed by smearing the juices from an underground plant on the skin, which would then turn the skin black.","Finally, a caterpillar-species fey called Imprint Worm would gnaw on the stained skin, forming an imprint on the skin.","The purplish-black imprint would remain on the body forever.","The Imprint Worm also vomited into the skin while it was gnawing to increase the effectiveness of the mark.","This caused the purplish-black curse to sink into the flesh until it reached the bone.","If the area with the cursed skin was cut open, as long as the cut was deep enough to reach the bone, the cursed flesh could be removed.","However, the people with curses in the Grotto Continent were mostly normal people who were not spirit qi professionals that had feys.","The spirit qi professionals that formed contracts with feys were always of high status in the Grotto Continent.","In the horrible environment in the Grotto Continent, normal people without feys would not be able to survive once they cut out a chunk of their flesh from the waist.","Even if they did somehow manage to survive, a large scar would be left behind without the healing from a healing-type spirit qi professional.","It was taboo to have a scar on the waist in the Grotto Continent. No matter what the reason was, one would be punished if discovered.","As a citizen of the Grotto Continent, Bei Xu was well aware of this. This was why he felt the way he was feeling."]},{"number":791,"title":"Chapter 791","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan did not need to use a lot of resources to solve Bei Xu’s concerns.","Once Bei Xu gained the Sharp Shadow Bat, it could use Bat Colony Sucking to heal the portion of his waist that was cut out.","With Bat Colony Sucking to replenish Bei Xu’s vitality, his flesh would regrow quickly without leaving a scar.","However, Bei Xu would have to experience some struggles in the process.","The Sharp Shadow Bat had been evolved to Legend quality, so Bei Xu would not have to worry about evolving it.","Genius’ spirit fluids would solve the issue of evolving the Sharp Shadow Bat’s grade.","In order to increase the sharpness of the Sharp Shadow Bat’s wings, it needed to consume a large amount of metal-type spiritual ingredients and hard minerals.","Most of the dimensional rifts that opened in the Grotto Continent were subterranean dimensional rifts. Hence, there was no lack of rocks and metal-type spiritual ingredients.","After Bei Xu increased the Sharp Shadow Bat’s grade after it evolved to Fantasy Breed, he would be able to rely on the Sharp Shadow Bat’s power to explore Class 1 subterranean dimensional rifts.","If Bei Xu could find source-type lifeforms in the Class 1 subterranean dimensional rift and use the Sharp Shadow Bat’s Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed, he would be able to form a faction.","Wen Yu’s face had completely drained of color, and the cat’s eye stone had also become dim.","When Lin Yuan noticed Wen Yu’s expression, he did not explain further to Bei Xu. All he said was, “You can do it.”","Lin Yuan exchanged a look with Wen Yu. With Lin Yuan’s agreement, Wen Yu disbanded the second Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting.","Soon, Lin Yuan woke up on the chair in the training room. He immediately took out a few pieces of the Angelfish of Bliss’ fish coat that had been roasted by Liu Jie and gave it to the pale Wen Yu.","When he handed her the roasted fish coat, he said, “Eat some of this fish coat, and you should feel better. You should also go to sleep and replenish your spiritual energy.”","Wen Yu received the roasted fish coat from Lin Yuan with a smile and took a bite as she replied, “Young Master, these Angelfish of Bliss fish coats that Big Brother Liu roasted with maple syrup are really yummy. Even if my spiritual energy wasn’t depleted, I wouldn’t be able to hold back from eating some.”","Lin Yuan immediately thought back to Genius eating the Angelfish of Bliss’ fish coats.","The Angelfish of Bliss’ fish coats had changed color after being roasted with a coating of maple syrup. With some of Liu Jie’s other marinades, the fish coats tasted like jerky.","Genius had also liked eating it, and it always tried its best to find some even though its spiritual energy was never depleted like Wen Yu’s was.","But ever since Genius knew that it was eating fish coats, it started to scorn it because it had always disliked eating fish.","Every time it needed to replenish its spiritual energy using fish coats after concocting spirit fluids, it scrunched up its face and put on a pained expression.","However, it still gobbled down the fish coats.","Lin Yuan felt that amongst all the feys he had contracted, Genius was the biggest troublemaker.","Wen Yu stretched as she munched on the fish coats.","“Young Master, I really need to sleep. Otherwise, I won’t be able to focus. If I try to do anything now, my efficiency will be low. When you used Star Spirit Seat to send items to Bei Xu, the Astronomical Parliament absorbed the laws you sacrificed and grew 30 times of when it absorbed willpowers.”","Lin Yuan felt a lot better after he heard what Wen Yu said.","Although Lin Yuan’s Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could rely on its skirt to easily extract willpowers and laws from the Law Crystals of dead Fantasy Breed feys, willpowers and laws were still too precious.","The use of willpowers and laws in this manner was like a rich man throwing money away.","Anyone would feel reluctant to spend their resources this way, especially the rich and powerful Lin Yuan.","Since Wen Yu’s Astronomical Parliament could evolve using the laws and willpowers that Lin Yuan spent, Lin Yuan did not feel as bad about sacrificing them.","Wen Yu went down from the training room on the third floor to her room on the second floor to rest.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to step out of the training room door, his phone started to ring.","When Lin Yuan picked up his phone, his eyes lit up, and he saw that the person calling was Long Tao.","Lin Yuan had guessed that when he showed the Law Crystals, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, and Coiling Dragon’s Valley would soon approach him.","The walls of Lin Yuan’s mansion had a thick layer of Soundproof Rock embedded into them. Hence, there was perfect soundproofing even between adjacent rooms.","But judging from the time, Li Xuan should be arriving soon.","Lin Yuan felt that if Long Tao also wanted to talk face-to-face, he should ask Long Tao to come too.","Lin Yuan’s schedule was packed in the time before the Guard Ye Banquet, and it would take up a lot of Lin Yuan’s time if Long Tao and Li Xuan came at two different times.","The voice at the other end of the call said, “Lin Yuan, your Law Crystal really helped my father. When my father found out that I got it from you, he told me to contact you to express my gratitude.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes narrowed as he started to think.","He had not asked Wen Yu to investigate the Long family’s Coiling Dragon’s Valley and its experts, so he was not familiar with the Long family’s situation.","However, that small piece of Law crystal was not enough for a Suzerain/Myth III fey to evolve to Creation Breed. However, it could allow a pinnacle Suzerain/Myth II fey to evolve to Myth III.","From Long Tao’s words, it seemed that his father was the one who wanted to meet Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan and Long Tao were friends with similar characters. Lin Yuan also planned on keeping Connected Beast Park under check by supplying Coiling Dragon’s Valley with Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Thus, Lin Yuan was not opposed to meeting Long Tao’s father.","Lin Yuan had told Li Xuan to bring his elders to the Return from Faraway Mansion because he wanted to send a message to the other factions about what kind of a place Return from Faraway Mansion was.","But since Long Tao wanted to bring his father to express his thanks to Lin Yuan, they would demonstrate Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s power to its maximum.","The reason for the Long family’s visit would differ from the Li family’s. The Long family’s faction would attract the attention of the other elite factions in the Royal Capital.","This would be able to better fulfill Lin Yuan’s goal of branding the Return from Faraway Mansion with his title as the Moon Empress’ disciple."]},{"number":792,"title":"Chapter 792","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan immediately said, “Big Brother Long, you’re too kind. Li Xuan is coming to my place. If you come too, we can go to the House of Enviable Fragrance together.”","Long Tao chuckled and replied, “Okay. I’ll reserve a table at the House of Enviable Fragrance and head over with my father.”","Lin Yuan remembered Brocade Zither, which he had spent an entire day nurturing in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and said, “I’ve prepared the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that we agreed on. You can take them back with you this time.”","A look of delight spread across Long Tao’s face. The Law Crystal had helped his father greatly. In a way, Lin Yuan had saved the Long family.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls would benefit the Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s expansion as it increased their elite Creation Master resources by 10%.","Long Tao knew that his father had asked to see Lin Yuan to express his thanks but also to establish a deeper partnership with Lin Yuan.","Since Lin Yuan could produce 17 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls so quickly, it meant that Lin Yuan had a decent store of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls on hand.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley still had the chance to trade for more Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with Lin Yuan.","After Lin Yuan hung up the call with Long Tao, he went downstairs to the lobby to see the Mother of Bloodbath sitting on the water rhinoceros leather sofa entertaining Li Xuan and a white-haired elderly man with exceptionally bright eyes.","The Mother of Bloodbath stood up when it saw Lin Yuan.","The elderly man next to Li Xuan stood up, and Lin Yuan rushed to hand a Gold fey storage box to the Mother of Bloodbath.","Inside the Gold fey storage box were some of the Blood Brew Grapevine’s slightly withered old leaves.","The process of withering could not be reversed. Even if these old leaves were left on the Blood Brew Grapevine, they would still end up withering.","Hence, Lin Yuan had pruned the old leaves. The Mother of Bloodbath could absorb the blood energy from these old leaves to increase its power.","Lin Yuan shot Li Xuan a radiant smile and said, “Big Brother Li, I’m done with my tasks. Sorry to have made you wait.”","The way Lin Yuan addressed Li Xuan made the white-haired elderly man’s nostrils contract.","The way that the elderly man looked at Li Xuan changed.","Although Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had been an elite faction for over 40 years, their fundamentals were not as strong as the other veteran elite factions.","But in terms of manpower, most top factions could not compete with the Li family.","Ascending Dragon City’s Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Wind Mist City’s Gao family only had one direct descendent, while the ruined Condense Fairy Orchard only had two.","Connected Beast Park did have more disciples than other top factions, but they only had about 10 young direct descendants.","However, there were 23 young direct descendants in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","As the oldest direct descendant in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, Li Xuan was always respected in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","But in recent years, the young direct descendants in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine were growing up, and Li Xuan felt increasing pressure.","However, now that the Moon Empress’ disciple had called Li Xuan ‘Big Brother’, it meant that they had a very good relationship.","Although the Radiance Federation seemed to be thriving with other 50 top factions, only the top 20 candidates who had learned from over a century of top factions’ skills had the right to interact with the Moon Empress, Chef Supreme, and Bamboo Monarch.","Although Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had been rising rapidly, they still did not have the right to interact with the Moon Empress, Chef Supreme, and Bamboo Monarch.","Thus, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had yet to gain a Law Source Crystal with pure law power.","Yet, Li Xuan had done what none of his elders could have done.","Li Xuan had formed a connection with the Moon Empress.","This was enough for the elderly man to re-evaluate Li Xuan’s position in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","After Lin Yuan and Li Xuan greeted each other, Lin Yuan turned to the white-haired elderly man next to Li Xuan and noticed the change in the way that the elderly man looked at Li Xuan.","Lin Yuan immediately understood what was going on.","He smiled slightly and nodded at the elderly man before turning to say to Li Xuan, “Big Brother Li, why don’t we all take a seat? Long Tao will be here soon. Big Brother Li, if you have time later on, why don’t we go to the House of Enviable Fragrance again?”","Li Xuan looked at Lin Yuan with gratitude.","He had brought his elder to see Lin Yuan to prove that he had a plan for his personal networks.","Hence, Li Xuan had intentionally invited the First Elder in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Now that the First Elder saw Li Xuan’s relationship with Lin Yuan, Li Xuan’s position in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would be significantly elevated.","At that moment, Li Xuan noticed Lin Yuan wink at him.","Lin Yuan picked up the Dehua porcelain teapot and poured Three Treasures Tea for the Mother of Bloodbath, the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s First Elder, Li Xuan, and himself.","As the fragrance of the tea permeated into the air around them, Lin Yuan said to the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s First Elder, “Senior, please have some Three Treasures Tea. The pine plum flowers and pinecones were harvested from Leaning Moon Mountain. There’s also some Buddha’s hand citrus added in. It tastes pretty good.”","The Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s First Elder quivered when he heard Lin Yuan’s introduction of the Three Treasures Tea.","Pine needles, plum flowers, and pine cones were ordinary ingredients that could be obtained from anywhere.","However, these ingredients in particular were priceless because they came from Leaning Moon Mountain.","The soil from Leaning Moon Mountain could not be bought without permission from the Moon Empress.","The Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s First Elder had also noted Lin Yuan’s respectful nature when he saw the order in which Lin Yuan poured the tea.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have poured the tea for himself last.","At first, Li Xuan did not understand why Lin Yuan had blinked at him.","Now that he heard what Lin Yuan said, he immediately understood Lin Yuan’s intention.","Warmth flooded Li Xuan’s heart."]},{"number":793,"title":"Chapter 793","paragraphs":["Although Li Xuan had not known Lin Yuan for long, Li Xuan had sensed Lin Yuan’s truly sincere preference to keep himself under the radar.","Ever since Lin Yuan had met Li Xuan, he never even breathed a word about his status.","When Lin Yuan mentioned that the ingredients had come from Leaning Moon Mountain, he was covertly declaring his status to Li Xuan’s First Elder.","Lin Yuan had done that to help Li Xuan.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had shown Li Xuan respect through the order in which he poured the tea.","At that moment, Li Xuan did not know how to thank Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had done that because he had noticed the change in the way that the First Elder was looking at Li Xuan. Hence, Lin Yuan decided to help Li Xuan even further.","Lin Yuan, who had come to this new world, understood interpersonal ties well. He immediately understood the meaning behind the First Elder’s gaze.","If by helping Li Xuan he could enable him to earn a higher authority in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, his relationship with Li Xuan would become even better.","The better friends Lin Yuan and Li Xuan became, the more authority Li Xuan had in the Li family. When Lin Yuan needed Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s help, he would be able to receive as much help as he needed.","...","Most top factions had set up luxurious mansions in the Royal Capital.","The mansions were empty most of the time and were only used to house the direct descendants of the top factions when they came to the Royal Capital on business.","In the Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s mansion, a ferociously mighty dragon’s roar sounded out as nine twisting Golden Soaring Dragons about 200 meters long each soared through the sky.","However, these nine Golden Soaring Dragons were different from normal flood-dragon-species fey.","They had the bone shield skin that only ferocious-dragon-species feys had.","These nine Golden Soaring Dragons also did not glide through the sky like flood-dragon-species feys. Instead, it was filled with sturdy power.","The Golden Soaring Dragons’ heads also greatly resembled that of ferocious-dragon-species feys, and tens of razor-sharp teeth protruded from their heads.","There was no soft fur on their neck. Instead, bony spines jutted out.","These nine flood-dragon-species feys that looked like ferocious-dragon-species feys were the special Golden Soaring Dragons that Coiling Dragon’s Valley nurtured.","Since ancient times, pure flood-dragon-species feys and ferocious-dragon-species feys could transform into main dragon-species feys.","Due to the clashing bloodlines in impure flood-dragon-species feys and ferocious-dragon-species feys, it was difficult to evolve their bloodlines.","However, the Long family had evolved the Golden Soaring Dragon by accident.","The Golden Soaring Dragon had both the viciousness of the ferocious-dragon-species feys’ bloodline and the liveliness of the flood-dragon-species feys’ bloodline. It was a dragon-species fey with an impure bloodline but also the potential to evolve to the main dragon-species fey.","Three of the nine Soaring Golden Dragons were more beautiful and stocky than the rest. They had already moved toward the transformation to the main dragon-species bloodline.","The nine Golden Soaring Dragons were attached to a magnificent pavilion. There were numerous golden carvings of dragons on the magnificent metal pavilion.","The metal pavilion galloped forward as the nine Golden Soaring Dragons pulled it.","This was the famous Long family’s Soaring Dragon Palace Carriage.","Usually, it was only used when the Long family visited prominent individuals.","The number of Golden Soaring Dragons that pulled the Soaring Dragon Palace Carriage represented the courtesy of the Long family.","When the Long family visited the Moon Empress’ Radiant Moon Palace, Chef Supreme’s House of Fragrant Chefs, and Bamboo Monarch’s Purple Bamboo Garden, the carriage was pulled by ten Golden Soaring Dragons.","When the Long family visited top factions that they were unfamiliar with, they used seven Golden Soaring Dragons.","The Long family only used eight Golden Soaring Dragons when they were visiting top factions that they were close with or in-laws.","Although nine Golden Soaring Dragons were just one less than ten, it was still the first time that Coiling Dragon’s Valley used that number of Golden Soaring Dragons.","The Long family’s Soaring Dragon Palace Carriage had displayed their prowess and attracted the attention of many top factions that had come to the Royal Capital to attend the Guard Ye Banquet.","These top factions were not only astonished that the Long family was using nine dragons but also curious about who the Long family was visiting.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was chatting with Li Xuan and the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Li Xuan and the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s First Elder were not in a hurry to reveal their purpose for coming.","They felt that the Long family would definitely be discussing collaboration and trading. They could also bring up their proposal then.","Soon, the roars of nine dragons could be heard outside Lin Yuan’s mansion. The Mother of Bloodbath immediately flashed itself to the entrance of the mansion.","When the Mother of Bloodbath saw the nine Golden Soaring Dragons and the carriage and sensed the overwhelming blood energy inside the nine Golden Soaring Dragons, it felt that those nine sausages looked delicious.","The Mother of Bloodbath led Long Tao and Long Tao’s father in.","The moment Long Tu saw Lin Yuan, he immediately strode over to Lin Yuan, reached out his hand, and said, “Young friend, thank you for giving my son the Law Crystal. It not only helped me greatly, but it also solved an issue I had been grappling with for years.”","Long Tao had walked in with a smile. But when he heard what his father said to Lin Yuan, his expression immediately changed to one of embarrassment.","It had always been sons that made use of their fathers. Since when did fathers start making use of their sons?","His father had called Lin Yuan ‘young friend’. Didn’t it mean that he would have to call Lin Yuan ‘uncle’ now?","Long Tao played with the thought of calling Lin Yuan ‘uncle’ and almost felt himself collapse.","Lin Yuan had also been stunned by the way Long Tu addressed him. He quickly led Long Tu to the sofa and said, “Uncle Long, I’m glad that I was able to help you.”","Lin Yuan shot a look at Long Tao.","Long Tao hurriedly sat down next to his father and pulled back his outstretched hand as he said with slight vexation, “Dad, did you call Lin Yuan young friend because you feel that you’re too old? Do you want to be brothers with me?”","Long Tu immediately snatched his hand out of Long Tao’s grip and rolled his eyes as he said, “Old? As if! Not even your mother finds me old.”","Lin Yuan poured Three Treasures Tea for Long Tu and Long Tao.","Li Xuan watched Long Tao and Long Tu with envy.","Although Long Tao had clearly spoken out of turn, Long Tu was not insulted at all.","It was clear how much Long Tu loved Long Tao.","Meanwhile, he might be the oldest direct descendant in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and had his mother’s love, but Li Xuan could not remember one time in his life where he experienced paternal affection."]},{"number":794,"title":"Chapter 794","paragraphs":["As of that moment, everyone had arrived.","Since Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine were well-acquainted, Long Tu knew the Li family’s First Elder well.","Everyone was talking freely and happily.","After chatting for a while, Lin Yuan waved his hand and summoned 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls onto the jade-textured old pearwood table.","Brocade Zither had only finished nurturing the last Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl less than an hour ago. It was very coincidental.","The 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls had small round pearls growing on them. The small and slightly pink Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls looked extremely cute.","Lin Yuan said to Long Tao and Li Xuan, “This is the 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that we agreed on. There are 17 for Long Tao and 9 for Li Xuan. You can take them.”","Li Xuan, Long Tao, Long Tu, and the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine did not react any differently when they saw the decoration in the mansion.","They knew that Lin Yuan was the disciple of the Moon Empress. Hence, they were not shocked by the luxurious interior of the mansion.","But they now had so many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls in front of them. Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had a few pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters and tens of Class 4 Creation Masters. Every Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl could increase the homogeneity of the spiritual ingredients in the concoction of spirit fluids by 10%, essentially increasing the effectiveness of the spirit fluid by 10%.","This meant that every 10 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls could match up to one Class 4 Creation Master.","These four people felt that what was in front of them was not 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls but 2.5 living Class 4 Creation Masters.","This feeling was too exciting.","As the main members of the Long family and Li family, Long Tao, Long Tu, Li Xuan, and the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine knew better than anyone how precious Creation Master resources were.","Although top factions needed to be supported by strong combat power, only a group like the Five Thearch Soldiers that had five thearch-class experts standing guard could have the influence of a top faction with three pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master.","Not even Coiling Dragon’s Valley could compete with the number of experts that Five Thearch Soldiers had.","However, in terms of influence, the only top faction that could suppress that of the Five Thearch Soldiers was Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","In fact, with the Five Thearch Soldiers’ high number of high-class spirit qi professionals, they needed Creation Master resources even more badly.","They even needed to secretly establish connections with top factions that had a large amount of high-class Creation Master resources.","By this analogy, the 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were not just 2.5 Class 4 Creation Masters but also a way to curry favor with thearch-class experts.","Long Tu could not help but sigh in amazement as he stared at the 26 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls on the table.","“I can’t believe that the Moon Empress nurtured such a precious item that can help Creation Masters. If there were slightly more of these, it would be able to completely change the style of factions that use Creation Masters as their role.”","Long Tu’s words made the Mother of Bloodbath, which was sipping on tea, frown. It shot a look of disdain at Long Tu.","The Mother of Bloodbath had become Lin Yuan’s Path Protector because it wanted to repay the Moon Empress for saving its life.","Before meeting Lin Yuan, its gratitude to the Moon Empress was enough for the Mother of Bloodbath to sacrifice its freedom and treat the Moon Empress with gratitude and respect.","After following Lin Yuan, the Mother of Bloodbath also felt that all of Lin Yuan’s achievements had come from the Moon Empress.","But as time passed, the Mother of Bloodbath had discovered that Lin Yuan was someone who could always create miracles.","The Mother of Bloodbath would often follow Lin Yuan to Radiant Moon Palace. The Moon Empress would always need to find an excuse even to give Lin Yuan the smallest gift.","It was clear that Lin Yuan’s vast reservoir of Creation Master resources did not all come from the Moon Empress.","This made the Mother of Bloodbath doubtful.","But after Lin Yuan had used his flimsy body to stand ground at the World Cleansing and summoned white sand to save the Mother of Bloodbath, the latter realized that it owed Lin Yuan a debt of gratitude larger than what it owed to the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress had only helped it out of convenience, like how she had given it the Crescent Moon Radiant Sunlight tablet that could suppress the Trial of World Creation.","However, Lin Yuan had a boundless future as the disciple of the Moon Empress, yet he had been willing to risk his life to save the Mother of Bloodbath.","As a wild fey that was born from blood, the Mother of Bloodbath had never felt any warmth like that.","Afterward, the Mother of Bloodbath did not try to find out how Lin Yuan could create miracles. Instead, it did its best to protect Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had clearly created the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls on his own. However, Long Tu had said that it was the Moon Empress who had nurtured them.","This annoyed the Mother of Bloodbath.","However, Lin Yuan’s smile became broader after he heard what Long Tu said.","Lin Yuan felt that he would not have been able to nurture a resource that could affect the fundamentals of Creation Master resources like Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls if he was not the Moon Empress’ disciple.","It was true that he was friends with Long Tao and Li Xuan. But if he did not have a high enough status, Coiling Dragon’s Valley leader and the First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would not be sitting in front of him so calmly.","Although they would not force him to trade the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, he would become the center of attraction once news of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls spread.","Every faction would close in on him.","Lin Yuan had come from another world and was willing to believe in the innate goodness of people. But he also knew that the opposite end of the spectrum was innate evil.","Goodness and evil manifested together.","As warm as goodness was, evil was cold.","Lin Yuan was willing to announce his identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple at the Guard Ye Banquet because he did not want to disappoint the Moon Empress but also because his past eight months of growth had allowed him to change completely from the weak youth that would pant while restocking a few shelves.","He had used every breath in him and every minute and second of the past eight months to improve.","As one of the younger generation, especially one that had felt the audience’s eyes on stage at the Allstar Match, Lin Yuan wanted to climb to the highest peaks and take Sky City along with him.","Although violence was not in Lin Yuan’s nature, his ambition was undeniably strong."]},{"number":795,"title":"Chapter 795 - Can You Handle It?","paragraphs":["Normally, the simplest ambition was to protect one’s loved ones.","Before Lin Yuan became the Moon Empress’ disciple, his loved ones only included Chu Ci and maybe Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang, who took care of him.","But after becoming the Moon Empress’ disciple, the entire Radiant Moon Palace had become his family.","Now that Chu Ci had become Cold Moon’s disciple, Lin Yuan’s family ties were closely connected with the Radiant Moon Palace.","As for the Return from Faraway Mansion, they were friends that had gone through thick and thin with Lin Yuan.","The private faction Sky City had also come from the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Lin Yuan wanted to protect the people that he cared about. No one felt more pressure to do this than Lin Yuan.","Thus, Lin Yuan felt that his improvement over the last eight months was nothing to toot his own horn about. He still had a long way to go.","Lin Yuan understood war even better after experiencing the evolving water world dimensional rift and fighting against the Zheng family.","He saw the entire Divine Wood Federation as wood to stoke his fire of life experience.","Moreover, the Astronomical Parliament’s continent strategy had been put into motion.","Although he had kept himself hidden as the City Lord of Sky City, one of his other identities needed to continue growing.","In another few months, when the Floating Island Whale hatched, Sky City would be able to float into the sky. Hence, Lin Yuan needed to collect resources as quickly as possible to increase Sky City’s combat power.","After Lin Yuan had learned about Tower Canon’s hundred-year ‘The Sleeper’s Revival’ plan, his mind was immediately on high alert.","This was why Lin Yuan had spent so much effort researching the Soldier Ration Radish with the goal of nurturing it.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine were clearly determined to work with him.","Hence, Lin Yuan quipped, “Uncle Long, you’re right. There are quite a lot of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. A fair number should change the style of factions that have Creation Master as their main roles.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Long Tu’s eyes gleam. If anyone else had talked to Long Tu that way, he would have treated it as a joke.","The style of factions only changed after hundreds of years. How could someone talk about changing it so easily?","But since it was Lin Yuan who had said it, Long Tu took the words seriously because they were most likely to be true.","Since Lin Yuan only wanted the useless Law Source Crystals in exchange for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, Long Tu became overwhelmed with emotion.","Is it possible that the Moon Empress is able to extract laws from Law Source Crystals!?","The level of Class 5 Creation Masters was too mysterious. It was a level that all pinnacle Class 4 Creation Masters spent a lifetime chasing but failed to attain.","People initially defined a Creation Master’s Class.","Given how rare Class 5 Creation Masters were, no one knew what kind of level existed beyond that.","Thus, the term Class 6 Creation Master had never been used.","If the Moon Empress could do what the other Class 5 Creation Masters could not, she could stand above them and be called the first true Class 6 Creation Master in the Radiance Federation.","At the thought of this, Long Tu jerked his head up to anxiously say something to Lin Yuan.","But Lin Yuan beat him to it and said nonchalantly, “I’m good friends with Big Brother Long. No other faction has had access to Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. As of now, you’re the only one. Since you said that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls can change the style of factions with the Creation Master role, why don’t you lead Coiling Dragon’s Valley as a pioneer?”","Lin Yuan’s words immediately caused Long Tu, Long Tao, Li Xuan, and the First Elder of the Li family’s breathing to quicken.","The four of them had immediately started thinking of ways to convince Lin Yuan to trade for more Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls the moment they saw the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","However, they did not expect Lin Yuan to initiate the topic.","Since Lin Yuan did not seem ready to allow the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to fall into the hands of other factions but wanted the two families to use the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to expand themselves, this situation was an enormous blessing for Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","This blessing did not need to be sustained for long. One month was enough for them to gain a much more solid foundation than other factions that had Creation Master roles.","The way Lin Yuan had said ‘Big Brother Long’ made Long Tao look at Lin Yuan with increasing affection.","As the only direct descendant of Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s young generation, Long Tao had been born with a golden spoon in his mouth. His life had been nothing but smooth sailing.","Besides Li Xuan, with who he had become friends when he was young and innocent, Long Tao could not be bothered with any other disciple from top factions.","The only possible ones would be his combat teammates from the Dragon Gate Guild Club.","But now, Long Tao regarded Lin Yuan as a good brother.","Long Tao was not alone with this sentiment. Li Xuan had been worn over when Lin Yuan called him ‘Big Brother Li’.","Lin Yuan had purposely mentioned Li Xuan when he was offering Dark Clouds Bird Shrine this good opportunity. It was like Lin Yuan was only offering Dark Clouds Bird Shrine this chance on account of Li Xuan.","It was fair to say that Lin Yuan’s words were enough to secure Li Xuan’s position in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Li Xuan no longer needed to constantly be on guard against his siblings.","When Lin Yuan had been speaking to Long Tu, his fist had clenched tightly. At that moment, Lin Yuan felt like he was holding a hefty power, one that had transformed Creation Master resources.","He could use his own ideas and decisions to direct the style of Creation Master resources.","Lin Yuan had taken the initiative to voice a collaboration instead of waiting for Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine to make offers so he could negotiate the price. His status and the value of the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls allowed him to be confident of controlling the price even though he was the one who had taken the initiative.","Since Lin Yuan wanted to form relationships with Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and Coiling Dragon’s Valley, he might as well go all the way.","The First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine said with a slight tremor in his voice, “How many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls will Dark Clouds Bird Shrine be able to borrow from you?”","When Long Tu heard the First Elder’s question, his eyes also quickly shot toward Lin Yuan.","It was clear that Long Tu was after the answer to the same question.","Lin Yuan tapped his finger on the table as he pondered for a moment before saying, “If I can provide both families with 600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls per month, will you be able to handle it?”"]},{"number":796,"title":"Chapter 796 - Lack of Law Crystals","paragraphs":["The First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine could not help but inhale sharply.","600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls in one month is an unimaginably huge load!","But worry quickly set in.","According to the price set for the trade of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, it was 30 Law Source Crystals for 1 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","With 600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, and Coiling Dragon’s Valley would have to produce 18,000 Law Source Crystals together.","Although Law Source Crystals were useless to them, it was not easy to kill Class 7 dimensional lifeforms.","When Lin Yuan had said that he had 600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls for the two families to share, Coiling Dragon’s Valley would receive a larger share because they had more Creation Master resources.","Hence, Coiling Dragon’s Valley would need to expend a significant amount of effort to produce so many Law Source Crystals.","But soon, the First Elder felt that he had just been slapped by Long Tu because Long Tu said, “According to the trade of 30 Law Source Crystals for 1 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl, the Long family can handle the 600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","“Haha! We need the flesh of a mountain of high-class dimensional lifeforms to nurture the Extreme Day Explosive Dragon. Hence, we made a deal with the Five Thearch Soldiers and have gained control over eight Class 4 dimensional rifts for many years. We always need to clean out Law Source Crystals annually and have accumulated a large store of Law Source Crystals over the last century.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up as the First Elder wrinkled his nose and said, “Dark Clouds Bird Shrine can take a smaller share of the 600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. But we’ll take 200 at the very least. We should be able to produce 6,000 Law Source Crystals.”","While he was speaking, the First Elder had already decided that he would teach the other four elders who managed Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s storage a good lesson when he went back.","If they had not deemed the Law Source Crystals useless and thrown away a large amount to trade for the money to build a breeding base for avian-type feys, the Li family could have taken 300 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","However, the First Elder also knew that taking 200 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls was Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s limit.","It was not that Dark Clouds Bird Shrine could not obtain more Law Source Crystals from external sources because they could have exchanged for more with other factions by trading rare resources.","However, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had always been relying on the Long family. They had relied on the Long family’s help to advance to a top faction in the last 40 years.","Thus, whether it was for emotional, logical, or power-related reasons, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had to take a smaller share.","When Long Tu heard what the First Elder said, he chuckled and said, “Of course, 200 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls are no problem. If you don’t have enough Law Source Crystals, we can lend you some.”","As Lin Yuan watched the way that the First Elder and Long Tu managed business, he gained a better understanding of the perspectives of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","Lin Yuan had said that he would provide 600 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls for both factions to share because he wanted to see the way they managed business.","What he saw was one compromising party and a party that was willing to provide compensation.","Although Lin Yuan’s identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple protected him in every deal that he made with factions so that he would not have to worry about being taken advantage of, this push and pull collaboration was definitely much more comfortable.","Lin Yuan knew how much Brocade Zither could produce. Brocade Zither could produce 24 to 25 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls per day.","One month of hard work would produce about 750 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, which exceeded the amount that Lin Yuan was offering Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","From the way Long Tu spoke, he would be happy to take all Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls that Lin Yuan could offer.","During the transaction a month later, where he would gain 18,000 Law Source Crystals, Lin Yuan would be able to gain more worlds that were formed from laws, and his Sacred Source Wielding Queen’s Stars would also increase.","It would definitely increase to 2 Stars, even to 3 Stars, and gain new abilities.","After this trade, it would be impossible for Connected Beast Park to sleep soundly.","After the Long family gained a large number of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, Connected Beast Park’s role would be viciously suppressed by Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","This would shake Connected Beast Park’s roots and influence to their cores.","Moreover, there was no way that Connected Beast Park could devour Condense Fairy Orchard.","At that point, Connected Beast Park would be stuck between Condense Fairy Orchard and Coiling Dragon’s Valley, causing them to come after Sky City.","With 18,000 Law Source Crystals per month, Sky City’s combat power would change drastically.","Endless Summer and the Mother of Bloodbath’s evolution to Creation Breed would no longer be uncertain.","There would also be a large number of Law Crystals that the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer would be able to use to charge toward the second Trial or even the third Trial.","Even though they were done talking about the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, neither Long Tu nor the First Elder made any indication that they were leaving.","Lin Yuan knew that they were waiting for each other to mention the Law Crystals with pure law power.","This was different from the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, and Lin Yuan had no intention of initiating this topic.","This Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls deal had enabled Lin Yuan to gain an unprecedented reward.","As long as the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were constantly improved, Lin Yuan’s money and resources would never dry up.","Hence, Lin Yuan no longer needed to rely on Law Crystals to gain rewards.","Lin Yuan had already decided to keep more Law Crystals for internal use for those he was really close to.","There would definitely be many leftover Law Crystals after Endless Summer, and the Mother of Bloodbath evolved to Creation Breed.","But as he, Chu Ci, Liu Jie, Wen Yu, Duan He, Master Hong Shen, and Hu Quan’s powers increased, there would never be enough Law Crystals.","The Myth III feys of his that could use the Law Crystals were Genius, Chimey, Red Thorn, the Acid Corrosion Queen Bee, the Ethereal Jellyfish, the Source Sand, the Jasmine Lily, Blackie, the Blue Flash Purple Butterfly, Gray, Silver Corona, Brocade Zither, and the Floating Island Whale that had yet to hatch.","This amounted to over 20 lifeforms.","As Morbius evolved, Lin Yuan would be able to lock even more feys. As of now, his spiritual energy could still form a contract with one fey.","After the Cinnabar Osmanthus Haworthia ripened, Lin Yuan could increase his spiritual energy by eating its fruits and be able to form contracts with even more feys.","This meant that Lin Yuan’s usage of Law Crystals would be a huge problem for him."]},{"number":797,"title":"Chapter 797 - The Three Stages of the Spirit Qi Awakening","paragraphs":["The First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine and Long Tu both wanted to trade for Law Crystals.","After they exchanged looks, the First Elder tried to please Lin Yuan by saying, “My Lord, can Dark Clouds Bird Shrine have some of your Law Crystals? You can have your pick from our treasure collection.”","The First Elder’s words shocked both Lin Yuan and Long Tu.","Long Tu did not expect the First Elder to be willing to make such a serious offer.","By opening up the treasure collection, Lin Yuan would have access to all of the Li family’s precious resources.","The treasure collection of a top faction hid their secrets. Yet the First Elder of the Li family was willing to give Lin Yuan access to their secrets in exchange for Law Crystals.","This was a huge sacrifice.","Long Tu was momentarily too taken aback to pick up after the First Elder.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection might not have any important secrets after only having been a top faction for 40 years, but the family’s treasure collection was different.","Before this century of the Spirit Qi Awakening, there had been five years of Spirit Qi Vacuum.","Before the five years of Spirit Qi Vacuum, there were almost 5,000 years of Spirit Qi Thinning.","This century of Spirit Qi Awakening had allowed humans to form contracts with feys and become spirit qi professionals.","However, the Long family’s ancestors had already started using spirit qi to collect treasures since the Spirit Qi Thinning period and established a solid foundation for Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","Long Tu would be extremely pained if any of these items were taken away.","Hence, Long Tu planned on observing first.","If Lin Yuan agreed to work with Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, Long Tu would decide whether or not to make his advancement based on what Lin Yuan picked from Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection.","Long Tu had already gained one Law Crystal and healed his fey, whose roots had been injured. The fey was no longer stuck at Myth III.","However, no faction would complain that they had too many Law Crystals.","The Long family was in great need of Law Crystals.","Most pinnacle emperor-class experts had the potential to become thearch-class experts. However, without Law Crystals, they would be stuck at the pinnacle emperor-class.","Lin Yuan did not expect the First Elder to offer to open their treasure collection to him. This gesture moved Lin Yuan immensely.","But even so, Lin Yuan did not plan on giving up too many Law Crystals.","With a wave of his hand, three crystal fragments appeared in Lin Yuan’s hand.","After Lin Yuan shook the fragments in his hand, he said to the First Elder, “I only have three Law Crystal fragments. Since the Li family is so sincere, I’m willing to allow the Li family to have two.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Long Tu unable to continue to sit silently.","However, even as the head of the family, he could not decide to open Coiling Dragon’s Valley’s treasure collection on his own.","Since Lin Yuan was only willing to allow Dark Clouds Bird Shrine to have two Law Crystal fragments, Long Tu could have the last one.","Long Tu took a deep breath and said in a low voice, “I’m willing to use one Suzerain/Myth III poison-type Law Crystal to exchange for one Law Crystal with pure law power. Is that okay?”","Long Tu had only said this after deep contemplation.","One poison-type Myth III Law Crystal could enable much more evolution than a fingernail-sized Law Crystal.","However, poison-type laws were too unorthodox, and Coiling Dragon’s Valley did not have use for them.","Although a Myth III poison-type Law Crystal could benefit a poison-type fey 50 times more than a fingernail-sized Law Crystal, it could not help a fey that was stuck at pinnacle Myth II evolve to Myth III.","It was worth it to use one Myth III poison-type Law Crystal that was just collecting dust in storage to exchange for a Suzerain/Myth III fey.","But this was as far as Long Tu could go.","Lin Yuan was delighted to hear this.","But once happiness bloomed in Lin Yuan, he curbed it before it burst out of control, and none of it emerged through his expression.","Lin Yuan had trained this emotionless facade over the course of the past eight months.","There were very few poison-type laws. The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had absorbed many Law Crystal fragments, but it had never absorbed a poison-type law.","The rarity of poison-type feys in the Radiance Federation caused an awkward position for poison-type Law Crystals amongst all Law Crystals.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan felt that poison-type laws would be of great use to him.","The willpowers and laws on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt could be applied to Lin Yuan. When fighting against Zhou Luo, Lin Yuan had accidentally discovered that the laws carved on the skirt could strengthen his immunity against laws.","As a weak spirit qi professional that only had a fleshy body, he was most afraid of being poisoned rather than injured by physical or elemental attacks.","Although the Jasmine Lily could fix genetic models and regrow limbs, it was helpless against strong poisons.","If Lin Yuan was poisoned during an actual life-and-death battle, Lin Yuan would have no choice but to amputate the poisoned area.","Then, he would use the Jasmine Lily’s Severed Limbs Growth to regrow the amputated area.","This method would only be effective against feys that used slow-acting poison.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s Spatial Shift could transport elemental energy, and poison was not pure elemental energy. Thus, Spatial Shift would not be very effective against poison.","Lin Yuan had never had a good solution to counter poison.","Although some spiritual ingredients could increase a spirit qi professional’s defense against poison, these spiritual ingredients were always poison themselves.","While they increased the body’s susceptibility to poison, it would also cause enormous pain and even result in disfigurement from the decaying of skin.","Lin Yuan might not place much value on his own looks, but he did not want to be disfigured just to increase his defense against poison.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but think,? If I can use one Law Crystal to exchange for a Suzerain/Myth III poison-type law and allow the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb it, my resistance to poison should increase dramatically. I can’t get this increase from the spiritual ingredients that improve resistance."]},{"number":798,"title":"Chapter 798 - The Opportunity to be Impervious to Poison","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","There would be many plant- and insect-species feys in the Divine Wood Federation where Lin Yuan was going to go soon.","These feys occupied more than 90% of all the feys in the Divine Wood Federation.","Most of these feys were capable of producing poison. With the Myth III Law Crystal, Lin Yuan would be even safer during his training in the Divine Wood Federation.","When the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen evolved the Myth III poison-type law to a world of poison, normal poisons would have no effect on Lin Yuan.","At that point, Lin Yuan could even say that he was impervious to poison.","After Long Tu revealed the best terms he could offer, he kept his gaze locked on Lin Yuan’s eyes.","He noticed a moment later that Lin Yuan’s gaze had not changed at all after he heard about the Myth III poison-type Law Crystal. Long Tu’s breathing froze, but he did not plan on offering anything else.","As the head of Coiling Dragon’s Valley, he could not budge on the limit he had set.","Although there was no room for negotiation of more, the Long family had many other items that he could offer in place of the Suzerain/Myth III poison-type Law Crystal.","“Instead of the Myth III poison-type Law Crystal, I also have a pinnacle Myth II dark-type Law Crystal and a water-type Law Crystal. The pinnacle Myth II dark-type Law Crystal has the Gray Shadow Law while the water-type Law Crystal has the Fast Flow Law. Frankly, the Myth III poison-type law is pretty good. It is the Vicious Poison Law, which is common amongst poison-type laws. As long as the poison attack does not use spiritual energy, most poison-type feys should be able to absorb it,” said Long Tu.","Suddenly, Long Tu felt that he was being stupid.","As the Moon Empress’ disciple who also had the ability to easily produce three Law Crystals, even if Lin Yuan had a poison-type fey, he would use his own Law Crystals instead of the Myth III Vicious Poison Law Crystal.","Moreover, as much as the Vicious Poison Law was well-liked by poison-type feys, it did not change the fact that poison-type laws had a small community that used them.","When Lin Yuan heard Long Tu say that the Myth III poison-type Law Crystal had the Vicious Poison Law, he lost control of the delight he had been fighting down, and his lips curled upward.","Lin Yuan had been slightly stunned when he first heard Long Tu mention the Myth III poison-type Law Crystal.","The Acid Poison Law, Blood Poison Law, and Decay Poison Laws were useful to Lin Yuan, but they could not enable the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to evolve because these laws only strengthened a specific type of poison when they were evolved.","They were unable to raise Lin Yuan’s overall resistance to poison.","But the Vicious Poison Law was different because it encompassed most of the different types of poison.","If Lin Yuan evolved the Vicious Poison Law, he would gain immunity from acid poison, blood poison, decay poison, and more.","Although it would not be as effective as the specific poison laws, it was good enough for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could not care less about the pinnacle Suzerain/Myth II dark-type Gray Shadow Law and pinnacle Suzerain/Myth II water-type Fast Flow Law.","He currently had the murderous and manipulative dark-type Dark Death Law. Thus, he did not want the inferior Gray Shadow Law.","Lin Yuan felt that the two dark-type Law Runes that he had were enough.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt also had no lack of water-type laws because Duan He had swept a nest of Qiu Horn Gray Whales.","Lin Yuan had immediately absorbed the three piles of Law Crystal fragments that came from different Qiu Horn Gray Whales.","Although the Qiu Horn Gray Whales’ Law Crystals were incomplete and Lin Yuan could not evolve them, the water-type Fast Flow Law was also not worth Lin Yuan evolving it.","Although the Fast Flow Law seemed to be water-type, it was actually the speed of water.","As long as Lin Yuan did not flee to the ocean or try to chase an enemy into the ocean, this Law Crystal would never be of use.","Thus, Lin Yuan disregarded it firmly.","“I’ll choose the Suzerain/Myth III Vicious Poison Law Crystal,” said Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan gave one of the Law Crystals to Long Tu.","Long Tu received the Law Crystal and peered closely at it before saying seriously, “I’ll immediately send someone to retrieve the poison-type Law Crystal and the Law Source Crystals for the 17 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls. In a month, we’ll trade for 400 Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls with 12,000 Law Source Crystals. The Long family already has 12,000 Law Source Crystals on hand, and someone will deliver them in a few days.”","With the successful trade of the Law Crystal, Long Tu decided to do even more to establish a good relationship with Lin Yuan.","Although Long Tu did not know why Lin Yuan needed so many Law Source Crystals, he did not need to cheat Coiling Dragon’s Valley for Law Source Crystals when he was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Lin Yuan raised his gaze to meet Long Tu’s eyes. A second later, Lin Yuan beamed brightly and said softly, “Uncle Long, the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls are just the beginning. I hope to work with you more in the future.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Long Tu look over the moon and excited at the same time.","It would only benefit Coiling Dragon’s Valley to work with Lin Yuan more.","If Lin Yuan brought anything else similar to the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to the Long family first in the future, the Long family’s strategy would be able to surpass that of the other factions by leaps and bounds.","The First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was looking angrily at Long Tu, and he could not help but scold Long Tu inwardly.","Long Tu had been afraid to say a word, but after the First Elder said that he would open Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection, Long Tu immediately exchanged for one of Lin Yuan’s Law Crystals with a Suzerain/Myth III Law Crystal.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley was a huge organization. The Long family had the main role of Creation Master and used their endless stream of Creation Master resources to rapidly accumulate even more resources.","However, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was different.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had to constantly expand and grow to become a top faction over the last 40 years because of their dominance of the avian-type fey market.","Every move that Dark Clouds Bird Shrine made in the market required large spending.","Due to their continuous expansion, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection no longer had anything as precious as a Suzerain/Myth III Law Crystal."]},{"number":799,"title":"Chapter 799 - Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass","paragraphs":["Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Regardless, the past 40 years of major resource development had allowed Dark Clouds Bird Shrine to completely grab hold of the avian-type fey market.","They could now sit back and accumulate resources just like the Long family.","The First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was really afraid that Lin Yuan would refuse to trade for the two Law Crystals after he saw what was in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection.","Hence, the First Elder’s hand could not stop twitching.","He gave Lin Yuan a catalog containing many different feys, spiritual ingredients, and some source-type lifeforms.","“My lord, this catalog lists everything that is in Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection now. We’ve been focusing on expanding, which resulted in our treasure collection becoming a bit sparse,” said the First Elder.","Lin Yuan flipped through the catalog.","The First Elder had not said that a large portion of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s treasure collection had gone toward expanding the faction to be humble.","Otherwise, the First Elder would not have to talk down about Dark Clouds Bird Shrine during the trade because it would not have benefited Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","But even so, Lin Yuan spent five minutes flipping through just the Elite source-type items.","It was clear that top factions really had a mountain of resources.","While Lin Yuan was reading through the catalog, his attention had been caught by several items.","There were many items that Lin Yuan felt could be of use. However, he did not plan on using Law Crystals to exchange for them. He would exchange these items for the improved Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls once Dark Clouds Bird Shrine ran out of Law Source Crystals.","Thus, Lin Yuan’s gaze mostly went back to items that he would not be able to trade for using the improved Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","This method of reading through the catalog allowed Lin Yuan to go through it quickly.","Lin Yuan did not pay much attention to Myth II Law Crystals.","The Myth II Law Crystals were good, but Lin Yuan would need to use a large amount of Law Source Crystals to nurture Law Crystals that were below pinnacle Myth II.","Including the Myth III Vicious Poison Law, Lin Yuan already had four laws that he needed to nurture.","After laws became able to increase Lin Yuan’s resistance to elements, the Cold Flames Law became an advantage because of its unorthodox nature of having both ice and fire characteristics.","This gave Lin Yuan resistance to both ice and fire.","He had already evolved the Cold Flames Law and intended on putting effort into nurturing it.","The First Elder felt more anxious the faster that Lin Yuan flipped through the catalog.","Lin Yuan had almost flipped to the end of the catalog. If he really could not find anything inside that caught his fancy, the Li family would essentially have lost two Myth III feys.","Besides thearch-class experts, spirit qi professionals with Myth III feys had the most battle prowess in top factions.","During Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s quick expansion, they also needed to steadily increase their power.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had many experts with feys that were stuck at pinnacle Myth II.","If the Li family could not trade for Law Crystals with Lin Yuan this time, it was unlikely that they would have the chance to in the future.","While Lin Yuan was flipping through the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s catalog, he noticed that special resources that the First Elder had mentioned were unique avian-type feys that Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had specially nurtured.","These avian-type feys had been nurtured to Diamond X/Legend, and any would be able to fulfill Lin Yuan’s need for an avian-type fey.","If this was in the past, Lin Yuan would have immediately decided to trade for them.","But he now had Blackie, which could fly as fast as the Divine Travel Black Swallow ever since it had evolved to Gold/Fantasy.","It was enough to meet Lin Yuan’s needs.","Moreover, Lin Yuan did not need a few avian-type feys for the fey carriage that he wanted to build.","But it was also unnecessary for Lin Yuan to produce 12 Law Crystals to trade for 12 avian-type feys that he could use for the fey carriage.","He had pure spirit qi that not even Class 5 Creation Masters could create. It would not be difficult for him to nurture a new type of avian-type fey.","The avian-type feys that he nurtured using the pure spirit qi would be even better than those nurtured by Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","Just when Lin Yuan was about to say that he did not find anything that he wanted and suggest that the Li family use a large amount of Law Crystal fragments to trade when his gaze stopped on the last page of the catalog.","Lin Yuan’s heart pounded wildly in his heart.","If he could trade for this with Dark Clouds Bird Shrine, he would be able to bring one of his ideas to life as well as save himself decades of hard work.","Lin Yuan reached out and pointed at a normal-looking zigzag-shaped green grass and asked the First Elder, “Was this Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass child ramet nurtured from the ortet? What’s the difference between the effects of the child ramets and ortet? It says here that you have five child ramets. What does the Li family usually do with it?”","The First Elder was stunned by the onslaught of Lin Yuan’s questions.","When Lin Yuan had reached the last page of the catalog, the First Elder’s heart plunged.","He did not expect Lin Yuan to be interested in the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass.","However, the First Elder was unclear on what Lin Yuan meant.","He did not know if Lin Yuan had asked casually or if he was prepared to use the Law Crystals to exchange for the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass child ramets.","If so, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would benefit greatly.","Although the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass was the foundation of avian-type feys’ sense of direction that Dark Clouds Bird Shrine used when nurturing avian-type feys, all the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass in the catalog had been separated from the ortet.","Although they had the same effects as the ortet, they did not have the ortet’s abilities.","Thus, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine would have gained two Law Crystals for almost nothing if Lin Yuan wanted to trade for the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass.","The First Elder cleared his throat and said truthfully, “The Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass child ramets are usually planted in a sealed-off space and can release a special fragrance.. The bodies of lifeforms that smell this fragrance gain an incredible memory and can memorize complicated movements and directions.”"]},{"number":800,"title":"Chapter 800 - The Fall of the Main Phoenix-Species","paragraphs":["The First Elder of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine paused momentarily before he said, “However, the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ fragrance is also extremely poisonous and can seriously damage the muscles in a body. Dark Clouds Bird Shrine uses it with extreme care. Otherwise, one wrong move and the avian-fey nurtured with it would be poisoned to death.”","A troubled look came over the First Elder’s face.","He talked about the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass with slight terror, and it was clear that he hated it as much as he loved it.","“After avian-type feys are born, they are triggered using residues of the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ scent to give them the ability to memorize complicated flight routes perfectly. It also enables them to produce specific responses after they hear the name of particular locations. Our Dark Clouds Bird Shrine has learned a lot after the deaths of countless precious avian-type feys.”","Lin Yuan nodded as he listened to the First Elder’s explanation which signaled for the First Elder to continue speaking.","Normally, the First Elder would never reveal Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s secrets and the management strategy of the faction’s expansion.","But there were no unpleasant individuals here. Long Tu was already well aware of Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s situation.","As the Moon Empress’ disciple and the person who provided Dark Clouds Bird Shrine with so many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, Lin Yuan was allowed access to these secrets.","After a moment of silence, the First Elder said, “When using the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass, Dark Clouds Bird Shrine noticed that the avian-type feys with fewer impurities in their bodies can better hold up against the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ scent. After countless experiments, we confirmed this after using the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ roots when a main phoenix-species fey was about to be successfully nurtured.”","The First Elder could not help but sigh.","The main phoenix-species fey was like the main dragon-species fey and was the most elite species of its bloodline.","The main phoenix-species feys of lesser quality would definitely be able to become Myth Breed feys as long as the feys did not die halfway.","The main phoenix-species feys of higher quality had the potential to become Creation Breed feys.","This move to rush the success shook Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s roots.","Lin Yuan frowned when he heard the First Elder’s sigh.","“Why?” asked Lin Yuan.","The scent of the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ roots was nearly 10,000 times more effective than the main plant.","If the scent from the main plant could enable avian-type feys to accurately remember routes and react to directions, a spirit qi professional could use the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ roots to memorize the slightest movement and battle strategy.","The moment of memorization would be more vivid in the spirit qi professional’s mind than all the battle strategies and movements that they had painstakingly memorized beforehand.","From the moment the main phoenix-species fey was born, the body could be tempered to remove all impurities.","According to Dark Clouds Bird Shrine’s research, the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ roots should be harmless to main phoenix-species feys.","The First Elder responded in a flat tone, “We didn’t expect that the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ roots would affect the soul. The Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass could only be used on feys with a pure soul.”","Lin Yuan’s heart lit up.","The first time he had used the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar was to clear out all the impurities in his body and evolve his genetic model.","The second time he had used it, he realized that he had two souls in his mind. Coincidentally, the Moon Empress had prepared twice the amount of Suzerain Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar for him.","The honey made from Suzerain Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia could cleanse the soul.","After consuming the Suzerain Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar twice, the impurities in his soul had been cleansed without his consent.","This meant that Lin Yuan would be immune to the effects of both the scent of the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass and its roots.","Luckily, Lin Yuan had seen the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass in the Li family’s treasure collection catalog.","If he waited till after he allowed the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb the Myth III Vicious Poison Law Crystal and his body became resistant to poison, the effectiveness of the Muscle Hyperthymesia would drop by half.","After all, the Muscle Hyperthymesia Grass’ effects were directed at the toxins in the body and were considered poison-type damage.","When Blackie had evolved to Fantasy Breed and gained Spirit Essence Explosion, he pondered ways to use Spirit Essence Explosion.","Lin Yuan had secretly tried injecting half of his spiritual power into his fist to unleash the might of Spirit Essence Explosion.","He had realized that when this strike landed against the radium walls of the Mother of Bloodbath’s training room, he could cause a small mark.","Although Spirit Essence Explosion used explosive spirit qi to cause damage, the mark left on the radium wall meant that a full-powered attack would carry the full power of a Diamond X/Fantasy V fey.","But as compared to a Diamond X/Fantasy V fey, Lin Yuan’s body was not built as sturdily, nor was it as agile.","Lin Yuan could not evolve the body he had.","The genetic model of humans placed humans as the most intelligent lifeform. By forming contracts with feys and battling with others, humans could use spiritual power, willpower, and exceptional senses to create the best way of living.","But if a person tried to strengthen their body using many spiritual ingredients, there would only be two outcomes.","One was that the body would be unable to hold up, and the organs would shut down, leading to death. The other outcome would be that the body would reach a maximum level that was about the same as a pinnacle Gold fey.","Currently, the bodies of thearch-class experts were about as strong as pinnacle Gold feys.","But thearch-class experts could circulate their spiritual power to create spirit qi vortexes that they could use to protect themselves.","Since he could not do anything about his physical body, Lin Yuan’s only option was to make himself more agile.","No matter how he thought about it, Lin Yuan felt that Chu Ci had great foresight.","Although Chu Ci had only been learning some basic fencing tricks in the last six months, she had become acquainted with fencing."]}]);
